window.FWN_CHAOTIC_SWORD_GOD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CHAOTIC_SWORD_GOD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3901,"title":"Chapter 3901: Tian Changji Perishes (3)","paragraphs":["On the battlefield, Jian Chen and Tian Changji were like ghosts, flickering around at high speeds. Whenever they met, it would be accompanied with deafening booms. From time to time, droplets of red blood would spray out, filled with pure energy. They stood out like rubies.","The two of them had already clashed hundreds of times with lightning speed. They were fiercely locked in battle.","Boom!","Finally, with a startling rumble, the two of them separated. They retreated rapidly at the same time.","Between them, sharp sword Qi scattered off into the surroundings with a violent storm of energy, shaking the space violently.","Jian Chen’s Heaven-lifting sword continued to shine brightly. It churned with light. His clothes were torn to shreds, revealing large chunks of skin. Slashes covered his entire body, leaving behind vicious wounds.","While his injuries seemed quite deep, Jian Chen’s presence did not weaken at all. Instead, it grew. The startling battle intent he gave off made it seem like he would not stop until his opponent fell before him.","On the other side, Tian Changji had lost his usual demeanour. He was disheveled, and his clothes were also in tatters. He had vicious slashes on him, and he seemed no better than Jian Chen.","“Your strength is much greater than what Xia Mingtian described.” Tian Changji stared at Jian Chen closely and emphasised each word.","In reality, he was nowhere near as calm as he seemed on the surface. In the past, he had learnt all about Jian Chen’s strength from Xia Mingtian. In his knowledge, the reason why Jian Chen could defeat Xia Mingtian was almost entirely due to a treasure that healed him rapidly.","With the rapid recovery of his injuries and an unguardable secret technique, he fought a battle of attrition against Xia Mingtian, forcefully outlasting his opponent.","Yet right now, neither the rapid regeneration nor the unguardable secret technique had appeared. Jian Chen used his strength alone to fight him to such an extent, which left Tian Changji shocked.","“That’s because my strength has increased over the years,” Jian Chen said calmly. There was indeed a tremendous difference in strength right now compared to back then in the Observance Heaven City.","In the Observance Heaven City, he had used a medium quality god artifact. Now, he had switched it out for a high quality god artifact, the Heaven-lifting sword!","Powered by Chaotic Force, the power of the high quality god artifact was maximised. Just that alone allowed him to challenge those stronger than him.","That was only the first factor. The second factor was the many stone tablets from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable he had comprehended over the years. Although he did not break through with the Way of the Sword, his understanding and comprehension was still above the level it once was.","Tian Changji was stern. He was no longer as relaxed as before. He had already realised that despite the low cultivation of his opponent, he was definitely a tough enemy.","In the next moment, he formed seals with both hands. Powerful energy rushed out of his body, immediately condensing into a pair of lustrous wings. Afterwards, it turned into a pair of blades that slashed towards Jian Chen with terrifying might.","At the same time, Jian Chen slashed out with his Heaven-lifting sword. When he slashed out, his forearm and the Heaven-lifting sword seemed to merge into space, vanishing from view.","Tian Changji’s eyes narrowed. He recalled Xia Mingtian’s description, and his vigilance immediately peaked. He did not dare to hold back any more. A layer of leather armour covered his body, forming a powerful defensive barrier.","The leather armour was anything but ordinary. It was a high quality god artifact!","“I’d like to see if my Heavenly Kylin Armour can block your strange secret technique or not!” Tian Changji was not convinced. He powered his armour with his full strength.","But in the next moment, his expression changed drastically. His eyes narrowed violently, filled with disbelief.","A powerful strand of sword Qi appeared out of nowhere inside his body. When the sword Qi exploded, his organs were torn to shreds like fragile paper.","Spurt! Tian Changji’s mouth sprayed with blood. He turned sheet-white.","“ This secret technique is actually even more powerful than what Xia Mingtian described. ” Tian Changji was shocked. A dense, green light enveloped him. He immediately used the power of the Laws of Wood to heal himself.","Jian Chen was also struck by Tian Changji’s secret technique. The two blade-like wings formed a deep gash on his chest. He was launched away, slamming heavily into the rocks behind him.","But shortly afterwards, Jian Chen stood back up like nothing had happened at all. His injuries closed up at a visible rate, making a complete recovery very quickly.","When he saw how Jian Chen was unscathed again, Tian Changji could not help but gasp deeply. “Xia Mingtian wasn’t lying. You indeed possess a treasure that can allow you to recover quickly. However, I’m certain your regeneration is limited at the end of the day. It can’t be limitless.”","Tian Changji stowed the folding fan away. His eyes were filled with determination. In the next moment, his presence climbed, instantly surpassing his peak condition.","He was igniting his essence blood, burning his foundations to use a terrifying secret technique.","“Divine Court of Ascension!” Suddenly, Tian Changji bellowed out furiously. His face rapidly paled, becoming haggard, but his pressure grew stronger and stronger. It grew so powerful that it stirred up the clouds in the sky, kicking up sand and dust.","As he used the Divine Court of Ascension, a dazzling ball of light appeared above Tian Changji’s head. It illuminated the world like a sun. It was too bright to look at directly.","Under the dazzling light, a dense cluster of structures seemed to manifest. Numerous tall figures sat on them, surging with pressure and giving off an extraordinary aura of valiance.","The Divine Court of Ascension was an ultimate technique of the Immortal Feather sect. Under normal circumstances, only Immortal Exalt ancestors could grasp it. It was extremely powerful.","Jian Chen was stern. He had witnessed this technique when he fought against Xia Mingtian in the Observance Heaven City. He knew exactly how powerful it was. If it were not for the Source of Life, the only way he could have dealt with it was with the Profound Sword Qi to forcefully interrupt it.","Shortly afterwards, a restraining force that Jian Chen was familiar with appeared. The might of the Divine Court of Ascension manifested. It seemed to rewrite the ways and set the laws, turning the space into Tian Changji’s domain. Jian Chen was immobilised.","Afterwards, Jian Chen went through the same experience that he had encountered in the Observance Heaven City. The illusionary figures struck out one by one, launching devastating attacks at Jian Chen.","Each attack possessed terrifying power. Not only could it easily kill Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperors, but even First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would face tremendous danger.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Jian Chen was immobilised, forcefully enduring this devastating barrage of attacks. It left him bloodied and bruised. His body was like a piece of porcelain, covered in countless cracks. He seemed like he could collapse at any time."]},{"number":3902,"title":"Chapter 3902: Tian Changji Perishes (4)","paragraphs":["The vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie, was also fixated on the Divine Court of Ascension, seemingly admiring the ultimate technique of a court of heaven. She paid no concern to Jian Chen’s injuries.","She had personally witnessed just how powerful Jian Chen’s recovery rate was. Let alone the Divine Court of Ascension that could only threaten First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, even she could not threaten Jian Chen when she used her full strength. Her startling battle prowess was enough to challenge those stronger than her, so the dangers he faced right now were nothing.","It all happened in a split second. The numerous attacks from the Divine Court of Ascension were all completed instantly. By the time Tian Changji’s pressure had dissipated, all of Jian Chen’s wounds had recovered as well.","The regeneration from the Source of Life was far too terrifying. It could even heal Jian Chen faster than he was injured.","“You’re a-a-actually completely unscathed!” Tian Changji radiated with a sense of weakness. He stood there with difficulty, staring at the unscathed Jian Chen in disbelief. He was overwhelmed with shock.","“No wonder, no wonder the Wayless Ancestor could never forget about you. The healing treasure you possess probably even has wondrous effects on Immortal Exalts,” Tian Changji said feebly. He looked at Lan Caidie and said, “Vice cult leader Lan, does a treasure like that not tempt you at all?”","Tian Changji began to instigate Lan Caidie. He knew that Lan Caidie had the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal in her. If she triggered that power, it would be devastating. More than half of the Immortal Exalts from the Immortal Feather sect were wary of it.","“I’m not tempted at all.” Lan Caidie shook her head without hesitation. That was a slight lie. She had desire that recovery treasure in the past, even lusting after it, but unfortunately, she was not capable of obtaining it.","As a matter of fact, if she had not fled fast enough, she probably would not even be alive right now.","“You’re an impressive great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, yet you’re actually trying to instigate one of my people to turn against me? What a joke.” Jian Chen sneered. He arrived before Tian Changji with a flash and thrust the Heaven-lifting sword at him.","When he thrust out, numerous blurs appeared before all merging together. It immediately lifted the power of Jian Chen’s attack to a whole new level.","Five superimpositions!","Bang! With a grunt, Tian Changji who had already become extremely feeble no longer had the strength to block Jian Chen’s Five Superimposition Sword. The attack launched him far away, and a white mark appeared on his high quality god artifact armour.","The armour was extremely extraordinary. It was forged from the hide of an Immortal Exalt divine beast. Its defences were very powerful.","Unfortunately, after using the Divine Court of Ascension, Tian Changji had exhausted himself far too much. Not only was he utterly feeble, but he had also drained his vitality. He no longer had the strength to activate the high quality god artifact armour.","As a result, not only did Jian Chen’s attack completely obliterate Tian Changji’s organs, but a large chunk of his flesh on the surface had erupted as well, exposing white bone in many places.","Tian Changji coughed up chunks of flesh and blood again and again. It was mixed in with many pieces of organs. The injuries he sustained were so heavy that even ingesting high grade God Tier pills were not enough to stabilise them.","He quickly used a secret technique without any hesitation, igniting his vitality further before becoming wrapped in scorching flames, instantly vanishing into the distance.","He understood that only death awaited him if he stayed here, so he chose to flee without any hesitation.","Due to using a secret technique from the Immortal Feather sect, he fled with startling speed. Even some Immortal Exalts could not necessarily keep up with him.","If they were in the outside world, perhaps he would have escaped from Jian Chen, but this was the Skyscraping World!","Bang!","He had only fled a thousand kilometres away when Tian Changji ran head-first into a boulder. Due to the protection of the formations, the boulder was undamaged, while Tian Changji was left dazed.","Under the suppression of the formations, the senses of the soul could only reach a hundred kilometres away in the Skyscraping World. Even when the spiritual Qi had thinned out and visibility had reached five hundred kilometres, this was still an unavoidable consequence if they moved too quickly.","In short, it was impossible to move too quickly through the meandering mountain paths.","Jian Chen used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, grasping everything that occurred within several thousand kilometres. Through the fluctuations in spiritual Qi, he locked onto Tian Changji precisely and chased after him.","The Laws of Space perturbed gently around him, allowing Jian Chen to move like he was teleporting. With each flash, he would cover several hundred kilometres.","In the Skyscraping World, Jian Chen suffered from the same restraints. He could not travel at full speed like in the outside world either.","Watching Jian Chen travel off, Lan Caidie hesitated for a moment before letting out a gentle sigh and following him.","Just like that, Tian Changji fled while Jian Chen pursued. They both pushed their speed to the limits, crossing through numerous regions.","In just a few short hours, the two of them had covered several tens of million kilometres.","In the outside world, they could traverse this distance in a split second, but it took several hours in the Skyscraping World","“Chang Yang, just what kind of feud do you have with our Immortal Feather sect? Do you have to pursue me so relentlessly? What benefit do you get from killing me? That will only deepen the Immortal Feather sect’s hatred for you.” Sensing Jian Chen chase after him relentlessly, Tian Changji began to panic slightly, roaring out furiously in response.","He was growing more and more feeble. He could not last much longer.","Jian Chen said nothing as he chased behind him. His eyes shone with killing intent. He was extremely determined to kill Tian Changji. No one could make him waver.","At this moment, the fleeing Tian Changji sensed a hefty presence up ahead.","“ An Immortal Exalt! ” Tian Changji beamed with joy inside. He felt like he had found a ray of hope amongst his despair. He let out a mouthful of essence blood as his speed erupted. He immediately crossed the final bit of distance, appearing near the Immortal Exalt.","He had arrived at a flat area several thousand metres across. A huge stone tablet stood there. Around a dozen figures sat around the stone tablet, ranging from Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals to Immortal Emperors.","A fiery-red figure stood quietly at the foot of the huge stone pillar. He stood with his hands behind his back and his eyes shut, carefully comprehending the secrets of the stone tablet.","From his presence, he had already reached Immortal Exalt, and he was at the Second Heavenly Layer!","At this moment, the Immortal Exalt seemed to sense something, and his eyes snapped open.","Soon after, the bloodied Tian Changji appeared beside the Immortal Exalt. He seemed to lose all of his strength at that moment. He was extremely feeble and haggard in presence.","“I am a great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, Tian Changji. Help me stop this person. Our Immortal Feather sect will definitely thank you heavily...” Tian Changji said. At the same time, he took out a jade bottle and swallowed several medium quality God Tier pills one after another.","Tian Changji’s arrival broke the peace of the place. The cultivators who were comprehending the secrets of the stone tablet all opened their eyes. However, when they saw the bloodied Tian Changji on the edge of death, all of them were shocked. They felt disbelief.","Fighting and killing was unavoidable in the Skyscraping World, but the person before them possessed extraordinary status. He was a great elder of one of the twelve courts of heaven, the Immortal Feather sect.","With such a glorious background, who still had the courage to harm him?"]},{"number":3903,"title":"Chapter 3903: Scarlet Fire’s Choice","paragraphs":["Right when everyone developed the same doubts, powerful sword intent appeared. Jian Chen had arrived like he had teleported over.","He was not in a hurry to kill Tian Changji. Instead, he looked at the Immortal Exalt beside Tian Changji and smiled mysteriously. “Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, I never thought I’d encounter you here. Weren’t you with the Profound Spirit Master?”","The Immortal Exalt in fiery-red robes was the city lord of the Yi Immortal City, one of the three great immortal cities of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt!","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt immediately recognised Jian Chen and furrowed his brows. He looked between the murderous Jian Chen and Tian Changji who was riddled with injuries. Bone-chilling coldness filled his heart. “My objectives are different from the Profound Spirit Master’s, so we parted ways a long time ago.”","Since they were acquainted, Jian Chen could clearly tell that his confidence was somewhat lacking from his tone. He had already guessed that this was due to his eldest son, Chi Yutian.","“Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, are you going to protect this person?” Jian Chen looked at Tian Changji.","“Senior Scarlet Fire, you only need to block this person and buy me ten minutes of time. Afterwards, our Immortal Feather sect will definitely thank you dearly,” Tian Changji said feebly. He was filled with bitterness. If it were not for the special environment of the Skyscraping World, he would have escaped a long time ago with his abilities.","When they heard him mention the gratitude of the Immortal Feather sect, the Immortal Emperors and Immortal Monarchs sitting around them all looked over enviously.","They were not attracted by the treasures that the Immortal Feather sect could reward them with, but they all wanted opportunity to forge a tie with the Immortal Feather sect.","In the past, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt would have been delighted when such a great opportunity presented itself. He would have done everything that he could to curry favour with the Immortal Feather sect.","After all, this person’s status in the Immortal Feather sect was not low. He was a great elder that was only second to the ancestors. He possessed quite a lot of authority.","But right now, when faced with this fantastic opportunity to ingratiate himself with the Immortal Feather sect, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt could only sigh gently. He said with anguish, “I must apologise. The implications of this are too great. Our Yi Immortal City is of meagre strength. We cannot bear the consequences!”","Shaking his head gently, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt no longer remained. With a step, he vanished several hundred kilometres away, refusing to get involved.","Watching the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt disappear, the nearby Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors were all taken aback. They were surprised.","“ This is a heaven-sent opportunity, yet senior Scarlet Fire has just given up on it like this... ”","“ On the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Yi Immortal City’s status is nowhere near as stable as you might imagine. If they can ingratiate themselves with the Immortal Feather sect, then the Yi Immortal City’s status on the Hall Brilliance Heaven will definitely rise. Any organisation that wants to go after the city lord of the Yi Immortal City will have to reconsider. Senior Scarlet Fire is usually quite clever, so why did he suffer from a lapse of judgment at a time like this... ”","“ Foolish. Why don’t you think about what kind of organisation would be behind someone who’s even bold enough to kill a great elder of the Immortal Feather sect? Senior Scarlet Fire has been thoughtful. He might have brought devastation upon himself before he could even ingratiate himself with the Immortal Feather sect... ”","A few Immortal Emperors who happened to be familiar with one another communicated among themselves. After what the last person said, they all fell silent.","Shortly afterwards, an Immortal Emperor stood up and clasped his fist towards Jian Chen amicably, copying the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt and leaving this place.","With someone in the lead, everyone else copied him. All of the cultivators who gathered around the stone tablet left. With someone to warn them, they all considered the potential costs and benefits of the situation. They all refused to take part.","Watching the cultivators in the surroundings scatter, Tian Changji who was already sheet-white became slightly paler. Deep despair filled his eyes.","“Tian Changji, do you still have the strength to flee?” Jian Chen made his way over to Tian Changji slowly with the Heaven-lifting sword. Compared to Tian Changji’s feebleness, Jian Chen was filled with energy. Despite his tattered and bloodied clothes, he did not have a single wound on him. He was in peak condition.","This was the advantage of Chaotic Force. During intense battles, Chaotic Force would always deplete at a slower rate. It was the best for fighting battles of attrition. There was basically no possibility of running out of energy.","Of course, the disadvantage was the recovery and replenishment of Chaotic Force. It would often take several fold the resources compared to cultivators of the same level. Each breakthrough required an astronomical amount of resources as well.","Blood trickled from the corner of Tian Changji’s mouth. His despairing eyes were filled with madness. He laughed aloud. “I don’t care who you are. Only death awaits you when you oppose our Immortal Feather sect...” As soon as he said that, his remaining energy suddenly became abnormally wild. A devastating presence appeared. R₳ꞐỐ฿ÈṨ","“You want to detonate yourself? It’s too late!” Viciousness flashed through Jian Chen’s eyes. He immediately used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. Powerful sword Qi bypassed Tian Changji’s high quality god artifact armour, directly slashing inside his body.","Tian Changji shuddered violently and could not help but let out a grunt. His face was filled with pain. The energy he had gathered for the sake of detonation was completely dispersed.","His attempt at detonation had been forcefully interfered with.","Shortly afterwards, the cold gleam of a sword lit up again. The Heaven-lifting sword in Jian Chen’s hand turned into a blur, piercing Tian Changji’s forehead cleanly. His soul was destroyed.","The great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, Tian Changji, had perished!","With that, all three great elders from the Immortal Feather sect who entered the Skyscraping World had died by Jian Chen’s hand.","Coupled with the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor that he had slain when the Wayless Immortal Exalt was pursuing him, four great elders of the Immortal Feather sect had already died by Jian Chen’s hand.","After killing Tian Changji, Jian Chen was unfazed. He made his way over and collected his Space Ring as well as the high quality god artifact armour.","Even the god artifact that Tian Changji used, the folding fan filled with sword Qi, ended up in Jian Chen’s hands.","At the same time, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt stood quietly several hundred kilometres away, gazing into the distance. He witnessed the entire process of Jian Chen killing Tian Changji fearlessly. He was filled with mixed emotions that he struggled to pacify.","“Fortunately, I had Tian’er’s warning, which made me make the other choice in time. Hopefully, I won’t regret this decision,” the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt murmured. He was in a slight daze. He could not help but recall all the information regarding Jian Chen he had gathered on the Hall Brilliance Heaven.","Back then on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, he already knew that Jian Chen’s background was extraordinary, helping the Immortal Rising City resolve a disaster.","But back then, Jian Chen could only make him wary at most. It was not enough for him to feel fear.","But at this very moment, when the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt personally witnessed how Jian Chen did not even bat an eye when he killed a great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, he finally understood just how terrifying Jian Chen was.","How could his Yi Immortal City afford to provoke a figure who had the courage to publicly oppose a court of heaven?","“You should feel fortunate that you didn’t get involved, or it wouldn’t just be Tian Changji who is dead right now.” Suddenly, a voice rang out from behind the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt."]},{"number":3904,"title":"Chapter 3904: Lan Caidie’s Concerns","paragraphs":["The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt shuddered inside as his wariness rocketed. Immediately, he looked back and saw an elderly figure standing silently in the mist.","She was an old woman, standing there with a cane. Her presence was perfectly contained, so even the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt failed to sense her presence.","“You’re... vice cult leader Lan of the Ghost Immortal cult!” The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt quickly recognised her, and his eyes narrowed. He subconsciously thought of the information he had received from the Profound Spirit Master, which filled him with fear and surprise. He stumbled a few steps back subconsciously.","He had learnt from the Profound Spirit Master that there were a few people that he could never afford to offend in the Skyscraping World. The vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie, happened to be one of them.","When he mentioned vice cult leader Lan Caidie of the Ghost Immortal cult, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt could never forget about the Profound Spirit Master’s expression. With his powerful cultivation as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he was actually very wary of Lan Caidie.","Yet in the end, the existence that even the Profound Spirit Master was wary of had miraculously appeared before his eyes. How could the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt not be surprised?","“I am the city lord of the Yi Immortal City on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, Scarlet Fire. Greetings, vice cult leader Lan!” The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt sucked in a deep breath. He clasped his fist towards Lan Caidie in complete respect. He behaved with great modesty before her.","Lan Caidie nodded gently before staring ahead without saying a word.","Following Lan Caidie’s gaze, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt knew that she was observing Jian Chen. After deliberating, he asked carefully, “Vice cult leader Lan, do you know fellow Yang Yutian as well?”","Lan Caidie said nothing as if she refused to talk with the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was not angered. He could tell that Lan Caidie did not want to converse with him, so he stood to one side quietly.","Not only did the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt remain nearby, but the other cultivators around the stone tablet did not travel too far away either. They all stopped several hundred kilometres away, hiding themselves in the mist.","By now, Jian Chen had finished cleaning up the battlefield. After stowing away the Heaven-lifting sword and his spoils, he made his way back in the direction he had come from, arriving by Lan Caidie’s side in the blink of an eye.","“Let’s go back to where we were before.” When he passed by Lan Caidie, Jian Chen did not stop. After leaving behind that message, he vanished into the mist several hundred kilometres away.","As for the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt who stood nearby, Jian Chen did not even spare a glance at him.","Lan Caidie glanced at Tian Changji’s corpse that lay at the foot of the stone tablet one last time and sighed silently inside before turning around and following Jian Chen.","That sight immediately filled the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt with shock. He could clearly sense from Jian Chen’s demeanour and tone that he clearly treated Lan Caidie like a servant.","“ The vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie, is with Yang Yutian! ” The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was greatly shocked. He had finally understood what Lan Caidie meant initially. If he chose to help Tian Changji, perhaps Lan Caidie would have taken action too.","After Jian Chen left, the cultivators lingering around all returned to the giant stone tablet. When they saw Tian Changji’s corpse, they all fell silent.","“I’ll take out this fellow of the Immortal Feather sect’s corpse and then find some way to hand it over to the Immortal Feather sect.” After a lengthy silence, an Immortal Emperor finally broke the heavy atmosphere. He created a casket using rock on the spot and carefully placed Tian Changji’s corpse inside.","“You better think things through. You better not mishandle this and end up enduring the wrath of the Immortal Feather sect instead, facing disaster for no good reason.” An Immortal Emperor warned him.","“I will tell them about what happened here truthfully. The Immortal Feather sect is one of the twelve courts of heaven. They will be reasonable,” the Immortal Emperor who collected Tian Changji’s corpse said sternly.","“G-great elder, y-you better stop saying that. W-what if that senior returns...” an early Immortal Monarch said in a trembling manner. He was extremely fearful, afraid that words might lead to disaster.","When he heard that, the Immortal Emperor who collected Tian Changji’s corpse subconsciously quieted down. He glanced in the direction that Jian Chen left in as his expression changed several times. He was also afraid of retribution.","In the end, he made up his mind and left without hesitation, immediately swallowed by the thick mist in the distance.","His departure made the dozen or so remaining cultivations glance at one another. Some of them also wanted to flee from this place of strife, just in case they were dragged in, but they were also reluctant to go when they looked at the tall stone tablet in front of them.","“What do we do? Do we leave or not? A great elder of the Immortal Feather sect died here...”","“This is one of the nine secret techniques that senior Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind. If we just move on, it’s such a pity...”","......","...","In the end, only a few of the original dozen or so cultivators chose to stay behind. The others all gave up on the opportunity here after some deliberation, fleeing from the place.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt was one of the few who stayed behind. He dismissed his thoughts and continued comprehending the secrets of the stone tablet.","He had not grasped the Laws of the Sword, but he still hoped to gain some insight from the nine secret techniques of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable.","Jian Chen and Lan Caidie returned to the medicinal garden. They repeated the same trick. Jian Chen was responsible for draining the spiritual Qi from the area, while Lan Caidie and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt would use the Energy-devouring Furnace to deplete the spiritual Qi.","However, after killing Tian Changji from the Immortal Feather sect, Jian Chen did not encounter any more people who tried to rob him for a very long time.","Jian Chen obviously preferred the peace he received, but Lan Caidie became much quieter than before. She had a long face all day long, where her wrinkles were squished together. She seemed like something was bothering her.","“Are you worried about retribution from the Immortal Feather sect?”","After eliminating a few more medicinal gardens, Jian Chen finally asked while Lan Caidie was free from picking heavenly resources.","Only after a moment of silence did Lan Caidie say sternly, “Although Tian Changji’s death has nothing to do with me, too many people already know that I am with you. If I had nothing tying me down, I would have no fears, but the Ghost Immortal cult behind me...”","Lan Caidie sighed heavily when she reached there.","“When I encounter Xing Caijian again, I’ll discuss this with her and see if the Heavenly Star Palace can help your Ghost Immortal cult handle this misunderstanding. After all, I was the one who killed the people from the Immortal Feather sect, not your Ghost Immortal cult,” said Jian Chen.","“If it were any other organisation, the Heavenly Star Palace could obviously resolve it with ease, but it’s different this time. Great elders from the Immortal Feather sect have died, and it’s three all at once.” Lan Caidie looked at Jian Chen and said with worry, “Actually, there’s something else I’m worried about apart from the Ghost Immortal cult, which is how the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect will handle this matter. I’m even worried that a war will erupt between the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect if this is mishandled.”","“I don’t need the Heavenly Star Palace to help me deal with my matter. I can handle it myself,” Jian Chen said without any concerns.","Very soon, they set off again towards the next medicinal garden.","But this time, when Jian Chen arrived at his destination, the medicinal garden had already vanished. All that remained was a field of holes. Clearly, someone had beat him to it."]},{"number":3905,"title":"Chapter 3905: Proceeding to the Mountain Peak","paragraphs":["Jian Chen stared at the barren medicinal garden. His eyes flickered slightly before secretly calling the sword spirits, “ Zi Ying, Qing Suo, help me sense if there is the presence of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star here. ”","Several seconds later, Jian Chen received a reply from the sword spirits. There was indeed a hint of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s power and presence.","After receiving the news, Jian Chen could not help but smile gently. He said to himself, “That princess from the Heavenly Star Palace has finally come to her senses. She’s realised that it wasn’t easy nurturing all these heavenly resources, and it’s an utter waste to just destroy them.”","“C’mon, let’s go to the next place.”","Jian Chen led Lan Caidie towards the next medicinal garden, but when they reached their destination, it was also an area of barren land. There was also a wisp of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s presence that lingered in this place.","“ Xing Caijian again! ” Jian Chen found it to be quite a pity. He immediately continued onwards with Lan Caidie, visiting the other medicinal gardens that they had not visited yet.","But along the way, all of the medicinal gardens Jian Chen passed by had been harvested by Xing Caijian. He obtained nothing as a result.","After visiting several medicinal gardens one after another, Jian Chen finally gave up on the thought of finding another medicinal garden. He was already certain that not a single medicinal garden remained in the other regions of the Skyscraping World.","Xing Caijian was faster than him. She had harvested around sixty percent of them, while Jian Chen had only harvested forty percent of the medicinal gardens.","On top of that, Jian Chen could tell from the various traces that Xing Caijian had already cleaned up these medicinal gardens several months ago. With her speed at destroying these formations, Jian Chen really wondered if he could have obtained even half as much as he did if she had not intentionally left some to him.","Perhaps he would have only been able to obtain ten percent!","With a flip of his hand, Jian Chen took out the map that detailed where the medicinal gardens were located in the Skyscraping World. The Skyscraping World was shaped like a huge mountain. The foot and waist of the mountain was all connected, with countless paths that he could take.","Only the region near the peak had been isolated. In order to enter that region, there was only one path available.","The peak of the mountain also happened to be where they would compete for the seed of ways.","That was because according to the past cases, the seed of ways would only appear in the region around the mountain peak. At the very least, there had yet to be a case when it fled towards the lower regions.","Jian Chen’s eyes landed on the six red dots on the top of the mountain. That represented the location of six medicinal gardens.","“Those are probably the six last medicinal gardens left in the Skyscraping World.”","“Though it looks like the organisations behind these six medicinal gardens are astounding to be able to establish their medicinal gardens there,” Jian Chen said to himself.","“If I’ve guessed correctly, her majesty has probably dealt with the six medicinal gardens already,” Lan Caidie stood beside Jian Chen and said in thought as she gazed at the map in his hands.","When he heard that, Jian Chen could only let out a sigh of utter pity. He knew that Lan Caidie was right. The six medicinal gardens near the mountain peak were probably no longer his business.","Shortly afterwards, he took out the Energy-devouring Furnace and sent the senses of his soul inside. When he saw the shimmering energy crystals that had already formed mountainous piles, he let out a smile of satisfaction.","Just the energy crystals condensed from absorbing the power of the formations were of startling value, even if he forgot about the heavenly resources he had obtained.","That was because these energy crystals came from a total of several dozen protective formations. Each protective formation was very powerful and abundant with energy. Even though the Energy-devouring Furnace could only convert a very small amount of the energy into energy crystals, the quantity was still extremely startling when he pooled several dozen piles of them together.","“If I check the time, the seed of ways should emerge close. It’s time for me to head up.” Jian Chen turned his gaze and stared at the long flight of stairs on the map. Anticipation filled his eyes.","Even though he had already had a bountiful harvest in the Skyscraping World, the seed of ways was his original reason for coming here.","Lan Caidie heard Jian Chen’s plans and said, “The path leading to the top of the mountain won’t be easy to take. Many powerful formations will be hiding there. There are even some powerful killing formations that can pose a threat to Immortal Exalts.”","“As the place where you compete for the seed of ways, it’s nowhere near as safe up there as down here. Once you do go up, you are basically under constant threat. It’s extremely dangerous. Weaker Immortal Exalts might even end up dying.”","Jian Chen nodded. “I obviously understand what you’re saying. In order to reduce the competition for the seed of ways, many people will set up powerful killing formations up there, but do you think these formations will pose a threat to me?”","“I’m only giving you a warning. Oftentimes, danger comes in an instant. I’m afraid that you’ll suffer from not being prepared beforehand,” said Lan Caidie.","Afterwards, Jian Chen and Lan Caidie continued on the way. They made their way towards the top of the mountain. When they encountered some low grade God Tier heavenly resources along the way, neither of them even spared a second glance. They solely focused on travelling.","After harvesting the heavenly resources of several dozen medicinal gardens, Jian Chen had truly become thriftless. A few low grade God Tier heavenly resources were completely beneath his attention now. He could not even be bothered with picking them.","Now that it was getting closer and closer to the emergence of the seed of ways, Jian Chen gave up on comprehending the stone tablets he came across as well.","As they approached the top of the mountain, Jian Chen also noticed that there were more and more formation.","These formations were completely hidden in the space there. If it were for Lan Caidie’s warning, Jian Chen would not have noticed them.","As a matter of fact, there were some formations that even with Lan Caidie to warn him, Jian Chen still could not spot them at all.","It was impossible to sense their existence unless his cultivation had reached a certain level.","Of course, not all of the formations were hidden away either. Some of the formations were openly exposed. Anyone with some cultivation could spot them.","These formations were not to target the cultivators that had entered the Skyscraping World. They only served as warnings and obstacles to block off weaker cultivators.","The two of them travelled swiftly. When they were still a few thousand kilometres from the peak, Jian Chen suddenly stopped. Through the surrounding spiritual Qi, he could already sense the presence of many Immortal Exalts gathered near the path leading to the mountain peak.","He could not help but recall the group of Immortal Exalts who were very interested in him when he first entered the Skyscraping World when he saw this.","“That’s the flight of stairs up ahead. Past the flight of stairs, you’ll officially enter the range of the mountain peak.” Lan Caidie stared ahead. She could only see a few hundred kilometres away, which had reduced from the original five hundred to three hundred as the spiritual Qi of the Skyscraping World gradually recovered.","“There are people intentionally waiting for me up ahead. I’ll travel alone for now. You don’t have to follow me for the time being. You can come up once I enter the region around the peak,” Jian Chen said to Lan Caidie.","“I know you don’t fear them, but it’s not a good idea to reveal your trump cards too early. Do you really not need my assistance?” Lan Caidie asked sternly.","“With you by my side, it instead restricts me. Don’t forget about how the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit ended up in my hands,” Jian Chen said calmly.","Lan Caidie narrowed her eyes. She immediately recalled Jian Chen’s eerie ability to vanish when she tried to obtain the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.","Afterwards, Lan Caidie simply stopped. She borrowed the thick mist to hide herself, while Jian Chen proceeded alone towards the choke point leading to the top of the mountain."]},{"number":3906,"title":"Chapter 3906: Immortal Exalts Gather","paragraphs":["As Jian Chen made his way to the mountaintop, it was not peaceful outside the Skyscraping World.","At this moment, the Scholar Capital Master who sat in the cold and dark space opened his eyes once again. He could not hide his anxiety.","He calculated the time. Who knew how many times he had repeated that. His knitted eyebrows remained furrowed.","“If I look at the time, more than half of the Skyscraping World’s opening has elapsed already...” the Scholar Capital Master murmured. After he spent several decades waiting here, each passing day felt like agonising torture to him. He was worried about the situation on the Modest Silence Heaven, but he was also concerned about the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that he had nurtured after all that difficulty.","“ Nothing is more important than my Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. As for the situation on the Modest Silence Heaven, hopefully the Dreaming Autumn Nun can last a little longer. ” The Scholar Capital Master sighed inside.","At this moment, a streak of light shot through the darkness, reaching him with unbelievable speed.","“Hmm? The Scholar Capital Master of the Modest Silence Heaven!” An elderly voice rang out from the light. Then the light subsided and revealed an old man in long, black robes.","He had a slender figure, radiating with sword intent. His body contained a tremendous amount of energy, so even a casual gesture of his had the power to destroy stars.","He was a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He grasped the Laws of the Sword, so his attacks were sharp and decisive. As a result, his battle prowess already rivalled some relatively ordinary Sixth Heavenly Layer experts.","“Scholar Capital Master, what are you doing so far away here instead of watching over the Modest Silence Heaven?” the old man in black robes asked.","“So it’s the ancestor of the Sword Sect of Jade Clouds from the Cloud Extent Heaven, the Cloud Furnace Master. Why’d you leave the Sword Sect of Jade Clouds and come all the way here?” the Scholar Capital Master replied with a similar question.","When he heard that, the Cloud Furnace Master immediately erupted with killing intent. He said coldly, “I personally established a medicinal garden in the Skyscraping World. The several dozen high grade God Tier heavenly resources growing in there had all been gathered arduously by me after many years. Each one of them is extremely rare, yet in the end, these heavenly resources have all been stolen by some clueless kid. I’ve personally come here to intercept him at the entrance.”","When he heard that, the Scholar Capital Master’s expression could not help but change. “They’ve already reached high grade God Tier, so why did you keep them in the Skyscraping World? Don’t tell me you wanted these heavenly resources to continue evolving?”","“It’s because these heavenly resources are extremely special. They cannot be preserved over long periods of time. No matter how you store them, they’ll only last ten thousand years. After that, their effects will gradually bleed away. I prepared these resources to refine a supreme God Tier pill to increase my chances of breaking through once I had reached the peak of my current realm of cultivation. The day I need that pill refined might be several hundred thousand years in the future. If I stored them in jade boxes, less than a tenth of their effects would have remained.”","“Due to the geography of my Sword Sect of Jade Clouds, the spiritual Qi there is quite violent, which is unsuited for these heavenly resources. As a result, with no other choice, I was forced to move these heavenly resources into the Skyscraping World, using its environment to preserve their efficacy.”","“The Skyscraping World only opens once every several hundred thousand years. Whenever it opens, the people who enter aren’t particularly strong. I’ve set up a powerful formation, which cannot be breached with their strength. As a result, it could be said that the heavenly resources were extremely safe inside.”","“Furthermore, our Sword Sect of Jade Clouds has very few enemies in the Immortals’ World. Who would take on the risk of offending our Sword Sect of Jade Clouds just to go after these heavenly resources?”","Reaching there, the Cloud Furnace Master’s voice was filled with great confidence. That was confidence in his strength and reputation.","“Cloud Furnace Master, you underestimate the cultivators of the world far too much. In the Immortals’ World, there is no shortage of enthusiastic people who are willing to gamble their lives for the sake of an opportunity.” The Scholar Capital Master sighed gently. When he heard about the Cloud Furnace Master’s encounter, he immediately felt sympathy.","“Yeah, that was indeed a miscalculation on my behalf. I never thought there’d actually be a clueless fool who would turn his attention towards my treasures.” The Cloud Furnace Master ground his teeth. He utterly hated the person who stole the heavenly resources.","“Oh right, Scholar Capital Master. What brings you here?” The Cloud Furnace Master looked at the Scholar Capital Master.","“I suffered the same incident as you. A heavenly resource that was extremely important to me was stolen by some clueless kid in the Skyscraping World,” the Scholar Capital Master said calmly. Soon afterwards, he thought of something and asked, “Cloud Furnace Master, do you remember the identity of the person who stole your heavenly resources?”","The Cloud Furnace Master furrowed his brows and said in thought, “I don’t know his identity or origins. I only managed to tell that he was a mere Immortal Emperor.”","“A mere Immortal Emperor?” The Scholar Capital Master suddenly narrowed his eyes.","“He does indeed appear to be an Immortal Emperor on the surface, but I’m confident that he’s not the main perpetrator. I could vaguely sense the presence of an Immortal Exalt nearby,” the Cloud Furnace Master said sternly.","At this moment, another streak of light shot over from afar, crossing through the sea of stars in the blink of an eye and appearing near the Scholar Capital Master and the Cloud Furnace Master.","He was a skinny, middle-aged man. He wore black robes; his appearance was quite hideous. His flesh seemed to have been forcefully healed after it had already rotted away.","“Corroding Venom Ancestor!”","The black-robed man’s appearance immediately made the Scholar Capital Master furrow his brows, while the Cloud Furnace Master cried out. His gazed at the man in black warily.","The Corroding Venom Master was also a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. His original form was a venomous serpent. After undergoing numerous trials and tribulations, he finally evolved into a venomous dragon. He possessed the body of a divine beast, and his battle prowess was very great. He was known to be invincible among his peers.","Even the Cloud Furnace Master who grasped the Laws of the Sword and possessed extremely powerful attacks believed he was not the Corroding Venom Ancestor’s opponent.","Soon after the Corroding Venom Ancestor arrived, several other experts reached here after a journey through outer space. Even the weakest were Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. As for the strongest, apart from the Scholar Capital Master, there was an old woman known as the Divine Monarch of Cursing Heavens. She was skilled in the Laws of Curses.","“I never thought everyone would all come for the same matter. Over all these years, the possessions we’ve left in the Skyscraping World have been safe and sound, yet this time, all of us have suffered heavy losses. Looking at that, we can almost be certain that it’s the same person behind this,” the Divine Monarch of Cursing Heavens said sternly.","“If I lose the high grade heavenly resources in the Skyscraping World, then our sect will suffer a severe loss. There will be many important God Tier pills that we won’t be able to refine any time soon, so I must recover the heavenly resources...”","“Recovering the heavenly resources is only the first point. The second point is finding out exactly who’s bold enough to actually rob my possessions...”","“It doesn’t matter who it is. We’ll make them pay a heavy price. As for the organsation behind them, I recommend that we band together and destroy it...”","......","...","Over a dozen experts had already gathered outside the Skyscraping World. None of them were weaklings. After all, without sufficient strength, it was pointless for them to come in the first place.","Among these experts, some of them had left behind a wisp of their souls in the medicinal gardens, so they knew it was an Immortal Emperor and Immortal Exalt who robbed their medicinal gardens. There were also some people who did not leave behind a wisp of their soul, instead finding out through other ways. As such, they were uncertain about what had exactly unfolded in the Skyscraping World.","Of course, apart from Jian Chen, there was also the daughter of the heavenly emperor from the Heavenly Star Palace, Xing Caijian, who was destroying the medicinal gardens.","But without any exception, all of the experts who knew about Xing Caijian did not come here."]},{"number":3907,"title":"Chapter 3907: The Star of the Show Arrives","paragraphs":["The path that led to the top of the Skyscraping World was a long, stone staircase. It trailed down from the heavens like a white dragon. Setting foot on the stone staircase was like embarking on a path to heaven.","Only when he stood before the stone steps did Jian Chen properly understand the scale and grandiose of the stone steps. Each stone step was twenty-seven metres tall and two hundred and seventy steps wide. As he stood before the step, it was like he was facing a mirror-smooth cliff face.","Formations extended through the interior of the stone steps. From time to time, they would produce terrifying pulses of energy that could even bring chills to Immortal Exalts.","Very clearly, the formations used to protect these stone steps were even stronger than the formations used in other areas.","Standing before the first stone step, Jian Chen sucked in a deep breath before making his way up step by step with his hands behind his back.","He seemed to teleport, crossing several steps with each step.","Just like that, Jian Chen made his way upwards with composure like he was on a casual stroll.","At the same time, over a dozen figures sat at the top of the staircase, radiating with the pressure of Immortal Exalts.","Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens from the Wondrous Success Heaven was among them.","Apart from him, there was also the Heavenloss Master from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul.","As well as the Profound Spirit Master from the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights from the Cloud Extent Heaven.","They either gathered together or sat alone, conversing with one another at a leisurely pace. They would furrow their brows sometimes or smile gently at other times.","However, the topic they discussed the most were the rumours regarding Yang Yutian.","The news that Yang Yutian slew great elder Tian Changji of the Immortal Feather sect had spread already. Now, many Immortal Exalts had heard about it, which left them all shocked.","Some of them guessed at Yang Yutian’s background and origins. They were certain that it was no weaker than a court of heaven, possessing the great heritage that left them fearless of the courts of heaven.","There were also some experts who claimed that Yang Yutian was truly just an independent cultivator. He simply did as he pleased without any tethers, which was why he could behave so fearlessly.","There were also some people who guessed that some kind of connection existed between Yang Yutian and the Heavenly Star Palace. He had the Heavenly Star Palace backing him, which was why he did not fear the Immortal Feather sect.","“Oh right, I’ve suddenly remembered something.” At this moment, a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt old man suddenly spoke up. Seeing how many people looked at him, he cleared his throat and continued, “Fellows, do you still remember that bounty that the Immortal Feather sect released in the past?”","“Of course I do. The bounty had been personally issued by an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Immortal Feather sect. They wanted an Immortal Emperor called Chang Yang. Who knows what incriminating thing that person did to actually make the Immortal Feather sect come after him like this...”","“Chang Yang is a mid Immortal Emperor. He cultivates the Chaotic Body and comprehends the Laws of the Sword. He possesses startling battle prowess. Even regular late Immortal Emperors aren’t his opponent...”","“I heard he also possesses a treasure that can hide his presence perfectly. Why do I feel like the Chang Yang that the Immortal Feather sect is after bears great similarity to Yang Yutian...”","When he said that, many of the Immortal Exalts present sank into their thoughts. They all found that the special characteristics lined up a little too well.","“Surely not. After all, not only are Chang Yang and Yang Yutian’s presence and appearance different, but Chang Yang used a medium quality god artifact, while Yang Yutian uses a high quality god artifact,” someone said in rebuke.","“Appearances and presences can be changed. There is some difficulty to that, but it’s not impossible. As for the difference in god artifacts... fellow, don’t tell me you’ve only ever used one god artifact in your life?”","When faced with an answer like that, the person who rebuked them immediately shut up.","Hearing everyone’s discussions, the face of the Profound Spirit Master who sat on the steps changed again and again. He seemed uncertain.","“Regardless of whether Chang Yang and Yang Yutian are the same person or not, his bravery is commendable. He’s just an Immortal Emperor, yet he actually has the courage to provoke one of the twelve courts of heaven, the Immortal Feather sect. He’s even offended the Immortal Feather sect to such a great degree, killing their great elders. That’s basically beyond the point of reconciliation.” The Heavenless Master sighed near the Profound Spirit Master.","His descendant had tied the knot with the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, forging a tie for the entire sect. That was fantastic news, but even with a background like that, the Heavenloss Master still did not have the courage to offend the Immortal Feather sect at all.","“ Heavenloss Master, do you still remember the junior who stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? ” the Profound Spirit Master suddenly communicated. He only spoke to the Heavenloss Master. None of the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings could hear his voice.","“ Of course, I do. A major reason why I’m guarding this place is because of him. If he doesn’t come to the peak, then so be it, but if he does, I won’t spare him, ” the Heavenloss Master ground his teeth. Back then, in the cave where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew, they had already agreed he would take it. The Heavenloss Master had already begun treating the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing as his private possession. If someone tried to take it, that would be trying to rob him.","“ I suspect the person who stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was actually Yang Yutian! ”","He had realised that Jian Chen was definitely far more difficult to deal with than he had initially imagined. After all, he had fearlessly killed Tian Changji, and he was likely the Chang Yang that the Immortal Feather sect had issued a bounty for. As such, he wanted to rope in the Heavenless Master from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul.","“ What? That person was Yang Yutian? ” The Heavenloss Master was greatly surprised, but upon closer thought, he discovered that the identifying characteristics of the Immortal Emperor who miraculously stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that day lined up with Yang Yutian.","The Heavenloss Master’s eyes turned cold. He ground his teeth as he thought, “ So that’s Yang Yutian. No wonder he was so reckless. No wonder he possessed that ability as well, where we couldn’t find him even with so many Immortal Exalts. ”","“ Looks like that’s also the reason why the experts of the Immortal Feather sect have failed to capture him, forced to issue a bounty to the entire Immortals’ World. ”","“ Not only is Yang Yutian fearless and reckless, Xing Caijian shows him goodwill for some reason. Heavenloss Master, how do you plan on dealing with this? ” the Profound Spirit Master asked.","“ Hmph, it doesn’t matter who he is or how great his background is. He needs to spit out the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. That’s an offering specially prepared for the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. In the present Immortals’ World, who dares to steal from the elder princess? ” The Heavenloss Master’s eyes shone coldly. Towards the end, his voice was filled with great confidence and haughtiness that looked down on all.","It was true. In the eyes of the Immortal Exalts of the Immortals’ World, although the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance had not become a Grand Exalt yet, she was already akin to one.","She faced the four supreme ancestors of the Sacred Beast clan alone, yet she still managed to defeat them, emerging unscathed.","Apart from Grand Exalts, no one in the current Immortals’ World could replicate such a feat.","“Hmm? Isn’t that Yang Yutian? Yang Yutian is here...”","At this moment, a voice called out, and the dozen or so Immortal Exalts seated on the steps looked over. All they saw was a figure climbing up through the mist, growing clearer and clearer."]},{"number":3908,"title":"Chapter 3908: The Heavenloss Master","paragraphs":["That figure was Jian Chen!","Right now, Jian Chen strolled along the long staircase to the top leisurely with his hands behind his back. His face remained composed as if he had not noticed all the Immortal Exalts sitting above.","Among these Immortal Exalts, basically the majority were there for Jian Chen. Initially, they did not possess much of an understanding of him. They only began paying attention to him because of the daughter of the heavenly emperor from the Heavenly Star Palace, Xing Caijian. Xing Caijian clearly did not know Jian Chen, yet she treated him in such a special manner the first time she met him. She had clearly noticed something.","As a result, many of them suspected that Jian Chen was probably hiding a huge secret, which made them want to investigate him. Some even develop ulterior motives.","In the past, they definitely would have leapt at Jian Chen immediately.","But now, after learning that Jian Chen had killed great elder Tian Changji of the Immortal Feather sect and how it was extremely likely for him to be the Chang Yang that the Immortal Feather sect were after, the experts who originally developed ulterior motives all sank into thought and hesitation.","“Yang Yutian!” At this moment, a deep voice boomed out. The Heavenloss Master from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul stood up from his seated posture. He arrived in the middle of the steps with his hands behind his back, blocking Jian Chen’s path. He gazed down at him from above.","Jian Chen stopped several stone steps away from the Heavenloss Master. He raised his head slightly and looked at the Heavenloss Master above him. He could not help but furrow his eyes, saying with some displeasure, “What?”","The Heavenloss Master was unconcerned about Jian Chen’s indifferent attitude. He was not expecting a junior who was even bold enough to offend the Immortal Feather sect to show him much respect, so he cut right to the chase. He said sternly, “Were you the one who stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing or not?”","When the Heavenloss Master asked that, the eyes of many of the Immortal Exalts seated there narrowed. They were surprised.","Perhaps some of them had already made a connection between Jian Chen and the mysterious figure who stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, but there were also people who had not. That was why they were so surprised when they heard the Heavenloss Master’s question.","Not only did he provoke the Immortal Feather sect, but he even had the courage to steal an offering to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. They could no longer use words to describe such madness.","“Was the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing stolen?” Jian Chen stared straight at the Heavenloss Master. There was a hint of scorn in his voice.","“Hmph, everyone had already agreed that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing would belong to me as my private possession, yet in the end, you stole it by hiding in the shadows. Is that not theft?” the Heavenloss Master said righteously. His gaze was very sharp.","“What a joke. What an absolute joke. Heavenloss Master, if you just said that it would come down to a contention of strength, I’d still have some respect for you, but you’re actually shameless enough to view the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing as your private possession, completely obscuring the fact that you’re just here to rob me. Such hypocrisy is truly contemptful.” Jian Chen sneered without holding back.","“How dare you! Yang Yutian, do you know who you’re talking to?” The Heavenloss Master flew into a rage.","“I obviously know who I’m talking to. You’re the Heavenloss Master. You come from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul. Because the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance took a liking to one of your descendants, he was married into the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. The entire Sword Sect of Yang Soul’s status has benefitted through this connection to an existence that only Grand Exalts can shake,” Jian Chen said with ease. When he mentioned the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, he sighed inside. He could not help but think of that graceful figure.","“Since you know that our Sword Sect of Yang Soul has deep connections with the Divine Palace of Great Radiance, you should also know that our Sword Sect of Yang Soul is not an existence that you can provoke. No matter what your background is, even if it’s something as terrifying as a court of heaven, you’ll end up prostrating on the ground as long as you incur the elder princess’s wrath,” the Heavenloss Master said coldly.","“Your Sword Sect of Yang Soul wants to use the elder princess’s influence to steal from others. What will she think of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul if she finds out about this?” Jian Chen asked.","The Heavenloss Master’s eyes narrowed as he said coldly, “Yang Yutian, you openly claim that I’m stealing from others, but what evidence do you have? If you don’t have any evidence, then with my status as an Immortal Exalt, I am not one to be accused of by a mere Immortal Emperor like you.”","“Since you won’t admit it, then let me tell you a little bit about the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.” Jian Chen paused and glanced past the Immortal Exalts. He discovered that many of them had been present around the sword pool where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was originally left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. Afterwards, it was discovered by the Scholar Capital Master from the Modest Silence Heaven. At the time, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was not at high quality. Perhaps the Scholar Capital Master needed a better Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, so he set up an extremely high quality concealing formation outside the cave where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was growing to hide it. That was why no one discovered any trace of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing over all these years.”","“That was until I entered. I happened to discover the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. I went through tremendous effort to remove the Scholar Capital Master’s formation to find the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing hiding inside.”","“I could have picked the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing immediately, but I discovered that it was about to evolve, so I gave up on that idea. I ended up sacrificing a tremendous amount of resources to feed it, which was why it managed to complete the final part of its journey in this limited amount of time, truly completing its evolution.”","“Meanwhile, you were drawn over by the presence that the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing gave off when it evolved.”","Jian Chen glanced past the Heavenloss Master and looked at one of the figures behind him. “And you, Seven Antelope Ancestor, was the first Immortal Exalt to arrive.”","The figure that Jian Chen was looking at was the Seven Antelope Ancestor.","But at this moment, the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s face was sunken. He stared at Jian Chen viciously and ground his teeth. “So you were the Immortal Emperor who stopped me!”","“That’s right, that was me. However, even if I didn’t stop you, you wouldn’t have obtained the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. You might have even destroyed something so precious,” Jian Chen said indifferently.","The Seven Antelope Ancestor snorted coldly and said nothing more. Even though he also understood this, it still weighed on his mind constantly.","“Yang Yutian, spout all the nonsense you want, but I only have one request. Hand over the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing!” The Heavenloss Master’s face did not change. He said firmly, “Even if what you said is true, that can’t change the end result. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is to be offered to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. It is not something that you can possess.”","“So you’re not going to call me a thief anymore? Are you planning on taking it by force now?” Jian Chen sneered.","The Heavenloss Master’s gaze was cold. “You too are aware that possession all comes down to a matter of strength. If you hand over the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, we can forget about everything that happened. If you don’t, then you won’t just be offending the Immortal Feather sect but also our Sword Sect of Yang Soul and the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.”","“Your Sword Sect of Yang Soul can even make decisions for the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance?” Jian Chen said.","“Hmph, the elder princess possesses paramount authority in the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. When the time comes, I only need to make a slight mention of this before the elder princess. No matter what kind of background you have, it’ll be useless,” the Heavenloss Master said.","Jian Chen began to laugh. He was very relaxed, without feeling any pressure at all. “Sure. Actually, I’d like to see if the elder princess you’re relying on will actually help you or not when the time comes.”","“Looks like you plan on being obstinate.” the Heavenloss Master’s face immediately sank. His voice became icy. “Yang Yutian, I’ve given you an opportunity. Since you refuse to comply, I’ll have to claim it myself.” After saying that, a tremendous presence erupted from the Heavenloss Master. The quiet stone steps were immediately engulfed by fierce winds. A violent storm of energy wreaked havoc in the surroundings.","The Heavenloss Master struck out directly. Endless sword Qi immediately permeated his surroundings. As he formed seals, a cloud of dense sword Qi poured down like a barrage, engulfing the space where Jian Chen resided."]},{"number":3909,"title":"Chapter 3909: Surrounded by Immortal Exalts","paragraphs":["There were many First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts around the stone steps, but their expressions all changed when they witnessed the might behind the Heavenloss Master’s attack.","The Heavenloss Master did not hold back at all, completely displaying his strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. The attack was so powerful that even some of the First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts nearby had no confidence in blocking it.","The Heavenloss Master was no regular Second Heavenly Layer expert. He came from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul. He was a powerful Immortal Exalt who had comprehended the Laws of the Sword with sharp and swift attacks.","Jian Chen became stern. From that attack, he could tell that the Heavenloss Master was much stronger than the Seven Antelope Ancestor who also happened to be at the Second Heavenly Layer.","Without any hesitation, he drew the Heaven-lifting sword. As Chaotic Force surged in, the sword erupted with blinding light. He immediately produced a net of slashes in front of him.","The slashes overlapped, filling the space and seemingly forming an airtight wall to block the Heavenloss Master’s barrage.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","Deafening rumbles rang out on the stone steps. The scattered sword Qi filled the skies as the powerful storms of energy swept through the surroundings.","The dozen or so Immortal Exalt on the steps all began to block the incoming storm of sword Qi. Some of them used their cultivation to condense thick barriers of energy, while others drew out their various defensive god artifacts to avoid being affected.","The Heavenloss Master was surrounded in a layer of blinding Laws of the Sword. He had his left hand behind his back while his right hand pointed at Jian Chen. He seemed to become a sharp sword himself, cleaving the incoming storm of energy in half.","A while later, the storm of sword Qi gradually subsided. The Heavenloss Master’s presence continued to surge, remaining stationary without budging like a divine sword. The sword intent he gave off left a few other Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts deeply wary.","Meanwhile, Jian Chen had already retreated over a hundred steps. He did not wear the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, so he was already covered in blood. He was covered in densely-packed wounds, which was a hideous sight to behold. He had been pierced all the way through multiple times, with entire chunks of flesh missing.","His Chaotic Body was very powerful. It was known to be invincible among his peers. However, the difference in cultivation was far too great. With several minor realms of cultivation and a major realm of cultivation separating them, it was already extremely impressive that he could remain standing.","Despite his severe-looking injuries, Jian Chen’s presence continued to soar. There were no signs of weakening or feebleness.","He raised the Heaven-lifting sword high up in the air. The blinding light it gave off was dazzling like a sun as he slashed at the Heavenloss Master.","“You’re overestimating yourself to be swinging your sword at me with your bit of strength.” The Heavenloss Master shook his head gently and mocked him openly when he saw that.","But in the next moment, his expression changed drastically. He shook violently and let out an uncontrollable grunt. Blood flowed out from the corner of his lips.","“I didn’t think you’d actually know such a strange secret technique. You actually managed to bypass all of my defences and injure me with your measly strength as a mid Immortal Emperor.” The way that the Heavenloss Master looked at Jian Chen changed slightly. He took him a little more seriously, but shortly afterwards, he sneered. “Unfortunately, your cultivation is too low. Even when you’ve grasped such a mysterious and powerful secret technique, you’ve only left a painless scratch on me.”","“Fellows, please surround this place for me. I’ll definitely capture this kid alive today.”","“Hahahaha, you have nothing to worry about, fellow Heavenloss. This person is going nowhere today!” The Profound Spirit Master from the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights was the first one to stand forward. He arrived below Jian Chen with a flash, blocking his path of retreat.","At the same time, the Immortal Exalts sitting in the surroundings all stood up one by one, answering the Heavenloss Master’s call. They gathered nearby to block off Jian Chen’s paths of retreat.","At this moment, a total of ten Immortal Exalts surrounded Jian Chen, including the Heavenloss Master. Only a few remained seated nearby without taking any action.","However, despite being trapped, Jian Chen remained unfazed. He did not panic at all. His injuries healed at a visible rate. His rate of recovery left many of the nearby Immortal Exalts envious and jealous.","He looked past the Heavenloss Master, gazing at a region of space behind him.","He sensed a powerful pulse of energy from there. Clearly, something like a trap was hidden there, waiting for him to throw himself into it. Even if he wore the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and used its ability to hide itself, he could not pass through.","Clearly, these Immortal Exalts had already taken countermeasures after what happened at the sword pool.","“Yang Yutian, I’ll give you one last chance. Are you going to hand over the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing or not?” the Heavenloss Master bellowed furiously.","The Immortal Exalts who answered the Heavenloss Master’s call and surrounded Jian Chen all stared at him with sharp gazes. Their faces were filled with determination, staring at Jian Chen closely.","The Seven Antelope Ancestor was among them.","“ Hmph, even if I can’t use the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to forge a tie with the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, it won’t be too great of a loss if I can establish a bond with the Sword Sect of Yang Soul today, ” the Seven Antelope Ancestor thought, finally finding some comfort.","“Heavenloss Master, if the elder princess found out that you went as far as to steal from an Immortal Emperor junior for the sake of a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, do you think the elder princess will be happy? Or should I say, do you think the elder princess will still recognise your good will?”","At this moment, a gruff voice rang out from behind.","When he heard that, the Heavenloss Master’s face sank slightly. He slowly turned around and looked at the burly middle-aged man behind him. He said sternly, “Fellow Zuo Dao, are you helping Yang Yutian?”","Zuo Dao shook his head. “I’m not helping him. I simply can’t stand to watch a group of sect ancestors stoop to the level of banding together to steal from an Immortal Emperor.”","Zuo Dao’s words caused many of their expressions to change. Zuo Dao was not particularly powerful, but the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens behind him was a terrifying organisation that no one could neglect.","Only the Sword Sect of Yang Soul that was now connected to the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance had no need to be wary of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens’ authority. The Heavenloss Master’s voice gradually turned cold as he said mercilessly, “Fellow Zuo Dao, why are you saying this? If you can’t stand this, then you’re welcome to assist Yang Yutian. However, you better remember that Yang Yutian has killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect and robbed the medicinal gardens of who knows how many organisations. He has quite a lot of enemies outside.”","Zuo Dao’s face immediately sank. He said frigidly, “Just because you’re connected to the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, your Sword Sect of Yang Soul no longer takes our Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens seriously? Your Sword Sect of Yang Soul better cling on tightly to the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.”","“You don’t have to worry about that, fellow Zuo Dao. That descendant of mine is on very good terms with the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.” The Heavenloss Master was unfazed.","“ Master, the Divine Formation of the Heavens is prepared. We’re ready to strike at any time! ”","At the same time, Jian Chen received the Primeval artifact spirit’s message. The space on the stone steps was limited. Not only was he facing so many Immortal Exalts, but there were also unknown dangers lurking up ahead that targeted his Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","Faced with a situation like this, the Profound Sword Qi was no longer sufficient. Only the Divine Formation of the Heavens would be of any use.","Right when Jian Chen was about to unleash the Divine Formation of the Heavens, a terrifying presence suddenly erupted from below.","The presence was so powerful that all of the Immortal Exalt ancestors’ expressions changed drastically. When they glanced down subconsciously, they saw a bloody cloud rise up from below with unbelievable speed. The surging energy sent chills down all of their spines."]},{"number":3910,"title":"Chapter 3910: Breaking out of the Encirclement","paragraphs":["“This presence... oh no, it’s the Ghost Immortal cult’s power...”","“What a terrifying presence. What a startling storm of energy. T-this is clearly the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult...”","“It’s the Ghost Immortal cult’s Lan Caidie. Dammit, is she getting involved? Isn’t she afraid of bringing destruction to the Ghost Immortal cult?”","......","...","As the bloody cloud pressed closer from below, all of the Immortal Exalts reacted violently. Even Zuo Dao from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens became extremely stern like he was facing great danger.","The surging energy that rapidly approached them from below did not simply make them wary. It struck deep fear into them.","As a matter of fact, there was even horror!","This power was far too great and far too startling. Even the Profound Spirit Master who had already reached the Fourth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt encountered the thought of immediately turning around and fleeing.","Jian Chen furrowed his brows as well. Lan Caidie’s action had taken him by surprise. He originally wanted to use the Divine Formation of the Heavens to resolve the danger he was facing, but he never thought that Lan Caidie would take action by herself and use the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal at this time.","After all, it was not as easy for Lan Caidie to use the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal as it was for him to activate the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","Whenever she used the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal, Lan Caidie would have to pay a tremendous price and would even face a prolonged period of feebleness.","Meanwhile, he only needed to exhaust the energy of several tens of thousand disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to activate the Divine Formation of the Heavens. At most, he only needed to use some resources before they could all recover. The price he paid was far lighter than Lan Caidie’s.","“ She clearly knows that I can resolve the danger I’m facing right now, but she still chose to help without hesitation. Clearly, she doesn’t wish for me to expose the secret of the Primeval Divine Hall here. ” Jian Chen sighed inside. He already understood Lan Caidie’s intentions.","Meanwhile, the Heavenloss Master’s face was extremely ugly. He stared straight at the bloody cloud that flew up rapidly from below and bellowed sternly, “Vice cult leader Lan, my actions right now represent the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance to a certain extent. You better consider the consequences of interfering and ruining my matters.”","However, Lan Caidie was unfazed by the Heavenloss Master’s threats. Clad in the bloody mist, she completely unleashed the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal, rushing towards the group of Immortal Exalts like she was unstoppable.","Watching Lan Caidie get closer and closer, some of the Immortal Exalts around Jian Chen began to panic slightly.","“Don’t panic, everyone. So what if she has the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal? There are so many of us. Are we supposed to be incapable of stopping her?” the Heavenloss Master called out sternly.","It had to be mentioned that the Heavenloss Master’s influence had become extraordinary from borrowing the name of the Divine Palace of Great Radiance. The Immortal Exalts who stood forward to trap Jian Chen gathered together. Terrifying energy surged out of their bodies as they swung their god artifacts at full force.","Immediately, gorgeous light illuminated the area. A powerful storm of energy made the spectating Immortal Exalts behind them subconsciously back away. A total of ten flows of energy collided with the bloody mist with devastating force.","Boom!","A deafening rumble erupted on the staircase. The surrounding space shook violently. If this place was not protected by the powerful formations of the Skyscraping World, the region probably would have ceased to exist, having been reduced to void.","Within the dense, bloody mist was Lan Caidie who powered the Remains of the Ghost Immortal.","She faced a total of ten Immortal Exalts. The Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Profound Spirit Master, was the strongest. There were also numerous Third, Second, and First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","However, following the strike, all ten Immortal Exalts grunted, including the Profound Spirit Master, having been knocked flying like leaves. Many of them fell to the ground with pale faces.","Some of the Immortal Exalts who were only at the First Heavenly Layer even coughed up bloody pulp uncontrollably, which was filled with pieces of their organs.","The strongest of them, the Profound Spirit Master, did not seem to sustain any obvious injuries, but he did become sickly pale. His gaze towards Lan Caidie was filled with deep fear.","After repelling the ten Immortal Exalts, Lan Caidie’s presence continued to surge. The power from the Remains of the Ghost Immortal had yet to run out.","Afterwards, she turned into a red blur and slammed into the hidden traps up ahead with her remaining power.","Immediately, the surroundings erupted. A terrifying storm of energy stirred once again. A huge net appeared where Lan Caidie was, radiating with the power of a high quality god artifact.","When the net appeared, Jian Chen immediately recognised it as the Profound Spirit Master’s god artifact.","Very clearly, the Profound Spirit Master had hidden his high quality god artifact there, waiting for him to walk right into it.","If Jian Chen were trapped in it, breaking free would force him to use some trump cards.","But at this moment, the high quality god artifact net immediately paled following Lan Caidie’s attack. All of its energy was instantly exhausted before she knocked it far away.","However, the net was only the first trap.","Shortly afterwards, a formation appeared from the surrounding space. It flickered with ancient glyphs, seemingly turning into a cage that engulfed space. It seemed capable of sealing off the world. Even early Immortal Exalts would struggle to break free once they fell inside it.","In the end, the trapping formation shattered after taking a single attack from Lan Caidie.","However, following the ensnaring formation was a third hidden trap. It was a palm-sized jade bottle. It suddenly appeared from the surrounding space with its mouth already facing Lan Caidie.","In the next moment, a terrifying stream of coldness erupted from the jade bottle. When the coldness appeared, the world seemed to freeze. Even space seized up. The surrounding Immortal Exalts could not help but shiver.","Immediately, the long staircase became covered in a thick layer of frost. A few weaker First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts even became covered in a thin layer of ice crystals.","Jian Chen was no different. His entire body was covered in thick ice. Terrifying coldness invaded his body as if it was even trying to freeze up his raging chaotic blood.","However, despite how terrifying the coldness was, it still could not approach Lan Caidie. It had been blocked by the power from the Remains of the Ghost Immortal.","The Remains of the Ghost Immortal was far too powerful. The coldness from the jade bottle was extraordinary, but it could only pose some threat to early Immortal Exalts. Before the Remains of the Ghost Immortal that had already reached the peak of mid Immortal Exalt or late Immortal Exalt, it was obviously nowhere near enough.","Boom!","Lan Caidie struck out. She slammed the jade bottle with her hand. A rumble erupted as she knocked the jade bottle far away. It smashed into the steps up ahead and fell to the ground.","Immediately, the barricade formed from the ten Immortal Exalts and the three traps up ahead had all been destroyed by Lan Caidie in an unstoppable manner.","“Go!” Lan Caidie called out to Jian Chen. Her power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal was on the verge of running out. She could not last much longer. A period of weakness awaited her.","By now, Jian Chen was affected by the aftershocks of energy as well. His flesh and blood heaved. He arrived beside Lan Caidie with a flash, about to take her away from here.","“Don’t worry about me. I have methods for self-preservation,” Lan Caidie said feebly and urgently. She was already past her peak condition. Her presence rapidly declined.","“Take care!” Jian Chen did not insist. He took out the jade box that contained the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit without any hesitation and shoved it into her hands without saying anything more.","Lan Caidie was taken aback at first. She quickly opened the box by a crack. A fragrance filled with the presence of reincarnation filled her nose. It immediately filled her feeble and exhausted eyes with surprise and joy.","“Thank you!” Lan Caidie thanked him in a hurry before using the remaining power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal. She turned into a blood-red blur and quickly shot off towards the mountain peak, immediately vanishing into the thick mist up ahead.","Jian Chen was not in a hurry to leave. Instead, he looked back at the Immortal Exalts who had blocked his path and said coldly, “You must already know how I’ve killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. I don’t even fear one of the twelve courts of heaven, so what is your measly background supposed to be in my eyes? If you keep making these incessant demands, I’m not going to show any mercy.”","After tossing that out, Jian Chen left without looking back. He used the Laws of Space to climb towards the mountain peak.","He did not wear the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. Instead, he travelled at a steady pace, helping Lan Caidie buy even more time to escape.","“You arrogant junior!” Only now did the Profound Spirit Master recover from the powerful attack from the Remains of the Ghost Immortal. He let out a bellow as his presence surged, immediately chasing after Jian Chen.","At the same time, he swung his hand. The high quality god artifact net that fell nearby flew back into his hand.","“Yang Yutian, I don’t care if you’ve killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. If you don’t leave behind the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, you’re going nowhere,” the Heavenloss Master of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul also yelled furiously. Shortly afterwards, he looked at the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings who had suffered injuries of varying degree. “Fellows, please assist me in capturing this kid. Our Sword Sect of Yang Soul will never forget about the assistance you’ve provided today!”","The Immortal Exalts all nodded in agreement. Many of their eyes burned with enthusiasm.","By now, capturing Jian Chen was no longer simply a matter of currying favour with the Sword Sect of Yang Soul. Jian Chen possessed the heavenly resources of several dozen medicinal gardens. Just this wealth alone and the secrets he was hiding was enough to make these Immortal Exalts rally with interest.","Apart from that, he was also the person that the Immortal Feather sect was after. Capturing him and offering him to the Immortal Feather sect would also result in great reward.","The Profound Spirit Master, the Heavenloss Master, and the other Immortal Exalts all turned into blurs and chased after Jian Chen."]},{"number":3911,"title":"Chapter 3911: The Myriad Ways Cult’s Calculations","paragraphs":["With their departure, the noisy stone steps regained their previous peace, but pulses of energy continued to erupt and collide in the limited space. It turned into gusts of fierce wind, ruffling the clothes of the Immortal Exalts below.","“The Remains of the Ghost Immortal possessed by vice cult leader Lan Caidie of the Ghost Immortal cult truly is as powerful as rumoured. There were no exaggerations whatsoever,” said Zuo Dao warily as he looked in the direction that Lan Caidie had vanished in.","The power behind a single attack had repelled the combined attacks of ten Immortal Exalts in an unstoppable manner. In particular, the ten Immortal Exalts included an expert at the Fourth Heavenly Layer. The feat was far too startling.","It was not just Zuo Dao. The other Immortal Exalts who lingered nearby all shivered inside whenever they recalled the terrifying power that Lan Caidie erupted with.","“Fortunately, she could only use this power once in a while before suffering an extremely severe backlash. Otherwise, what would happen if a Second Heavenly Layer expert like her could freely use power of that level?”","The Immortal Exalts were all badly shaken. They had already developed deep wariness towards Lan Caidie.","“Hahahaha, Lan Caidie, I never thought you’d make such a foolish mistake despite being so clever. You actually decided to side with that guy called Yang Yutian at a time like this.” At this moment, laughter that conflicted with the atmosphere rang out. An old man dressed in daoist robes laughed aloud like a mad man. He even began dancing around on the spot.","All of the Immortal Exalts present were familiar with the old man, as he was an ancestor of the Myriad Ways cult. He was a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, known as the Red Maple Grandmaster.","The Red Maple Grandmaster danced around in great joy. “That Yang Yutian has enemies scattered across the entire Immortals’ World now. Not only has he offended the Immortal Feather sect, but he’s also robbed all the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World. He’s even stolen the offering for the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Brilliance. Others all avoid a person who’s committed heinous deeds like him like the plague, yet you actually decided to side with him against your best judgement.”","“No, you didn’t just side with him. You’re his accomplice. You’re an accomplice...”","“Hehehehe, hahahaha, Ghost Immortal cult, how will you deal with his disaster? Will the Heavenly Star Palace be able to protect you like usual?”","With a flip of his hand, an item akin to a memory crystal appeared. He was already prepared. He had recorded the entirety of the events.","Worried that any accidents would happen to him, he immediately made several dozen copies of the memory crystal before tossing them towards the Immortal Exalts nearby. “Fellows, once the Skyscraping World opens again, please pass these memory crystals to the cult leader of our Myriad Ways cult. As compensation, our Myriad Ways cult will give you each fifty high grade God Tier pills.”","The Immortal Exalts were all disinterested initially, but all of their faces lit up with joy and interest when he mentioned the reward of fifty high grade God Tier pills. The only exception was Zuo Dao.","Fifty high grade God Tier pills was a tremendous sum that weaker Immortal Exalts that did not have proper backgrounds could not ignore.","As a matter of fact, the possessions of some poorer Immortal Exalts who only broke through recently would even be below fifty high grade God Tier pills in value.","“Please don’t worry, fellow Red Maple. I will deliver this to the hands of the cult leader as quickly as I can...”","The Immortal Exalts all agreed, stowing the memory crystals away like they were treasure.","Just delivering a single item could net them fifty high grade God Tier pills. That was quite a sum to them.","“Our Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens has no interest in your feuds,” Zuo Dao replied indifferently. With a wave of his hand, he returned the memory crystal that hovered before him.","The Red Maple Grandmaster was unfazed. Seeing how the other Immortal Exalts had all agreed, he finally let out a sigh of relief inside.","It was quite a large price, but as long as they could bring down the Ghost Immortal cult, losing these resources would be nothing.","“ The Ghost Immortal cult is under the Heavenly Star Palace’s protection, which is why our Myriad Ways cult has never had the courage to launch a war of destruction against them in the past few years. After all, the Heavenly Star Palace will definitely stand forward at the very end. With that, everything we do will become meaningless. However, it’s different now. Even the Heavenly Star Palace might not be able to deal with the trouble that Lan Caidie has caused. As a result, this is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to destroy the Ghost Immortal cult... ” the Red Maple Grandmaster thought to himself. He was in an extremely good mood. As a matter of fact, he even hoped for the Skyscraping World to open right now so that he could spread this news.","......","...","At this moment, in the region around the peak of the Skyscraping World, Jian Chen did not conceal his presence. He continued to travel with the Laws of Space. He seemed to teleport, crossing several hundred kilometres with each flash.","Ten aggressive Immortal Exalts pursued him relentlessly from behind. The Profound Spirit Master and the Heavenloss Master were at the very front.","The peak of the Skyscraping World was clearly even more abundant in spiritual Qi, so visibility was reduced to just three hundred kilometres here.","The mountain path curved and winded, reducing their visibility even further. With their senses of their souls suppressed, there were no experts who could move quickly in these circumstances.","“The peak of the Skyscraping World is only so big. Yang Yutian, if you just stayed in the lower region peacefully, we really would have been powerless over you, but you just had to come to the mountain peak...”","“You have nowhere to hide at all on the mountain peak, so why don’t you just give up and save yourself some pain?”","Immortal Exalts called out from behind.","However, Jian Chen ignored them. He advanced quickly as he checked the map of the Skyscraping World, just in case he ran into a dead end.","“ It’s about time. Lan Caidie should have found a safe spot already. ” After stowing the map away, Jian Chen decisively equipped the Divine Armour of Heavenflight at a fork in the road.","In the next moment, he completely vanished, person and all. He had perfectly concealed himself.","“Have you gone into hiding again? Hmph, the mountain peak might not be small, but it’s not big either. You still want to hide in this place? You’re dreaming.” The Profound Spirit Master sneered. He immediately looked back at the other and said, “Everyone, let’s split up. Once you find traces of Yang Yutian, keep him busy at all costs. We’ll rush over immediately.”","“Yeah. Yang Yutian’s cultivation might not be high, but his abilities are extraordinary. It’s very difficult to overwhelm him without the strength of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, so it’s best if those who haven’t reached the Second Heavenly Layer stick together in groups,” said the Seven Antelope Ancestor."]},{"number":3912,"title":"Chapter 3912: The Ancestor of the Wind Clan","paragraphs":["Jian Chen used the power of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight to hide. Meanwhile, the ten Immortal Exalts led by the Heavenloss Master either set off alone or moved off in groups. They searched the mountain peak of the Skyscraping World for Jian Chen.","The concealment ability of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight was far too perfect, so no presences or flaws remained. It was traceless. As a result, with no other choice, the Immortal Exalts who searched for Jian Chen were forced to repeat the same trick. They attacked the space or the ground, producing terrifying storms of energy to influence the surroundings and forcing out everything hidden around them.","There was no peace on the top of the Skyscraping World any more. Energy storms on the level of Immortal Exalts erupted everywhere.","At the same time, the Heavenloss Master began recruiting others on the mountain peak. He sought assistance from all the Immortal Exalts who had reached this region. They searched for Jian Chen’s traces together.","By now, basically ninety percent of all the Immortal Exalts that entered the Skyscraping World had reached the mountain peak. They were scattered in different regions, making preparations to seize the seed of ways.","Originally, they had no interest in partaking in the Heavenloss Master and Jian Chen’s conflict. They were reluctant to get involved in any unnecessary trouble.","However, when they heard how Yang Yutian had killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect and was also the Chang Yang that the Immortal Feather sect was after, some of these Immortal Exalts who originally wanted to remain uninvolved began to develop other motives.","“ If I capture Yang Yutian, not only will I be able to earn a favour from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul with the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, but it’ll also be a great deed if I hand him over to the Immortal Feather sect... ”","“ Now, the Sword Sect of Yang Soul has already allied themselves with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. They’re different from before. I’ll have to offend Yang Yutian, but I’ll be able to befriend both the Sword Sect of Yang Soul and the Immortal Feather sect at the same time. If I handle it well, I might even forge a tie with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. Now this is a worthwhile deal... ”","“ The heavenly resources from the medicinal gardens are all on Yang Yutian. Sigh, obtaining the heavenly resources from Yang Yutian is different from provoking these peak organisations... ”","......","...","Faced with various temptations, some of these Immortal Exalts immediately cast aside their qualms that came from the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian. They left their original spots and joined in on the search for Jian Chen.","At the same time, three Immortal Exalts gathered together in a thick bush on the mountain peak. Their faces were sickly pale, and their presences were feeble. Clearly, they were heavily injured.","Among the three Immortal Exalts, one of them was the Crouching Peace Master who had tried to rope in the city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, outside the Skyscraping World.","Another person was Zhou Yunzhuang who had the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit stolen from him.","“Many Immortal Exalts on the mountain peak have already joined in on the operation to capture Yang Yutian. This person ruined everything for us earlier. He also played a certain role in the loss of the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit.” Zhou Yunzhuang ground his teeth. Then he looked at the Crouching Peace Master and said, “We shouldn’t spare him. Since he’s already become a target for all, we should take part in this as well, Crouching Peace.”","The Crouching Peace Master sighed gently when he heard that. “I too am deeply pained by the loss of the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit, but this is simply due to our strength and luck. We shouldn’t push the blame onto fellow Yang Yutian.”","“Sigh, if he had been slightly cooperative back then, I would have been able to escape with the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit. Vice cult leader Lan Caidie of the Ghost Immortal cult would have never found me.” Zhou Yunzhuang fumed.","The Crouching Peace Master stared at Zhou Yunzhuang strangely and said earnestly, “Brother Zhou, that’s a kid who even has the courage to kill great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. Tell me, for what reason should he have cooperated?”","“Furthermore, he even had the courage to steal the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit right in front of Lan Caidie. I don’t know what happened afterwards, but I heard that Lan Caidie has already decided to side with Yang Yutian.”","“Think about who Lan Caidie is. With the recognition of an extremely powerful Remains of the Ghost Immortal, her strength cannot be understood through regular logic. Even someone like her failed to gain the upper hand against Yang Yutian. Do you think Yang Yutian is someone simple?”","“Hmph, the reason why vice cult leader Lan was willing to help Yang Yutian must have been due to Xing Caijian. After all, who in the Immortals’ World doesn’t know that the Heavenly Star Palace is the Ghost Immortal cult’s greatest backing?” Zhou Yunzhuang still felt aggrieved.","“Regardless of the reason, I don’t recommend becoming involved in this mess. If the Three Lives Reincarnation Fruit is lost, then it’s lost. All that matters is we preserved our lives. I just feel like the opening of the Skyscraping World this time will be more brutal than any before. The seed of ways hasn’t even appeared yet, and several Immortal Exalts have already gone missing. Some say they’ve already died. Sigh...”","......","...","“Sure enough, all of the medicinal gardens on the mountain peak have been harvested by Xing Caijian.” At this moment, Jian Chen appeared before one of the medicinal gardens on the mountain peak by hiding himself with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. Looking at the fertile, hole-ridden soil, he could not help but let out a sigh.","At this moment, a pulse of energy appeared in the distance. Jian Chen immediately pulled back his gaze and used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, observing the surroundings through the spiritual Qi. Sure enough, he discovered an Immortal Exalt several thousand kilometres away making his way over while searching. He attacked the surroundings constantly, producing waves of energy. Wherever he passed by, the ground was reduced to a mess. All of the vegetation was annihilated.","It was a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Jian Chen had no plans on facing him, so he silently left under the cover of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","Afterwards, Jian Chen constantly changed locations on the mountain peak. Because more and more Immortal Exalts searched for him, coupled with the relatively smaller area of the mountain peak, there was no place that was absolutely safe.","Even if he hid in a remote location that people rarely visited, he would encounter an Immortal Exalt who left no stone unturned before long.","Jian Chen remained in a single spot for no longer than twenty-four hours on the mountain peak.","As a matter of fact, he had to switch multiple hiding spots in the span of an hour at one time.","If it were not for the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable that gave Jian Chen the advantage, he would have been forced out a long time ago by the wild barrages of these Immortal Exalts even if he had the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","At this moment, an old man in black robes sat on a mossy rock somewhere on the mountain peak. His eyes were shut as if he was cultivating.","At this moment, a violent pulse of energy swept over from afar, forcing the old man to circulate his energy and block the incoming storm.","“Still nothing? This Yang Yutian sure is hard to find. If I had that treasure that could conceal my presence, probably all of my enemies in the Immortals’ World would be shaking in fear.” A murmur rang out from nearby. A middle-aged man in white robes appeared three hundred metres away from the old man in black robes. He gave off the presence of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","“Apologies, fellow Chen Feng. Please forgive me.” The middle-aged man in white robes apologised to the old man on the mossy rock three hundred metres away. He spoke extremely politely.","“It’s not a problem. I’ve already grown used to it. As soon as Yang Yutian got here, the entire region became a mess. Sigh...” The old man in black robes called Chen Feng waved his hand without minding and sighed gently.","“You can only blame him for possessing far too many valuable items. Who wouldn’t be tempted by all the treasures he carries on him? Moreover, capturing him might even lead to connections to a court of heaven like the Immortal Feather sect. This is just too great of a deal to pass on.” The man in white chuckled. He did not try to hide his objectives.","“Fellow Chen Feng, would you like to search for Yang Yutian with me?” After a pause, the man in white invited Chen Feng.","“I’m not in the mood for that right now.” Chen Feng was rather stern. “The two great elders who accompanied me into the Skyscraping World have already been missing for many years. I can’t contact them no matter what. Only recently did I finally confirm that they had already died.”","“Something like that has actually happened?” The man in white robes was surprised. “Just who in the Skyscraping World has the courage to kill the great elders of your Wind clan? Who doesn’t know that the Mistress of Contrary Winds of your Wind clan might reach the Seventh Heavenly Layer at any moment?”"]},{"number":3913,"title":"Chapter 3913: The Culprit","paragraphs":["“I don’t know who would work against our Wind clan either.” Chen Feng’s heart weighed heavily. He continued, “Although our Wind clan has some enemies in the Immortals’ World, there are only so many people who have entered the Skyscraping World this time. The organisations behind them have nothing to do with our Wind clan, so I struggle to understand who would come after our Wind clan no matter how hard I think.”","“Fellow Chen Feng, could the deaths of your two great elders be related to a struggle over some treasure?” The middle-aged man in white robes guessed.","“Even if it were a struggle over treasure, what kind of treasure do you need for them to silence them with death? After all, our Wind clan is no ordinary peak organisation.” Chen Feng shook his head gently, clearly disagreeing with this suggestion.","After a casual conversation, the middle-aged man left. He continued to scour the area for Yang Yutian.","The Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Wind clan remained on the mossy stone, clearly choosing to remain uninvolved.","For the next two hours, two Immortal Exalts appeared near Chen Feng one after another. Perhaps due to the fact that Chen Feng came from the Wind clan, possessing a powerful background, they all extended an invitation to Chen Feng. They were extremely polite.","But without any exception, Chen Feng turned them down.","The deaths of two great elders was quite a large loss to the Wind clan. Right now, all he could think about was how he would find the murderer.","“If I recall correctly, you’re an ancestor of the Wind clan from the Fierce Gales Heaven, right?” Suddenly, a voice rang out from behind him.","The instant the voice rang out, Chen Feng’s heart suddenly tightened. Immediately, he opened his eyes. There was a hint of seriousness and shock.","From the voice, he could tell that the person was within thirty metres of him, yet he had failed to sense his approach at all.","Chen Feng suddenly looked back. All he saw was a figure hovering three inches above the ground nine metres behind him. His entire body was covered in an ancient armour, only leaving his eyes exposed.","“It’s you! Yang Yutian!” Chen Feng called out. He recognised him with a single glance, but he was very perplexed. Right now, many Immortal Exalts were searching for his traces on the mountain peak. Instead of hiding away properly, why did he come to him instead?","Chen Feng composed himself and looked at Jian Chen with mixed feelings. “That’s true. I am one of the ancestors of the Wind clan from the Fierce Gales Heaven. Yang Yutian, you’ve gone as far as to expose yourself to find me, so why?”","“Since I’ve confirmed your identity, it’s time for me to send you on your way.” Jian Chen’s voice was icy. Reaching out, the high quality god artifact, the Heaven-lifting sword, appeared in his hand. It surged with light.","“Oh right, I forgot to tell you, but soon after we entered the Skyscraping World, the two great elders of your Wind clan died by my hand.” With that, the Heaven-lifting sword suddenly erupted with dazzling light, directly thrusting towards Chen Feng.","When he struck out, numerous blurs immediately appeared in the space there before overlapping. When the five blurs merged together completely, Jian Chen’s attack rose to a level that could even shock First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Jian Chen knew that regular attacks would struggle to pose much of a threat towards a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like Chen Feng, so he used the Five Superimposition Sword right off the bat!","“What? The two great elders of our Wind clan were actually killed by you? Yang Yutian, how has our Wind clan provoked you for you to be so vicious?” Chen Feng was greatly shocked. He was overcome with surprise and fury. He stared straight at Jian Chen as his eyes turned bloodshot.","In the next moment, he erupted with surging energy. A mallet-shaped high quality god artifact appeared in his hand, erupting with gorgeous light as he swung down viciously.","Boom!","The two god artifacts clashed violently mid-air. With a deafening rumble, Chen Feng staggered backwards with a violent storm of energy.","The Five Superimposition Sword unleashed with Jian Chen’s current strength was completely sufficient to pose a certain level of threat to First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","But similarly, Jian Chen stumbled over a dozen steps back uncontrollably. His right arm that wielded the Heaven-lifting sword became numb.","“Why, Yang Yutian? Tell me, why did you kill the two great elders of our Wind clan? What feud does our Wind clan have with you?” Chen Feng regained his footing. He clutched his mallet firmly. He gripped it so tightly that veins had already begun to bulge on his arm. His growls were filled with fury.","“You want to know the reason? If it were the Mistress of Contrary Winds, I would let her die knowing, but you’re nowhere close to being worthy.” Jian Chen sneered.","“How dare you. Yang Yutian, you’re only an Immortal Emperor. How dare you disrespect the Contrary Winds Ancestor like that!” Chen Feng was furious. The Mistress of Contrary Winds clearly held great status in his eyes. He could not allow anyone to show any disrespect towards her.","His presence surged. Tremendous energy gushed out like a tidal wave as the mallet in his hand erupted with blinding light. He swung it towards Jian Chen with startling force.","Immediately, the immense might of the world filled the surroundings. Chen Feng’s attack was no regular attack. Instead, he instantly used a God Tier Immortal Technique.","With the God Tier Immortal Technique, the power of his attack virtually broke through the limits of the First Heavenly Layer, reaching the Second Heavenly Layer.","Despite his strength, he was using a God Tier Immortal Technique against Jian Chen who was only a mid Immortal Emperor, which only demonstrated the extent of his wariness.","There had been far too many rumours surrounding Jian Chen recently. In particular, he had escaped with ease from a group of Immortal Exalts when he seized the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","As a result, Chen Feng did not dare to be careless at all against such a troublesome opponent. He used his full strength right from the beginning.","However, he failed to sense that when he used the God Tier Immortal Technique, Jian Chen’s lips curled into a mysterious smile underneath the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","In the next moment, the immense might of the world vanished instantly. The God Tier Immortal Technique that Chen Feng had used at the cost of tremendous energy deflated like a balloon. All of its might vanished.","In the end, the terrifying strike that should have possessed devastating power dissipated into the surroundings as a ball of pure energy.","Even when part of it came into contact with Jian Chen, it struggled to pose a threat to him.","When his God Tier Immortal Technique collapsed, Chen Feng was taken aback.","However, Jian Chen did not hesitate. While Chen Feng remained stunned, he used the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike. The Laws of the Sword and the Laws of Space merged together. A powerful strand of sword Qi bypassed all of Chen Feng’s defences and directly erupted inside his body.","Spurt! Chen Feng grunted in pain as blood sprayed from his mouth. His eyes were filled with shock.","By now, Jian Chen had already arrived before him silently. The Heaven-lifting sword thrust towards Chen Feng’s forehead with five afterimages.","He had used the Five Superimposition Sword again!"]},{"number":3914,"title":"Chapter 3914: Killing Chen Feng","paragraphs":["Chen Feng’s caution surged. An unprecedented sense of danger filled his mind, making his eyes narrow violently.","He made the correct response almost reflexively. He quickly retreated while raising his god artifact to defend.","Boom!","The five afterimages of the Heaven-lifting sword merged as one and struck Chen Feng’s god artifact again. The great force made Chen Feng stumble backwards. The attack almost knocked the high quality god artifact out of his hand.","Jian Chen rushed over with the Laws of the Sword wrapping around him. The Heaven-lifting sword turned into a blur, producing numerous streaks of dazzling light as he clashed violently with Chen Feng.","For a moment, rumbles rang out constantly. Fragments of sword Qi scattered everywhere inside the violent storm of energy.","In mere moments, the two of them clashed several hundred times. Even the space there became filled with chaotic storms of energy.","Chen Feng only possessed a single high quality god artifact, which was the mallet in his hand. Clashing with Jian Chen had already ruined his medium quality god artifact armour. It was covered in sword slashes and his blood that radiated with great energy.","On the other hand, Jian Chen’s Divine Armour of Heavenflight had also received some attacks. A few marks had appeared.","However, that was all they were, marks. As a high quality god artifact of impressive grade, the Divine Armour of Heavenflight was very sturdy. It could not be damaged by any early Immortal Exalt.","Let alone early Immortal Exalts, even peak mid Immortal Exalts would struggle to inflict any realistic damage to the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","On the surface, Jian Chen seemed unscathed, but in reality, he had been shaken up slightly, except these injuries were no different from scratches to him.","“You’re too weak. If this is all the strength that you possess, then you won’t be able to last very long against me at all.” Jian Chen stood with his sword. He radiated with fighting spirit as he stared at Chen Feng coldly.","There was still a distinction between strong and weak among First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. Chen Feng’s battle prowess could only be regarded as run of the mill.","He was relatively mediocre.","He was an impressive Immortal Exalt, yet an Immortal Emperor mocked him right now, which made Chen Feng burn with fury inside. However, Jian Chen had displayed startling battle prowess, which also forced him to recognise that the Immortal Emperor before him was very powerful.","Before this, he never would have imagined that a mid Immortal Emperor could face an Immortal Exalt in a direct confrontation.","“Yang Yutian, you may possess unprecedented talent but so what? You’ve offended so many peak organisations at the same time and have even provoked our Wind clan. You’re fated to die.”","“There is nothing I can do about you right now. If you’re still alive when the Skyscraping World opens up again, I’ll definitely report what happened here to the Contrary Winds Ancestor. Just you wait for the Contrary Winds Ancestor’s pursuit,” Chen Feng said angrily. He understood her temperament extremely well. She was definitely a vengeful figure.","“You think you can leave the Skyscraping World alive?” Jian Chen smiled coldly. The cold killing intent in his eyes grew heavier and heavier.","“I admit that you have the ability to contend with me, but you can’t stop me from escaping,” Chen Feng said proudly. He had already made up his mind about retreating. He did not want to fight Jian Chen any longer.","He had also noticed that Jian Chen was completely unscathed despite withstanding many of his attacks. It made him think of a rumour. He knew that if they kept fighting, Jian Chen would outlast him in the end.","“Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, seal off this area. Don’t let this person escape,” Jian Chen said suddenly.","As soon as he said that, an extremely burly figure appeared out of nowhere. He radiated with demon Qi.","It was the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt!","After these years of recovery and being “fed” by Jian Chen several times, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s strength was rapidly recovering. Despite not returning to his peak condition of the Fourth Heavenly Layer yet, he had still reached the peak of the Third Heavenly Layer.","“W-who are you? There’s no one like you among the Immortal Exalts who entered the Skyscraping World this time.” Looking at the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt who had appeared out of nowhere, Chen Feng was greatly startled. When he sensed the powerful pressure from him, his face immediately became extremely ugly.","But shortly afterwards, he realised something. His heart shook violently as his gaze towards Jian Chen changed dramatically. It was replaced by burning greed and interest.","At the same time, there were even undisguised signs of madness.","“S-so you’re actually even hiding such a terrifying treasure on you!” Chen Feng’s voice trembled, perhaps out of excitement or even fear.","“Sect master, just leave someone as insignificant as him to me,” said the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. When his eyes that flickered with pitch-black flames turned towards Chen Feng, Chen Feng’s heart immediately tightened. All he felt was invisible pressure from all sides. His entire body and even his soul was about to be frozen.","Chen Feng quivered inside. His burning greed directly turned to ice. He had never been so stern before.","Only now did he realise a severe problem. Despite discovering that Yang Yutian was hiding a startling secret, he also had to face the threat of a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","“No need. You only need to seal off the surroundings and prevent him from escaping. I’ll personally deal with this person.” Jian Chen said emotionlessly. His eyes were cold. The killing intent he gave off made the surrounding temperature plummet.","In the past, an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had died by the Mistress of Contrary Winds’ hand. Now, it was time for him to collect this blood debt bit by bit.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s figure had already vanished. He turned into a dense, black mist that pervaded the surroundings, fading in and out of view.","Meanwhile, when Chen Feng heard that Jian Chen would deal with him personally, he beamed with joy inside. He thought, “ What an idiot. If you got that Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt to take action, I definitely could not last for long, but you’re actually confident enough to think that you can kill me as a mid Immortal Emperor. I only need to buy some time. Before long, other Immortal Exalts will definitely pass by this place. ”","Thinking up to there, Chen Feng immediately eased up.","But at this moment, extremely powerful sword intent suddenly appeared. Just the presence alone gave off a paramount bearing that could dominate the world. It also made the thick spiritual Qi in the surroundings thin out as if it had been obliterated by the sword intent.","Two finger-sized strands of sword Qi appeared over Jian Chen’s head, shining with blinding light. They dyed the entire space snow-white.","In order to kill Chen Feng as quickly as possible, Jian Chen used two strands of Profound Sword Qi without hesitation!","“W-what is that...” Chen Feng’s eyes narrowed violently. He felt a tremendous threat. He immediately raised a barrier of energy as quickly as he could.","In the next moment, the two strands of sword Qi pierced the air simultaneously. They surpassed time and space, overcoming all obstructions and arriving before Chen Feng’s forehead instantly and plunging into his soul.","“Argh!” Chen Feng shook violently and howled out in pain.","His soul had endured two strands of Profound Sword Qi at the same time. It felt like his soul was being sliced apart by a knife. It was nowhere near enough to be lethal, but it was definitely excruciating.","Most importantly, his soul was affected, which made him temporarily blank out. His vision also plunged into temporary darkness, almost cutting his senses off from the outside world.","He could recover in just a few seconds, but even a moment’s lapse in attention in the middle of a battle could determine the outcome, let alone a few seconds.","“Five Superimposition Sword!”","At the same time, Jian Chen had already arrived before Chen Feng silently. The Heaven-lifting sword in his hands thrust towards Chen Feng’s forehead with a series of afterimages and surging sword Qi."]},{"number":3915,"title":"Chapter 3915: Seven Antelope Dies","paragraphs":["At this moment, Chen Feng’s soul was injured. His senses towards the outside world had been reduced to an absolute minimum. Faced with Jian Chen’s lightning-fast lethal strike, he could not respond at all.","Spurt!","In the end, the blinding Heaven-lifting sword plunged deeply into Chen Feng’s soul. The Five Superimposition Sword that had power that rivalled a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt effortlessly obliterated Chen Feng’s soul.","A First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Wind clan perished just like that!","Two strands of Profound Sword Qi, a high quality god artifact, the Heaven-lifting sword, and the Hundred Superimposition Sword comprehended up to the fifth superimposition. All this combined was enough for Jian Chen to kill a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt in an extremely short amount of time.","Of course, the Profound Sword Qi played the biggest role among the three. Its influence on the enemy’s soul gave Jian Chen the chance to kill them in a single strike.","“You are the first Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Wind clan to die by my hand, but you are definitely not the last.” Jian Chen stared at Chen Feng’s corpse indifferently. Despite already perishing, his might as an Immortal Exalt did not disperse. Each droplet of blood he shed was filled with powerful pulses of energy.","Without a certain level of cultivation, even approaching Chen Feng’s corpse was impossible.","Despite already dying, his eyes remained open. His dull eyes were wide open as if he had died with regrets.","Even upon death, he did not understand what feud existed between the Wind clan and Jian Chen.","“Sect master, there seems to be other Immortal Exalts headed this way.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt appeared by Jian Chen’s side. He stared into the distance. He could already vaguely sense powerful pulses of energy from a region that neither his vision nor senses of the soul could reach.","Jian Chen nodded. He stowed Chen Feng’s corpse away in the Primeval Divine Hall before getting the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt to go through a simple process of cleaning up the traces and presences. Afterwards, he used the concealment ability of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and silently vanished.","Soon after Jian Chen had left, two First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts arrived. They stood in the centre of the battlefield and studied the surroundings with furrowed brows.","“A battle just occurred here!” an Immortal Exalt said. He carefully sensed the surroundings, but he discovered nothing apart from the turbulent spiritual Qi that had yet to settle down and the destroyed vegetation.","Very soon, a few more Immortal Exalts arrived one after another. They either travelled alone or in groups of two or three.","“Do you think it’s Yang Yutian?”","“Many of the traces have been erased. Coupled with the formations of the Skyscraping World, it’s no longer possible to turn back time here.”","“Who were the people fighting here? Why didn’t they leave behind any presence or traces even when they left?”","“It was probably Yang Yutian. Quick, scour this area. If we waste any more time, he’ll escaped...”","......","...","For the next few days, Jian Chen remained in hiding with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. He did not continue fighting. Instead, he ensured he remained at peak condition at all times, so he was prepared to seize the seed of ways.","On this day, Jian Chen was changing locations when he suddenly stopped. He furrowed his brows.","Using the spiritual Qi, he discovered that Immortal Exalts had blocked off his path from behind and in front. At this moment, they were using all of their strength to attack the space before them as they approached him.","Unfortunately, there were no forks within several tens of thousand kilometres on the mountain path that he currently travelled on.","The Skyscraping World was riddled with formations. It was highly restrictive. Everyone had to move around according to predetermined mountain paths. They could not even fly too high. They had to stay close to the ground.","“I have no other choice. I’ll have to kill my way out of here.” Jian Chen’s eyes turned cold. They were filled with determination. With a sway, he flew forwards.","“Yang Yutian, where exactly are you hiding?” At this moment, the Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Seven Antelope Ancestor, endured his sense of urgency as he attacked his surroundings again and again, producing storms of energy.","He constantly swept the surroundings, making use of both the senses of his soul and his eyes. He closely examined the surroundings.","Boom! Another ball of pure energy struck the almost-indestructible cliff face, making the space there shake violently.","But this time, a figure clad in armour silently appeared from the shaking space. It clearly swayed about in the vicious storm of energy.","It was Jian Chen!","“Huh?” The Seven Antelope Ancestor immediately captured Jian Chen’s figure. He was clearly mildly surprised. In the next moment, he ravished with joy. “Yang Yutian, I’ve finally found you. You won’t be escaping this time.”","The Seven Antelope Ancestor already knew about Jian Chen’s concealment ability. He erupted with all of his strength without any hesitation to stop Jian Chen from hiding again, doing his best to disturb the stability of this space. At the same time, he arrived before Jian Chen with a flash and swung his hand with great energy.","“I know I can’t kill you, but as long as I keep you busy and wait until more fellows arrive, you’ll be done for.” The Seven Antelope Ancestor laughed aloud as if he was finally allowed to vent his grievances.","Jian Chen was unfazed by the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s attack.","Right when the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s palm strike was about to land on Jian Chen, a large, demonic figure suddenly appeared before him. The figure casually extended his hands that were as large as palm fronds before closing his fingers. He directly clasped the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s hand. The two powerful forces collided violently, twisting the space there violently.","“Sir, w-who are you?” The Seven Antelope Ancestor stared at the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt who had suddenly appeared in surprise, but in the next moment, his expression changed. He cried out, “No, you weren’t one of the Immortal Exalts who entered the Skyscraping World. W-where exactly did you come from?”","“End it quickly!” Jian Chen said indifferently. In the next moment, he used two strands of Profound Sword Qi without hesitation, directly attacking the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s soul.","“Argh!” The Seven Antelope Ancestor howled out. His soul flickered violently. The intense pain made him pale.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt let out a cackle before turning into a ball of black mist that invaded the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s soul. He dealt devastating attacks to his soul.","For a moment, the Seven Antelope Ancestor howled out furiously. He clutched his head and leapt around on the spot, his face contorted in pain. His presence fluctuated rapidly.","But in just a few seconds, the Seven Antelope Ancestor stopped struggling. His chaotic presence settled down as well.","His eyes suddenly snapped open. They were a pair of pitch-black eyes filled with demonic Qi.","“Hehehehe, sect master, we can go,” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt said.","In the next moment, surging demonic Qi permeated from the Seven Antelope Ancestor before condensing into the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s figure again.","Meanwhile, the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s body fell to the ground stiffly."]},{"number":3916,"title":"Chapter 3916: Deterrence From the Tablet","paragraphs":["“Yeah, you can return to the Primeval Divine Hall for now.” Jian Chen nodded. Having lost the two strands of Profound Sword Qi that he had recently recovered, the familiar sensation of dizziness overwhelmed him again, which filled his face with some exhaustion.","However, he had to use the two strands of Profound Sword Qi to kill a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like the Seven Antelope Ancestor swiftly.","With the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s current strength, he could crush the Seven Antelope Ancestor, but he definitely could not kill him swiftly. In fact, a slight lapse in judgment might even result in him escaping.","As such, Jian Chen could not afford to save the two strands of Profound Sword Qi.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt returned to the Primeval Divine Hall in satisfaction. Jian Chen did not waste the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s corpse either, stowing it away.","With the Seven Antelope Ancestor’s death, Jian Chen’s path had opened up again.","By now, the Immortal Exalt behind him was only a thousand kilometres away.","The Immortal Exalt had clearly sensed something. He accelerated, rushing over.","Jian Chen was reluctant to become caught up with him, so he planned to use the concealment ability of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","However, right when he was about to leave, his expression suddenly changed. After a moment of thought, he cancelled the Divine Armour of Heavenflight’s concealment ability. He simply stood there, waiting for the Immortal Exalt to arrive.","Virtually moments later, powerful sword intent filled the space there. The Heavenloss Master of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul appeared before Jian Chen.","Jian Chen stood there calmly, staring at the Heavenloss Master. He looked at him like he was gazing at one of his peers. There were no signs of additional respect.","The Heavenloss Master immediately beamed with joy when the person he had been searching for arduously finally appeared before him. Subconsciously, he started to move to trap Jian Chen.","However, when he saw Jian Chen simply standing there, out in the open and taking it easy, a hint of surprise flashed through his eyes. He held back his urge to strike and called out, “Yang Yutian, why are you not hiding?”","“Heavenloss Master, must you get yourself killed over a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that doesn’t belong to you?” Jian Chen said. His voice remained extremely calm.","“Get myself killed? Hahaha, Yang Yutian, I admit that you are a genius. You’re already capable of clashing with me as a mid Immortal Emperor. However, if you want to kill me, you’d be overestimating yourself a little too much.” The Heavenloss Master laughed aloud. He snorted in contempt at Jian Chen’s words. “I know you have some connection with the daughter of the heavenly emperor from the Heavenly Star Palace. However, do you think the Heavenly Star Palace will proactively provoke the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance?”","“Yang Yutian, it’s as I said before. Hand over the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, or I definitely won’t spare you!”","Jian Chen shook his head and said, “I have no connection to the Heavenly Star Palace. My matters have nothing to do with the Heavenly Star Palace either. If I really wanted to kill you, would you believe me if I said you definitely would not be leaving the Skyscraping World?”","“Hahahaha, now that I don’t believe. Yang Yutian, if you really were capable of that, why don’t you show me then?” The Heavenloss Master laughed at the absurdity of his statement. He had never seen such a cocky Immortal Emperor before.","With a wave of his hand, the corpse of the ancestor of the Wind clan appeared. His still radiated with the faint pressure of an Immortal Exalt.","Seeing Chen Feng’s corpse, the Heavenloss Master’s expression immediately changed. He had already identified it. He was very shocked.","Shortly afterwards, Jian Chen swung his hand again. Another Immortal Exalt’s corpse was thrown onto the ground. He radiated with even greater might.","“F-fellow Seven Antelope...” This time, the Heavenloss Master directly cried out. His eyes were filled with disbelief.","Just a few hours ago, he had come across the Seven Antelope Ancestor along the way. He had never thought that when they met again, the Seven Antelope Ancestor would already be a corpse.","Most importantly, the Seven Antelope Ancestor had died far too quickly. With his strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he could last some time even if he encountered Third Heavenly Layer experts. Even if he was not their opponent, he could have escaped.","Yet, the Seven Antelope Ancestor had directly perished!","“Yang Yutian, y-y-you killed the Seven Antelope Ancestor?” The way that the Heavenloss Master looked at Jian Chen changed overwhelmingly. His gaze now contained shock, surprise, deep wariness, and caution.","The Seven Antelope Ancestor’s death had indeed shocked him.","“If it weren’t for the sake of the elder princess, I wouldn’t have spared you either. Through your connection with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, you do indeed have some influence in the Skyscraping World. A lot of Immortal Exalts show you respect,” said Jian Chen.","When he heard that, the Heavenloss Master eased up slightly inside. He sneered and said, “Yang Yutian, I thought you were truly fearless. Looks like you also fear the elder princess.”","“You’re wrong. I’m doing this for the sake of the elder princess because I treat her as my friend; it is not because I fear her,” said Jian Chen.","“What? You say you treat the elder princess as a friend?” When he heard that, the Heavenloss Master’s expression immediately became extremely strange. Shortly afterwards, as if he had just heard the funniest joke in the world, he could not help but tilt his head backwards and laugh aloud. “Yang Yutian, oh Yang Yutian. Aren’t you even going to consider what kind of lofty figure the elder princess is? She’s a paramount existence that even countless leaders of clans and sects in the Immortals’ World wish to have a connection with. You’re just a mere Immortal Emperor, so what gives you the right to treat the elder princess as a friend?”","“I understand that your friendship with the elder princess is purely one-sided and that the elder princess might not even know that a person like you exists in the Immortals’ World, but I really do look down on you for having a thought like that, Yang Yutian.”","“When I heard about your past chronicles, I wasn’t optimistic about your future, but your fearless spirit did earn some of my respect. But looking at it now, that’s all you are.”","The Heavenloss Master shook his head with a gentle sigh as if he was greatly disappointed.","“Heavenloss Master, do you recognise this?” With a flip of his hand, a tablet appeared in Jian Chen’s hand. It was the same tablet that Fang Jing had personally handed over to him when he first bade farewell to her.","“T-that’s a tablet from the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance?” When the Heavenloss Master saw the tablet in Jian Chen’s hand, he shuddered inside. His pupils contracted violently.","He really did possess a tablet from the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance?","“Yang Yutian, where did you obtain your tablet from?” The Heavenloss Master gradually became stern. As long as they came from the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, they would all possess an identity tablet. Meanwhile, tablets given away by people of different statuses would bear different levels of significance.","Of course, there were many ways to obtain a tablet. It did not have to be a gift. For example, killing a descendant of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance could also lead to a tablet.","“The owner of this tablet left behind a wisp of her presence. You’ll know once you sense it.” Jian Chen looked at the Heavenloss Master like he was looking at a joke.","The Heavenloss Master frowned as if he disliked the way that Jian Chen looked at him very much, but he could not be bothered with haggling over these details. With some caution, he released a wisp of the senses of his soul, carefully approaching the tablet in Jian Chen’s hand.","However, when the wisp of the senses of his soul came into contact with the tablet, an extremely terrifying presence immediately filled the Heavenloss Master’s senses. It was like an invisible hammer, slamming down heavily in the Heavenloss Master’s mind. He felt like he had just been struck by lightning. He directly blanked out on the spot. Disbelief filled his face.","Under the influence of the presence, he seemed to see a beautiful figure hovering beyond the nine heavens, looking down at him quietly with a cold and emotionless gaze.","The identity of the figure made the Heavenloss Master’s heart tremble. As a matter of fact, prompted by his instincts, he almost prostrated on the ground."]},{"number":3917,"title":"Chapter 3917: Hunting Immortal Exalts","paragraphs":["For a moment, the Heavenloss Master only felt his mind waver. He was overwhelmed with shock and alarm, as he had already identified the presence from the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.","Of course, if it were merely a wisp of presence from a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, it would only act as a deterrence to weaker Immortal Exalts. Something like that was nowhere near enough for the Heavenloss Master to lose his composure like this.","The true reason for his loss of composure was the owner of the wisp of presence.","It belonged to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, an invincible existence who defeated the four supreme ancestors of the Sacred Beast clan alone, known by others as the strongest beneath Grand Exalt.","And right now, the Sword Apostle of their Sword Sect of Yang Soul had tied the knot with the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.","The fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance was not a particularly dazzling figure in the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. Strictly speaking, she was unworthy of the Sword Apostle of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul.","The main reason for this was the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance!","Their Sword Sect of Yang Soul had bent over backwards and racked their brains, yet in the end, all they managed to do was forge a bond with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. Meanwhile, Jian Chen directly possessed a tablet that bore the elder princess’s presence.","How could the Heavenloss Master not be shocked?","Withdrawing the senses of his soul, the Heavenloss Master struggled to find peace. His expression changed again and again. Only after a good while did he compose himself, yelling out in indignation, “If you possessed the elder princess’s tablet, why didn’t you take it out sooner?”","“Why should I?” Jian Chen sneered. “I never planned on running around under the elder princess’s name and using her influence as mine. If it weren’t for the fact that your descendant had married the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Brilliance and how killing you would perhaps make things difficult for her, I never would have even taken out this tablet.”","“I showed you this tablet in hopes that you would realise that you should back down when you should. If you end the matter here, then I won’t pursue what you did in the past either. However, if you want to be stubborn and keep coming after me, then I’ll bury you here.”","“That’s all I have to say. You can decide for yourself.”","Leaving that behind, Jian Chen stowed away the tablet. Using the Divine Armour of Heavenflight’s ability, he silently vanished.","Meanwhile, the Heavenloss Master was thunderstruck. He stood there blankly, unable to respond for an extended period like he had been petrified.","A very long time later, he finally seemed to return to his senses. He seemed to lose all of his strength, making his way over to a small rock that was only an inch tall and sitting down. He sank into a long daze.","Before long, gusts of energy appeared in the distance. An Immortal Exalt made his way over, quickly discovering the Heavenloss Master who sat on the rock.","“Hmm? Fellow Heavenloss, what’s the matter with you? Why do you seem lost?” the Immortal Exalt asked in surprise.","“I just want a moment to myself...” the Heavenloss Master said absent-mindedly. His mind was very chaotic, and his emotions were a mess. The sight of Jian Chen grasping the elder princess’s tablet was imprinted in his mind like a brand, one that he could not eliminate.","Regardless of what the tablet represented, their Sword Sect of Yang Soul had no right to be granted a tablet from the elder princess herself at the very least.","However, Yang Yutian possessed a tablet like that!","It was not that he had not considered the possibility that the elder princess gave it to him before she had reached her current peak.","However, the presence from the tablet clearly possessed the pressure of a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt!","That meant that the elder princess had granted the tablet after she had reached her current peak!","In short, the Heavenloss Master’s mind was a mess right now.","Thinking that he understood what the Heavenloss Master was pondering about, he comforted out of good will. “Fellow Heavenloss, don’t worry too much. Yang Yutian’s concealment ability is indeed very powerful, but it must take quite a toll on him as well. With his cultivation as an Immortal Emperor, he won’t last long at all. That’s why he can’t stay hidden for much longer. We’ll definitely recover the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","After saying that, the Immortal Exalt clasped his fist at the Heavenloss Master before leaving. He continued on his path, scouring the place.","The Heavenloss Master opened his mouth as if he wanted to say something, but in the end, there was nowhere for him to start. Eventually, it turned into a lengthy sigh that echoed in the surroundings.","He seemed to be aware that the reason why these Immortal Exalts were so proactive with searching for Yang Yutian was not simply due to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. There was another important factor—after robbing all the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World, he had accumulated enough heavenly resources to drive many Immortal Exalts crazy.","Of course, the bounty from the Immortal Feather sect was another important factor.","......","...","“Hmm? It’s Yang Yutian. I’ve finally found you. Don’t you even try running away this time...”","......","...","“Yang Yutian has appeared. He’s in the south-eastern forest...”","......","...","“I’ve found him. He’s near the ruins of a medicinal garden in the west...”","......","...","Afterwards, Jian Chen used the Divine Armour of Heavenflight to change locations several times in the Skyscraping World. Although he possessed the secret technique in the Skyscraping World, allowing him to observe the activity within several thousand kilometres through the spiritual Qi, he was unavoidably cornered given the size of the mountain peak and the many Immortal Exalts searching for him.","As a result, he was exposed several times as well.","Jian Chen did not choose to engage these Immortal Exalts. Instead, he fled quickly, slipping away under the watch of these Immortal Exalts easily.","But gradually, he discovered that the various formations around the mountain peak gradually increased. Clearly, the Immortal Exalts had already begun setting up various traps.","Immortal Exalts could easily spot these formation traps, but they were not as obvious for those beneath that realm. Jian Chen had almost been trapped numerous times.","“ This can’t continue! ” At this moment, Jian Chen stopped at a fork in the road. He hesitated, but a hint of viciousness flashed through his eyes very quickly. “Looks like it’s time to prune off some of these Immortal Exalts.”","After he made his decision, Jian Chen immediately took out a fist-sized fruit from the Primeval Divine Hall. It was a medium grade God Tier heavenly resource, shining with blinding violet light. A single whiff of its fruity fragrance was enough to reinvigorate a person.","This was a heavenly resource that was greatly beneficial to the soul. Not only could it rapidly recover the power of the soul, it could also nourish the soul.","Jian Chen wolfed it down. As the fruit reached his belly, he immediately felt the power of his soul recover rapidly. The two strands of Profound Sword Qi that he had used to kill the Seven Antelope Ancestor condensed several dozen times faster than usual.","After consuming two of these fruits, he finally recovered all five strands of Profound Sword Qi after several days.","Coincidentally, an Immortal Exalt entered Jian Chen’s senses. It was another Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Jian Chen did not hold back. He immediately worked with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, killing him with unbelievable speed after using two strands of Profound Sword Qi.","“Hehehe, satisfying, how satisfying. This is as satisfying as it gets. Sect master, before I met you, I had never experienced killing Immortal Exalts as easily as crushing an ant.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt laughed heartily. Whenever they killed an Immortal Exalt, he would get the chance to devour their souls, becoming the person who benefitted the most from these battles."]},{"number":3918,"title":"Chapter 3918: Eerie Disappearance","paragraphs":["Jian Chen ignored the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s excitement. He immediately collected the Immortal Exalt’s corpse, planning on handing it over to the Immortal Devouring Orchid later.","This time, he did not intentionally clean up the traces. He only made the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt clean up his demonic presence. Afterwards, he intentionally sprinkled some of the Immortal Exalt’s blood before vanishing again with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","Four hours after Jian Chen left, two First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts arrived. They immediately noticed the droplets of blood scattered on the ground, which left them pondering.","One of them waved his hand gently. A droplet immediately rose up from the ground, hovering before them.","“This is... the Ink Scar Ancestor’s blood!” They immediately recognised the owner of the blood, and their faces changed.","“Was the Ink Scar Ancestor injured here? Could it be Yang Yutian who injured him?” an Immortal Exalt asked with uncertainty.","“He should have been injured by Yang Yutian’s strange secret technique but don’t worry. It’s impossible to defend against that secret technique, but there’s the two of us. If we work together, he won’t even have the time to use the secret technique...” the other Immortal Exalt said confidently. Shortly afterwards, he looked at his companion and scoffed, “What? You’re thinking of shirking away?”","“Sigh, so many Immortal Exalts have searched for him for so long, and we still haven’t captured him. I just have a feeling that although he’s an Immortal Emperor, he’s probably not that easy to deal with.”","“Of course, he’s not easy to deal with. If he were easy to deal with, why would the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing still be lost? But to us, Yang Yutian is also an opportunity, a shortcut for all of our organisations to befriend those rulers at the apex. If we succeed, the organisations behind us will rise up, without any fear of any threats or challenges. However, this opportunity obviously comes with a certain amount of risk. C’mon, let’s keep looking. When we come across the Ink Scar Ancestor next time, we’ll ask him about the situation...”","......","...","Elsewhere, Jian Chen sat on a smooth rock. Before him hovered a shrub a metre in height, radiating with a hazy glow.","The tree itself was a mid grade God Tier heavenly resource. Its greatest effect was to recover the power of the soul.","However, the method of consuming it was not to devour it whole.","Jian Chen opened his palm. As he circulated his Chaotic Force, a ball of chaotic flames immediately sprouted in his hand, radiating with heat.","He scorched the metre-long shrub with the chaotic flames. The verdant shrub immediately began to wither. Droplets of jade-green fluid were forced out, wrapped in an invisible power as it hovered in the air.","Before long, the shrub turned to ash. A few droplets of jade-green fluid hovered in front of Jian Chen, radiating with enchanting fragrance.","The droplets of fluid contained all of the essence of a mid grade God Tier heavenly resource.","In the next moment, the droplets of fluid merged into Jian Chen’s forehead, turning into a cool and refreshing presence that his soul absorbed.","Jian Chen sat on the rock with his eyes shut, focusing on digesting the effects. His depleted power of the soul began to recover rapidly.","For the next period of time, Jian Chen began his hunt of Immortal Exalts. He repeated the same trick, interfering with their souls through the Profound Sword Qi first before getting the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt to strike when they were vulnerable, directly invading their bodies and annihilating them through their souls.","The targets that Jian Chen chose were all First and Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, and none of them were supreme geniuses. None of them possessed the ability to challenge those stronger than them, so whenever Jian Chen took action, these Immortal Exalts were guaranteed to die.","As for the Third Heavenly Layer experts, Jian Chen temporarily chose to avoid them. He could still kill Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts if he worked together with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt without using the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","However, the effort required was far too great, and it was easy for the enemy to escape, so Jian Chen had no plans to go after opponents like this for now.","The other reason was also because there were far too few Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts in the Skyscraping World. Most of them were at the First or Second Heavenly layer.","During this time, Jian Chen had already wandered through the various regions of the mountain peak several times, but he did not find the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian. It was as if Xing Caijian had vanished into thin air after he had set foot on the mountain peak. There were no traces of her to be seen.","However, he did encounter Lan Caidie several times. She had already recovered from her feeble state, but she still was not in peak condition. She simply sat on a boulder out in the open, meditating. Groups and groups of Immortal Exalts passed by her, but no one dared to provoke her.","Even the Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Profound Spirit Master, chose to keep his distance from Lan Caidie, acting as if he had completely forgotten about how she had attacked him earlier.","The startling power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal had left a permanent impression on the Profound Spirit Master. Without any particularly great conflicts of interest, he refused to provoke Lan Caidie.","“Sigh, the mountain peak is only so big. Yang Yutian has managed to avoid being captured after all this time. How astounding.” Zhou Yunzhuang sighed to himself as he sat on the ground in a certain region of the mountain peak.","When he heard that, the Crouching Peace Master who sat beside him became filled with mixed feelings. “Have you noticed that the experts searching for Yang Yutian seem to have reduced in number?”","“Yeah, there have indeed been fewer Immortal Exalts that have passed by this place recently. They’ve probably given up on the search and chosen to adjust their conditions somewhere else,” Zhou Yunzhuang said without any concern.","“Fellow Chu, what do you think?” The Crouching Peace Master looked at the third Immortal Exalt around them.","He was an old man in green. His presence was withdrawn, which made him seem like an ordinary old man. It was very difficult for him to raise any attention.","“Some people have obviously given up. Crouching Peace Master, are you asking this because you suspect that they’ve met a bad end?” the old man in green asked indifferently.","The Crouching Peace Master was rather stern. “I just have a bad feeling that these people have perhaps actually encountered trouble...”","......","...","“Hmm? It’s the Profound Spirit Master. Profound Spirit Master, have you seen the Kylin Heaven Master?”","“Fellow Blackwind, have you come across the Azure Sky Laity, the Snow Sword Ancestor, or the Eight Regions Ancestor...”","“That’s strange, why haven’t we encountered the Ink Scar Ancestor after all this time...”","“And the Seven Antelope Ancestor. It seems like a very long time since we came across him...”","......","...","Gradually, the Immortal Exalts who continued to search the Skyscraping World for Jian Chen noticed the strangeness. Some of the regular faces they usually encountered seemed to have evaporated altogether. They had not seen them in a very long time.","At the same time, some of the presence and traces they left behind in the Skyscraping World gradually vanished.","This phenomenon left many Immortal Exalts uncertain. They were all filled with an ill omen.","The Heavenloss Master from the Sword Sect of Yang Soul noticed this situation as well. He stood before a sheer cliff and stared at the rock face seemingly sliced by a knife. He was filled with mixed feelings.","He seemed to know the fate of these missing people already, but for some reason unbeknownst to him, he did not disclose the fact that Jian Chen possessed a tablet personally bestowed to him by the elder princess."]},{"number":3919,"title":"Chapter 3919: Signs of Emergence","paragraphs":["Inside the Skyscraping World, the Immortal Exalts who continued to search for Jian Chen everywhere began to waver. Many even considered giving up.","That was because the missing Immortal Exalts were truly gone. They had searched the mountain peak several times, but they did not find any traces of them.","They could not help but make connections as a result. Gradually, a sense of uneasiness emanated through the depths of their hearts.","Some people had already begun to consider the worst possible scenario!","“ Hehehe, sect master, my strength has already returned to the Fourth Heavenly Layer. ” As Jian Chen sat in a certain region of the mountain peak to silently recover the power of his soul, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s voice rang out in his head.","When he heard that, Jian Chen gradually smiled as if he felt happy for the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s recovery from the bottom of his heart.","“ However, my strength has only just returned to the Fourth Heavenly Layer. I’m still weaker than I would be in my peak condition, but I’m close. ” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was extremely excited. When he was trapped in the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, each day was hellish. He was like livestock, spending his days in darkness. Even death would have been a luxury.","However, ever since he followed Jian Chen, his demonic path immediately seemed to open up. It went from being narrow and winding to a wide, straight path, which filled the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt with a multitude of emotions.","“Starting with the Seven Antelope Ancestor, we’ve already killed eight of the Immortal Exalts here...” Jian Chen murmured. He had paid a certain price to kill eight Immortal Exalts as well, which was ingesting many heavenly resources that healed the power of the soul.","However, the entire wealth of these eight Immortal Exalts also became his spoils. In short, his gains had widely surpassed his losses.","At this moment, a blinding ball of light suddenly appeared from the very top of the Skyscraping World. It was countless times brighter than the sun, immediately dyeing the entire realm white.","When the blinding light emerged, all of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, Immortal Monarchs, and Immortal Emperors that wandered through the Skyscraping World shut their eyes reflexively.","The light was far too harsh. It had already surpassed the limits of many cultivators, so even Immortal Emperors could not bear it.","Jian Chen also felt his eyes sting severely, but he did not close them. The sheen of swords shone in his eyes. His eyes were fixed on the highest point of the Skyscraping World.","A colossal sword stood at the peak of the Skyscraping World, radiating with invincible sword intent.","The sword was not tangible. Instead, it was condensed from extremely powerful Laws of the Sword. Sword Qi surged inside as the violent and wanton power made the space shake and the world tremble. Even the terrifying formations personally set up by Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts that protected the Skyscraping World trembled violently before this powerful sword Qi.","It felt like the sword Qi was so powerful that even these peak formations could not endure it, like they would shatter.","“This is... the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s Laws of the Sword.”","“So powerful. Now that truly is the Skyscraping Sword Venerable who was able to stand supreme amongst a group of Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. He’s already perished for so many years, yet the power he left behind in the past still possesses such terrifying might...”","“This sword Qi... even if a wisp of it leaks out, it can easily kill all of the Immortal Exalts here...”","“After waiting for all this time, the seed of ways has finally emerged...”","......","...","At this moment, the eyes of the Immortal Exalts scattered throughout the Skyscraping World all lit up. Many of them had even begun to rub their hands as they burned with ambition. They were determined to get their hands on the seed of ways.","At this moment, all of their attention was occupied by the seed of ways that was about to emerge. None of them could bother with Yang Yutian anymore.","“This is a sign of the emergence of the seed of ways. This day has finally arrived.” Jian Chen’s eyes felt like they were about to bleed. This was the damage from staring directly at the colossal strand of sword Qi.","However, he completely ignored his eyes. He was leaping with joy inside, filled with great excitement and eagerness. He stared straight at the highest point of the Skyscraping World.","Halfway up the mountain, several cultivators maintained a certain distance from one another in front of a huge stone tablet that recorded one of the nine secret techniques. The city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, was among them.","At this moment, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu’s gaze was sharp like swords, staring straight at the top of the mountain brightly. He could clearly see the rays from the giant sword that was thousands of times stronger than the sun, covering every inch of land and illuminating every inch of sky. Regardless of how dense the spiritual Qi was, it could not block out the terrifying sword intent.","“This is a sign of the seed of ways’ emergence,” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu murmured. He immediately lost his calm as burning ambition silently spread through his heart. He was tempted to rush to the mountain peak and take part in the competition.","If he obtained the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s seed of ways, then he would have high hopes of making progress with the Way of the Sword. He could likely reach the Third Heavenly Layer!","However, when Jian Chen’s figure appeared in his head, he felt like a bucket of cold water had been poured over his burning ambition. It became icy-cold again.","“ Without any accidents, the seed of ways will be his. I entered this place at the wrong time, so I have no destiny with the seed of ways. ” Immortal Exalt Tan Yu sighed gently. He withdrew his gaze and turned his attention over to the stone tablet again.","“ This is where my opportunity lies... ”","......","...","Near the foot of the mountain, in a region of wilderness that virtually no one set foot in. In this remote location, there stood another stone tablet that recorded one of the nine secret techniques. Several Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals sat there. They had also been blinded by the dazzling light.","Jian Chen’s disciple, Jing Mumu, was amongst them.","She was the person with the weakest cultivation here, only a Xuan Immortal. She was not even a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","In terms of her age, her cultivation speed was already unparalleled. She could be regarded as a prodigy of the current age.","In terms of her cultivation, she was the weakest person in the Skyscraping World.","“ Little Grass? Are you saying that this is a sign of the seed of ways’ emergence? ” Jing Mumu sat with her eyes shut. Her face was filled with surprise as she communicated in an extremely discrete manner with the green vine that resembled an ornament on her wrist.","That was the Immortal Devouring Orchid!","The Immortal Devouring Orchid concealed its presence and remained by Jing Mumu’s side. Unless they encountered powerful Immortal Exalts, it was impossible for it to be discovered.","“ The seed of ways is emerging. The time when master needs us is here. Little Mumu, it’s time for us to go. ” The Immortal Devouring Orchid let out a pulse of thought, urging Jing Mumu.","Jing Mumu stood up without any hesitation. Her beautiful face was filled with excitement and eagerness. “ Then what are we waiting for? Little Grass, let’s head over there immediately. We can finally return to master’s side. ”"]},{"number":3920,"title":"Chapter 3920: The Seed of Ways","paragraphs":["On the mountain peak of the Skyscraping World, the Immortal Exalts were scattered in the various regions. Everyone had their heads raised, staring at the highest point without blinking.","The supreme sword Qi danced madly for over an hour before the power finally reached its apex. Afterwards, powerful sword Qi erupted, directly plunging into the heavens and merging with the formations that protected the Skyscraping World.","If these formations corresponded to a sturdy lock, then the powerful sword Qi that erupted just now was the key.","When the sword Qi plunged into the formations, a gate hidden in the space there immediately opened silently.","However, when the gate opened up, the eyes of all of the Immortal Exalts gathered near the mountain peak narrowed. They were filled with great surprise and disbelief.","A woman currently sat in the gate, hovering in the air. An ancient sword wrapped in coarse cloth was placed across her knees.","“It’s the daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor from the Heavenly Star Palace, Xing Caijian. W-what’s she doing in there?”","“How exactly did Xing Caijian get inside?”","......","...","When they saw Xing Caijian, all of the Immortal Exalts gathered there were greatly surprised. They were filled with great doubts.<az7cf6> This text is hosted at novel·fıre·net</az7cf6>","Even Jian Chen was surprised. It was no wonder that he did not find Xing Caijian despite roaming the mountain peak for so long. As it turned out, she had already entered a special place blocked off from everyone else.","At this moment, a blinding ball of light drifted out from the gate. It radiated with the profound Laws of the Sword, immediately exposing itself before all of the Immortal Exalts.","“The seed of ways. That’s the seed of ways...”","“It’s emerged. The seed of ways has finally emerged...”","Immediately, the eyes of many Immortal Exalts lit up with burning desire.","However, the formations of the Skyscraping World restricted flight. They could only hover at a low altitude. Once they crossed this threshold, they would be suppressed by the power of the formations. As a result, as they gazed at the seed of ways in the sky, none of them moved recklessly.","That height was beyond their reach!","At this moment, the seed of ways drifted out from the gate in the sky before falling rapidly towards a certain location, vanishing from view very quickly.","At the same time, the Immortal Exalts who were all ready to set off vanished, racing towards where the seed of ways fell as quickly as possible.","Jian Chen moved as well. His body seemed to merge into space completely as he used the Laws of Space to travel. His speed had already surpassed most Immortal Exalts in the Skyscraping World.","At this moment, the seed of ways that had fallen from the sky hovered a metre off the ground in the centre of a rocky area. It was only the size of a fist, shining with blinding light. Layers of the Laws of the Sword wrapped around it.","It was like a tiny fairy, filled with intelligence and energy. It drifted through the rocky region and would pause from time to time as if it was in thought, curious about everything in the surroundings.","“Hahaha, I’m actually the first one to find the seed of ways. Looks like the seed of ways is destined to be mine this time.” At this moment, excited laughter rang out from nearby. Several dozen kilometres away, an old man appeared. He stared at the seed of ways in front of him with burning interest. He was in fantastic spirits.","Soon, he took a step and immediately crossed the distance, arriving before the seed of ways. His hand surged with energy, directly reaching towards the seed of ways.","Immediately, space seemed to freeze. The old man’s action was combined with a technique, directly locking up the space within several dozen metres of him as if he was trying to grip everything in that area.","The seed of ways seemed to be greatly startled. With a flash, it appeared several dozen kilometres away like it had teleported. It was completely unaffected by the restraining force.","“Hmm? It actually escaped?” The old man was taken aback, but he began to laugh shortly afterwards. “Sure enough, the rumours are true. The seed of ways possesses a certain level of intelligence, and it has some kind of connection with the peak formations of the Skyscraping World. Capturing it will not be easy.”","“But that’s fine. Since I’m the first to find you, it means that your destiny lies with me, so you’ll be mine sooner or later.”","As he said that, the old man arrived before the seed of ways with another step. Surging energy erupted from his body. He began to freeze this space with a secret technique, reaching towards the seed of ways again.","This time, his hand seemed to become the sky, covering a range of several dozen kilometres.","However, the seed of ways ignored all of the restraints once again, arriving over a hundred kilometres away with a flash.","The old man did not give up. He tried again and again, trying all of the methods he could think of. After using all of his strength, he still failed to capture the seed of ways.","“Why is it so hard to capture?” Watching the time trickle by, the old man lost his cool. He gradually began to panic.","“Hahahaha, seed of ways, I’ve finally found you.” At this moment, a resonant voice rang out. A second Immortal Exalt had arrived. He beamed with joy, directly throwing himself at the seed of ways.","“Piss off, Uprooting Elder. I found the seed of ways first. I’m the one who is destined.” The old man who reached here first roared out furiously. His presence as an Immortal Exalt erupted as he directly charged towards the Uprooting Elder.","In the next moment, the two of them clashed. Violent storms of energy erupted. Each clash would result in deafening booms.","The seed of ways was like an extremely timid fairy. The more violently they fought, the further away it backed until it vanished with a flash.","“Dammit, the seed of ways has already vanished. Stop fighting me and chase after it!”","The two Immortal Exalts both stopped at the same time and sped off, chasing after the seed of ways.","“Hmm? Seed of ways, I’ve found you. You’re not going anywhere...”","“Seed of ways, I've been waiting a very long time for you already. You’re my greatest hope at reaching the Third Heavenly Layer...”","......","...","Since all of the Immortal Exalts on the mountain peak had basically gathered towards the same location, the seed of ways ran into Immortal Exalt after Immortal Exalt as they converged as soon as it escaped.","For a moment, all of the Immortal Exalts used their abilities, trying everything within their arsenal to capture the seed of ways. As a matter of fact, some people had already set up traps, waiting for the seed of ways to walk right into them.","However, in the Skyscraping World, the seed of ways completely ignored all of these snares. The various formations and traps were unable to stop it at all. Faced with more and more Immortal Exalts blocking it, it was like a frightened rabbit. Despite it behaving frantically, it would always slip away time and time again with ease."]},{"number":3921,"title":"Chapter 3921: Outmaneuvering Everyone","paragraphs":["As great energy gathered around the seed of ways, the compressed space seemed to be completely frozen. It seemed to turn into steel, becoming indestructible.","The power did not possess any destructiveness. It was mostly for trapping, suppressing, and sealing everything in the world.","Immediately, multicoloured light filled the space around the seed of ways. The various abilities and secret techniques wove together, even drowning out the seed of light’s brightness.<az508e> Updates are released by n͟o͟v͟e͟l͟f͟i͟r͟e͟.net</az508e>","Some of the Immortal Exalts were nearby with their hands extended, wanting to grasp the seed of ways, but they were forcefully obstructed by the various suppressing and restraining powers around the seed of ways, preventing them from getting any closer.","Shortly afterwards, the remaining Immortal Exalts also arrived before the seed of ways. Their hands surged with power, forcing their way through the various restraints with devastating might.","Even though the various restraints around the seed of ways were extremely startling, it was still overpowered by the sheer number of Immortal Exalts. The hands all reached towards the seed of ways with lightning speed and startling strength.","“Piss off!” With a furious bellow, the Profound Spirit Master who seemed slightly disheveled erupted with fury. His pressure as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt flooded the surroundings. With a wave of his hand, he repelled two Immortal Exalts, also reaching towards the seed of ways as quickly as he could.","At this moment, even the weakest Immortal Exalt around the seed of ways was of the Second Heavenly Layer. First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts did not even have the ability to squeeze in.","However, right when everyone’s hands were about to touch the seed of ways, it suddenly vanished from view again, making everyone miss.","“Oh no, it’s escaped...”","“According to previous experiences, the seed of ways won’t travel more than ten thousand kilometres whenever it escapes. Everyone, split up...”","The Immortal Exalts scattered immediately, choosing a direction and flying off.","Their senses were greatly limited in the Skyscraping World. Let alone ten thousand kilometres, even a thousand kilometres was beyond the range of their senses.","“ Search a hundred thousand kilometres in this direction. If I don’t find any traces of the seed of ways, turn back... ”","Many Immortal Exalts shared the same thought. They moved very quickly, covering over two hundred kilometres with each step. A hundred thousand kilometres was nothing to them.","Elsewhere, Jian Chen also moved at full speed towards where the seed of ways fell.","“ By the time I get there, the seed of ways will have left a long time ago. ” Jian Chen sighed softly inside. The place where the seed of ways landed happened to be in the exact opposite direction. The location was virtually the other side of the mountain.","That was equivalent to traveling halfway across the mountain peak of the Skyscraping World.","At this moment, Jian Chen’s eyes narrowed as he moved swiftly. Before him, powerful sword intent suddenly appeared. Before Jian Chen could even respond, a streak of light shot past him like a bolt of lightning, vanishing into the distant mist.","“I can’t let it escape this time...”","“Quick, catch up to it. Don’t lose track of it, or you’ll lose your advantage...”","Shortly afterwards, a noisy ruckus rapidly approached him from afar. As soon as Jian Chen stopped, he saw multiple Immortal Exalts fly past him at great speed.","Despite all these Immortal Exalts discovering him, none of them cared about him anymore. All of them chased after the seed of ways.","No one even cared about the Immortal Exalts who disappeared one after another when they searched for Jian Chen. Even if someone did come up with any ideas, they would have dismissed them forcefully to chase down the seed of ways.","“ That was the seed of ways just now! ” Jian Chen’s eyes lit up. Without any hesitation, he immediately changed directions.","Jian Chen’s cultivation was very low here, but he was very fast. First of all, he possessed the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique, allowing him to see the path several thousand kilometres away. Furthermore, he had surpassed all of the Immortal Exalts in speed here with the Laws of Space.","After all, with the senses of their souls suppressed, the Immortal Exalts could not unleash their full speed. Otherwise, it was very easy for collisions to occur on the meandering mountain paths.","Jian Chen was different. Using the spiritual Qi as his eyes, his range of detection was several dozen times larger than these Immortal Exalts. He could observe the situation ahead of him before everyone else.","“Hmm? Yang Yutian, you actually have the courage to chase after the seed of ways?”","“Even with all of these Immortal Exalts, we might not necessarily obtain the seed of ways, yet a mere Immortal Emperor like you thinks he has a chance?”","“Hmph, and he’s actually in front of us. He’s skilled in the Laws of Space, so he’s actually even faster than us...”","“His Laws of Space seem a little special? I’ve met many Immortal Emperors who have grasped the Laws of Space, but none of them have been able to utilise the Laws of Space to his degree...”","......","...","Jian Chen ignored these Immortal Exalts. He simply showed himself to everyone and travelled with the Laws of Space, shaking off these Immortal Exalts one by one.","And that was with him intentionally reducing his speed. Otherwise, he could move even faster.","“Time to a Standstill!” At this moment, a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt just happened to encounter the seed of ways that flew straight at him. He reacted extremely swiftly. With a bellow, the time within several kilometres of him came to a standstill.","This Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt grasped the Laws of Time. He used his temporal abilities to halt all activity there in an attempt to restrain the seed of ways.","The seed of ways immediately slowed down.","In the next moment, the nearest Immortal Exalts all struck out. The Profound Spirit Master was among them. Various restraining techniques were used on the seed of ways.","Even when the seed of ways was immune to these restraints, the many layers of energy still influenced it to some degree. Faced with these aggressive Immortal Exalts, it would fall into peril if it paused for even a split second.","Immediately, the seed of ways was surrounded by another group of Immortal Exalts.","With nowhere else to go, the seed of ways teleported once again, escaping from the senses of the Immortal Exalts.","“It’s escaped again? Everyone, split up...”","“It uses up quite a lot of energy every time it moves. It can’t escape too many times...”","The Immortal Exalts split up and began searching again. Only Jian Chen remained.","Jian Chen was not in a hurry to go. Instead, he shut his eyes and used the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique with his full strength. For the first time ever, he tried to push the secret technique to its limits.","“I found it. It’s nine thousand kilometres from here...” Very soon, Jian Chen’s eyes lit up brightly. He accurately located the seed of ways through the secret technique.","This time, he used the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and vanished perfectly. Afterwards, he sped off towards the seed of ways.","At this moment, he stopped holding back. When he took his first step, he directly teleported over to a cliff eight hundred kilometres away before changing directions and taking a second step.","With the second step, he covered three hundred kilometres and arrived at a crossroad. Without any hesitation, he chose the path leading downwards. After travelling almost another one thousand kilometres, he arrived before a fork that split into three paths.","Afterwards, Jian Chen encountered many forks. The most he encountered at one time had a selection of seven paths. If he did not know the precise location, it was very easy for him to take a wrong turn.","Once he took a wrong turn, then he could only find a way to get back to the fork. Under these numerous restraints, there were no shortcuts available.","This time, Jian Chen was the first to find the seed of ways.","Looking at the seed of ways that hovered several dozen kilometres in the distance, Jian Chen did not move rashly.","“ No one will reach this place within the next fifteen seconds. I should think about how to stop it from escaping, ” Jian Chen thought rapidly. He even called the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt out from the Primeval Divine Hall.","“I have also heard about the seed of ways left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. It doesn’t seem very easy to capture,” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was rather troubled as he stared at the seed of ways that hovered several dozen kilometres away.","“We don’t have much time. Let’s just use our full strength to try and capture it.” After a moment of thought, Jian Chen and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt moved at the same time.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt erupted with the tremendous might of a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He turned into a black demonic cloud that blanketed the space there, turning the range of a hundred kilometres into his territory.","Jian Chen used the Laws of Space to disturb the space, immediately producing layer after layer of spatial barriers around the seed of ways.","With this trap complete, he reached out without any hesitation, reaching towards the seed of ways with the Laws of Space."]},{"number":3922,"title":"Chapter 3922: Obtained","paragraphs":["Imbued with the Laws of Space, Jian Chen moved with lightning speed. He seemed to surpass the limits of space. His hand immediately appeared before the seed of ways.","However, right when Jian Chen was about to grasp the seed of ways, it vanished again. No matter how abundant the preparation that Jian Chen and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt made was, it did not seem to be enough to stop it from escaping.","“It’s escaped again!” Jian Chen furrowed his brows. He used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable again. Under his full strength, it took him less than three seconds to lock onto where the seed of ways had fled to.","He sent the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt back into the Primeval Divine Hall to hide before activating the concealment ability of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, racing off towards the seed of ways.","Soon after Jian Chen left, several Immortal Exalts appeared. They all paused and furrowed their brows.","“Why is there a faint hint of demon Qi here? Don’t tell me there are experts of the demonic path among those who entered the Skyscraping World this time?”","“I remember every single person who entered the Skyscraping World. Some of these people hid themselves relatively well. It was difficult to see through them, but there was definitely no demonic expert among them...”","“Lingering demon Qi doesn’t necessarily mean there’s a demonic expert. It could also be from a demonic object. After all, there are plenty of people who secretly use demonic artifacts among the experts of the Immortals’ World...”","“Forget about the demon Qi. None of that is important. The important thing is finding the seed of ways...”","After a short pause, the Immortal Exalts went off on their search again.","At this moment, Jian Chen found the seed of ways again several thousand kilometres away. It was only the size of a fist, a ball of light condensed from the Laws of the Sword. It radiated with powerful sword intent. If no one tried to capture it, it would not flee. Instead, it was like a fairy, drifting around in a small region in the surroundings.","“ Master, there is a connection between the seed of ways and the Skyscraping World. If it uses the power of the formations to escape, then probably even some Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts can’t stop it from fleeing unless they possess strength that rivals the formations that protect the Skyscraping World. ” At this moment, the sword spirits’ voices rang out in Jian Chen’s head.","“ Hey... erm... Jian Chen, you only need to catch it a few more times. It can’t use the ability where it flees through the formations too many times. It uses up a part of its power whenever it escapes. Once it runs out, then it’ll be a sitting duck, ” the Source of Life added. It had gradually become considerate of Jian Chen despite its initial rejection and resistance to him.","Jian Chen looked at the seed of ways drifting around before him and smiled deeply. “If that’s the case, then I’ll chase you until you run out of power. This is probably the ultimate reason for why the Skyscraping Sword Venerable taught me this secret technique.”<az0893> Tʜe source of this ᴄontent ɪs novelFire.net</az0893>","Afterwards, Jian Chen repeated the same trick, using his Laws of Space to chase down the seed of ways.","The seed of ways would not teleport every single time. Most of the time, it escaped by flying away. Only when it ran out of options would it use the power of the formations to vanish.","At a time like this, the Laws of Space that Jian Chen had inherited from the soul of the Spatial Insect Emperor came into play. Despite his Laws of Space coming nowhere close to Immortal Exalt, his usage and grasp of the Laws of Space had reached quite a high level of mastery through his intimate connection with space. As a result, the seed of ways could not flee for long under Jian Chen’s chase. Jian Chen would be able to force it into a corner every several dozen seconds, forcing it to escape using the formations of the Skyscraping World.","But despite that, Jian Chen would lock onto its new position very quickly.","At this moment, Jian Chen was like a leech, latching onto the seed of ways firmly. He could not be shaken off no matter what.","“That’s strange. Where did the seed of ways? Where’d it go...”","“Who found the seed of ways? Why does it feel like it’s suddenly vanished for good...”","“Something is off. Even if the seed of ways can teleport away, it can’t teleport too far away. We should have found it a long time ago...”","“Expand the search region. Scour the entire mountain peak...”","Many Immortal Exalts rushed around the Skyscraping World like headless flies. They had completely lost track of the seed of ways.","At this moment, Jian Chen chased after the seed of ways and gradually forced it to the other side of the mountain. It was relatively far away from the Immortal Exalts. Essentially, they were on the front of the mountain, while he was on the back of the mountain.","After all, the region around the mountain peak was not an open, flat area. That was only the case for the area near the very peak.","After teleporting away several times, the seed of ways seemed to run out of power. It was on the verge of exhaustion. As a matter of fact, it was quite obvious that it became more difficult to use the formations of the Skyscraping World to flee.","Of course, in terms of exhaustion, that was only the power it used when teleporting away. The mysteries of the laws that it contained had not diminished at all.","“It has already run out of power. Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, trap it!” At this moment, Jian Chen bellowed out. The power of the Laws of Space gathered around him. He did his best to disturb the space there.","“Hehehe, it definitely won’t be escaping this time.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt laughed aloud and struck out without holding back, restraining the seed of ways with his full strength. Even though he was unable to restrain the actual seed of ways, he still disturbed it to his greatest ability.","The seed of ways had virtually run out of power. All of its energy had been spent while fleeing. It was no different from a sitting duck right now.","In the end, Jian Chen’s hand seemed to merge into the space there. As he swung down, everything in the surrounding region immediately entered his hand.","He gripped the seed of ways firmly in his hand.","“After all this trouble, I’ve finally caught you.” Jian Chen smiled victoriously as he looked at the seed of ways stuck in his hand.","He had achieved his original goal behind entering the Skyscraping World.","But very soon, Jian Chen’s smile stiffened. Right when he wanted to stow the seed of ways away, he discovered that he could not no matter what he tried. All of the objects he carried were incapable of holding the seed of ways.","Even the space in his soul could not.","“ Primeval artifact spirit, send the seed of ways into the divine hall. ” Jian Chen communicated with the artifact spirit of the Primeval Divine Hall.","“ I can’t. The formations in the Skyscraping World stop it. Unless the power of the formations here are completely suppressed, you won’t be able to take it away with you. ” The artifact spirit of the Primeval Divine Hall sighed gently and said, “ If I were at my peak condition, this would obviously be a trifling matter, but right now, the Primeval Divine Hall’s powers come nowhere close to contending against formations of this level. It can only protect itself from the formations. ”","When he heard that, Jian Chen furrowed his brows. He immediately used the Divine Armour of Heavenflight in an attempt to keep hiding.","He ended up disappearing, but the seed of ways in his hand remained exposed. Anyone could see it.","The concealing ability of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight could not hide the seed of ways.","“Not only am I unable to place it in the divine hall, but even the Divine Armour of Heavenflight can’t hide it. That’s basically forcing me to refine it on the spot. The test that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable set down is truly quite difficult.” Jian Chen furrowed his brows deeply. He could not completely refine the seed of ways in a short period of time."]},{"number":3923,"title":"Chapter 3923: Surrounded","paragraphs":["“The mountain peak is too small. Looks like I’ll have to bring the seed of ways to a lower region,” Jian Chen said to himself. He understood that if he remained in the region near the mountain top, he would be found before long. Only by venturing to a lower region would he have sufficient time to refine the seed of ways.","Right when Jian Chen made up his mind, his expression suddenly changed. Through the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s secret technique, he had already discovered several Immortal Exalts rapidly approaching him from several thousand kilometres away.","“ I can’t stay here for long. I need to leave quickly. ” With no other choice, Jian Chen could only grip the seed of ways in one hand. He locked it firmly in his hand before quickly leaving this place.","“ As long as I make my way half way down the mountain or off the mountain entirely, it won’t be that easy for these Immortal Exalts to find me anymore, ” Jian Chen thought rapidly as he flew, considering his next plans.<az37c3> Follow current novels on novelfire.net</az37c3>","But at this moment, the seed of ways in his hand seemed to realise the fate awaiting it. It began to struggle violently.","Jian Chen snorted gently. His Chaotic Force erupted, turning his hand into an iron clamp. He trapped the seed of ways in his hand firmly. No matter how the seed of ways struggled, it was unable to break free from his clasp.","Very soon, the seed of ways seemed to realise that it was wasting its strength, but it refused to be trapped like this. In the next moment, blinding light erupted in Jian Chen’s hand. Powerful sword intent surged out from the seed of ways, spreading into the distance in an unstoppable manner.","In the Skyscraping World, the influence of the formations on the seed of ways seemed to be minimised, allowing the sword intent to spread several hundred thousand kilometres away instantly.","That was not even the limit. As time progressed, the sword Qi reached further and further.","Jian Chen’s face immediately changed when this happened. He seemed to be rather surprised as well.","His heart sank. He never thought that the seed of ways would create a mess like this. The current situation was rather different from the rumours.","Jian Chen tried everything he could to suppress and isolate the sword intent radiating from the seed of ways.","Unfortunately, the seed of ways seemed to possess special authority in the Skyscraping World, and it was also strengthened slightly by the formations present. Nothing that Jian Chen tried could suppress it. He could only allow the seed of ways to let out its distress signal in his hand.","“Hmm? This sword Qi... it’s the seed of ways...”","“The seed of ways has appeared in the south-eastern direction...”","“Quick, quick, quick. We have to get there before the others this time.”","“That’s strange. Why is the seed of ways’ sword Qi being emitted from so far away? If I remember correctly, it wasn’t like this in the past...”","“I’ve already travelled several tens of thousand kilometres, and I’ve actually yet to reach the source of this sword intent. Just how far away did the seed of ways go? According to previous experiences, the seed of ways won’t create such a great disturbance apart from when it first emerges...”","......","...","The sword Qi that the seed of ways gave off by itself was like a lantern in the dark. It immediately attracted countless people.","For a moment, the Immortal Exalts who ran around aimlessly all locked onto the precise location of the seed of ways before rushing in from all directions.","Immediately, Jian Chen’s location turned into the eye of the storm. Immortal Exalts converged from all directions to block him off, forming an encirclement around him.","Jian Chen was stern. He sent the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt into the Primeval Divine Hall before gripping the seed of ways in one hand. Determination flooded his eyes. He chose a direction and rushed off.","Very soon, he encountered the first group of Immortal Exalts.","“I’ve found the seed of ways! Hmm? The seed of ways is actually in Yang Yutian’s hand.”","“Dammit, Yang Yutian is only an Immortal Emperor. How is he the first one to obtain the seed of ways...”","The two incoming Immortal Exalts were surprised as if they found it rather difficult to believe what they were saying. Shortly afterwards, they struck without hesitation. They immediately erupted with their tremendous powers, swinging their god artifacts at Jian Chen at the same time.","“Yang Yutian, leave behind the seed of ways...” The two Immortal Exalts howled out furiously as they launched powerful attacks.","Jian Chen did not clash with them. He wore the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, but he did not use its concealment ability. Instead, he channelled his Chaotic Force into the armour, completely unleashing its defensive power.","Boom! With a great rumble, the powerful attacks from the two Immortal Exalts struck Jian Chen at the same time. The powerful storm of energy wreaked havoc in the surroundings, throwing Jian Chen far away.","Jian Chen grunted. The Divine Armour of Heavenflight blocked most of the power, but the force behind the attacks still rocked his organs.","Making use of this opportunity, he appeared a hundred kilometres away with a flash through the Laws of Space. Afterwards, he did not stop. He took another step and immediately escaped from the range that the two Immortal Exalts could sense.","“Go after him!”","The two Immortal Exalts immediately pursued him. With the presence of the seed of ways as their guide, they were not afraid of losing track of him.","Jian Chen used the Laws of Space to move swiftly. Very soon, he encountered more Immortal Exalts. He used the same method to bypass them by resisting an attack and using the Laws of Space to flee into the distance.","Like that, Jian Chen was intercepted several times. In order to avoid becoming surrounded, he did not try to fight them at all. He simply focused on fleeing.","Very soon, all of the Immortal Exalts that gathered over were shaken off by Jian Chen like this. The encirclement turned into a pursuit.","“ Just how long is the seed of ways going to take before it stops this? ”","As Jian Chen focused on fleeing with the Laws of Space, he felt extremely pained. He looked at the seed of ways that constantly emitted powerful sword intent. For a moment, he could not make up his mind about discarding it or not.","Carrying it around, even the Divine Armour of Heavenflight was useless. The Divine Armour of Heavenflight could not hide the seed of ways, so concealing himself was pointless.","“Oh no.” Jian Chen used his secret technique to sense the situation behind him. He discovered that many of the Immortal Exalts had vanished, which gave him an ill feeling.","Sure enough, when he reached a fork, surging energy erupted loudly. Within the blinding light, formations after formations appeared, trapping Jian Chen like a prison.","“Hahahaha, Yang Yutian, let’s see where you’re running off to now...”","“Yang Yutian, just hand over the seed of ways obediently. You’re not destined to possess it.”","“Yang Yutian, if you didn’t thirst for the seed of ways, we’d truly be powerless over you. Unfortunately, you are too greedy. A single seed of ways will completely bury you...”","Figures of Immortal Exalts appeared around the formation, surrounding Jian Chen through the screens of light. There were around a dozen of them.","On top of that, as the Immortal Exalts pursuing behind arrived, the Immortal Exalts gathered here constantly increased.","In just a few seconds, almost forty Immortal Exalts had gathered outside the formation.","Gazing at Jian Chen who was trapped inside, many of the Immortal Exalts laughed.","Encircled, Jian Chen did not panic at all. He stood in the centre of the formation with composure and raised the shining seed of ways before him. He smiled and said, “The seed of ways this time might be different from before. If you possess it, you won’t be able to hide at all. If I were to hand the seed of ways to you, would you be able to maintain possession over it?”","“That’s not something for you to worry about. Yang Yutian, as long as you hand over the seed of ways, I won’t make things difficult for you,” a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt said sternly.","“If the seed of ways were in the hands of others, at least we still have a chance at competing for it. However, if it’s in your hands, you’ll just send us on a wild goose chase everywhere. Just with the Laws of Space that you possess, it’s difficult for us to catch you. If you decide to play hide-and-seek, it’ll be even tougher for us.” Another Immortal Exalt fumed. His voice was filled with a sense of helplessness.","“Yeah, Yang Yutian. Hand over the seed of ways, and I’ll swear that I’ll stop coming after you...”","“Hmph, Yang Yutian, you’re already trapped. Do you still think you have the right to bargain with us...”","“If you weren’t trapped, then we would only want the seed of ways. But since you are trapped, you’ll be coughing up far more than just the seed of ways...”","......","...","The Immortal Exalts outside the formation all spoke up. Many of them looked at Jian Chen with a multitude of feelings."]},{"number":3924,"title":"Chapter 3924: Trump Card Revealed","paragraphs":["As he listened to the Immortal Exalts’ yammerings, Jian Chen could not help but laugh. “Among you, some say you’ll spare me if I hand over the seed of ways, while others will still come after me even if I hand over the seed of ways. Isn’t the outcome all the same for me then, regardless of whether I hand over the seed of ways or not?”","The Immortal Exalts gathered around the formations all fell silent.","Jian Chen looked around and continued, “Since it’s all the same whether I hand it over or not, why should I hand over the seed of ways?”","“Don’t tell me I’m really a sitting duck in your eyes, completely at your whim?”","When Jian Chen said that, the eyes of the Immortal Exalts immediately narrowed.","“Oh no. This person probably still has trump cards. Quick, reinforce the formation...”","“Gather around, everyone. We’ve caught him after so much difficulty this time. We can’t let him escape...”","For a moment, many Immortal Exalts took action. Some of them tossed out formation discs and rapidly set up various kinds of formations. There were also others who blocked the path, guarding it closely.","“Without the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult’s support, I refuse to believe you’ll be able to escape, Yang Yutian.” The Profound Spirit Master looked at him coldly. He unfurled a net that covered the region and channelled his energy into it endlessly, which immediately made the high quality god artifact erupt with blinding light.","At the same time, the space inside the formations that trapped Jian Chen twisted violently. Several tens of thousand people appeared out of nowhere. Even the weakest was a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","There was not a lot of space in the formations that trapped Jian Chen, but it did not become cramped at all with the appearance of several tens of thousand cultivators.","As soon as these cultivators appeared, they assembled the Divine Formation of the Heavens. A terrifying and chilling pressure filled the surroundings.","The surroundings fell silent. All of the Immortal Exalts gathered near the formations gazed at these cultivators that had appeared from thin air in shock. They all became dazed.","After all, this was the Skyscraping World. There were formations upon formations outside set down by Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. Ever since the creation of the Skyscraping World, there had yet to be a person who managed to sneak in others under the tests from these peak formations.","Yet right now, not only had Jian Chen snuck people into the Skyscraping World, he had even brought several tens of thousands of them.","This sight immediately left them all dumbfounded.","Even the Profound Spirit Master was stunned. He stared at these cultivators in a daze, unable to return to his senses.","However, Jian Chen gave them no time to react. As soon as the Divine Formation of the Heavens appeared, it launched an attack. A devastating power erupted loudly. A huge stream of light blasted out with might that struck fear into the hearts of all of the Immortal Exalts.","Faced with such a terrifying attack, even the Immortal Exalts who had already reached the Fourth Heavenly Layer felt pins and needles. They felt as puny as ants.","At this moment, the shade of death engulfed all of the Immortal Exalts present!","They did not have enough time to dodge. Impelled by their reflexes, they either erupted with their full strength, or they drew various god artifacts and raised them in front of themselves, barely making it in time.","Boom!","With a startling rumble, the devastating attack from the Divine Formation of the Heavens obliterated all of the formations present before slamming into everyone with just as much force as before.","This time, the range covered by the beam of energy from the Divine Formation of the Heavens was far too large. It indiscriminately damaged everything in the surroundings, so all of the Immortal Exalts suffered injuries of varying degrees.","Some of the weaker Immortal Exalts coughed up blood. They were blown away like fallen leaves, slamming heavily against the boulders nearby.","Even the Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Profound Spirit Master, was launched away. His face was sheet-white as his blood and organs surged inside his body, almost spurting them out.","The attack from the Divine Formation of the Heavens affected everyone, but the stronger they were, the greater the damage they sustained.","Not only did the attack destroy all of the formations and traps here, it also injured close to forty Immortal Exalts.","“ The power this time has grown substantially from when I used it against Lan Caidie. ” Looking at the results from the Divine Formation of the Heavens, Jian Chen rejoiced inside.","Over the years, the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had been constantly increasing. As a result, even without the Immortal Devouring Orchid and his participation, the Divine Formation of the Heavens was still stronger than before.","“Get to killing, Thousand Soul Demon Exalt!” Jian Chen called out. He made the Primeval Divine Hall send all of the disciples back, only leaving the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt outside.","“Hehehe, as you wish, sect master. I definitely won’t disappoint you!” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt laughed heartily. Like a starved beast, he looked at the group of injured Immortal Exalts murderously.","In the next moment, powerful demon Qi erupted. He turned into a black ball of mist and forced his way into the soul of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt did not go after the stronger Immortal Exalts. After all, the stronger they were, the longer it would take. Instead, the First and Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts were relatively easy targets, which would allow him to destroy them in the shortest time possible.","Jian Chen did not idle around either. He clutched the restless seed of ways in his left hand as he charged out instantly with the Heaven-lifting sword in his hand. As he swung the Heaven-lifting sword, the dazzling light formed five afterimages as he swung towards the most injured First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Five Superimposition Sword!","“Earlier when I was trapped, you were one of the ones who wanted me dead,” Jian Chen called out. He directly thrust the Heaven-lifting sword towards his head. This First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt had not recovered from the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","At this moment, the Immortal Exalt constantly coughed up blood. His organs were virtually in pieces, unable to gather his energy to block Jian Chen’s attack that rivalled an Immortal Exalt’s.","Spurt! The Heaven-lifting sword pierced his soul without any obstruction, killing him on the spot.","At the same time, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had succeeded as well. The Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt he chose was also heavily injured, having yet to recover from the Divine Formation of the Heaven’s attack. In the end, he was slain effortlessly by the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","“Let’s go!” Jian Chen did not get greedy. After killing a person, he immediately stowed away their corpse before calling to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and fleeing rapidly.","The Divine Formation of the Heavens could only unleash a single attack within a short period of time. Once the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings recovered, he would be placed in a disadvantageous position again.","“Hehehe, off we go!” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt laughed aloud in content. Carrying his own spoil in his hand, he immediately followed Jian Chen’s footsteps.","In the blink of an eye, Jian Chen and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had vanished from view.","By now, the Immortal Exalts had begun to recover. They gathered together as their eyes all shone with shaken fear.","“What exactly is that formation? How is it so terrifying? Fortunately, all of us were fending it off together. If he used the formation against any one of us, he’d really be able to cull us as he pleases...”","“That’s probably no weaker than the full-powered strike of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt...”","“I don’t know if that’s equivalent to the full-powered strike of the Seventh Heavenly Layer, but it’s definitely more powerful than the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult’s Remains of the Ghost Immortal...”","“It is no wonder so many Immortal Exalts vanished recently. So they’ve all met bad ends. I didn’t think Yang Yutian would actually be hiding such a treasure on him...”","“Only that item of the legends can fool the formations of the Skyscraping World...”","......<azbfb2> New ɴᴏᴠᴇʟ ᴄhapters are published on Novᴇl_Fire(.)net</azbfb2>","...","After a moment of silence, all of the shaken Immortal Exalts’ eyes lit up with unprecedented burning desire. Their greed was countless times greater than when the seed of ways first appeared.","“ A sovereign god artifact and such a terrifying formation. Anyone who obtains it will basically go on a meteoric rise and reach the very apex... ” At this moment, all of the Immortal Exalts’ hearts thumped. Whether it was the sovereign god artifact or the terrifying formation, either one of them was enough to drive countless people crazy.","Even late Immortal Exalts would struggle to resist this temptation, let alone these early Immortal Exalts."]},{"number":3925,"title":"Chapter 3925: The Heavenloss Master’s Worry","paragraphs":["The exposure of the Primeval Divine Hall and the Divine Formation of the Heavens did not deter these Immortal Exalts. Instead, they sank into ecstasy.","To them, both a sovereign god artifact and the extremely terrifying Divine Formation of the Heavens was enough for them to risk their lives to obtain.","“He definitely won’t be able to use the formation a second time any time soon, or he wouldn’t be running. Chase after him...”","“With just a single strike, it managed to injure all these Immortal Exalts. Such a terrifying formation can probably only be activated once within a short period of time but even that’s enough...”","......","...","The Immortal Exalts who returned to their senses all chased after Jian Chen like they had lost their minds.","Even the two Immortal Exalts that Jian Chen had killed right in front of them were not able to frighten them at all.","In front, Jian Chen gripped the seed of ways in his left hand and moved swiftly. He did not pause for even a second.","Earlier, he considered making his way to the lower regions of the Skyscraping World, as the Skyscraping World was shaped like a mountain. The closer to the bottom he was, the more space he had.","However, he never expected the seed of ways to behave like this. If it continued to radiate its presence everywhere, then it would be meaningless no matter where he hid.","“ The presence from the seed of ways is weakening bit by bit. It’s extremely gradual, but that is a good sign at least. ” This discovery brought Jian Chen some comfort. Once the seed of ways ran out of energy and stopped releasing its presence, it would be much easier for him to hide away.","However, he did not place all of his hopes in the seed of ways. He sent a wisp of the senses of his soul into the Primeval Divine Hall and personally passed an order to make all the disciples who took part in the Divine Formation of the Heavens to recover their energy.","Inside the Primeval Divine Hall, the Immortal Emperors who took part in the Divine Formation of the Heavens did not use up much energy. The several dozen Immortal Monarchs had around half of their energy remaining as well. Only the several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples had their energy completely drained.","Usually, these disciples would mostly absorb the spiritual Qi in the Primeval Divine Hall to recover. At most, they would use supreme grade immortal crystals for assistance. Rarely did they use pills.","But right now, with Jian Chen’s orders, the doors to the Hall of Alchemy swung open. Supreme grade Immortal Tier pills were carried out by the box, together with countless low grade God Tier pills, which were allocated batch after batch.","“Hehehehe, you bunch of kiddos, you better give me all you’ve got and recover with everything you have. Once you get back to peak condition, I’ll lead you outside to kill Immortal Exalts.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt sat above a group of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, personally supervising and urging them. From the eager light in his eyes, he had run out of patience a long time ago.","“With your measly strength as Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, you’re not an ant in the eyes of those Immortal Exalts. They can annihilate you with a single breath. Yet right now, you’re participating in the unprecedented feat of hunting down Immortal Exalts. That’s a chronicle enough to go down in history...”","“Think about the other cultivators in the Immortals’ World. Apart from a select few prodigies, who hasn’t spent several hundred thousand years or even millions of years to reach Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal? Yet many of you haven’t even cultivated for ten thousand years, yet you’ve already achieved what others take hundreds of thousands or even millions of years to do. You really should feel fortunate about having such a great sect master...”","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt rattled on in the air. He made no attempt to hide his praise and admiration for Jian Chen.","Even for him, there were multiple times that he felt it was fortunate to meet a prodigy like Jian Chen, which changed his fate tremendously.","“ Hehehehe, if you count all the other Immortal Exalts I’ve killed in my life, it’s not as many as I’ve killed recently. ” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt chuckled inside. He discovered that he had already become addicted to the feeling of accompanying Jian Chen.","A few Immortal Emperors sat nearby. They glanced between the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. When they heard the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s words, they all agreed with him.","Although they had no other choice when they joined the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, to the point where it felt like they were threatened into joining, all of them felt extremely fortunate that they could meet the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Jian Chen.","They could already tell that joining the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was a tremendous boon to them.","Near the top of the Skyscraping World, the news that Jian Chen possessed a sovereign god artifact and a terrifying formation had already become known by all. All of the Immortal Exalts were shocked.","The Heavenloss Master who stood by a cliff face the entire time obviously received this news as well, but he was filled with confusion.","“Yang Yutian, oh Yang Yutian. You possess a tablet personally issued by the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. In the Immortals’ World, the authority behind the tablet is no different from a life-saving charm. It can get out of anything. Now that you face such dire straits, why would you rather expose a sovereign god artifact than take out a tablet issued by the elder princess?”","“Are you just too proud, refusing to use the elder princess’s reputation to avert danger? Or did the elder princess issue the tablet to you with other intentions in mind, so you don’t have the courage to parade around under the elder princess’s name?”","The Heavenloss Master sank into his thoughts. Ever since he learnt that Jian Chen possessed the elder princess’s tablet, he seemed to sink into a nightmare. He spent every moment filled with uneasiness, having lost interest in all the opportunities that the Skyscraping World had to offer.","“Heavenloss Master, weren’t you determined to retrieve the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? Now that Yang Yutian is carrying the seed of ways, its presence radiates far and wide. There’s nowhere for him to hide anymore. This is a fantastic opportunity for you to capture him, so why are you instead doing nothing now?” At this moment, a gruff voice rang out. Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens appeared nearby. He looked at the Heavenloss Master in interest and said, “Earlier, you were the most enthusiastic one about capturing Yang Yutian. Why have you become so demoralised now?”","Zuo Dao’s words seemed to poke at the Heavenloss Master’s sore point. His face darkened and paled. His emotions fluctuated heavily as he balled his fists uncontrollably.","If it were not for that fact that the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens behind Zuo Dao was far too powerful, his words alone would have been enough for the Heavenloss Master to fly into a rage.","Right now, what he was afraid of hearing the most was him borrowing the elder princess’s authority to gather others so that they could capture Yang Yutian.","The Heavenloss Master exhaled deeply, slowly calming himself. He sighed gently. “Fellow Zuo Dao, please stop trying to set me off.”","“Set you off? What do you mean?” Zuo Dao was perplexed. He felt like the Heavenloss Master’s recent behaviour had been very abnormal.","“Yang Yutian possesses a tablet personally issued by the elder princess,” the Heavenloss Master said powerlessly.","When he heard that, Zuo Dao narrowed his eyes. He was surprised. He stared straight at the Heavenloss Master and said, “Personally issued by the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance? Are you certain?”","“There was the elder princess’s presence. It couldn’t be wrong,” the Heavenloss Master said extremely confidently.","Zuo Dao sank into his thoughts and said, “Could it be that the elder princess issued the tablet during her earlier days?”","The earlier days that Zuo Dao spoke of referred to the times before Fang Jing had obtained the Dominion’s Brush. Back then, Fang Jing did not even have the right to raise much of their attention.","The Heavenloss Master shook his head and said, “Not from the earlier days. The presence in the tablet has already reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. It was clearly issued after the elder princess had reached the peak.”","The Heavenloss Master paused before saying with worry, “Yang Yutian admitted himself that he treats the elder princess as a friend. Originally, I found that hilarious to believe, but I never thought he would actually produce a tablet from the elder princess...”","“Now, I spend every single day at the end of my wit. I don’t know what relationship he has with the elder princess. If they’re not very close, then so be it, but if they are, there’ll be very severe consequences once the elder princess finds out that I’ve been using her name to rally so many Immortal Exalts in the Skyscraping World to hunt down someone she cares about.”"]},{"number":3926,"title":"Chapter 3926: Zuo Dao’s Decision","paragraphs":["Looking at how unsettled the Heavenloss Master was, Zuo Dao could not help but think about how aloof and domineering the Heavenloss Master had behaved back then in the cave where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew. He could not help but gloat inside.","Back then, the Heavenloss Master had been so domineering over the fact that his descendant had tied the knot with the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance that he even looked down on the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens. In the end, he shot himself in the foot like that.","“This is why you refuse to make the fact that Yang Yutian possesses the elder princess’s tablet public despite knowing that yourself?” Zuo Dao chuckled.","Despite knowing that Zuo Dao was mocking him to some degree, the Heavenloss Master was not irritated at all. He said vexedly, “I would have if the incident earlier didn’t occur, but now that it did, where would I find the courage to let others know that Yang Yutian has connections to the elder princess? Wouldn’t I just be digging my own grave?”","Read complete version only at novelfire.net</pzblx>","There was something else that the Heavenloss Master did not mention. He still had a sliver of hope that out of pride, Jian Chen would not tell the elder princess about what had happened in the Skyscraping World.","If that were the case, then the chances of the elder princess finding out about this would greatly diminish.","“Then what do you plan on doing next?” Zuo Dao asked.","The Heavenloss Master sighed. He stared at the smooth rock face in front of him. He was worried.","Although their Sword Sect of Yang Soul was already linked to the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance through marriage, the fifth princess’s marriage did not necessarily mean they had become particularly close with Fang Jing. The greatest purpose of this bond was to deter other organisations. It was enough for other organisations to think twice before they did anything.","However, it was difficult to say how important the fifth princess was to the elder princess inside the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.","They may be sisters, but there were plenty of cases where kin turned against one another in some organisations.","“Heavenloss Master, if I were you, I’d try and make up for what I did, instead of hiding here and doing nothing at all like what you’re doing right now.” Zuo Dao’s lips curled upwards like a smirk.","“Make up? You sure say that easily, but how easy can it actually be? Yang Yutian possesses so many trump cards. How am I supposed to make it up to him?” the Heavenloss Master said. The best idea he could think of was to announce he possessed the elder princess’s tablet. With the elder princess’s influence, at least it would drastically reduce the number of enemies that Yang Yutian had.","However, he had to keep this secret well hidden. He was afraid of others finding out about it, so how could he divulge it himself?","“Whether it’s easy or not comes down to the timing. If the timing is off, then what you’re doing is just futile. However, if you capture the timing perfectly, then you will help in a time of need,” said Zuo Dao.","The Heavenloss Master narrowed his eyes. He seemed to notice something. He turned towards Zuo Dao and said, “Fellow Zuo Dao, are you planning on helping Yang Yutian?”","“If an opportunity presents itself, I’d be extremely willing to represent the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens behind me and create a positive tie with him,” said Zuo Dao.","“Yang Yutian and the elder princess’s relationship is still not completely known. Aren’t you afraid of suffering any implications from the Immortal Feather sect if you approach him as a representative of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens so soon?”","“Actually, I already decided on this many days ago. Back then, I didn’t even know Yang Yutian possessed a tablet from the elder princess.” Zuo Dao’s gaze deepened.","The Heavenloss Master was surprised. He exclaimed, “What is the reason that even at the risk of offending the Immortal Feather sect, your Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens would still try and approach him?”","Zuo Dao smiled deeply. He made no response. He could not help but recall the startling news he had found out from the city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, from the lower regions of the Skyscraping World.","It was also from that moment onwards that his attitude towards Yang Yutian changed in an overwhelming fashion.","......","...","Jian Chen quickly moved through the area around the mountain peak with the seed of ways, buying time for when the second strike from the Divine Formation of the Heavens would be ready. At the same time, he waited as the seed of ways’ energy slowly wore out.","Behind him were the Immortal Exalts who pursued relentlessly.","“Yang Yutian, I’ve already ordered people to search for your female disciple in the lower region. If you still don’t stop, then your female disciple will probably be done for,” an elderly voice rang out from behind. When Jian Chen heard that, frigid light immediately flashed through his eyes.","That was because the voice came from the Profound Spirit Master of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights.","The eyes of a few other Immortal Exalts present lit up. Shortly afterwards, one of them said, “Profound Spirit Master, Yang Yutian possesses a sovereign god artifact that can hold many people. His disciple has probably hid inside already...”","“Several months ago, a disciple of my Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights used a secret technique to report to me that he had found Yang Yutian’s female disciple in the lower regions.” The Profound Spirit Master smiled gently as he pursued Jian Chen. “Actually, when the seed of ways ended up in Yang Yutian’s hands, I had already contacted that disciple to capture Yang Yutian’s disciple and personally bring her here.”","“If you look at the time, it probably won’t be long before he reaches the mountain peak...”","When they heard that, the eyes of many of the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings shimmered. Many of them came up with different ideas.","But after a short moment of hesitation, several Immortal Exalts immediately used secret techniques to pass the same orders as the Profound Spirit Master to the disciples of their sects.","......","...","Several cultivators sat with their eyes shut in front of a stone tablet halfway up the mountain. They were comprehending the secrets of the Way of the Sword.","At this moment, two of the Immortal Emperors sitting there seemed to sense something. They both opened their eyes and took out a tablet with a flip of their hands.","At this moment, the tablet was glowing faintly. Profound patterns constantly fluctuated in colour.","“It’s the ancestor! The ancestor is contacting us through the ancient technique. He actually... actually wants us to stop what we’re doing immediately and devote ourselves to finding Yang Yutian’s disciple?”","“If I recall correctly, Yang Yutian’s disciple hasn’t even reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, yet the ancestor actually wants us two Immortal Emperor great elders to find her? This... this must be a joke...”","The two Immortal Emperors exchanged glances. They were very confused.","“We can’t disobey the ancestor’s orders. Let’s split up and search for her...”","......","...","Similar situations occurred throughout the Skyscraping World. Many Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors received the order and began searching for Jing Mumu’s traces in the Skyscraping World.","“Little Grass, how long before we reunite with master?” At this moment, Jing Mumu moved quickly in the direction up the mountain. Her bright eyes were filled with eagerness.","“ Soon... ” the Immortal Devouring Orchid replied quietly.","At this moment, a figure appeared before Jing Mumu, radiating with the presence of an Immortal Emperor.","“Hmm?” Right when the Immortal Emperor was about to brush past Jing Mumu, he suddenly let out an exclamation of surprise, blocking her path in a flash.","“Greetings from Jing Mumu, senior!” Jing Mumu bowed to the Immortal Emperor out of respect as a junior.","“Jing Mumu? So your name is Jing Mumu. Hahahaha, I didn’t think I’d find you so quickly.” The Immortal Emperor let out a laugh before reaching towards Jing Mumu without any prior signs. At the same time, he said, “Jing Mumu, our ancestor has extended an invitation to you. Come with me.”"]},{"number":3927,"title":"Chapter 3927: Second Strike of the Formation","paragraphs":["The Immortal Emperor did not give Jing Mumu the opportunity to answer. It seemed that in his eyes, a cultivator as weak as Jing Mumu did not even have the right to speak to him.","Up against an Immortal Emperor, Jing Mumu was completely powerless. Despite possessing the Sword Constitution of Soul Connection and the Sword Immortal constitution, as well as the Nine Limits Saint’s powerful legacy, it was nowhere near enough to make up for the tremendous chasm that existed between an Immortal Emperor and her.","However, right when the Immortal Emperor was about to touch Jing Mumu, his body suddenly stiffened. All of his movements came to an instant halt.","A tiny tendril, as thin as a needle, was already deeply embedded in his forehead. Even though the tendril was very small, it possessed terrifying power before any Immortal Emperor. It had instantly destroyed his soul.","On the other end of the tiny tendril was Jing Mumu’s wrist.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid coiled around Jing Mumu’s wrist had struck out silently, effortlessly killing the Immortal Emperor.","“ Little Mumu, this person was after you. Despite being an Immortal Emperor, he actually lowered himself to the level of laying his hands on you, which can only mean one thing—they wanted to capture you and use you against master. ” The Immortal Devouring Orchid communicated. It was unable to speak, but it obviously possessed its unique method of communication.","Shortly afterwards, the Immortal Devouring Orchid swallowed the Immortal Emperor’s corpse in a single gulp.","Jing Mumu was stern. Her face was filled with worry. “Master must be in trouble. Little Grass, we need to move faster.”","“ Little Mumu, you don’t have to worry too much. I understand master’s abilities better than you. Although there are many cultivators with higher cultivation than master, there really is no one who can threaten him. ” The Immortal Devouring Orchid comforted Jing Mumu.","Apart from this Immortal Emperor, Jing Mumu encountered several more waves of people trying to stop her. There were both Immortal Monarchs and Immortal Emperors. Even some Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals took part.","Without any exception, they were all slain by the Immortal Devouring Orchid.","In the Skyscraping World, Jing Mumu’s cultivation was the lowest. As for everyone else, even the weakest were Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. As a result, she had no opportunity to fight here.","Two days later, Jing Mumu finally reached the staircase that led to the top of the mountain under the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s directions.","The spiritual Qi here was dense, so visibility was reduced to two hundred kilometres. Jing Mumu circulated her energy and climbed up the steps with great agility.","“Stop!”","At this moment, the Immortal Devouring Orchid suddenly called out to Jing Mumu. It made Jing Mumu wait where she was before immediately sliding off her wrist and vanishing into the distance.","Very soon, the Immortal Devouring Orchid came back and returned to Jing Mumu’s wrist. “Let’s move slowly. There are a lot of formations blocking the path up ahead. With my ability, I can’t breach them, so we won’t be able to cross them...”","......","...","“ Master, all of the disciples have recovered. The Divine Formation of the Heavens can be used again. ” At this moment, Jian Chen finally received the Primeval artifact spirit’s message as he fled quickly.","The message was like beautiful music to Jian Chen’s ears. He could not help but smile. “What are we waiting for then? Get the disciples to assemble the formation immediately!”","The Divine Formation of the Heavens required some time to prepare. After all, it was a colossal formation that took several tens of thousand people to assemble. It was very difficult to assemble instantly.","However, it was possible to assemble the Divine Formation of the Heavens in the Primeval Divine Hall first. Once it was ready to be activated, it could be transported out in the exact same shape through the powers of the divine hall.","At this moment, Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens appeared in front of Jian Chen. He sat on a boulder and seemed to have no plans on getting involved.","Right when Jian Chen shot past him, his lips moved, communicating to Jian Chen, “ Fellow Yang Yutian, the path off the mountain has already become covered with formations. Do be careful... ”","When he heard that, Jian Chen’s eyes shone brightly. Shortly afterwards, he changed directions, gripping the seed of ways and directly making his way towards the stone steps.","Before long, a long staircase appeared in his view. It was like a bridge that connected the earth to the heavens, shimmering within the thick mist.","Jian Chen stopped several kilometres away from the stone steps. He stared ahead in interest. From the seemingly-empty space, he could clearly sense a vague pressure.","“Looks like they want to trap me on the mountain peak and prevent me from going down to the lower regions,” Jian Chen said to himself. The presence from the seed of ways in his hand was slowly weakening. The other Immortal Exalts obviously detected this change as well.","“Unfortunately, all of their arrangements are for nothing. Instead, they wasted the precious materials for the formations.” Jian Chen sneered. The Divine Formation of the Heavens was growing stronger with each passing day. It had already become his greatest trump card for overcoming any obstacles.","Apart from fusing the twin swords, the Divine Formation of the Heavens had already become his greatest method of attack. It could rival late Immortal Exalts!","“Master!” At this moment, a call rang out.","Jian Chen’s eyes narrowed as he suddenly peered down the steps. Around two hundred kilometres away, a figure was hidden in the thick mist, gazing at him through the formations.","It was Jing Mumu!","Seeing her after all this time, a hint of gentleness finally appeared in Jian Chen’s cold eyes, as well as some adoration.","She was his disciple after all. She was the first disciple he had accepted since he began cultivating, as well as his only disciple!","“Dear disciple, back away! Get away from here!” Jian Chen said with a smile.","When she saw Jian Chen, Jing Mumu’s face was filled with surprise and joy. She opened her mouth and wanted to keep speaking, but the Immortal Devouring Orchid seemed to know what Jian Chen was trying to do. It retreated rapidly without saying anything, backing far away.","“Yang Yutian, we’ve already blocked off the path off the mountain. We’d like to see just how long you can flee for...”","“Yang Yutian, stop wasting your energy and just surrender yourself...”","“The terrifying formation you possess can’t launch a second strike anymore. Yang Yutian, hand over everything on you. That way, you still might have a chance at survival...”","Very soon, several dozen Immortal Exalts swarmed over. Their eyes all burned with greed.","The huge temptation of a sovereign god artifact had already made many of them virtually lose their common sense. Even if they had to risk their lives, they would still fight for it.","This was a tremendous opportunity that could change the fate of an Immortal Exalt.","Jian Chen looked at the expert who arrived here first. “Profound Spirit Master, you injured Immortal Exalt Tan Yu who travelled with me outside the Skyscraping World. After entering the Skyscraping World, you had ill intentions and came after me multiple times. You even said that you would capture my disciple to threaten me.”","“Since you want to get in my way at every turn, I’ll kill you no matter what this time.”","“You want to kill me? Hahahaha, you sure know how to boast. Yang Yutian, I’m a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Unless you can use that formation again, what are you going to use to kill me?” The Profound Spirit Master laughed aloud. He stared at Jian Chen with a burning gaze and said, “However, I refuse to believe that the formation can deliver a second attack in such a short amount of time.”","Despite saying that, caution still flashed through the depths of the Profound Spirit Master’s eyes. He was already prepared to retreat at any time. Despite his burning greed, he had not truly lost his mind.","Jian Chen’s eyes were cold. He had already passed a secret order to the Primeval artifact spirit!","In the next moment, the power of the Primeval Divine Hall appeared. All of the disciples who had already assembled the Divine Formation of the Heavens were transported out in the exact same positions.","Immediately, devastating might surged above Jian Chen’s head. The Divine Formation of the Heavens assembled from several tens of thousand disciples shone with dazzling light. The devastating presence flooded the surroundings, immediately frightening these Immortal Exalts out of their wits.","However, before they could respond, the Divine Formation of the Heavens had already launched its startling strike. A blinding beam of light rained down like judgment from the heavens with a destructive presence, directly targeting the Profound Spirit Master."]},{"number":3928,"title":"Chapter 3928: The Profound Spirit Master Perishes","paragraphs":["The Profound Spirit Master’s eyes narrowed violently in shock. After the devastating beam of light from the Divine Formation of the Heavens locked onto him, he felt like he had been engulfed by an aura of death. A feeling of despair filled his mind.","He wanted to retreat immediately, but he discovered that he was immobilised. The strike from the Divine Formation of the Heavens was far too terrifying. It affected space and interfered with order, forming an invisible restraint that pinned him in place.","The restraint was not particularly powerful. With the Profound Spirit Master’s strength, he only needed three seconds to break free from it.","But let alone three seconds, he did not even have a moment right now.","The Divine Formation of the Heavens launched a supreme attack as soon as it appeared. It was far too quick.","“ No— ” The Profound Spirit Master was overwhelmed with despair. He only had time to let out a howl inside. In the next moment, a tremendous sound engulfed the region. Terrifying storms of energy swallowed the space there.","Immediately, the space twisted as the ground shook. The entire Skyscraping World seemed to tremble gently.","All of the Immortal Exalts nearby were blown away by this terrifying storm of energy. No one remained standing near the centre of the explosion.","“Impossible, this is impossible. How can he make such a terrifying formation launch a second strike in such a short amount of time...”","“Argh! Dammit! Not only can he launch a second strike so quickly, but the attack this time even seems to be slightly stronger than before...”","......","...","The Immortal Exalts were either blown several hundred kilometres away, or they slammed heavily into the nearby rocks. However, they did not care about their wounds. All of them stared at the centre of the explosion in disbelief as their eyes remained widened.","A while later, by the time the devastating storm of energy slowly settled, all of the disciples who assembled the Divine Formation of the Heavens had already vanished. Only Jian Chen and the extremely large Thousand Soul Demon Exalt remained.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt stood half a step behind Jian Chen. With his strength as a Fourth Heavenly Layer Demon Exalt, he seemed like a servant as he stood behind Jian Chen.","As for the Profound Spirit Master, he had completely vanished. There were no remains. Apart from three high quality god artifacts, nothing remained.","With a wave of his hand, the three high quality god artifacts all ended up in Jian Chen’s hands. They were a blade, a sword, and a net.","But at this moment, the three god artifacts had all sustained damage to various degrees.","High quality god artifacts also differed in strength. Some of the weaker high quality god artifacts would not even survive an attack from the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","As for high quality god artifacts of extremely high grades such as the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, the Divine Formation of the Heavens at its current level obviously could not damage them. It could only leave behind a faint mark on the surface.","Not only did the Divine Formation of the Heavens’ attack kill the Profound Spirit Master, but all of the formations set up around the steps to block Jian Chen from leaving the mountain peak had been destroyed as well. All of the materials for the formations had shattered.","“Master!”","A voice filled with joy and surprise rang out. Jing Mumu quickly flew up the stone steps. The presence she gave off was not powerful. As a matter of fact, it could be described as puny, but she moved with extraordinary speed, no slower than an Immortal Exalt.","That was the power of the Immortal Devouring Orchid!","With so many Immortal Exalts around, the Immortal Devouring Orchid could not let Jing Mumu face them by herself. Even a slight pulse of energy was enough to claim her life.","Escorted by the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s power, Jing Mumu arrived by Jian Chen’s side in the blink of an eye, hugging his arm intimately.","“It’s too dangerous here. Go and stay in the divine hall.” Jian Chen looked at Jing Mumu tenderly before forcefully sending her into the divine hall before she could say anything. RãNОВÊS̩","The Immortal Devouring Orchid left Jing Mumu and coiled itself around Jian Chen’s wrist with great familiarity and ease. It seemed like a stylistic bracelet.","“Hehe, sect master, the next time you use the Divine Formation of the Heavens, it’s going to be quite a bit stronger yet again.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt glanced at the Immortal Devouring Orchid and let out a strange laugh.","“Let’s go. Now is still not the time to face them openly.” Jian Chen looked at the figures behind him and flew off into the distance quickly without any hesitation with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid.","Although the strength available to Jian Chen had greatly increased with the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s return, he was not arrogant enough to think that he could face off against several dozen Immortal Exalts with just the three of them.","Once they were surrounded, he would be fine because he had the Source of Life to heal him, but the Immortal Devouring Orchid and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt would be in danger.","He fled with the seed of ways. Behind them, several dozen Immortal Exalts glanced at one another.","The fact that the Divine Formation of the Heavens could fire a second attack in such a short amount of time had taken everyone by surprise.","The Profound Spirit Master’s death had also made them waver. They were deeply shocked.","However, it also demonstrated the power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens to them once again.","As a result, the fact that the Divine Formation of the Heavens slew the Profound Spirit Master in a single strike did not frighten away these Immortal Exalts. Instead, it stirred up their greed and desires even further.","“Apart from the formation, Yang Yutian no longer possesses anything that can threaten us. Quick, we have to capture him before the formation recovers its power...”","“Yeah, we can’t give him the chance to fire it a third time...”","Very soon, apart from a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt in black, the other Immortal Exalts all went after him.","The Immortal Exalt in black did not leave. Instead, he sat down on the stone steps. His eyes shone brightly, making no attempt to hide his burning greed and eagerness.","Around four hours later, two figures swiftly climbed up the stone steps, arriving before the Immortal Exalt in black in the blink of an eye.","They also wore black clothes. They were a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Monarch and a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","“Greetings, Soul Guarding Ancestor!” The two of them were very polite, bowing to the Immortal Exalt.","The Immortal Exalt in black was an ancestor of the renowned peak organisation, the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls. He was known as the Soul Guarding Ancestor.","The Soul Guarding Ancestor looked at the two of them and said hoarsely, “A tremendous opportunity has appeared in the Skyscraping World. If our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls grasps this opportunity, then it will directly alter our fate in the Immortals’ World. We’ll even be able to stomp the organisations that have been constantly opposing us under our feet.”","“Our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls must capture this opportunity, but our strength alone is nowhere near enough to seize it. As a result, I require the two of you to hold a ritual and use the supreme forbidden technique. We need to form a bridge of worlds through space and directly summon the soul of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.”","“What? We need to summon the soul of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy?” When they heard that, the elder and great elder were immediately surprised.","The Divine Sect of Ancient Souls was an ancient organisation that had existed in the Immortals’ World for countless years. Despite having lost its former glory, the sect still had multiple Immortal Exalts. The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloud was the strongest ancestor in the sect. He had reached the peak of the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt!","What was the peak? That was reaching the very end of his current realm of cultivation, caught by the barrier to the next realm.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was only a step away from the Eighth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt."]},{"number":3929,"title":"Chapter 3929: The Divine Sect of Ancient Souls","paragraphs":["“The Skyscraping World has many formations. Under the protection of these formations, even some Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts can’t force their way in. However, our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls has an ancient secret technique passed down from our ancestors. It is a Grand Exalt’s secret technique, which has greatly surpassed the peak formations of the Skyscraping World. Once used, even the formations of the Skyscraping World can’t stop it.”","“Soul Guarding Ancestor, we’re willing to sacrifice ourselves for the future of the sect, but this is the Skyscraping World. The obstructing power from the formations is far too powerful. If you use this ancient technique under these circumstances, y- you might...” The Immortal Emperor from the Divine Sect of Ancient Soul trembled. He did not like the consequences for the Soul Guarding Ancestor.","The Soul Guarding Ancestor’s eyes burned brightly. He said coldly, “As long as we can summon the soul of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, so what if I end up perishing in the process?”","“Alright, we don’t have much time. If you have any last words, say them now. If not, we’ll begin immediately.”","With that, the two experts from the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls glanced at one another. Their eyes were filled with determination and resolve. They passed their possessions over to the Soul Guarding Ancestor and said their final words to him. Afterwards, a ball of black flames rapidly rose up from them. Under excruciating pain, they offered up themselves through the secret technique without any hesitation.","The Soul Guarding Ancestor bellowed out. A profound formation immediately appeared in the air. The two of them sacrificed themselves to power this formation, and it shone with black light, emanating with an eerie presence.","Spurt! The Soul Guarding Ancestor sprayed the formation with a mouthful of essence blood. His vitality was being exhausted at an unbelievable rate. Meanwhile, the presence from the formation grew stronger and stronger.","In the next moment, the black light that the formation erupted with immediately swallowed the space, engulfing several dozen kilometres in radius. It plunged the region into absolute darkness.","Residing in the darkness, the Soul Guarding Ancestor felt like his senses expanded indefinitely, extending towards the distant Divine Sect of Ancient Souls.","But at this moment, an invisible power appeared from nowhere, blocking right in front of the Soul Guarding Ancestor and severing his connection with the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls.","This was the power of the formations of the Skyscraping World!","The Soul Guarding Ancestor had anticipated this situation. He did not panic at all. He began to burn his vitality, sacrificing his own wellbeing and using his full strength to breach the obstacles of the Skyscraping World.","“This is a supreme forbidden technique, created by the Grand Exalt that our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls gave birth to in the past. Skyscraping World, you can’t stop me...” the Soul Guarding Ancestor roared furiously. He used his full strength to breach the obstacles from the Skyscraping World.","At the same time, in an unknown location of the Immortals’ World where the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls stood, a bone was enshrined at the very top of an ancient hall that radiated with a sense of antiquity.","The bone was completely pitch-black. It seemed ordinary. There was nothing special about it. It did not give off any particular pressure or energy either.","Only a heavy sense of antiquity, one that would not go away, surrounded the bone all year round.","This was a sovereign’s bone, left behind by the Grand Exalt ancestor that had appeared in the history of the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls.","However, it was only a regular bone. To the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls, its symbolic meaning had instead exceeded any practical purpose.","It was also exactly because the bone was not worth much, nowhere close to a sovereign god artifact, that the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls still possessed it to this day. Otherwise, other experts would have seized it.","At this moment, the bone seemed to sense something. It emitted a faint, dark glow.","“Hmm?”","A gentle voice of surprise suddenly rang out in the pitch-black and silent hall. In the next moment, a figure that seemed to have merged with the darkness appeared before the bone. He bowed towards the bone respectfully before erupting with surging energy and channelling it furiously into the bone.","Immediately, the terrifying pressure of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt emanated out, making the entire ancient hall shake.","“What has happened...”","“Soul Guarding has used the supreme forbidden technique. Isn’t he in the Sky Skyscraping World right now?”","Several other figures appeared in the ancient and dark hall. They seemed to be part of the darkness as well, merging with the space perfectly. It was extremely difficult to notice them.","“Soul Guarding is calling for me in the Skyscraping World. He must have paid an extremely great cost to do that. Something startling must have occurred.” A deep voice rang out. It came from the figure who channelled his energy into the bone. ṛa₦obÈş","He was the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, the strongest expert of the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls, as well as an existence at the peak of the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt!","......","...","“Oh no, the obstruction from the Skyscraping World is actually even stronger than I imagined. Even with the Grand Exalt’s secret technique I’m using right now, I’m struggling to get through it instantly.” The Soul Guarding Ancestor’s face was ugly inside the Skyscraping World. Only when he truly clashed with the formations of the Skyscraping World did he understand just how powerful and deep they were.","“Soul Guarding, what’s going on?” At this moment, a booming voice drowned out everything in the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s mind, resonating with absolute authority.","Shortly afterwards, the Soul Guarding Ancestor discovered that a tremendous power that he found to be extremely familiar appeared on the other side to him. The two powers worked together from both inside and out, penetrating the barrier of the Skyscraping World and establishing a weak connection through space.","“Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, a tremendous opportunity has appeared in the Skyscraping World...” The Soul Guarding Ancestor immediately became excited. He quickly told the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy about everything that had happened in the Skyscraping World through this technique.","After hearing all that, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy sank into momentary silence. After a gentle sigh, he said, “That is indeed a tremendous opportunity, but unfortunately, only you are currently in the Skyscraping World. The formations of the Skyscraping World are so powerful that even someone as powerful as a heavenly emperor can’t breach them in a short amount of time. After all, a total of three heavenly emperors took part in setting up the formations in the past, and that’s without considering all the other experts.”","“With such terrifying formations separating us, I can’t come to you.”","“Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, I’m willing to sacrifice my soul. That way, you’ll be able to come in,” the Soul Guarding Ancestor said with burning ambition.","“You will die!” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy said sternly.","“As long as the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls can capture this opportunity, I’ll offer up everything I have willingly.” The Soul Guarding Ancestor’s tone was determined. He had already seen past death.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloud fell silent. Losing an Immortal Exalt was a heavy blow even to the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls. A price like this was far too large.","“If you want to take advantage of this opportunity, inside the Skyscraping World will be our only chance, as this place is blocked by many formations. Only our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls has a way to enter. Other experts are unable to get in here. However, once we leave the Skyscraping World, then our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls will not have any chance anymore,” the Soul Guarding Ancestor said urgently."]},{"number":3930,"title":"Chapter 3930: The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy","paragraphs":["The Soul Guarding Ancestor was aware of this as well. Their Divine Sect of Ancient Souls was indeed powerful. In particular, under the watch of a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, their Divine Sect of Ancient Souls had already squeezed into the upper echelon of peak organisations of the Immortals’ World.","But at the same time, there were several existences in the Immortals’ World stronger than their Divine Sect of Ancient Souls. They were aloof, refusing to get involved in anything and rarely participated in any conflict.","But that was only because it was not tempting enough, not enough to tempt them.","Once it was tempting enough, no matter how aloof they were, no matter how free from secular desires they were, they would all fall back to being worldly men.","And a sovereign god artifact was clearly tempting enough.","“This is such a heaven-sent opportunity. Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, we cannot afford to miss out on this. Otherwise, it will be a regret that goes down in history...” Seeing the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy hesitate, the Soul Guarding Ancestor urged again. His voice was pressing.","“Soul Guarding...” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s voice was filled with mixed feelings. It was filled with indescribable emotions. “Are you really prepared to do this?”","“If I can use my life in exchange for millennia of glory for the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls, then it would be my honour.” The Soul Guarding Ancestor’s eyes burned with fervour. He placed the interests of the sect above all else, even above his own life.","“If that’s the case, then I will promise you that regardless of whether we succeed or not, as long as the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls is still standing, your name will be forever engraved on the ancestral tablet, to be remembered by all disciples in the future.” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s voice was filled with vigour.","The Soul Guarding Ancestor was touched. He immediately began to ignite his soul, using the ultimate secret technique of the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls to cross through the vast space and summon the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul.","Immediately, the resistance from the formations increased, obstructing the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s powers.","It had to be said that the formations of the Skyscraping World were far too powerful. Peak formations upon peak formations seemed to form an impenetrable barrier of laws, obstructing all rule-breakers from all aspects. Even with the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s strength as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt after sacrificing his soul to use the ultimate secret technique, he was still unable to overcome the formations of the Skyscraping World.","At this critical moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy took action. Residing in the distant Divine Sect of Ancient Souls, he immediately erupted with devastating might. The tremendous pressure of a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt crushed the entire hall to the point where it creaked as if it was about to collapse.","At that moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not hold back at all. His tremendous and terrifying energy channelled endlessly into the Grand Exalt’s bone on the altar, using it as a bridge to form a connection with the Soul Guarding Ancestor.","“With only the power of Soul Guarding and I, it is still very tough to fend off the formations of the Skyscraping World. I need you to help me.” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s voice rang out in the dark and ancient hall.","“Sigh, Soul Guarding...” A figure let out a long and gentle sigh. He seemed aware of Soul Guarding’s fate as well. His voice was filled with sorrow and sadness.","In the next moment, he suddenly erupted with the might of an Immortal Exalt. His terrifying cultivation was channelled into the Grand Exalt’s bone.","The other figures said nothing, but they also gave it their all.","At that moment, the Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls collaborated from inside and outside, using the Grand Exalt’s bone as a bridge. Finally, they burst through the obstructions of the Skyscraping World.","Eternal darkness swallowed the area above the long flight of stairs in the Skyscraping World. In the centre of the darkness, the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s face was filled with pain as black flames flickered in his eyes.","He was burning his soul, sacrificing his soul to push the might of the ancient secret technique to the limit.","In the end, right when the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s soul had burned away completely, a dark spatial gate silently appeared. A blinding soul seemed to cross through time and space, descending from the distant unknown while wrapped in a dense layer of laws.","That was the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul!","As soon as the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul appeared in the Skyscraping World, he dove into the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body...","When the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul had merged with the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body completely, the darkness from the ultimate forbidden technique finally began to recede slowly.","The “Soul Guarding Ancestor” stood there, radiating with a strange and unique presence. He clearly had the cultivation of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, but he gave off a terrifyingly sinister presence.","“Soul Guarding, all of the disciples will remember your sacrifice. I will not let down your hopes either. I will do everything that I can to capture this opportunity that can change the sect’s fate...”","“Everything... will be for the sect...”","The “Soul Guarding Ancestor” said sternly. At this moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had already occupied the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body.","They shared the same origins after all. Coupled with the special characteristics of the cultivation methods of the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls, not only were there no signs of rejection when he occupied the body, but it instead seemed like a natural union, without any flaws.","His cultivation was at the Second Heavenly Layer, but his comprehension was at the peak of the Seventh Heavenly Layer.","In the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls deep in the sea of stars, only the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s empty body remained, guarded by the other Immortal Exalts of the sect.","The entire Divine Sect of Ancient Souls was on high alert. All of the protective formations operated at their limits.","Boom! With a rumble, the formations hidden in the space near the mountain top of the Skyscraping World shattered. Jian Chen and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt flew out from the churning demon Qi.","Jian Chen gripped the seed of ways and continued to flee, but he was no longer alone. He was accompanied by the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid.","The Divine Formation of the Heavens had already been exposed. There was no point in continuing to hide the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt.","Many of the Immortal Exalts pursuing him from behind set up various formations along the way, all in hopes of stopping Jian Chen at a critical moment.","As a result, more and more formations appeared on the mountain peak. With Jian Chen’s cultivation, there were many formations that he struggled to detect immediately. Fortunately, he had let out the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. He used the strength he had recovered to clear away the obstacles.","“Hehehehe, sect master, you only need to last a few more days to use the Divine Formation of the Heavens again.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt accompanied Jian Chen and let out a snicker.","Jian Chen looked at the seed of ways in his hand. Compared to before, the seed of ways had already used up a lot of its energy. The presence it gave off had greatly diminished.","“Once the seed of ways’ presence is extinguished, I will refine it,” Jian Chen thought. He continued to wander around the mountain peak. He was waiting for the seed of ways to stop giving off its presence. Once that happened, he could flee to the foot of the mountain and use the expansive area to hide himself.","By then, even if he could not stow the seed of ways into the space in his soul or the Primeval Divine Hall, it still would not be easy for these Immortal Exalts to find him.","“Yang Yutian, your flight comes to an end at this very moment! Soul Restriction!”","At this moment, an icy voice suddenly rang out in Jian Chen’s ears. With the last two words, Jian Chen immediately felt like an illusionary hammer had appeared in his soul without any signs at all, slamming down heavily with a special power.","For a moment, Jian Chen only felt his soul rumble. The entire world spun. His soul had been struck heavily.","Jian Chen immediately fell to the ground. His presence was a mess as excruciating pain filled his entire soul.","This was clearly a soul attack, similar to Jian Chen’s Profound Sword Qi. It could not be guarded against.","“ Oh no, this is the laws of a late Immortal Exalt! ” The sword spirits’ cries rang out in Jian Chen’s soul. Shortly afterwards, a violet and an azure streak of light immediately lit up, illuminating Jian Chen’s consciousness and protecting him.","“ Hmph, that’s only a late Immortal Prime, a slightly fatter ant. ” At the same time, the Source of Life’s voice rang out. It used its energy of life to form a verdant barrier, enveloping Jian Chen’s soul.","“ Fortunately, it isn’t a secret technique as deep as the Profound Sword Qi. I’d truly be powerless against the Profound Sword Qi, but I’m still able to guard against an inferior secret technique like this, ” the Source of Life said rather proudly."]},{"number":3931,"title":"Chapter 3931: Mysterious Expert","paragraphs":["Under the coordination of the Source of Life and the twin swords, Jian Chen blocked the sudden soul attack.","Despite that, his soul was heavily injured. He was overcome by excruciating pain like a knife had sliced at his soul. He felt like it was about to split into two.","This was the soul attack from a late Immortal Exalt. When it first appeared, both the twin swords and the Source of Life had responded a little slowly, which led to Jian Chen’s initial injuries.","It was only a split second, yet his soul had been heavily injured.","If it were not for his soul being relatively special, probably any Immortal Emperor, even a peak Immortal Emperor, would have perished before that strike.","The difference between late Immortal Exalts and Immortal Emperors was far too large. Even describing the difference as a chasm would be an understatement.","The excruciating pain made Jian Chen let out an uncontrollable groan. His face was pale-white. He reflexively fished out heavenly resources that could heal the soul and wolfed them down.","The Source of Life could not help him with injuries to the soul for the time being.","“Hmm? You only became injured? You’re a mere Immortal Emperor, something akin to an ant, yet you managed to survive before my secret technique. How unbelievable.” An elderly voice rang out vaguely. It seemed to be very far away, yet also very close.","“Soul, cometh!”","As the obscure voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head, he immediately felt a special, profound power seemingly appear from nowhere. It burst through the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, bypassed his bodily defences, and directly appeared within his soul.","Before the special power, Jian Chen felt a might so tremendous that it was beyond what he could fend off. Before this power, Jian Chen felt like an ant, unable to offer up any resistance or struggle.","This was an ancient secret technique. Its quality was not low. It could even be described as extremely high.","The power behind such a high quality secret technique cast by a late Immortal Exalt was unimaginable.","But this time, the Source of Life was already prepared. It guarded Jian Chen’s soul from all directions.","When this mysterious power slammed against the barrier formed by the Source of Life, it even managed to shake its power, making the verdant barrier tremble gently.","“ This secret technique is not simple. It’s much stronger than the one from earlier. Fortunately, I recovered some strength over the years, or I really wouldn’t have been able to block it. ” This time, the Source of Life’s voice was filled with surprise.","“ This technique should be created by a Grand Exalt. Master, you have to be careful. ” The twin swords warned him sternly. They were grim as if they were facing a powerful opponent.","“ Late Grand Exalt? Who is this? ” Jian Chen was very serious. He closely recalled everyone who had entered the Skyscraping World, but he had no idea.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster was the only person within Jian Chen’s knowledge whose cultivation had reached such heights, but he had not entered the Skyscraping World.","On top of that, the laws they comprehended were completely different.","“ There are opportunities in the Skyscraping World, but the greatest opportunity should just be the seed of ways. Logically speaking, the seed of ways won’t attract an expert like this. ” Jian Chen was perplexed. At this moment, after consuming those heavenly resources, his injured soul had not made a full recovery, but at least he had temporarily recovered some strength.","“Sect master, what’s the matter with you?” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt stared at Jian Chen with widened eyes. He was alarmed. He glanced back at the group of Immortal Exalts who got closer and closer before grabbing Jian Chen by the shoulder without saying anything more and speeding off into the distance.","“A late Immortal Exalt is attacking me from the shadows,” Jian Chen said slightly feebly.","“What? L-l-late Immortal Exalt...” When he heard that, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s expression changed drastically. He was frightened. He subconsciously looked around at the surroundings as a dark shadow was cast over his mind.","Late Immortal Exalts seemed to possess their own terrifying sense of deterrence. Just the mention of them was enough for the Fourth Heavenly Layer Thousand Soul Demon Exalt to tense up and feel chills run down his spine.","“Don’t worry. He can’t kill me. Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, enter the Primeval Divine Hall immediately. If he comes after you, I won’t be able to save you.” Jian Chen’s voice was still slightly feeble, but his soul had already consolidated.","He immediately sent the Immortal Devouring Orchid and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt into the Primeval Divine Hall.","He was protected by the Source of Life, so even a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert could not kill him. However, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid did not have such a trump card. ȒᴀNǑbĚş","Afterwards, Jian Chen did not encounter any more strange soul attacks. The mysterious expert who attacked him from the shadows seemed to be shocked by the fact that Jian Chen had survived two of his attacks.","During this time, Jian Chen constantly swallowed heavenly resources and God Tier pills for healing his soul.","The initial soul attack had left him quite injured. It had already affected his battle prowess. At such a critical moment, he needed to recover as quickly as possible.","He cultivated the Chaotic Body and he had the protection of the Source of Life. The last thing he was afraid of was injuries to the body. When he was in the chaotic sea, even experts like the Heartless Child and the leader of the Myriad Bone Guild struggled to kill him in a short period of time.","However, the soul was still his weak point.","“ A late Immortal Exalt... I can only use the Divine Formation of the Heavens to fend off an expert like that, but with my incomplete formation, I don’t know if I’ll necessarily be able to hit them. ” Jian Chen fled quickly as he thought of ways to deal with this expert, but in the end, he discovered that he did not possess any methods that could overwhelm such a foe.","Even if he managed to fire off the Divine Formation of the Heavens, it would only be equal to the Seventh Heavenly Layer at most, which was equivalent to a strike from the enemy.","In other words, each attack from the enemy was equivalent to a strike from the Divine Formation of the Heavens. A legitimate late Immortal Exalt was equal to countless strikes from the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","Meanwhile, he could only launch a single attack from the Divine Formation of the Heavens right now!","As for fusing the twin swords, the charge up would take too long. He would not have the chance at all.","No matter how he thought about it, Jian Chen discovered that apart from abandoning the seed of ways and hiding himself with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, he had no other way to deal with an expert like that.","At this moment, Jian Chen’s vision suddenly darkened. Whether it was through his eyes or the senses of his soul, he could not observe the outside world. All he sensed were powerful pulses of energy dancing madly in the surroundings, immediately weaving into a powerful formation that trapped him inside.","This formation was more powerful than any of the formations he had discovered on the mountain peak. With his strength, he could not break free from it at all."]},{"number":3932,"title":"Chapter 3932: The Hunter is Hunted","paragraphs":["“Don’t tell me that this formation is also set by that mysterious expert?” Jian Chen’s eyes shone. He was uncertain. He carefully sensed the strength of the formation that trapped him. He was very puzzled.","The mysterious expert who attacked his soul twice earlier must have been a terrifying late Immortal Exalt.","The sword spirits and the Source of Life had both confirmed that.","However, the formation that trapped him here clearly came nowhere close to that level, despite still being very powerful. He only needed to coordinate with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid to destroy it with a few attacks.","However, Jian Chen did not have the courage to let out the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid due to the soul attacks earlier.","“ He clearly possesses the terrifying strength to dominate all, yet he refuses to attack me openly, only resorting to sneak attacks from the shadows. What’s he worried about? ” Jian Chen’s thoughts flew past him rapidly as he stood in the formation. Despite facing a powerful opponent, he did not lose his cool at all.","At this moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy who occupied the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body hovered silently a hundred kilometres away. A strange presence permeated around him, interfering with the laws and rewriting the order there, allowing him to blend perfectly into space. Unless there were other Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts present, no one could discover him.","He remained a hundred kilometres away as he stared at Jian Chen silently. He did not take any action. He constantly recalled all the information he had learnt from the Soul Guarding Ancestor.","“ What a pity. I couldn’t kill you silently. This place is too small, so I can’t directly confront you either. Otherwise, if others find out that a sovereign god artifact has ended up in the hands of our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls, we will have no more peace... ”","“ The sovereign god artifact can only be obtained in secret. I can’t let anyone else find out... ”","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was filled with pity. Right now, he was occupying a body that did not belong to him. He only had the cultivation of the Second Heavenly Layer. His battle prowess was no longer at peak condition. His greatest source of strength was the laws he had comprehended.","The forbidden techniques he used against Jian Chen earlier were actually his strongest techniques right now. They were completely enough to heavily injure Immortal Exalts of the Sixth Heavenly Layer.","He had never imagined that even they would not be enough to deal with a mere Immortal Emperor.","“ People can’t get in for now, so before the Skyscraping World opens, I don’t have to worry about other experts barging in here. If that’s the case, I’ll let them wear you down first. Hopefully, I’ll be able to swoop in once you’ve been killed, as it’ll be much easier to take the sovereign god artifacts from others than you, ” thought the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. He remained in hiding as he observed Jian Chen who was trapped in the formation. He did not take any actions in a hurry.","Meanwhile, Jian Chen was surrounded once again. Several dozen Immortal Exalts encircled the formation, constantly reinforcing it. They constantly added to the formation set down by the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","For a moment, Jian Chen became surrounded by various formations shining with all sorts of colours. The powerful pressure even left some of the Immortal Exalts secretly surprised.","As for who had set up the initial formation that trapped Jian Chen, no one bothered to think about that anymore. After all, many of them had left behind traps like these formations along the way. They had already grown accustomed to them.","“Yang Yutian, we’ve finally caught you. I’d like to see how you escape now...”","“I refuse to believe you can activate that terrifying formation in such a short amount of time. You’re dead for sure this time...”","“Stop wasting time. Immediately activate all of the killing formations and kill this person first, just in case more accidents happen...”","“Yeah, we’ll kill him first. Do it...”","Immediately, dazzling light illuminated the space. Everyone immediately activated their formations. As the formations operated, various powerful attacks flooded towards Jian Chen.","They had intentionally set up these formations to avoid one another. They only targeted Jian Chen.","Immediately, fire, ice, sword Qi, blade Qi, and various other energies swallowed Jian Chen. With a great rumble, Jian Chen was completely drowned out by a devastating storm of energy.","At this moment, no one considered Jian Chen’s background, nor did anyone consider the consequences. The temptations of a sovereign god artifact was enough to drive many people crazy. In order to obtain it, they were willing to give up everything.","Even with all these people present, they were still willing to gamble everything for the slimmest chance, even if it would doom them for good.","In just a split second, Jian Chen suffered severe injuries. Countless holes were blasted through his body. Blood sprayed everywhere.","Before such intense attacks, even if he pushed the defences of his Chaotic Body to the limit, it was useless.","After all, he was facing a group of Immortal Exalts!","“Kill him first and then we’ll decide who the treasure belongs to...”","At this moment, all of the Immortal Exalts who surrounded Jian Chen had lost their minds. The only thought in their heads was to completely kill off Jian Chen.","That was because they had personally experienced just how difficult Jian Chen was to deal with. If it were not for the seed of ways that forced Jian Chen out of hiding, even finding him would be almost impossible.","Jian Chen’s body swayed around, rocked by the powerful attacks. He was unable to stand straight at all.","At this moment, he was like a rowboat in the middle of the ocean. He could tip over at any moment from the storm.","The power of the Source of Life trickled out, flowing endlessly throughout Jian Chen’s body. Wherever it passed by, Jian Chen felt all of his injuries recover at an unbelievable rate.","At times, it even healed faster than the injuries could be created.","“We can stop now. He should be dead...”","“Even a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt might not be able to survive such intense attacks, let alone a mere Immortal Emperor like him...”","The furious barrage of attacks lasted for several seconds before finally stopping. All of the Immortal Exalts who were scattered in the surroundings were fixated on the centre of the formations.","The pressure created by the highly-condensed storm of energy prevented the senses of their souls from getting close.","A while later, the multicoloured storm slowly dispersed. Jian Chen’s figure finally appeared before them again. Immediately, everyone gasped. They were dumbfounded.","That was because there was not a single trace of injury on Jian Chen at all. If it were not for the blood scattered on the ground, they might have even suspected that Jian Chen had not been injured at all.","“I had heard that Yang Yutian possesses a treasure that can rapidly heal his injuries, b-but this is simply inconceivable...”","Many of the Immortal Exalts cried out in the surroundings. The eyes of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy who occupied the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body a hundred kilometres away narrowed as well. He was shocked.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had heard from the Soul Guarding Ancestor that Yang Yutian could heal himself quickly, but he never expected it to be so fast.","He was basically unkillable."]},{"number":3933,"title":"Chapter 3933: Refining the Seed","paragraphs":["“His body is virtually indestructible, and his soul can endure the secret techniques that I use personally. Sure enough, this person’s fortunes are startling,” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy murmured. At his level of cultivation, very few items in the world could still interest him, but at this moment, his heart thumped uncontrollably. Even his eyes shone with an unprecedented light.","“It’s impossible for him to heal his injuries endlessly. He’ll stop sooner or later. Quick, keep attacking him...”","“Don’t idle around, everyone. We’ll all take action. We have to waste all of his recovery powers as quickly as possible...”","As two Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts roared out furiously, the Immortal Exalts gathered nearby all took action. Energy filled the space and deafening rumbles rang out endlessly. Jian Chen faced another barrage of destructive attacks.","This time, the storm of energy he faced was several times stronger than before!","They only had one objective, which was to exhaust the power that Jian Chen used to heal himself.","They were right. Jian Chen’s life energy was not endless. After all, even a sovereign god artifact’s powers were not truly endless. Once they experienced battles of high intensity, even items as powerful as sovereign god artifacts would run out of power.","The Source of Life in Jian Chen’s body was in a weakened state right now as well. It was not in peak condition.","However, they had misunderstood the nature of the treasure healing Jian Chen’s injuries. If it were a regular treasure, then it would indeed fail before this barrage of attacks. However, sovereign god artifacts were different.","Even when the Source of Life was weakened right now, it was still power from the level of Grand Exalts. Even just a hint of this power could revive an entire world and turn it into an oasis. These early Immortal Exalts were indeed getting slightly ahead of themselves when they thought they could exhaust the Source of Life’s powers.","Jian Chen endured the agonising pain from his body. He looked at the seed of ways in his hand; he became slightly irritated.","A major part of why he was in his current situation was because of the seed of ways in his hand.","The seed of ways prevented him from hiding. Both the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight were useless. Unless he gave up on the seed of ways, he could not even enter the Primeval Divine Hall.","The seed of ways was connected to the formations of the Skyscraping World. With the formations in the way, it was impossible to stow it away in any spatial god artifact.","“ Source of Life, I’ll leave my body to you. ” Jian Chen made a decision. Resolve flooded his eyes. He equipped the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and used its toughness to block the attacks from all directions, preventing his body from being pierced again and again. Afterwards, he ignored his physical injuries, enduring the devastating barrage as he refined the seed of ways.","Only by making the seed of ways disappear would he have a chance at hiding. Otherwise, even if he waited until he could destroy this formation with the Divine Formation of Heavens, he would be trapped again very soon.","Right now, it was not just these early Immortal Exalts who were coming after him. There was also a late Immortal Exalt.","“Don’t worry. With me around, you won’t die,” the Source of Life said with ease. Jian Chen’s injuries seemed very terrifying, but it used very little power in total to heal these injuries caused by early Immortal Exalts.","By now, the Divine Armour of Heavenflight had dimmed. Jian Chen only relied on its toughness to block the attacks from all directions.","It was a high quality god artifact, but its defences could only be activated when enough energy was channelled into it, allowing it to demonstrate its strength as a high quality god artifact. However, facing the vicious attacks of several dozen Immortal Exalts, Jian Chen was obviously unable to activate the defences of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight with his cultivation as a mere mid Immortal Emperor.","Even if he exhausted a tremendous amount of Chaotic Force to temporarily raise the defences of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, it would almost instantly be destroyed. RANꝋ₿ÈS","Jian Chen’s body constantly went through the process of destruction and restoration inside the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. It was very painful, but he had experienced the pain of forging his Chaotic Body over a dozen times after all. He had developed great willpower a long time ago. The physical pain was not enough to overwhelm him.","He had already begun refining the seed of ways, attempting to absorb the secrets of the Way of the Sword contained inside. However, under such brutal circumstances, the process was extremely slow. It would take over ten times longer than usual.","The injuries and impact to his body interfered with him severely.","“Oh no, he’s already refining the seed of ways...”","“He actually still has the courage to split his focus and refine the seed of ways while facing such intense attacks? He’s absolutely crazy...”","“The seed of ways is no longer important. We’ll kill him first. Only once he’s dead will we have the chance to seize this tremendous opportunity...”","The Immortal Exalts growled furiously. Tremendous energy surged out from their bodies. The terrifying storms they created made the world pale.","Their attacks lasted several hours before gradually stopping, but once the violent storm of energy dispersed, they discovered through the formations that Jian Chen was still unscathed.","Even more unbearably, Jian Chen had already shut his eyes, ignoring the situation around him and focusing on refining the seed of ways.","Even when he was knocked around, it did not affect him at all. All of the pain his body endured seemed to have nothing to do with him.","“Keep at it!”","Some Immortal Exalts roared out furiously. The more impressive Jian Chen appeared to be, the madder their greed became.","This time, they continued for an even longer time. Their furious attacks lasted for an entire day before stopping, but when they discovered Jian Chen’s condition, all of them felt like going berserk.","Jian Chen was still alive and well, focused on refining the seed of ways.","“ Dammit, don’t tell me his healing ability is truly endless... ” At this moment, many Immortal Exalts all thought the same thing. They felt powerless.","An Immortal Emperor withstood an entire day of furious attacks from several dozen Immortal Exalts, yet he still remained unscathed. That healing treasure was far too startling.","Under ordinary circumstances, even if it had been an early Immortal Exalt, who knew how many times they would have died already.","There were numerous Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts taking part in the encirclement after all.","“It can’t be endless. There must be a limit. Keep going!” A Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt roared furiously. His sword shuddered as resplendent streaks of sword Qi immediately pierced through the air, flying towards Jian Chen.","The longer it took, the more uneasy these Immortal Exalts became, as they had no idea when the Divine Formation of the Heavens could be activated again.","“ Source of Life, we need to be a little more discreet. Slow down my recovery rate and create the false impression that the healing energy is about to run out, ” Jian Chen communicated to the Source of Life as he refined the seed of ways.","The Source of Life immediately slowed down Jian Chen’s recovery rate. The Immortal Exalts who spent every moment watching Jian Chen noticed this very quickly. They were all elated, and their attacks immediately became even more intense.","“ You’ve reached your limit with the healing? ” A hundred kilometres away, a streak of light flashed through the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s eyes as he lay in hiding. “ I wonder if you can still endure my secret technique? I better send you off quickly. Once the sovereign god artifact ends up in the hands of others, it’ll be much easier to take. ”","“ Soul, cometh! ”"]},{"number":3934,"title":"Chapter 3934: Reinforcements?","paragraphs":["As the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy used his secret technique, a mysterious and eerie power pierced through space, bypassing all the formations cast down by the Immortal Exalts and silently striking Jian Chen’s soul.","The verdant barrier from the Source of Life had remained the entire time in Jian Chen’s soul. It had never lowered its defences. When the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s secret technique struck, it immediately shook the verdant barrier.","“It’s happened again. Soul attacks at this strength can instantly kill that demonic cultivator,” the Source of Life called out. This was no longer a regular soul attack, but a secret technique of rather high quality. It was extremely powerful.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy stared at Jian Chen closely. Shortly afterwards, a hint of surprise appeared in his eyes. He noticed that Jian Chen had only furrowed his brows. It did not have much of an effect on him.","“ Don’t tell me this kid even has a treasure that can block soul attacks? ”","“ But what kind of treasure can stop my secret techniques numerous times? ”","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s gaze deepened. He knew that Jian Chen possessed a sovereign god artifact that could hold several tens of thousand people, but a sovereign god artifact like that was completely incapable of stopping soul attacks.","Different kinds of god artifacts came with different functions after all.","“ Since I can’t directly destroy your soul, I’ll have to take another method, ” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy thought. He did not show himself or take part in the encirclement around Jian Chen. Instead, he remained in hiding. Apart from Jian Chen, no one in the Skyscraping World knew that a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was present.","At this moment, Jian Chen’s presence grew weaker and weaker while he remained trapped in the formations. His recovery speed slowed down as well.","All of the Immortal Exalts who took part in the assault became excited. They had already noticed that Jian Chen could not last much longer.","“No, something is off. Since this kid has a sovereign god artifact, why isn’t he hiding inside? With the sturdiness of a sovereign god artifact, it’s more than enough to block our attacks,” a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt calmed down and asked.","“So what if he hides in the sovereign god artifact? We might not be able to get through the sovereign god artifact, but we’re completely capable of taking a damaged sovereign god artifact away with us. If he goes inside, wouldn’t he become a sitting duck?”","“Damaged? How are you certain that the sovereign god artifact is damaged?”","“Hmph, if it weren’t damaged, why would he be so overwhelmed with the power of a sovereign god artifact?”","“In the Immortals’ World, just how many sovereign god artifacts that remain are still undamaged?”","A few Immortal Exalts stated their analysis, but most of them were no longer capable of calming down and thinking closely. Their intense greed and desires had made them lose their rationality.","Just how many people could remain composed when faced with a sovereign god artifact?","“You’re on the brink of death and you’re actually still thinking of refining the seed of ways. Looks like you’d rather die than leave the seed of ways behind. Hahaha, just how many people still care about the seed of ways right now...” An Immortal Exalt sneered.","The presence of the seed of ways had already diminished heavily inside the formations. After this difficult period of refinement, Jian Chen had absorbed less than one ten thousandth of the secrets of the Way of the Sword. However, the greatest benefit he derived was not the secrets of the Way of the Sword he had absorbed, but the fact that the seed of ways had greatly diminished.","By now, the range of presence from the seed of ways had already shrunken drastically.","“ Even if I can’t absorb the seed of ways completely in a short amount of time, it’s still good news that it can’t radiate its presence so far away, ” Jian Chen thought. With just a few more days, the Divine Formation of the Heavens could be activated again. He had already decided to do all that he could to wear down the seed of ways’ power before he used the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","As long as the presence of the seed of ways had weakened to a range of ten thousand kilometres, or even just a few thousand kilometres, it would be much easier for him to hide.","Suddenly, Jian Chen shivered inside. A familiar and tremendous power suddenly appeared in the distance. With this power’s appearance, the entire surroundings responded. A terrifying, blood-red light filled every inch of space, giving countless Immortal Exalts chills.","Jian Chen stopped refining the seed of ways. He subconsciously looked into the distance.","There, he sensed a familiar power.","The power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal!","“It’s the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, Lan Caidie. Everyone, be careful...”","“Vice cult leader Lan of the Ghost Immortal cult is also here to steal the sovereign god artifact. She only has enough to launch a single attack. Quick, everyone pour your strength together and block...”","“We can’t let Lan Caidie take the sovereign god artifact. She’s even stronger than you would imagine. Taking it from her will be far too difficult...”","It all happened in a split second. The power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal arrived before everyone. An elderly figure stood within the surging, bloody mist, her hair and clothes dancing. She arrived in a domineering manner with a devilish presence.","With a wave of her hand, the surging, bloody mist immediately churned. It seemed to condense into a huge, bloody claw, swinging towards the formations with a devastating power.","The Immortal Exalts gathered here obviously would not just watch helplessly as Lan Caidie penetrated the formation. Everyone took action at the same time, either drawing their god artifacts or using secret techniques. Powerful attacks after powerful attacks shot through the air as resplendent streaks of light, slamming into the bloody claw fearlessly.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of rumbles rang out in the surroundings. Close to forty Immortal Exalts struck out at the same time. The power was also devastating, but it was slightly weaker than the power of Lan Caidie’s Remains of the Ghost Immortal. It all shattered before the bloody claw.","However, the attacks weakened the bloody claw. The strikes from several dozen Immortal Exalts had failed to stop the bloody claw, but it had chipped away at its might.","In the distance, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s eyes shone. He did not take action.","Boom!","The bloody claw slammed into the formations. The sturdy formations immediately shattered one after another. In the blink of an eye, over a dozen of them had been destroyed. The violent storm of energy swept through the surroundings, forcing back all of the Immortal Exalts nearby.","However, Lan Caidie’s attack did not destroy all of the formations. When the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal dispersed, a final formation remained standing.","This formation was from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","It was not due to how powerful the formation was, but because the Remains of the Ghost Immortal had used up too much of its power against the attacks of the Immortal Exalts.","At this moment, the formation left behind by the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy rocked violently. It dimmed as if it only needed one last push before crumbling.","Lan Caidie’s expression changed. After using the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal, she no longer had the strength to launch another strike.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, I’ve come to help set you free.” At this moment, another elderly voice rang out. The Heavenloss Master appeared. He gripped a high quality god artifact sword that erupted with blinding light, slashing at the final formation with his full strength.","Boom! With a rumble, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s formation rocked violently. Many thin cracks appeared, but it still endured the strike in the end.","“And my Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens!” A gruff voice rang out. Zuo Dao had also arrived, using a secret technique and directly punching out.","The punch was devastating. It was only from a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, but it was enough to leave many Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts wary.","Under the Heavenloss Master and Zuo Dao’s attacks, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s formation that was on the brink of collapse finally gave in. It shattered with a crack.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, go now. I’ll hold them back for you,” the Heavenloss Master growled. His eyes were filled with determination. With a wave of his hand, a gentle power directly pushed Jian Chen into the distance. Shortly afterwards, he raised his sword before him and said coldly, “As long as I’m still around, you can all forget about even touching a hair on fellow Yang Yutian. If you want to get to him, you better step over my corpse first.”","“Heavenloss Master, what’s gotten to you?” A Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt stared at the Heavenloss Master as if he had just seen a ghost."]},{"number":3935,"title":"Chapter 3935: Shock","paragraphs":["It was not just him. Many other Immortal Exalts were also taken aback by the Heavenloss Master’s sudden, abnormal behaviour. They were confused.","At least Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens’ actions made sense. He had never participated in any of the operations that went after Yang Yutian.","However, the Heavenloss Master was different. Previously, he had rallied many Immortal Exalts in the Skyscraping World to capture Yang Yutian and retrieve the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. He had created a great disturbance on the mountain peak.","Although these Immortal Exalts participated in the capture of Yang Yutian, most of them had only done so because they wanted the heavenly resources in his possession. However, the Heavenloss Master had also been a major motivating factor.","Yet in the end, not only did the Heavenloss Master fail to take back the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, but he was now even standing on Yang Yutian’s side. He personally destroyed the final formation to free him. The huge turnaround left them all rather confused.","After all, they had no feuds with Yang Yutian. They simply did this for their interests, unlike the Heavenloss Master who had even tried to hunt down Yang Yutian due to the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing.","“Heavenloss Master, don’t tell me you think he’ll hand over the treasure obediently if you save him? If that’s really what you think, you’d be far too naive...”","“Heavenloss Master, I know you’re actually after the treasure as well, but you never, ever should have freed Yang Yutian. Do you have any idea just how much effort it took us to trap him?”","“You fool. Even if you want to contend for the treasure, you would want to deal with Yang Yutian first and not help free him...”","“Heavenloss Master, you were the most fervent one in pursuing Yang Yutian previously. I struggle to understand why you want to help him now...”","The Heavenloss Master’s face became more and more ugly. After learning that Jian Chen possessed a tablet personally issued by the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, he did not dare to go after him anymore. At the same time, he was afraid of these words that put him in opposition to Yang Yutian.","In particular, when he heard what they said at the very end about him hunting down Yang Yutian, it seemed to set him off. Fury burned inside him as he bellowed out, “Shut up! It is not up to you to tell me what I should or shouldn’t do. In short, I definitely won’t just watch you outnumber and overwhelm fellow Yang Yutian right now.”","With that, the Heavenloss Master’s presence surged once more. His will had never been so firm. He turned around and glanced at Jian Chen in the distance who had yet to leave. He roared out, “Fellow Yang Yutian, go! I’ll buy time for you!”","“You’re mad, Heavenloss Master. I think you’ve lost your mind. You have no idea what you’re doing anymore,” a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt said coldly. Wielding a god artifact sword, he surged with sword intent and directly slashed apart space. He thrust his sword towards the Heavenloss Master with unprecedented might.","“Heavenloss Master, even if your Sword Sect of Yang Soul has the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance backing you, we will never back down before an opportunity like this. If you insist on being stubborn, then we can only offend you...”","Facing the incoming attack, the Heavenloss Master behaved like he was confronting a great enemy. He also thrust out with his sword. Immediately, a terrifying might of the world permeated out, making his sword seemingly turn into a roaring sun. It collided with the Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt’s sword with the might of a God Tier Immortal Technique.","Boom! With a great rumble, the Heavenloss Master staggered backwards uncontrollably within the violent storm of energy.","The Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt also stumbled backwards uncontrollably.","They were both experts who had grasped the Way of the Sword, so their battle prowess was very great. The God Tier Immortal Technique used by the Heavenloss Master with his cultivation at the Second Heavenly Layer only managed to match his opponent.","However, it was not just a single person who attacked the Heavenloss Master. Shortly afterwards, two Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts also took action. They produced two powerful streaks of light that shot towards the Heavenloss Master with their god artifact swords.","The Heavenloss Master roared out furiously and blocked with his sword. However, he had just used a God Tier Immortal Technique. He was currently in a state of overexertion, so he obviously could not defend against the two attacks.","With a deep grunt, the Heavenloss Master was knocked away. He slammed into a rock wall behind him in an extremely sorry fashion.","“Galaxial Curtain!”","On the other side, Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens was fighting as well. He used a secret technique from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens. As he punched out, a gorgeous galaxy appeared.","The power behind his punch was so great that even some Third Heavenly Layer experts became wary.","But in the next moment, several Immortal Exalts struck out at the same time. Zuo Dao’s secret technique was instantly shattered. Afterwards, he was also launched away like the Heavenloss Master.","In an evenly-numbered battle against another cultivator of the same cultivation, regular Immortal Exalts would not be Zuo Dao’s opponent at all with his legacy from the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens. However, there was nothing he could do about being outnumbered.","Before the tremendous temptation of a sovereign god artifact, no one cared about Zuo Dao and the Heavenloss Master’s background anymore, but they did not try to kill them either. They only combined their strength to repel the two.","Outnumbered by several fold, both Zuo Dao and the Heavenloss Master’s efforts were feeble. They could not stop them at all.","On the other side, Lan Caidie had already used the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal. She had become extremely feeble, but she still grabbed Jian Chen by the shoulder. She turned into a blood-red blur that shot into the distance as quickly as possible.","She was extremely feeble right now. Whenever she used the power of the Remains of the Ghost Immortal, she would have to pay a hefty price. Right now, she only had the strength to flee. She no longer had any battle prowess left.","If she took too long, even escaping would become difficult for her.","“Vice cult leader Lan, you’ve already achieved your objective. Why are you still using this power to save me?” At this moment, Jian Chen suddenly opened his eyes as Lan Caidie carried him in her arms. He communicated to Lan Caidie carefully. He seemed extremely feeble as if he was on the brink of death.","Lan Caidie moved extremely quickly. She sped along the wide mountain path and did not waste a single moment. She glanced at Jian Chen with a hint of worry and said, “You’re not from the Ghost Immortal cult, so you do not understand just how much assistance the heavenly emperor has given to us. You also do not understand just how grateful our Ghost Immortal cult is towards the heavenly emperor. Since you are someone that the heavenly emperor favours, then I must save you even if it costs me my life.”","In the shadows, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy hid himself in the void, following behind Lan Caidie with composure. He heard every word that Lan Caidie said.","“A heavenly emperor? This kid actually has a heavenly emperor standing behind him?” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy narrowed his eyes slightly. Heavenly emperor was a supreme title used in the Immortals’ World. Throughout history, heavenly emperors represented existences only second to Grand Exalts. Let alone a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like him, heavenly emperors were great figures that even some Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts could not afford to provoke.","However, even when he found out that a heavenly emperor stood behind Jian Chen, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not give up at all. The caution in his eyes only became slightly heavier.","“You should go quickly. Don’t worry about me. There’s a late Immortal Exalt in the Skyscraping World,” Jian Chen said sternly.","When she heard that, Lan Caidie shuddered. Her elderly face immediately changed drastically. Her gaze blanked out at that moment as well.","However, she soon shook her head subconsciously. “Impossible. That’s completely impossible. The Skyscraping World has already opened numerous times. The items of greatest value that still remain here are the seed of ways and the nine secret techniques that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind. Just these things alone are not enough to attract late Immortal Exalts. Why would people as important as them be bored enough to come here in person? Even if there’s something that they need from here, they would only send a subordinate.”","“You know I possess an item of that level. With the confirmation of the artifact spirit, do you think this is false?” Jian Chen said.","Lan Caidie stiffened slightly. Shortly afterwards, a sense of coldness silently spread through her body. She could deny Jian Chen’s theory. After all, Jian Chen was merely an Immortal Emperor at the end of the day.","However, if he had received the confirmation from the artifact spirit of a sovereign god artifact, then it had to be true.","Taking advantage of this moment, Jian Chen immediately broke free from Lan Caidie’s grip. He glanced at the seed of ways that had greatly diminished in power but still radiated its presence far enough and let out a gentle sigh.","“Don’t worry about me, or you’ll doom yourself.” Leaving that behind, Jian Chen used the Laws of Space and shot off into the distance, immediately vanishing into the thick mist.","The seed of ways in his hand constantly projected a powerful presence into the distance like a lantern in the dark, providing the pursuing Immortal Exalts with accurate directions."]},{"number":3936,"title":"Chapter 3936: Confronting the Seventh Heavenly Layer","paragraphs":["Lan Caidie did not go after Jian Chen. She stood still, staring in the direction that Jian Chen had vanished in. She was uneasy, but she felt grimness over all else.","“ A late Immortal Exalt. An expert like that is already beyond what I can deal with. Even if he possesses a sovereign god artifact and has that formation of terrifying power, he’ll probably be done for sooner or later once an expert like that has turned their attention to him. What do I do now? ” Lan Caidie thought.","She understood the terrors of late Immortal Exalts very well. Before an expert like that, Jian Chen’s Divine Formation of the Heavens would be virtually useless, as it would be completely insufficient to injure such an existence.","As for the god artifact, she was uncertain just how powerful Jian Chen’s god artifact was. However, given that it was already exposed and he did not use it to protect himself even when he faced the pursuit of so many Immortal Exalts, Lan Caidie had already deduced that Jian Chen’s god artifact was either damaged or in a weakened state.","Unless it had a powerful master, a sovereign god artifact in such a state could not stop a late Immortal Exalt either.","“ The only thing I can do right now, as well as the only thing that I can think of, is to contact princess Caijian and see if princess Caijian can contact senior heavenly emperor... ”","“ However, the Skyscraping World is already closed. Even if the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor finds out, so what? He still won’t be able to change anything, as the formations here are too powerful. Just the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor alone won’t be able to breach the formations in a short amount of time. By the time he actually forces his way in, all will be too late... ” Lan Caidie thought. She felt very powerless.","“ Oh right, the ancient sword in princess Caijian’s possession... ” Suddenly, Lan Caidie’s eyes lit up. She recalled the terrifying power she had sensed from the ancient sword the last time she met Xing Caijian in person.","She did not know the origins of the ancient sword, nor could she sense any power from it, but the Remains of the Ghost Immortal that dwelled inside her trembled before the sword.","Thinking up to there, Lan Caidie glanced at the sky subconsciously. There was a hint of urgency in the depths of her eyes. She was unable to reach Xing Caijian right now. There was no way for her to contact Xing Caijian.","“ Senior heavenly emperor, I... have truly already done everything that I can... ”","......","...","Jian Chen rapidly advanced with the Laws of Space. At the same time, he fished out several God Tier pills from his Space Ring and ingested them. His injuries recovered at an abnormally slow pace. As a matter of fact, as he travelled at full speed, his wounds were even at risk of worsening.","At this moment, his presence was already feeble, and his life force was extremely dim. He had only lasted until now through the strength of the Chaotic Body.","Jian Chen suddenly coughed violently. Blood surged up his throat, but he managed to keep it down by force.","His injuries seemed to worsen all of a sudden as his speed drastically reduced. Very soon, the Immortal Exalts behind him would catch up again.","Suddenly, a powerful sense of danger appeared. Jian Chen subconsciously looked over. A figure completely clad in dark mist silently appeared. A withered hand drifted towards Jian Chen gently.","The hand did not seem to possess any power at all on the surface, but when it landed, the laws immediately wove together in the surroundings. Laws at an extremely high level struck Jian Chen mercilessly with destructive might.","The true power behind the attack was not the power of cultivation but the power of laws.","Spurt! Jian Chen sprayed out a bloody mist. The destructive laws seemed to penetrate the defences of Divine Armour of Heavenflight, directly injuring his body.","Before this power, the Chaotic Body that Jian Chen took pride in was fragile. Whether it was his flesh or his organs, it all collapsed in chunks.","The person behind this was the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy from the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls. After observing Jian Chen secretly for all this time, he finally took action in this place that no one was watching.","He did not hold back at all even with the very first attack, directly displaying his prowess as a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He wanted to kill him with a single attack!","“Since I can’t directly erase your soul, then I’ll kill you by destroying your body.” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy who occupied the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body could not help but smile gently. Although losing the Soul Guarding Ancestor would have a significant impact on the overall strength of the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls, the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls’ strength would increase instead if they obtained a sovereign god artifact here.","“ Fortunately, this is the Skyscraping World. If I kill you here, no one will be able to find out who the murderer is, nor will anyone know who the treasure ended up with, so does it matter even if a heavenly emperor is standing behind you? ” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was in a great mood. Although killing Jian Chen took more effort than he had expected, it was still mostly successful.","After claiming the sovereign god artifact, he could return to the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls through the same method with the sovereign god artifact and his soul by killing another two Immortal Exalts as a sacrifice. No one would notice.","Because this was the Skyscraping World, the environment was special. Coupled with intentionally covering his tracks, he was certain that even if a heavenly emperor came here, they would not be able to find anything at all.","But very soon, his smile gradually vanished as his gaze sharpened. They shone with a terrifying light.","Before him, Jian Chen’s injuries miraculously took a turn for the better despite his body collapsing as chunks. At the same time, he recovered at an unbelievable rate. Even the injuries personally dealt by the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not make Jian Chen’s recovery rate falter.","“You’ve finally shown yourself. A Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. I never expected such a terrifying expert to actually be hiding in the Skyscraping World. However, there is something that I don’t understand. The opportunities in the Skyscraping World don’t seem to be enough to attract late Immortal Exalts. Moreover, you’ve hid yourself and your motives for so long, where even when you faced my formation, you still behaved like you stood no chance and was injured as a result despite being able to endure it with ease. Clearly, you’re afraid of being noticed. What exactly are your intentions behind entering the Skyscraping World?” Jian Chen stared straight at the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. He was extremely vigilant.","He had an impression of this person. When he was encircled for the first time and he used the Divine Formation of the Heavens to break free, this person had been blown away by the resulting energy storm.","When he used the Divine Formation of the Heavens a second time on the stone steps that led to the top of the mountain, this person had also been repelled by the energy of the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","He was a peak expert at the Seventh Heavenly Layer, yet he put on such a realistic act before so many people, just to hide his true strength?","What was the point of doing all that? Even if he exposed his strength, what could the others do to stop him?","Jian Chen’s heart tightened. He thought of the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian.","“ Don’t tell me he has come for Xing Caijian? He hid his identity the entire time just to kill the daughter of the heavenly emperor? ” Jian Chen guessed. That was the only explanation he could come up with.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not say anything. He raised a finger at Jian Chen. He did not use his energy. He only used the laws.","As the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy extended his finger, Jian Chen immediately felt the world around him fall silent. His finger influenced the laws in the surrounding region as if space had halted and time had come to a standstill. The finger seemed to become the entirety of the world.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had already used his full strength. He used a secret technique of startling might.","The finger landed on the Divine Armour of Heavenflight gently. The terrifying power directly penetrated the armour, bypassing all of its defences and erupting inside Jian Chen."]},{"number":3937,"title":"Chapter 3937: In Trouble","paragraphs":["At that moment, Jian Chen felt like he had completely lost control of his body. As a matter of fact, he could no longer sense the existence of his body.","WIth his strength as a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, even a regular strike from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy possessed devastating might. Let alone an Immortal Emperor, it was a lethal strike even to some early Immortal Exalts.","On top of that, he was using a secret technique of extremely startling power. It was so terrifying that it destroyed Jian Chen’s Chaotic Body virtually instantly.","But in the next moment, the destruction of Jian Chen’s body stopped. The power of the Source of Life circulated through him silently, nourishing every inch of his flesh. Wherever that regenerative power filled with life force reached, Jian Chen’s injuries were repaired at a rate that could only be described as frightening.","His broken ribs were mended once more, his crushed flesh regenerated, and his veins all regrew.","This was a clash between the laws of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy and the laws of the Source of Life. One destroyed as the other repaired.","The result was very obvious. From this clash, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not have the upper hand. The injuries he dealt to Jian Chen immediately healed.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy narrowed his eyes slightly. There was a hint of disbelief.","That was because the recovery rate that Jian Chen demonstrated right now was several times greater than when he was surrounded by the several dozen Immortal Exalts.","Wasn’t that healing power close to running out?","Why did it seem to grow stronger instead?","“ Don’t tell me this recovery power is actually endless? Impossible, there are no powers that are endless. ” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy made up his mind. Without any hesitation, he struck out again, also attacking with the laws. He used another secret technique of startling power on Jian Chen. The terrifying force pierced the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and destroyed Jian Chen’s body.","Immediately, Jian Chen’s body was heavily injured once again, ravaged by the laws of the Seventh Heavenly Layer. Soon after, the Source of Life repaired it again.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy stared at Jian Chen in interest as if he was trying to see through the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and peer into all of the secrets inside Jian Chen’s body.","“ I see now... ” Suddenly, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy noticed something. His lips curled into a faint smile, hiding tremendous joy that he struggled to keep repressed.","He did not manage to see through Jian Chen completely, but from their proximity, he could vaguely sense the level of the life force that healed Jian Chen.","“ I didn’t expect the sovereign god artifact on you to be a healing treasure! ” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was in a fantastic mood. He truly felt that this was all worth it. If he used a treasure like this, it would bring him unimaginable benefits.","Perhaps it would not increase his battle prowess, but if he were unkillable, there was no need for him to feel fear even if he faced an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He could even forcefully tire them to death.","Let alone the Eighth Heavenly Layer, even if it were the Ninth, what was there to fear?","“ I have to obtain this treasure no matter what. ” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s gaze immediately became extremely determined. The speed of his strikes suddenly became abnormally fierce. The laws of a late Immortal Exalt condensed again and again, striking Jian Chen with devastating power.","In the very beginning, he still held back, afraid of letting the presence of his laws leak out in case it was sensed by the Immortal Exalts who caught up from behind.","His objective was to take the sovereign god artifact silently, without letting anyone sense him.","However, after discovering the power of the Source of Life, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy struggled to keep his original calmness. At this moment, even his heart that could be perturbed by very little things began to thump wildly. He no longer cared about hiding the shockwaves he created when he struck out.","“ As long as I can injure you faster than you can heal yourself, then I’ll be able to truly kill you. ” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s gaze towards Jian Chen gradually began to burn with desire. He was a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. The damage from each of his attacks could not be compared to those early Immortal Exalts. Often, it would require a tremendous amount of life energy to heal. He refused to believe that Jian Chen could last like this forever.","A few seconds later, the Immortal Exalts were about to catch up from behind them. The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy extended a hand. A tremendous power pinned Jian Chen down firmly. Afterwards, he wiped the space gently with one hand. As the laws swept over softly, he erased all of the traces and presences left behind.","“ I can’t make it flawless because I’m in a rush, but it won’t be that easy to discover for those below the Fifth Heavenly Layer, ” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy said steadily before grabbing Jian Chen by the shoulder and vanishing into the distance.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was also restrained by the formations in the Skyscraping World. However, as a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the influence on him was not as great as it was on early and mid Immortal Exalts.","He moved extremely quickly, appearing several thousand kilometres away with just a single step. After a few steps, he moved Jian Chen to a place several tens of thousand kilometres away, shaking off the Immortal Exalts who pursued him from behind.","After stopping, he used the laws to deliver terrifying attacks against Jian Chen again.","At the same time, he began to form seals with his other hand before using a profound secret technique and suddenly pressing it near Jian Chen’s heart.","Boom! Jian Chen’s heart that had only just healed immediately exploded. The dense life force inside seemed to be sucked away. It actually left Jian Chen’s body, passing through the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and gathering at the tip of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s finger.","This was the power of the Source of Life. It was at an extremely high level. When the dense presence of life radiated out, the barren land in the surroundings was quickly covered in a carpet of green. Swatches of plants began to grow furiously, turning into an oasis of green in the blink of an eye.","Looking at the ball of green energy that gathered at the tip of his finger, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy smiled in satisfaction. Immediately, he merged this power with the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body without any hesitation.","The Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body was not in perfect shape. Both the Divine Formation of the Heavens earlier and sacrificing his soul to summon the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had resulted in injuries of varying degrees to his body.","At this moment, when the ball of energy merged with his body, the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body seemed to gain a new lease on life. It rapidly regenerated at a rate that even amazed the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","“Wondrous, how wondrous. This is truly too wondrous.” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could not help but laugh aloud. He looked at the seed of ways in Jian Chen’s hand and said, “With this item around, I won’t be able to hide away properly. I better leave it to the people behind.”","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy directly struck Jian Chen’s shoulder with his palm. The powerful laws obliterated Jian Chen’s entire arm. Afterwards, before the arm could heal, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy swung him around violently. The seed of ways immediately fell out of Jian Chen’s hand.","“Without the seed of ways, I can focus on dealing with you,” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy smiled. He grabbed Jian Chen and immediately vanished.","Before long, the several dozen Immortal Exalts made their way over by following the presence given off by the seed of ways. When they discovered the seed of ways hovering in the air, their faces all changed drastically.","“Oh no, he’s abandoned the seed of ways and fled...”","“Dammit, the situation we were most worried about still happened in the end. Once Yang Yutian gives up on the seed of ways and hides himself, finding him will be far too difficult...”"]},{"number":3938,"title":"Chapter 3938: The Formation of the Skyscraping World","paragraphs":["Gazing at the ownerless seed of ways hovering in front of them, none of these Immortal Exalts felt any joy.","With all the developments so far, no one cared about the seed of ways anymore. Before Jian Chen exposed the sovereign god artifact, the seed of ways was indeed the biggest attraction, a treasure that they would all fight over for.","As a matter of fact, most of them had specially come to the Skyscraping World for the seed of ways.","But now, all these Immortal Exalts could think of was the sovereign god artifact!","“Sigh, we were just about to succeed, but it’s all gone to shambles again. Not only is it difficult to find Yang Yutian now, but even if we do find him, he’ll have sufficient time to unleash his terrifying formation of startling power...”","“It’s all because of the Heavenloss Master, Zuo Dao, and the vice cult leader from the Ghost Immortal cult. If it weren’t for the three of them, Yang Yutian would have never been able to escape...”","“Who knows what happened with the Heavenloss Master. He was clearly so hostile towards Yang Yutian, yet at such a critical moment, he instead decided to help Yang Yutian...”","The several dozen Immortal Exalts gathered there and fumed. After all their efforts, none of them could cheer up from a result like this.","Right now, they no longer had the courage to search for Yang Yutian alone. None of them could survive before that formation. Even someone as powerful as the Profound Spirit Master had died.","However, if they did not split up, who could find him in the Skyscraping World with Yang Yutian’s concealing ability?","At this moment, a resplendent streak of light flashed in the sky. With the light’s appearance, all of the Immortal Exalts raised their heads.","The sky in the Skyscraping World was restricted. There were no experts who could fly at high altitudes, but at this moment, the streak of light appeared at a height that none of them could reach.","The height was definitely within the Skyscraping World’s forbidden zone, which would face the suppression of the formations!","Yet right now, the streak of light moved without obstruction, directly crossing through the forbidden zone and plummeting down from above.","“It’s Xing Caijian of the Heavenly Star Palace!” An Immortal Exalt recognised the graceful figure within the streak of light and cried out.","In the next moment, many Immortal Exalts focused on Xing Caijian who flew down from above. They had mixed emotions.","They could all tell that Xing Caijian was in possession of some kind of secret of the Skyscraping World, allowing her access to a central zone that no one else could set foot in.","A while later, Xing Caijian landed on the ground. She carried the ancient sword in her hand. The glow she gave off subsided as she directly appeared before the seed of ways.","The seed of ways did not flee. Perhaps it had run out of power, or perhaps it did not reject Xing Caijian.","“Where is Yang Yutian? Have you seen him, seniors?” Xing Caijian’s gaze paused on the seed of ways for a moment before glancing at the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings. Her tone was not rude, but it was not particularly respectful either.","“Princess Caijian, the reason why you showed such special attention to Yang Yutian earlier was probably because you sensed the sovereign god artifact on him, right? Are you also interested in the sovereign god artifact, princess Xing Caijian?” a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt asked sternly.","When she heard that, Xing Caijian’s expression changed slightly. She had already realised that Jian Chen’s sovereign god artifact had been exposed.","At this moment, a hunch-backed figure appeared before Xing Caijian. She was Lan Caidie, the vice cult leader of the Ghost Immortal cult.","Because she had used the Remains of the Ghost Immortal recently, Lan Caidie seemed extremely feeble. Her face was sheet-white as she swayed around as she stood there. She seemed like she could fall over at any moment. �","“Greetings, your highness. You’ve finally come out, your highness.” Lan Caidie clasped her fist towards Xing Caijian and bowed. Her feeble voice was filled with excitement. She seemed to find her saviour with Xing Caijian’s appearance. She was filled with hope.","“Vice leader of the Ghost Immortal cult, you actually still have the courage to show yourself here? You’ve opposed so many of us again and again. Aren’t you afraid of bringing devastation to your Ghost Immortal cult?” Lan Caidie’s appearance infuriated many Immortal Exalts.","In order to save Jian Chen, it could be said that Lan Caidie had virtually offended everyone here.","“What happened?” Xing Caijian furrowed her brows and stared at Lan Caidie.","“Your highness, fellow Yang Yutian is in danger. A late Immortal Exalt has gone after him,” Lan Caidie said immediately. She was not concerned about Jian Chen originally. However, she had later learned that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor cared very much about Jian Chen from Xing Caijian. The Ghost Immortal cult was indebted to the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, so Lan Caidie obviously did not hope for anything to happen to Jian Chen.","“What did you say? There’s a late Immortal Exalt in the Skyscraping World?” Xing Caijian’s expression changed when she heard that. Her first reaction was disbelief, as it was virtually impossible for experts like that to venture into the Skyscraping World personally. There were no treasures in the Skyscraping World that could interest them.","“Lan Caidie, you are still one of the vice cult leaders of the Ghost Immortal cult. You possess quite the status, so why are you speaking without thinking now? A late Immortal Exalt has appeared in the Skyscraping World? Hahahaha, who would believe you?”","“A late Immortal Exalt? Why would such a lofty figure be bored enough to visit here?”","“Yeah, didn’t you notice that even the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster didn’t come in? That’s because the Skyscraping World has no opportunities that can interest them. Even the owners of the medicinal gardens will just send in their disciples. They won’t waste their own time...”","Not only did Lan Caidie’s claim raise Xing Caijian’s doubts, but none of the Immortal Exalts present believed her either. Even in some peak organisations, a late Immortal Exalt was a paramount figure who held up the entire organisation. They would rarely ever appear in public.","“Vice cult leader Lan, how can you prove what you said is true?” Xing Caijian stared at Lan Caidie in interest.","“I can’t, as I haven’t seen an expert like that either. However, Yang Yutian told me that it has been confirmed by the artifact spirit,” Lan Caidie said with difficulty.","Towards the back, Zuo Dao and the Heavenloss Master appeared. Their presences were rather chaotic, and they seemed quite ruffled up.","They also heard what Lan Caidie said. Their eyes were filled with shock. They also found it to be difficult to believe.","“A late Immortal Exalt? Why would someone like that conceal their identity to enter the Skyscraping World?” the Heavenloss Master muttered to himself. The three hundred-odd figures who entered the Skyscraping World appeared in his head as he analysed each face closely.","On the other side, Xing Caijian became extremely stern. Suddenly, she placed the ancient sword on her back before bringing her hands together, unleashing a secret technique.","In the next moment, a unique presence radiated from her body, merging with space and filling the surroundings.","Shortly afterwards, the Skyscraping World immediately darkened as if the sun had set and the curtain of night had descended. Many shining stars appeared in the sky in this dark space. Cluster after cluster appeared as if the sky was filled with stars. They were countless.","At that moment, the sky of the Skyscraping World seemed to become a tremendous cosmos, radiating with a chilling pressure.","“This is... one of the Skyscraping World’s peak formations?”","“Don’t tell me it’s the Heavenly Star Palace’s renowned paramount formation, A Galaxy a World? It’s said that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had personally participated in erecting the protective formations of the Skyscraping World.”","“It might not necessarily be A Galaxy a World, but it’s definitely a peak organisation of the same level from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.”","Looking at the sky that had already changed in colour, the expressions of many of the Immortal Exalts present changed drastically.","They could already tell that this was one of the peak formations of the Skyscraping World, but they never imagined that Xing Caijian could actually use this formation with her strength as an Immortal Emperor."]},{"number":3939,"title":"Chapter 3939: The White Jade Lamp","paragraphs":["Xing Caijian had already shut her eyes. A unique presence radiated from her body, seemingly merging with this stellar formation.","At that moment, Xing Caijian still only possessed the strength of an Immortal Emperor, but none of the Immortal Exalts present dared to underestimate her.","A figure who could control a peak formation of the Skyscraping World, even if her cultivation was not particularly high, was enough to become unprovoked in everyone’s eyes.","Of course, these Immortal Exalts still did not know about the power of the ancient sword in Xing Caijian’s possession. They did not know that the ancient sword was actually Xing Caijian’s strongest weapon, as well as the primary reason why the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was not worried about Xing Caijian entering the Skyscraping World alone.","At this moment, Xing Caijian merged with the formation of the Skyscraping World, allowing her to temporarily break free from all restraints from the Skyscraping World. She freely expanded the senses of her soul as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, covering the entire Skyscraping World in virtually an instant.","At that moment, nothing in the Skyscraping World remained hidden from Xing Caijian. As a matter of fact, because she had merged with the formation, she could use its profound capabilities to a certain degree, allowing her to see some secrets that she definitely would have missed with her original strength.","“I’ve found you. As long as you’re in the Skyscraping World, I’d like to see where you can hide!” Suddenly, Xing Caijian called out gently. Her gaze became extremely frosty. She trapped the seed of ways in her hand and sped off into the distance.","After Xing Caijian left, the formation faded away as well. The sky in the Skyscraping World returned to normal, shrouded by the thick mist.","“C’mon, let’s go and take a look. Anyways, I refuse to believe a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert has entered here...”","“If there really was someone at the Seventh Heavenly Layer, then there’s no point for us to fight against one another, as we have no chance at all. They would be on a completely different level to us.”","“Princess Xing Caijian of the Heavenly Star Palace should be able to handle an expert like that, right? After all, she can control the formations here. Even though it’s just one of them, the power would still be unimaginable...”","“That would be difficult. Didn’t you notice that Xing Caijian did not use the power of the formation to attack? In my opinion, Xing Caijian can only borrow the formations to obtain some miscellaneous abilities such as searching. As for completely controlling the formation here, her strength probably still isn’t enough...”","“That would be difficult to say. After all, she is the one and only daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor...”","......","...","The several dozen Immortal Exalts gathered there all followed Xing Caijian’s presence and hurried over.","Elsewhere near the mountain peak in the Skyscraping World, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy used his laws as a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt to completely overwhelm Jian Chen. The terrifying power that could only be described as devastating constantly destroyed Jian Chen’s body in an attempt to waste away the Source of Life’s recovery power.","“The formation that appeared just now was personally set up by the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. In the Skyscraping World, the only person that can control this formation is the daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, Xing Caijian!” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy glanced over and furrowed his brows slightly.","When the formation appeared, he felt like he was being watched. Even when he had already intentionally hidden his tracks and presence, he still felt exposed.","“Have I been discovered?” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy murmured. He casually glanced at the surroundings. There was a hint of powerlessness on his face.","Outside, if he intentionally hid himself, even some Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would not necessarily be able to find him.","But in the Skyscraping World, in this unique environment, his hands were tied.","In the next moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy suddenly vanished. He sped off into the distance with Jian Chen, moving rapidly as he tidied through the memory fragments left behind by the Soul Guarding Ancestor. Gradually, a clear map of the Skyscraping World appeared in the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s head.","With a clear route, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was in his element now. He directly appeared on the steps that led to the lower regions of the Skyscraping World, making his way to the side and foot of the mountain with Jian Chen.","The side and foot of the mountain were connected, and it was very spacious. Who knew how many times larger it was compared to the mountain peak. Once he made it there, finding someone would truly be no different from finding a needle in a haystack.","Soon after the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had left, figures gathered near where he had stopped previously. Xing Caijian and numerous Immortal Exalts appeared there.","However, as she gazed at the empty region, Xing Caijian furrowed her brows firmly.","As for the several dozen Immortal Exalts who followed her here, they used various abilities, merging their souls with the space there to study the surroundings, but they found nothing.","When the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy left, he had already erased all of his traces and presences. With his strength at the Seventh Heavenly Layer, perhaps he could not fool experts of the same level with how rushed he was, but it was more than enough to deal with these early Immortal Exalts.","Very soon, the colour of the sky in the Skyscraping World changed once again. The tremendous sea of stars descended once more, covering every inch of the Skyscraping World.","Xing Caijian activated the tremendous formation that her father had personally set up in the past a second time.","The cultivators in different parts of the Skyscraping World were all shocked. They raised their heads and looked at the tremendous sea of stars in the sky.","On the side of the mountain, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy stopped subconsciously. His expression changed. He was uneasy.","When the formation appeared, the feeling of being watched filled him once again, but there was nothing he could do about it.","Entering the Skyscraping World was equivalent to entering the range of these various peak formations. He could not hide even if he wanted to.","Xing Caijian sensed the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s location again from the top of the mountain. Clutching her ancient sword, she rushed down the mountain while keeping the seed of ways trapped in her possession.","However, when Xing Caijian appeared on the side of the mountain, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was already gone. He had already made his way to a further place, heading to the bottom of the mountain.","“ Jian Chen, my power is being drained faster and faster. This can’t continue. You have to get yourself out of this situation as soon as possible, ” the Source of Life said in Jian Chen’s head. There were some hints of seriousness.","It had wasted far, far too much power against the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. It was not in its peak condition in the first place, so the power it wasted pained the Source of Life deeply.","Facing the laws of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was even more difficult than facing several dozen early Immortal Exalts at the same time.","After all, some differences in quality could not be made up by quantity.","“ Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, how much longer does the Divine Formation of the Heavens still need? ” Jian Chen sent a wisp of the senses of his soul into the Primeval Divine Hall.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt sat above the several tens of thousand disciples in an independent space within the Primeval Divine Hall. Glancing down, he said sternly, “Sect master, all of the disciples are already doing all that they can to recover their energy, but despite that, we’ll still need three days at the very least.”","“Master, the Divine Formation of the Heavens at its current level might not be able to threaten this Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. From the strength of his laws, he’s no longer a regular Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He is extremely close to the Eighth Heavenly Layer,” said the artifact spirit of the Primeval Divine Hall.","When he heard that, Jian Chen’s heart sank slightly. His greatest trump cards were the Profound Sword Qi, the Divine Formation of the Heavens, and fusing the twin swords. Against a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert, his Divine Formation of the Heavens had already lost its deterrent influence. The Profound Sword Qi obviously went without saying as well. It was still of some use against early Immortal Exalts, but it would be no different than an itch to late Immortal Exalts.","He directly eliminated fusing the twin swords as well. Why would the enemy just stand there foolishly and wait to be cut down by him?","“Against an expert of the Seventh Heavenly Layer, the countermeasures I currently possess really are a little insufficient, but it’s not like I don’t have anything at all.” Suddenly, determination appeared in Jian Chen’s eyes. In the next moment, a white jade lamp silently appeared.","The oil lamp was one of his spoils from destroying the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. It was a great weapon that could threaten Immortal Exalts of the Seventh heavenly Layer, but the exact way to use it had always been in the possession of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. Even after all these years of study, Jian Chen had not found the complete way to use it.","He did not have the complete method of use, but he had already deduced an incomplete method. The greatest difference between the two was one was controllable, while the other was uncontrollable.","Jian Chen was aware that detonating the white jade lamp before a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert was extremely difficult. If he mishandled it, he might even be overwhelmed before he could even find the time to set it off.","As a result, Jian Chen had already made his preparations before he took out the oil lamp. As soon as the lamp appeared, Jian Chen set it off as quickly as possible.","Immediately, the various inscriptions on the white jade lamp fell into disorder. The balance inside the lamp was immediately disturbed. A violent power erupted with a startling rumble. Jian Chen and the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy were immediately swallowed by it.","Jian Chen had detonated the lamp in an almost suicidal manner!"]},{"number":3940,"title":"Chapter 3940: Breaking Free","paragraphs":["Originally, Jian Chen wanted to save the white jade lamp for the Mistress of Contrary Winds from the Wind clan, but he could only use it prematurely. After all, he was left with no other choice.","However, the power of the white jade lamp had exceeded his imaginations. When the devastating storm of energy swallowed this space, it led to a violent reaction from the formations of the Skyscraping World.","Profound formations appeared both in the sky and underground, weaving through every inch of space. As it stabilised the space, it also suppressed the terrifying power that the white jade lamp erupted with.","If it were not for the suppression, the devastating storm of energy from the white jade lamp could easily swallow the entire Skyscraping World.","If this happened outside, it would have reduced a galaxy to eternal darkness.","This was the terrifying power of a late Immortal Exalt after all.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was caught slightly off-guard. The white jade lamp erupted between him and Jian Chen, so he could only let go of Jian Chen and rapidly retreat in the surging storm of energy. Laws weaved through the air, forming barrier after barrier in front of him.","Before the power of the white jade lamp, the only thing he could use was his comprehension of the laws. As for his cultivation, the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s cultivation as a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was completely useless before a storm of energy that was as powerful as late Immortal Exalts.","But despite that, the barrier of laws that the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy set up in front of him shattered one after another. Some of the fragmented energy reached his body, leaving behind terrifying wounds. Some of his flesh even directly vanished.","With comprehension at the peak of the Seventh Heavenly Layer and a body and cultivation at the Second Heavenly Layer, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could not use his peak strength at all.","The incompatibility between cultivation and comprehension would even become a restraint at times.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy retreated quickly in the devastating storm. Jian Chen, who received the same attack, was not well off either. He was launched flying like a cannonball, slamming into the rock behind him heavily. Not only did the great force shatter his bones, but even his soul swayed violently and uncontrollably.","Before the tremendous might of the white jade lamp, the Divine Armour of Heavenflight was undamaged, but Jian Chen still faced devastating injuries. If it were not for the Source of Life’s recovery, Jian Chen probably would not even have a corpse left with his current cultivation.","Jian Chen constantly coughed up blood. His head was so dizzy that he almost directly fainted.","However, he knew he definitely could not faint right now. Once he fainted, the ray of hope he had created by exhausting a treasure like the white jade lamp would all go to waste. He gritted his teeth and suddenly pushed off the rock face behind him with his arms. He forcefully changed his posture, turning his back on the empty mountain path.","In the next moment, he shot off like an arrow, having been blown far away by the incoming storm of energy. He flew for several hundred metres before he slammed into another rock heavily. He coughed up blood constantly. He was sheet-white.","Under the protection of the formations of the Skyscraping World, the rock was undamaged, but Jian Chen paid a hefty price. His organs ruptured once again, but they were repaired again by the Source of Life in the blink of an eye.","The power of the white jade lamp was far too great. Even though it could not destroy the Skyscraping World, it still affected the space within a range of ten thousand kilometres, making the space distort violently.","The space here was not as feeble as the outside world’s. Instead, it had been reinforced by peak formations. It could easily withstand battles between a group of Immortal Exalts. It was truly impervious.","At this moment, visibility within ten thousand kilometres became extremely clear. All of the mist dispersed.","Suddenly, a terrifying presence erupted towards Jian Chen like a volcano that had remained dormant for far too long.","Jian Chen narrowed his eyes slightly. Several hundred kilometres away, the storm created by the white jade lamp was forcefully parted into two by a terrifying power. A bloodied figure strode out with firm steps.","It was the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. At this moment, his face was extremely ugly. Many horrific injuries had appeared on his body, with many of them penetrating straight through his body, reaching from his chest to his back. Even his right hand had gone missing.","He did not move quickly. He covered several dozen kilometres with each step, enduring great pressure as he forced his way through the storm created by the white jade lamp, approaching Jian Chen.","Jian Chen shivered inside. He knew his opponent was a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. If it were not for the obstruction from the white jade lamp, he only needed an instant to arrive before him.","Without any hesitation, he immediately unleashed the Laws of Space with his full strength, fleeing as quickly as possible. At the same time, he used the secret technique from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable to explore ahead, just in case he ended up at a dead end.","At the same time, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had already crossed through the centre of the storm. His speed immediately increased, directly appearing behind Jian Chen in a single step. He extended his hand. A great power that could seize the space there reached towards Jian Chen.","However, with his body greatly injured, the strength that the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could use was severely affected. His movements seemed rather stiff.","However, he ended up missing in the end. Jian Chen happened to use the Laws of Space at that instant, appearing several thousand kilometres away like he had teleported.","He did not dare to pause. He used the Laws of Space again and again, moving far away in just a few flashes and entering the thick mist again.","Once he entered the mist, visibility would be severely affected. Even the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could not avoid that.","However, Jian Chen still did not shake off the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. A tremendous pressure descended as a hand condensed from the laws ripped through the mist, hurtling directly towards Jian Chen.","Jian Chen shivered inside. He used the concealment ability of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, silently vanishing from there.","Boom! The hand condensed from laws heavily slammed into the place where Jian Chen vanished from. It produced a great rumble and terrifying storms of energy swept out into the surroundings, compressing the space.","Three hundred kilometres away, Jian Chen was affected despite hiding away. He immediately fell out of the space there. He coughed violently. The Laws of Space wrapped around his body as he immediately moved a hundred kilometres away before using the Divine Armour of Heavenflight to vanish again.","Behind him, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy let out a growl. His gaze was extremely frightening. Through the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s memories, he understood just how powerful Jian Chen’s ability to hide was. Once he had hidden himself away completely, finding him again would truly be difficult.","When he first learnt about this from the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s memories, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not think too much about it, as he did not believe an Immortal Emperor could hide away so flawlessly before him.","Only now was he forced to accept this terrifying truth, as he had completely lost his grasp over Jian Chen.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy immediately appeared where Jian Chen had vanished. He completely stopped trying to hold back. The laws manifested in the space there, directly disturbing the order in the space and forcefully interfering with it.","In the outside world, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could easily influence half a heaven with such an attack, but in the Skyscraping World, everything was suppressed by the formations. In the end, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy only managed to interfere with the space a thousand kilometres from him.","A few hundred kilometres away, Jian Chen was forced out again, but he continued to move at high speeds. He moved extremely quickly, leaving the region under the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s influence in the blink of an eye before hiding himself with the Divine Armour of Heavenflight again.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy pursued closely.","Very soon, Jian Chen arrived at a fork in the road. Before him were seven different paths. Each path led off in a different direction.","Jian Chen seemed to be prepared. With a flick of his finger, he sent an extremely weak wisp of his presence down the path furthest away from him before immediately diving down a different path and vanishing.","In the next moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy appeared. He directly raced down the path that Jian Chen had sent his presence down. Along the way, Jian Chen would always expose his presence from time to time in an extremely weak manner, which made the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy subconsciously believe that Jian Chen was unable to completely conceal his presence as he fled urgently when he was forced out by his powers.","However, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy noticed something amiss very quickly. There was absolutely no trace of Jian Chen within ten thousand kilometres.","He immediately retraced his steps and went down the second mountain path.","He travelled down the second path for several thousand kilometres, but there was still nothing, which made the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy realise this was also the wrong path.","Returning to the original location, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy stared at the seven paths before him as his face darkened."]},{"number":3941,"title":"Chapter 3941: Hunting Down Clear and Cloudy","paragraphs":["The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not continue his pursuit, as he had already witnessed Jian Chen’s ability to hide. The only way to capture him was to maintain a firm grasp over him before his traces had vanished completely.","Otherwise, once he was gone, finding him again was as difficult as finding a needle in a haystack.","After choosing the wrong path twice in a row, that was enough time for him to escape very far away.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy fumed inside. He was a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. His abilities were extraordinary, but unfortunately, he was in the special environment of the Skyscraping World. Under the restrictions of the formations and the environment, many of his abilities were affected. Otherwise, an Immortal Emperor would have never been able to slip away right under his watch.","At this moment, the sky in the Skyscraping World changed again. Starlight glimmered, forming an impressive star chart. The tremendous pressure of a peak formation permeated every inch of space in the Skyscraping World.","Whenever the starry sky changed, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy felt like he was being watched. Even with his cultivation and comprehension, he was powerless over this feeling.","The Skyscraping World was a miniature world, but it could also be treated as a formation that possessed all sorts of functions. Upon entering the Skyscraping World, it was equivalent to entering a series of peak formations. There was obviously nowhere for him to hide.","At this moment, a huge sense of danger suddenly overwhelmed him, which made the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy narrow his eyes. Bone-chilling coldness filled his entire heart.","He had already forgotten just how many years it had been since he last felt this, as there were only so many people in the Immortals’ World who could give him this feeling.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy suddenly looked behind him. The space there cracked open and powerful sword intent surged out, filling the entire space like the ruler of the world had descended.","Gazing at the crack, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy shivered inside. Even he did not have the ability to tear open the space of the Skyscraping World.","In the next moment, an ancient sword shot out from the crack. Its glow seemed to possess the endless stars, directly slashing down at the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy with terrifying power.","“T-this is the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star!” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could not help but cry out. He immediately became grim. He did not have the courage to receive the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s attack at all. With a thought, the laws in the surroundings wove together, forming huge hands that slammed against the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. Meanwhile, he rapidly retreated, dodging the attack from the sword.","Immediately, energy surged through the surroundings. The laws of a late Immortal Exalt illuminated the space with blinding light.","But in the next moment, as the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star slashed down, the hands condensed from the laws all shattered, having been crushed by an immense power inside the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy dodged the attack, but a streak of light brushed past him. Extending down from his left ear, his entire body seemed to be sliced apart. His entire left arm, the left side of his chest, the left side of his abdomen, and half of his left leg vanished. It had all been pulverised by the power of the sovereign god artifact.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s heart turned completely cold. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star from the Heavenly Star Palace was not damaged. It was a sovereign god artifact in perfect shape. Furthermore, he even sensed a power from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor inside the sovereign god artifact. Even a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like him was forced to avoid a sovereign god artifact like this.","“ Fortunately, it’s just a sovereign god artifact without someone controlling it. If it were in the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s hands, then I’d truly be going nowhere. ” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was relieved inside. Before the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star could launch a second attack, he vanished into the space there, having used a secret technique to escape.","Right after the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had left, Xing Caijian appeared. Several dozen Immortal Exalts tailed behind her.","“W-what is this god artifact... How is it so terrifying...”","“A sovereign god artifact, it’s definitely a sovereign god artifact. Don’t tell me it’s the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star from the Heavenly Star Palace...” ŕΆ₦Ȯ฿Ęs̈","......","...","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star hovered mid-air, allowing all of the Immortal Exalts to see it. The immense pressure it radiated shocked everyone present.","At that moment, all of the Immortal Exalts looked at Xing Caijian with deep fear and reverence.","Before this, they were only wary of her identity and background. If those were set aside, they would not take her seriously at all. A Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor was nothing in many of their eyes.","Only at this moment, after learning about the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s existence, did they truly begin to fear and revere Xing Caijian.","At this moment, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star withdrew its pressure. All of its glow faded away before returning to Xing Caijian. Xing Caijian closed her eyes gently as if she was communicating with the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","“ Go, you can’t let this person escape! ” Suddenly, Xing Caijian opened her eyes and used the secret technique to control the stellar formation again. With the assistance of the formation that covered every inch of space inside the Skyscraping World, she located the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy with ease. Immediately, she raced off in pursuit with the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms.","At the same time, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s heart sank, having just stopped recently. He never expected Xing Caijian to be so persistent, chasing after him relentlessly. She had already done this several times now.","However, when he thought of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not have the courage to confront her. The power of a complete sovereign god artifact could not be compared to a damaged sovereign god artifact.","In particular, the sovereign god artifact even contained the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power, which made it even more unstoppable.","With a flash, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy sped off, travelling far away from here.","A while later, Xing Caijian appeared where the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had previously stopped. Her face was ugly.","“ Senior heavenly star, please help me kill this person! ” Suddenly, Xing Caijian bowed deeply towards the Divine Sword of Heavenly Star and pleaded with it.","“ My responsibility is to ensure your safety, ” the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star communicated. Only Xing Caijian could hear it.","“ If this expert survives, he... will be very dangerous... There are some secrets that still cannot be divulged... ” Xing Caijian said to the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. She was stern. She did not know whether the expert had discovered the existence of the twin swords, but that was not something she could gamble on. As such, this expert had to die!","Swish!","In the next moment, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star turned into a streak of light and pierced the space, vanishing instantly.","Xing Caijian’s strength was completely insufficient to control a sovereign god artifact, so the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star was entirely under the artifact spirit’s control.","Elsewhere, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had eased up slightly when he sensed something. His expression immediately changed drastically, fleeing once again without any hesitation.","Shortly afterwards, the space cracked open, and the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star flew out. The power of the stars manifested around it, chasing after the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy relentlessly with terrifying and chilling power.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy fled urgently, but he was extremely frustrated. Against a sovereign god artifact without someone controlling it, even if he was not its opponent, he would not be as powerless as right now.","Unfortunately, the Skyscraping World restrained him. He had only projected his soul over, without his body. He could not unleash his full strength. He could not use the powerful secret techniques that required some of his cultivation.","On the other hand, as a sovereign god artifact, the quality of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had already surpassed the formations of the Skyscraping World. The formations of the Skyscraping World were completely unable to restrain it.","Under these influences, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy virtually could not oppose the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star at all.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy fled urgently up ahead. Restrained by the environment, he could not get faster. Meanwhile, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star tore through space and pursued relentlessly behind him.","The distance between them rapidly reduced at an irreversible pace.","It had only taken five seconds for the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star to catch up to the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","Seeing how he could not escape, determination filled the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s eyes. He bellowed out, “Ancient secret technique, Soul and Heaven as One!”","In the next moment, a mighty power of the soul surged violently. The space where the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy resided immediately plunged into darkness.","Swish! The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star shot through the darkness with great might, seemingly cutting the space in half. The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy who resided there turned and scattered as dust, left without any remains."]},{"number":3942,"title":"Chapter 3942: Slipping Away with a Decoy","paragraphs":["The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was reduced to ashes, but this region enveloped by darkness did not return to normal. However, as the sword Qi from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star swept by, much of the pitch-black darkness was purged.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star did not leave. Instead, it turned around. It shone with dazzling starlight as if it possessed the tremendous power of countless stars. It shot through the darkness once again.","This time, the might that the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star erupted with seemed to be even greater than when it killed the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. Wherever it passed by, space collapsed in chunks. Even the laws seemed to be severed.","In a split second, the space that had darkened under the influence of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s secret technique shattered from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s slash. All objects and energies that it contained were obliterated before the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star did not idle around for any longer afterwards. It shot off immediately, returning to Xing Caijian’s hand.","By then, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had already shed all of its light and pressure. It seemed like a regular sword.","Xing Caijian used the coarse cloth to bundle up the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star again before holding it in her arms like before. She said without much concern, “The Seventh Heavenly Layer expert has already been killed. Seniors, you don’t have to follow me around anymore.”","Behind her, the group of Immortal Exalts all gazed at the sovereign god artifact in her arms. All of them shivered inside.","“Princess Caijian, has that Seventh Heavenly Layer expert r-r-really died?” A Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt gulped and mustered the courage to ask.","Even at this moment, some of them were still doubtful, refusing to believe that a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt had actually appeared in the Skyscraping World.","That was because to a group of early Immortal Exalts, the Seventh Heavenly Layer was far too distant. Regardless of where they were, figures like that were experts that controlled the fate of an entire organisation.","A supreme figure like that had just perished without them even catching a glance of him?","It felt so surreal to all of them.","Xing Caijian did not pay any attention to them. Holding the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms, she left without looking back while clutching the seed of ways in her hand. She vanished from view.","No one followed her. Even when Xing Caijian had taken the seed of ways with her, no one dared to say a word. The unparalleled might that the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had demonstrated deeply deterred every single one of them.","As a matter of fact, they could not help but recall the various gestures of care that Xing Caijian had shown towards Yang Yutian when they entered the Skyscraping World.","In the beginning, many of them were in contempt of her actions. They did not believe that Xing Caijian had the power to complete what she had promised. Now that everyone had learned about the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, who could get past her if she wielded the sovereign god artifact and protected Yang Yutian?","......","...","At this moment, an Immortal Monarch sat beneath a stone tablet with a marking of the Way of the Sword near the foot of the mountain. He seemed to be comprehending the mysteries there.","At this moment, he opened his eyes slowly, revealing a pair of deep eyes seemingly as vast as the sky. Anyone meeting those eyes would feel as if their souls were being sucked inside.","“The power of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star is terrifying as expected. It truly is a complete sovereign god artifact after all. Probably even if I were in my peak condition, the only thing I’d be able to do is flee given its invincible might that can destroy everything...”","“But fortunately, my Divine Sect of Ancient Souls also possesses an impressive legacy. If it had been anyone else, they would have perished already if they were in that predicament just now...” the Immortal Monarch said softly.","Shortly afterwards, he raised his head and glanced at the surroundings. There was a smear of weariness in the depths of his eyes.","“The daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor can use the formations here to search the Skyscraping World. Out of all the people who entered the Skyscraping World, there should be no one who can hide themselves perfectly from formations of this level. However, I’ve already changed my identity. As long as I don’t expose myself with this identity, she’ll just treat me as an Immortal Monarch even if she controls the formations to search the Skyscraping World again...”","The Immortal Monarch stood up. He did not use the laws, travelling purely by using his cultivation. He left there at a steady pace.","That was the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy from the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had destroyed his body, but at that critical moment, he had used an ultimate secret technique to escape with his soul. He possessed an Immortal Monarch, leaving his original body as a decoy to hide away.","“A recovery sovereign god artifact is far too useful. It’s enough for me to make a small sacrifice to obtain it. I don’t stand a chance against the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, but it’s an offensive artifact at the end of the day. Battle is its forte. I just have to avoid it now...”","At that same time, on the side of the mountain, Jian Chen wore the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race, constantly remaining hidden. He sat against a tree on the ground. His heart weighed heavily.","Although he had managed to escape from that unknown expert, he had also lost the trump card of the white jade lamp. He had even lost the seed of ways.","Going after the seed of ways this time had truly cost him more than he had benefitted.","At the same time, the Source of Life grumbled to him. During this period of time, he had endured the combined attacks of several dozen Immortal Exalts before experiencing devastating attacks from a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert over a long period of time. These events had led to a significant depletion of the Source of Life’s power.","He could find ways to replenish the Source of Life’s exhausted power. With the seed of ways that he lost, he was confident about stealing it back as well.","Most importantly, a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert was watching him from the shadows, which prevented Jian Chen from exposing himself at all.","This was the Skyscraping World. Space was severely limited. If the Seventh Heavenly Layer expert caught him again, he felt no confidence about escaping again.","“ I better wait it out and take it slowly once the Divine Formation of the Heavens is available again. ” Jian Chen could only make that decision helplessly.","But right when he thought up to there, his eyes suddenly narrowed. He stared straight at the end of the mountain path.","At this moment, powerful sword intent appeared in the distance. Jian Chen was all too familiar with the sword intent. It was the power released by the seed of ways.","A few seconds later, a familiar figure appeared in the thick mist.","It was Xing Caijian.","Xing Caijian carried the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms, clutching the seed of ways in her left hand. She stopped in Jian Chen’s vicinity and looked around. “Come out. I know you’re around here.”","Jian Chen stowed the Divine Armour of Heavenflight away and revealed himself. By now, his injuries had already recovered, and he had changed into a new set of blue robes. It was impossible to think that he had been heavily injured just recently.","“Looks like the Divine Armour of Heavenflight’s concealment ability is as good as nothing in your eyes.” Jian Chen sighed gently.","“As long as you haven’t died. So much for me worrying.” Seeing Jian Chen appear there unscathed, Xing Caijian let out a visible sigh of relief. She did not care about Jian Chen personally, but she cared very much about who Jian Chen was.","“Here is the seed of ways. Refine it here. I’ll watch over you personally.” Xing Caijian tossed the seed of ways over to Jian Chen without any reluctance at all.","Seeing the seed of ways appear before him once again, Jian Chen was taken aback. He had regained this item, but he was unable to cheer up no matter what. Instead, mixed feelings welled up inside him.","The feeling from earning his own opportunities compared to opportunities given to him by others was completely different.","In order to earn this item, he had paid a hefty price as well. He had even exposed a sovereign god artifact.","Yet in the end, Xing Caijian was just going to give the seed of ways to him like this, without any conditions at all?","“The Seventh Heavenly Layer expert who came after you earlier has already been killed by senior Heavenly Star, so you can set aside all of your worries. Hurry up and refine the seed of ways.” Xing Caijian urged him."]},{"number":3943,"title":"Chapter 3943: Jian Chen’s Guess","paragraphs":["When he heard Xing Caijian mention the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, Jian Chen could not help but think of the mysterious expert who had almost left him powerless, requiring him to use the white jade lamp in the very end to earn a chance at escaping.","“Has he really died? Even across the entire Immortals’ World, there aren’t a lot of Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. Each one counts. Losing one is a loss to the entire Immortals’ World.” Jian Chen sighed. He thought of the three sovereign god artifacts in his possession. The three sovereign god artifacts were all on the same level as the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","Yet when he faced the Seventh Heavenly Layer expert, there was virtually nothing he could use apart from holding on using the Source of Life’s recovery powers. He was not even able to touch a hair on the enemy.","Yet in the end, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had actually slain an expert like that effortlessly.","That left Jian Chen speechless.","They were all sovereign god artifacts, but the difference was far too great.","“ Looks like I need to try everything I can to get the twin swords to recover as quickly as I can, ” Jian Chen thought. Each of the three sovereign god artifacts he possessed bore a unique function. The Primeval Divine Hall’s advantage was spatial. Of course, its greatest source of assistance to Jian Chen right now was the slumbering generals inside.","The Source of Life’s purpose was for healing. It was an auxiliary sovereign god artifact, granting Jian Chen an undying body.","Only the twin swords were focused on offence, which allowed them to openly rival the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","The twin swords had eaten a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing of extremely high quality, and their strength had already recovered substantially. However, it was still nowhere near enough in Jian Chen’s opinion.","Xing Caijian’s expression became slightly mixed as well. “You’re right. Each expert that has reached the Seventh Heavenly Layer is precious to the entire Immortals’ World. If a war between worlds erupts in the future, experts like that possess pivotal influence. Unless there are blood feuds, even if they fight amongst themselves, there won’t be any fatalities.”","Reaching there, Xing Caijian glanced at Jian Chen and said, “However, your identity is special. Since this expert knows about your secrets, he must die. If it’s the other sovereign god artifact, then so be it, but they... can’t be exposed just yet.”","Jian Chen understood what Xing Caijian was referring to by “they”. She was referring to the twin swords.","The twin swords were not regular sovereign god artifacts.","Regular sovereign god artifacts were powerful, but they struggled to pose any lethal threat to Grand Exalts.","The twin swords were different. The power from fusing the swords was far too great. That was truly something terrifying that could threaten Grand Exalts.","He had been trapped by that Seventh Heavenly Layer expert for who knew how long earlier. Who knew how many times his body had been destroyed. In reality, even Jian Chen was not sure if the Seventh Heavenly Layer expert had noticed the existence of the twin swords or not.","“Oh right, I feel like something was off about that Seventh Heavenly Layer expert,” Jian Chen suddenly said.","“What was off?” Xing Caijian was curious.","“After recalling closely, I noticed that the Seventh Heavenly Layer expert only ever used the laws against me. He never used his cultivation.”","“I have an impression of this person previously as well, as he also came after me in the past. Back then, he was only a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Both his cultivation and comprehension was very ordinary. Most importantly, he had even answered the Heavenloss Master’s call and spent many years searching through the Skyscraping World for me.”","“If he really were a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert, why would he handle these matters personally? After all, the Heavenloss Master is only close with the fifth princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. The fifth princess isn’t the elder princess.”","“As a result, I suspect that the Seventh Heavenly Layer expert might not be the same person originally.” Jian Chen stated his guess. He had developed doubts about this a very long time ago. What in the Skyscraping World could draw over a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt? Logically speaking, it was not very likely for experts like that to appear in the Skyscraping World.","Now, he seemed to understand something.","“Not the same person originally? What do you mean by that?” Xing Caijian was taken aback.","“Princess Caijian, do you think it’s possible that the Seventh Heavenly Layer expert used some kind of special method to get in here?” Jian Chen looked at Xing Caijian brightly.","“Impossible. That’s definitely impossible. The Skyscraping World is already shut. No one can come in unless they’re a heavenly emperor. Even if they’re a heavenly emperor, forcing their way in from outside won’t be easy. At the very least, when they face the formations of the Skyscraping World, it will be a devastating event. The entire Skyscraping World will shake. It’s impossible for it to go without being noticed.” Xing Caijian only shook her head after hearing that. She denied Jian Chen’s guess without any hesitation.","“What if it’s only the soul? After all, I’ve only seen the Seventh Heavenly Layer expert use his laws ever since he exposed himself. He never used his cultivation,” said Jian Chen. Combing through the details carefully, he discovered a very drastic change in the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s actions.","His actions previously did not seem befitting of a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert.","“Even if it’s the soul, it won’t be possible, even if they use some kind of secret technique. You better not underestimate the formations that protect the Skyscraping World. These formations were personally arranged by multiple peak experts. They cover many domains,” said Xing Caijian. She was extremely confident in the formations of the Skyscraping World.","However, not only did the existence of the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt surprise Jian Chen, but even Xing Caijian found it quite strange. “Once we get out, I better ask my father. He is one of the people who arranged the formations. If there are any weak points, he’ll be the most knowledgeable one about it.”","Afterwards, Jian Chen began refining the seed of ways. Xing Caijian did not leave Jian Chen’s side, instead holding the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms and sitting down thirty metres away, personally guarding Jian Chen.","With Xing Caijian’s guarantee and the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s deterrence, Jian Chen truly stopped worrying. He focused all of his efforts on refining the seed of ways.","At this moment, the presence of the seed of ways grew weaker and weaker. This power would weaken with the passage of time in the first place. As Jian Chen refined it at full strength, it would without a doubt wear down the seed of ways’ resistance even further.","Meanwhile, Xing Caijian’s gaze remained fixed on the seed of ways the entire time. A smear of intrigue gradually appeared in her eyes. She murmured gently, “The seed of ways this time seems different from before. It actually has an additional hint of intelligence. It knows to protect itself. I wonder if this has anything to do with the departure of senior Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s final lingering will.”","When she thought of the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s final wisp of lingering will that dispersed, Xing Caijian could not help but let sorrow appear in her eyes.","That meant that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had truly left this world for good now."]},{"number":3944,"title":"Chapter 3944: Heavenloss’ Stance","paragraphs":["Over the next few days, Jian Chen focused on refining the seed of ways. During this time, a few Immortal Exalts had arrived here. They all looked towards Jian Chen with gazes of desire and greed. The allure of a sovereign god artifact had made them lose their minds.","However, when they saw Xing Caijian thirty metres away, wariness filled their eyes again.","Who would have thought that Xing Caijian would actually bring the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star of the Heavenly Star Palace in with her.","The power of this sovereign god artifact was enough to give them all chills.","On this day, two figures approached this area. They were the Heavenloss Master of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul and the Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens.","They did not move quickly, only covering ten kilometres with each step. They approached Jian Chen’s location at a steady pace.","“Stop right there!” Xing Caijian called out as her gaze locked onto the Heavenloss Master and Zuo Dao.","The Heavenloss Master and Zuo Dao stopped where they were. The Heavenloss Master spoke for them, smiling amicably. “Please do not misunderstand, princess Caijian. We’re with fellow Yang Yutian. Earlier when fellow Yang Yutian was trapped in a formation, it was the two of us and vice cult leader Lan Caidie of the Ghost Immortal cult who destroyed the formation and assisted him in breaking free.”","“Heavenloss Master, you flip sides faster than you can flip the pages of a book. In the beginning, it was you who rallied everyone together to capture Yang Yutian, wanting to take back the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in Yang Yutian’s possession. Why have you lumped yourself with Yang Yutian now?”","As soon as the Heavenloss Master said that, a vigorous voice rang out from the distant mist. A middle-aged man strode over, stopping a hundred kilometres away in the end and staring at the Heavenloss Master in displeasure.","When she heard that, Xing Caijian’s eyes turned slightly cold.","The Heavenloss Master’s expression changed as he immediately called out, “Nonsense. That was just a slight misunderstanding between Yang Yutian and I. Now that we’ve already cleared up the misunderstanding, I will only provide fellow Yang Yutian with my full support. Anyone who makes an enemy out of fellow Yang Yutian is making an enemy out of me, as well as our Sword Sect of Yang Soul.”","The Heavenloss Master looked at the middle-aged man. His face was frosty. “On the other hand, if you really want to instigate enmity like this between us, Tiger Mountain Ancestor, I’ve remembered you. You better hope I don’t get a grasp over any of your vulnerabilities in your future, or I won’t let you off easily.”","The thing that the Heavenloss Master was most afraid of hearing right now was how he had hunted down Yang Yutian. He was afraid of it spreading further and further before reaching the ears of the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance in the end. As a result, he immediately developed a grudge towards the Tiger Mountain Ancestor.","At this moment, a huge bell suddenly appeared over Jian Chen’s head. It radiated with the might of a high quality god artifact, directly slamming down over Jian Chen.","A sovereign god artifact was far too tempting. Even with Xing Caijian’s Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star as a deterrence, there were still people willing to take the risk to try and abduct Jian Chen.","“How dare you!” The coldness in Xing Caijian’s eyes intensified as she called out.","At the same time, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms rose up into the air. It did not break free from the coarse cloth. It produced a terrifying strand of sword Qi that sliced through the space of the Skyscraping World, landing on the bell.","There were no deafening rumbles, nor were there any destructive energy storms. The high quality god artifact bell simply turned to dust mid-air. It did not leave behind a single fragment.","A hundred kilometres away, there was a grunt. At the same time, blood sprayed out in a hidden location. It was a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. After the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star destroyed the bell, he had suffered a backlash as well.","“How dare you! Those who lay their hands on fellow Yang Yutian are an enemy of mine. Stay right there!” the Heavenloss Master bellowed out. He was desperate to make up for his mistakes, so he immediately raced off in pursuit of the Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","In the next moment, a powerful streak of light erupted in the distance, followed by deafening rumbles.","However, the battle stopped very quickly. The Heavenloss Master retraced his steps. His presence was slightly disorderly. He sighed gently. “I let him get away.”","“That’s expected. When a Third Heavenly Layer expert focuses on fleeing, you can’t make them stay,” Zuo Dao said indifferently.","“ Heavenloss Master, can you tell me why you want to help Yang Yutian? ” At this moment, a discreet message drifted into the Heavenloss Master’s ear.","The Heavenloss Master’s eyes narrowed as he glanced at an old man who had just reached an area a hundred kilometres away. He could not help but become slightly cautious.","That was the Red Maple Grandmaster. He was from the Myriad Ways cult, which was mortal enemies with the Ghost Immortal cult. If it were not for the Heavenly Star Palace’s protection, the Immortal Ghost cult would have been destroyed by the Myriad Ways cult a long time ago.","The Red Maple Grandmaster stared straight at the Heavenloss Master. He urgently wanted to know the truth, as vice cult leader Lan Caidie of the Ghost Immortal cult was very close with Jian Chen. Jian Chen had pillaged many medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World, which offended many large organisations in the Immortals’ World. Coupled with the bounty from the Immortal Feather sect and the fact that he stole an offering to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, Jian Chen was already someone with a death sentence in the Red Maple Grandmaster’s eyes. No one could save him. He only needed to maneuver matters slightly to lump the Ghost Immortal cult with him. Even the Heavenly Star Palace would not be able to save them.","Yet right now, as one of the most important elements in this plan, the Heavenloss Master had actually changed his attitude significantly, which threw off the Red Maple Grandmaster.","Without the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance’s participation, the forces to deter the Heavenly Star Palace would diminish drastically.","“ You know Yang Yutian’s background, right? His background made you change your mind, right? ” As the Heavenloss Master thought about how to answer the Red Maple Grandmaster, the Red Maple Grandmaster’s voice rang out again.","“ Yeah, I found out about his background, which changed my mind, ” the Heavenloss Master communicated back.","“ What is his background? ” The Red Maple Grandmaster’s tone was rather pressing.","“ Who else could it be apart from the Heavenly Star Palace? ” the Heavenloss Master replied in exasperation.","“ The Heavenly Star Palace? Impossible. Your Sword Sect of Yang Soul is connected with the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. Why would just the Heavenly Star Palace make your attitude change in such a drastic manner? “ The Red Maple Grandmaster was unconvinced.","“ It’s up to you whether to believe it or not. ” The Heavenloss Master refused to elaborate, afraid of revealing more if he spoke further.","In the blink of an eye, a few more days passed. By now, the resistance from the seed of ways had completely vanished. All that remained was pure comprehension of the Way of the Sword. At the same time, it could be stored away in various spaces now.","At this moment, Jian Chen hesitated slightly. Did he want to completely absorb the seed of ways in the Skyscraping World, or did he want to stow it away for now and refine it after he had left this place?","After a moment of deliberation, he immediately pressed the seed of ways against his forehead. Pure Laws of the Sword turned into a steady trickle that merged with his soul.","Immediately, Jian Chen’s mind rumbled as if the sky had shattered. An unfamiliar and even grander world silently took shape.","The seed of ways was from the Skyscraping Sword Venerable after all. As soon as it entered Jian Chen’s soul, it gave Jian Chen a whole new experience. He felt like he had discovered a whole new world.","Right as Jian Chen merged the entire seed of ways into his soul, an Immortal Monarch sitting a thousand kilometres away snapped open his eyes. He glanced in Jian Chen’s direction. The thick mist did not affect his vision. His lips curled into a faint smile as he said, “It’s time!”"]},{"number":3945,"title":"Chapter 3945: Clear and Cloudy’s Possession Attempt","paragraphs":["With that, the middle-aged Immortal Monarch bit his finger and used the blood from his fingertip to inscribe an ancient formation in the air.","The blood-red formation was complicated and incomprehensible. It contained a profound power of the ways. Each inscription seemed to possess tremendous power.","The middle-aged man had paid a heavy price to draw the formation. Not only did his face instantly become sheet-white, but his burly body rapidly withered away as well.","His vitality was rapidly flowing away. He rapidly aged as a result. A large number of wrinkles appeared on his face.","Very soon, the blood-red formation was completed. From the moment the formation was completed, the middle-aged man’s entire body seemed to vapourise, vanishing completely from the world.","Everything in his body had been converted into a strange power to draw the blood-red formation. In other words, it had been converted into some kind of offering, sacrificed for the completion of the formation.","However, the only thing that vanished was his body. A powerful soul remained, shining with blinding light as if it was woven from the laws.","The soul belonged to the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy from the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls.","“ After sacrificing an Immortal Monarch and a good chunk of the power of my soul, I’ve finally completed this Spirit-sealing curse. This curse was created by that paramount ancestor who appeared in the history of our Divine Sect of Ancient Souls. It’s specifically for sealing artifact spirits. ”","“ Even though the Spirit-sealing curse that I’ve created with my abilities are still nowhere near enough to deal with a sovereign god artifact, it’ll still have some effect against a damaged sovereign god artifact. I only need a split second as well... ”","“ However, without the body of the Immortal Monarch hiding me, I will be exposed when the formation of the Heavenly Star Palace appears again, so I must be quick... ” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy thought.","Shortly afterwards, he wrapped his soul in the Spirit-sealing curse and vanished from there silently.","A thousand kilometres away, the seed of ways had merged with Jian Chen completely. The profound laws extended throughout his soul, which forced Jian Chen into a state of comprehending the Laws of the Sword.","Under this state, his awareness of the outside world plunged to a minimum. He was virtually completely defenceless.","This was a form of trust that he had towards Xing Caijian. He believed that with her around, other people would struggle to get to him.","At the same time, it was a form of confidence in the Source of Life. As long as the Source of Life was around, even if someone managed to launch a sneak attack at such an important time, they could not kill him.","At this moment, a powerful soul hidden in the surrounding space silently appeared. He concealed his existence with a secret technique. Let alone Xing Caijian and the early Immortal Exalts who stood around nearby, even the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star failed to sense the existence of this soul.","After all, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star was only an offensive god artifact. It was not omnipotent.","Silently, the powerful soul directly forced its way through the top of Jian Chen’s head.","As he comprehended the Laws of the Sword, Jian Chen only felt a strange sensation of dizziness, which forced him out of his state of comprehension. Shortly afterwards, a tremendous sense of danger filled his mind, but by the time he had responded, his sea of consciousness had plunged into eternal darkness.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul had invaded his body, directly trying to possess him.","However, Jian Chen was recognised by sovereign god artifacts. Three sovereign god artifacts lurked inside his body, so how could he be possessed so easily?","In the next moment, a ball of powerful green light bloomed in the darkness, bringing light to Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness once more. It purged most of the darkness. At the same time, the remaining darkness was rapidly purified by the Source of Life’s power.","“Since I have the courage to possess this kid, I’ve obviously made abundant preparations. Spirit-sealing curse!” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy growled. Shortly afterwards, a blood-red formation appeared, directly merging with the green light.","The Spirit-sealing curse was extremely profound. Using the Source of Life’s power as a medium, it immediately appeared on the Source of Life itself before sticking to it firmly like a talisman.","Immediately, the protective green light receded like the tide in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness. The Spirit-sealing curse had already restrained the Source of Life’s power.","“A weakened sovereign god artifact is unable to be completely unaffected by the Spirit-sealing curse. Even if it only affects you for a short period of time, that will be enough. I only need a split second to possess an Immortal Emperor!” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy said coldly. He was an expert in this field. Not only could he complete the possession of an Immortal Emperor in a split second, but he could even absorb the entirety of his memories. Even the daughter of the heavenly emperor who wielded the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star would not be able to tell who he was.","“If I had any other choice, I really wouldn’t have resorted to possession.” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy stopped hesitating. After restraining the power of the Source of Life, the darkness filled Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness again, occupying ninety-nine percent of the space there.","“Hmm? This kid’s soul seems a little different!” But in the next moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could not help but be surprised. He discovered that he struggled very much to occupy the final one percent. He was met with tremendous resistance.","To actually encounter resistance when he tried to possess an Immortal Emperor with his cultivation was simply unimaginable.","“This presence seems to be the Chaotic Force... No, there’s something off about this Chaotic Force. This doesn’t seem to be false Chaotic Force. T-that’s...” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy seemed to realise something. He immediately gasped. At that moment, even with his cultivation as a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he could not help but become shocked. His heart churned.","What he witnessed right now completely overturned his previous ideas.","“You’ve chosen the wrong person to possess.” At this moment, an elderly voice rang out in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness. The illusionary figure of a divine hall appeared, erupting with some of its remaining power. Immediately, an impressive power swept through Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness, opposing the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s possession attempt.","“A second sovereign god artifact? This kid actually possesses not one, but two sovereign god artifacts?” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was rather taken aback. He had never thought that there would be two sovereign god artifacts. As a matter of fact, he did not even have the courage to think that.","Even across the twelve courts of heaven, just how many of them could produce two sovereign god artifacts?","But shortly afterwards, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy let out a great laugh. “Good! Good! Good! Once I finish occupying this kid, these two sovereign god artifacts will both be mine. Hahahahahahaha...” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy stopped holding back. He erupted with a terrifying power of the soul, forming a violent storm that swept through Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness.","Under the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s full strength, the Primeval Divine Hall’s power was immediately beaten into a retreat. It seemed to struggle heavily to resist.","Right now, the Primeval Divine Hall’s greatest advantage was its physical sturdiness. Even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would struggle to damage it. However, its physical sturdiness would play no effect in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness.","When it came to strength, the Primeval Divine Hall still was not the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s opponent with how much it had recovered so far.","With the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s strength, he could completely overwhelm weakened sovereign god artifacts!","“Zi Ying, Qing Suo, stop hiding. What are you waiting for?” the Primeval Divine Hall’s artifact spirit called out rather unhappily."]},{"number":3946,"title":"Chapter 3946: Battle in the Sea of Consciousness","paragraphs":["As soon as the Primeval artifact spirit said that, two powerful streaks of light suddenly appeared in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness.","They were the power of the sword spirits!","After consuming the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, the sword spirits had already recovered a lot of their strength. The two powerful beams of violet and azure light turned into a pair of illusionary swords, piercing into the region of darkness covered by the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy with unstoppable might.","Immediately, large swathes of darkness were purged from the area of the sea of consciousness occupied by the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","Under the combined efforts of the twin swords and the Primeval Divine Hall, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s power was immediately forced back. The ninety-nine percent of Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness he originally occupied quickly shrank to just a third.","Once his power was completely purged, not only would it mean that his possession attempt had ended in failure, but he would also face a severe backlash.","At this moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy seemed to have blanked out. For a moment, he forgot to resist the suppression from the twin swords and the Primeval Divine Hall.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was truly stunned. He was completely dazed, as he had already recognised the twin swords. He was extremely dumbstruck, so he momentarily forgot to fight back.","At his realm of cultivation, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy understood far too well what the twin swords represented. Without any exaggeration, the shock that the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy felt from discovering the twin swords was countless times greater than when he found out Jian Chen possessed the Source of Life and the Primeval Divine Hall.","“The Azulet swords, the Azulet swords. It’s actually the legendary Azulet swords. I never thought that these items of legends would actually appear here after going missing for over three million years...” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s voice trembled. His heart surged violently as he felt intense disbelief.","Everything that unfolded before him actually made a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer expert feel like he was dreaming. It was all so surreal.","A mere Immortal Emperor, something akin to an ant, was actually hiding three sovereign god artifacts. One of them was even the Azulet swords renowned through the Immortals’ World. If anyone else heard this, just who would believe it?","During the moment of blankness from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, the region he occupied had already been reduced to a mere fifth by the twin swords and the Primeval Divine Hall. Right when he was about to be squeezed out completely, about to face the backlash from failing to possess Jian Chen, the advance of the twin swords and the Primeval Divine Hall came to a halt. They were not able to take another step forward.","“Hahahahaha, I never thought that I would actually come across such a great opportunity today. The ancestors are watching over me...” Suddenly, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy let out an excited howl. Shortly afterwards, an illusionary figure condensed within the remaining region of darkness. His eyes burned with fervour and madness.","A total of three sovereign god artifacts, where one of them was even the legendary Azulet swords, had thrown the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy into complete madness.","Suddenly, the illusionary figure condensed from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s power of the soul formed a seal in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness. Shortly afterwards, black mist surged violently, instantly condensing into a colossal figure. It shook up the sea of consciousness with a strange power, directly pressing down on the Primeval artifact spirit.","Bang!","A rumble rang through Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness. The entire world in there seemed to shake violently. The Primeval artifact spirit’s power had been repelled by the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s figure.","Shortly afterwards, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy struck out again. He used the same secret technique, condensing a finger from the power of his soul that made contact with the twin swords. As the two powers collided, the twin swords were forced back as well.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy immediately went after them in pursuit, quickly reclaiming a portion of lost territory. Afterwards, he struck out again and again, fighting against the two sovereign god artifacts in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness as the illusionary figure. He actually managed to force back the Primeval Divine Hall and the Azulet swords alone.","Despite working together, the two sovereign god artifacts were not the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s opponent!","Very soon, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy reclaimed half of his lost territory, occupying almost half of Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness.","“This person’s mastery of the soul is extremely high. He is extremely skilled in battles like this. Hold him back at full strength. The Source of Life will recover very quickly.” The Primeval artifact spirit snorted coldly. He felt very frustrated. In the past, he had fled from the hands of a sovereign of the Saints’ World multiple times, yet today, he had been forced into such a situation by a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He found it simply unacceptable.","Unfortunately, he could not use the advantage of the Primeval Divine Hall inside Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness at all. He also happened to be weakened, so the Primeval artifact spirit had no better way to handle this situation.","The twin swords said nothing. They could also sense how troublesome the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was. They were clearly in their master’s sea of consciousness. They should have had a home court advantage, yet they felt like they were fighting in someone else’s sea of consciousness right now.","Here, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy moved with great grace. As he formed seals after seals, he unleashed various different secret techniques. He grew mightier as he fought, all with great ease.","If it had been any other Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, perhaps they would have struggled with a battle in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness, but the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not have this concern at all.","The different powers clashed violently in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness, but the darkness that represented the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy clearly possessed the advantage. It spread further, occupying sixty percent of the sea of consciousness already.","Right when the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s invading powers were about to occupy seventy percent of the region, the Source of Life finally broke free from the Spirit-sealing curse, immediately joining in on the battle against the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","As the sea of green filled with vitality spread through Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s advance finally came to a halt. The region filled with darkness rapidly receded under the ebb of the Source of Life’s power.","When it came to battle, the Source of Life came nowhere close to the twin swords, as it was an auxiliary sovereign god artifact. As a matter of fact, it was even weaker than the Primeval Divine Hall.","But when it came to defence, the Source of Life obviously surpassed the Primeval Divine Hall and the Azulet swords.","As a result, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy struggled to take over any region that fell under the protection of the Source of Life.","If the twin swords and the Primeval artifact spirit were not around, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was completely capable of fending off the Source of Life with his abilities, but right now, he was outnumbered one to three.","Immediately, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy lost all advantage. He was forced back by the three sovereign god artifact’s combined efforts.","On top of that, the three sovereign god artifacts had already surrounded him, trapping the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul in the centre. They constantly pressed against the space occupied by the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. Once they squeezed him into a certain range, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy would not be able to escape anymore."]},{"number":3947,"title":"Chapter 3947: Suppressing Clear and Cloudy","paragraphs":["Even though he had lost the upper hand, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not panic at all. As the area he occupied grew smaller and smaller, the power of the soul that infiltrated Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness became more and more concentrated as well.","In the end, when the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s powers only occupied ten percent of the sea of consciousness, the three sovereign god artifacts were unable to advance any further.","With the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s strength, perhaps he could not hold onto too much territory under the suppression of the three sovereign god artifacts. After all, the more space he occupied, the more strength he would exhaust. Under regular circumstances, this was a negligible detail, but as he faced the three sovereign god artifacts, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was already using his full strength. He needed to make use of every bit of his strength appropriately.","By guarding a tenth of the sea of consciousness, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy managed to maintain a stalemate with the three sovereign god artifacts.","“We have to keep him trapped. We can’t let him escape. If we can destroy this person in master’s sea of consciousness and then let master devour the power of his soul, master’s soul will definitely develop rapidly...”","“Yeah, this is a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. His soul is far too powerful. Even if master can only absorb a small portion, that’ll make a qualitative change...”","“This Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt is far too stupid. Why’d he think of possessing Jian Chen? If he went after Jian Chen outside with his advantage in comprehension, then Jian Chen would truly be in a tough position. Even the three of us won’t stand any chance. Yet, he just had to choose a hopeless path. This path is a path of no return...”","The three sovereign god artifacts communicated.","Outside, apart from the twin swords that had lost their physical bodies, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy definitely could not destroy any of these sovereign god artifacts. He would not even be able to harm them, as sovereign god artifacts were far too tough. They had already left behind a legend in history where only Grand Exalts could break them.","However, being unbreakable did not mean they could not be taken away.","Feeble sovereign god artifacts were like a rock. They were impenetrable, but they could be easily taken away. Some stronger Immortal Exalts could even achieve that with great ease.","This was particularly true with the Source of Life. As a sovereign god artifact that primarily focused on recovery, it would have an extremely tough time against peak Immortal Exalts even if it were in its peak condition, let alone now, unable to avoid the fate of being overwhelmed in the very end.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could clearly hear all of the conversations between the artifact spirits in the sea of consciousness.","“Hmph, you once possessed paramount glory, possessing the strength to overwhelm worlds, yet in your current state, you can’t even overpower me.” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy snorted coldly. He had already seen through the situation with the three sovereign god artifacts. Let alone being in his peak condition, even if he only occupied the Soul Guarding Ancestor’s body, he could forcefully take the three sovereign god artifacts away with him using his advantage in cultivation and comprehension.","The three sovereign god artifacts were far too weak compared to his peak condition. Perhaps they could fend off early Immortal Exalts with their powers as sovereign god artifacts, but they would lose their advantage before mid Immortal Exalts.","As for late Immortal Exalts, they would be even more powerless.","In the next moment, a black flame silently appeared inside the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul. As the fire burned, his presence swelled. The disadvantageous situation of being suppressed by the three sovereign god artifacts immediately turned around. His territory rapidly grew to twenty percent, and then it increased to thirty percent of the sea of consciousness, followed by even more.","“He’s burning the power of his soul. Hmph, he can’t last much longer!” The Primeval artifact spirit snorted coldly.","“Source of Life, you better keep a close eye on him. Don’t let him escape!” Zi Ying instructed sternly.","......","...","In the outside world, Jian Chen was like a statue, sitting there without budging at all. Xing Caijian sat thirty metres away from him with her full attention, personally watching over Jian Chen and chasing away all troublemakers.","Even further away was the Heavenloss Master, Zuo Dao, and a few scattered Immortal Exalts who refused to leave.","At this moment, everyone’s gazes focused on Jian Chen, filled with envy, jealousy, reluctancy, pity, and various other mixed emotions.","However, without any exception, no one present could sense the precarious battle of possession that Jian Chen currently experienced.","That was because the person behind it was the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer expert who had incredible mastery over the Way of Souls. Under the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s intentional concealment, even some mid Immortal Exalts would struggle to sense any abnormalities unless they proactively looked for them, let alone a group of early Immortal Exalts.","As for the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, it could sense the existence of the twin swords as a form of familiarity with its peers, but it could not see inside Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness.","After all, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star was only the artifact spirit of a sword. Despite possessing devastating power, it was not omnipotent.","The silent battle inside Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness had already developed to a white-hot intensity. The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy forced back the three artifact spirits with the great power he had obtained by igniting his soul.","Jian Chen did not idle around. He understood that he stood no chance against an expert like the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy with the strength of his soul, so he used the chaotic soul.","A wisp of true Chaotic Force had fused with his soul, making it undergo an unbelievable transformation. If it were not for his chaotic soul, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy would have completed the possession almost instantly in the very beginning.","At this moment, he brought his chaotic soul forward from behind, standing at the front lines to half the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s advancing steps.","Faced with the chaotic soul, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy still felt like he was stuck in mud despite the power he had obtained from burning his soul. The difficulty of his infiltration increased greatly.","In the end, Jian Chen even brought out the five strands of Profound Sword Qi. Even though he knew that he could not harm a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert with the Profound Sword Qi given the strength of his soul, that was all he was capable of in the sea of consciousness.","Only techniques connected to the soul could be used in the sea of consciousness. Techniques like the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike and the Hundred Superimposition Sword could not be used.","However, when Jian Chen tried using the first strand of Profound Sword Qi, he discovered in surprise that it actually erased a small portion of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s power of the soul.","In the outside world, Jian Chen knew that even if he used all five strands, he would struggle to affect an expert like the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, let alone injure him.","But in his sea of consciousness, the Profound Sword Qi actually had an unexpected effect.","“An Immortal Emperor ant can actually harm me? What is this power?” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was surprised as well. He immediately noticed the Profound Sword Qi. Upon recalling it, he sighed. “The Profound Sword Qi. It’s actually that legendary technique. It’s said that with nine strands of Profound Sword Qi unleashed, even Grand Exalts can be injured. In the current Immortals’ World, there aren’t a lot of people left who can still recognise this technique.”","But very soon, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s face contorted. He said coldly, “No matter who you are or how impressive your legacy is, once I possess you, it’ll all be mine...”","That was what he said, but the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy gradually seemed to run out of strength. The great power he obtained by burning his soul had been successfully repelled by Jian Chen and the three artifact spirits. The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could not maintain this state for too long either, so he stopped burning his soul very soon.","By now, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had already become exhausted. He demonstrated hints of feebleness.","“Source of Life, stop being so stingy. In the sea of consciousness, you have a greater effect than both us and Primeval. Use this opportunity to suppress this person!” Zi Ying called out.","“Hmph, dammit. I’ve already exhausted too much of my power on this person.” The Source of Life was displeased. It hesitated.","But in the next moment, it made use of the bit of Myriad Source Qi it had managed to accumulate over the years after so much difficulty.","When the presence of the Myriad Source Qi appeared, Jian Chen’s expression immediately changed. He understood exactly how important the Myriad Source Qi was to the Source of Life. Even back then, when a Grand Exalt like the Wind Venerable was around, the Source of Life had been extremely protective over the Myriad Source Qi. In the end, it only ended up compromising after being promised a strand of Primeval Qi in exchange.","Not only could Myriad Source Qi repair god artifacts, but it was also a power that the Source of Life required to heal itself.","As the Myriad Source Qi was exhausted, the Source of Life’s presence immediately swelled, immediately overwhelming the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy in an almost-overwhelming manner while he was feeble.","The Primeval artifact spirit and the twin swords cooperated with their full strength as well. Jian Chen also used another two strands of Profound Sword Qi, trying to strike while the iron was hot and suppress the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy in one fell stroke.","Under their combined efforts, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul was reduced to just one hundredth of the sea of consciousness, but after that point, they could not advance any further no matter what they tried.","“In our current state, it’ll be very difficult to completely eliminate a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert in the sea of consciousness. We’ll suppress him first and then wear him down slowly,” said the Primeval artifact spirit. Afterwards, it turned into the figure of a colossal divine hall, setting down on top of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul with tremendous force.","The Source of Life had already exhausted its Myriad Source Qi, and its presence returned to normal. Together with the twin swords, it joined in on the team that suppressed the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","PS: Recently, there have been readers who say that Xiaoyao has written the three sovereign god artifacts on Jian Chen to be a little weak. Here is a rough explanation. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star is in perfect shape, and it has the power of a heavenly emperor. In simple words, it is powered by the energy of the heavenly emperor.","Jian Chen’s three sovereign god artifacts are all in feeble states. They are using the power of the god artifacts themselves, while their opponent is a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, which is why they’re having such a difficult time. A Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt is already an impressive figure who stands at the apex. Please do not underestimate the Seventh Heavenly Layer.","Last of all, I’d like to thank the readers for their comments in the comments section, and I also hope that there will be more comments in the future. Let us propel Chaotic Sword God forward together."]},{"number":3948,"title":"Chapter 3948: Sword Sage","paragraphs":["The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not utter another word. By now, his heart had sunk completely. Not only did he end up failing when he tried to possess a mere Immortal Emperor with his impressive strength, but he had even ended up in a situation like this. He had never even thought of an outcome like this.","However, while his situation seemed dangerous, unable to escape from the suppression of three sovereign god artifacts, it would not be easy for them to completely eliminate him either.","Jian Chen let out a great sigh. He had finally placed this mysterious expert under control. From the moment this person appeared, he had been put into a difficult position, basically unable to fight back at all. If he had not used the white jade lamp in the final moment to earn a sliver of chance to escape, there would not be any good fate awaiting him even if he had the Source of Life to heal him.","The Source of Life’s recovery power was not endless after all. The power exhausted by a Seventh Heavenly Layer expert was even greater than facing several dozen early Immortal Exalts at the same time.","The difference between the power of early and late Immortal Exalt was qualitative. It was a difference in level.","“Master, we need to devote ourselves to keeping this person under control, just in case he decides to launch a counterattack. During the next period of time, we’ll all be a little tied up...” The sword spirits communicated.","Very soon, Jian Chen grasped the current situation from the three artifact spirits. The three artifact spirits had to suppress the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. They would not be of as great help as before in the future.","When it came to the twin swords, that did not matter too much. Apart from fusing them, he had no use for the twin swords for the time being.","However, the Primeval Divine Hall would affect Jian Chen to a certain degree. In order to ensure that no accidents happened, he would always assemble the Divine Formation of the Heavens in the Primeval Divine Hall before transporting the entire formation outside through the divine hall’s power.","The Primeval Divine Hall’s power was occupied now, so he could not use the Divine Formation of the Heavens too often in the future. Otherwise, once the Primeval Divine Hall ran out of power, he would face a counterattack from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","The Source of Life was similarly affected, having to suppress the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul. The Source of Life played a very large role. In the sea of consciousness, the Source of Life was equivalent to a form of defence. It could drastically keep the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s attempts at possession at bay.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s existence occupied most of the Source of Life’s power. For a good period of time into the future, it perhaps could not heal Jian Chen’s injuries with its full strength.","Even if it could use its full strength, it would not be able to last too long, or it would have an effect on the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s suppression.","After learning about the situation, Jian Chen had no idea whether to celebrate or to mourn. He had suppressed a Seventh Heavenly Layer. If he could refine him, even just absorbing a small portion of the power of his soul would be a colossal boon to him.","But similarly, the three sovereign god artifacts were now caught up.","Neither Jian Chen nor the three sovereign god artifacts could come up with any better idea right now to deal with the intruder in his soul. All they could do was keep him suppressed and wear down his power slowly.","After addressing the threat of possession, Jian Chen immediately felt his head spin. The battle against the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had taken quite a toll on him as well. He had used three strands when it came to the Profound Sword Qi alone, and that was not taking other aspects into account.","Apart from that, a stabbing pain emanated from the depths of Jian Chen’s soul, which made his head that was already dizzy feel even heavier. His consciousness even momentarily blurred. The world spun around him. He almost fainted.","His soul was injured. This was a consequence from fusing the twin swords in the past. Over the years, Jian Chen had used various methods to slowly nurture this injury. Over time, he had finally healed it to the point where it would not have too great of an affect on him after great difficulty.","Yet now, with the struggle with the Anecstor of the Clear and Cloudy, his soul injury had worsened again.","Jian Chen temporarily set aside the matter of his soul injury, because now was not the time for that. Now that the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy could not affect him anymore, he continued to absorb the seed of ways’ power.","The seed of ways contained pure laws, which included the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s comprehension of the Laws of the Sword.","Absorbing the seed of ways did not correspond to directly absorbing the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s comprehension. Similarly, it could not increase a person’s strength. It only presented the confusing and perplexing laws in the clearest, simplest, and most direct manner. Whether they could comprehend something and how much they could comprehend would all come down to their talent.","If they had sufficient talent, a seed of ways was enough for a breakthrough. The talented could reach higher realms with it.","If they did not have sufficient talent, then no matter how many seeds of ways they absorbed, it would still be useless.","The power of ways in the seed of ways gradually diminished as it constantly manifested the ways. Jian Chen’s understanding and grasp of the Way of the Sword constantly increased as he was submerged in comprehension. Vaguely, he seemed to see a door that led to a higher place.","This was the door that led beyond Sword Immortal to Sword Sage!","Sword Sage was basically the highest realm that almost all experts of the Way of the Sword could pursue.","That was because all cultivators who comprehended the Way of the Sword, whether they were early, mid, or late Immortal Exalts, would all stop at Sword Sage.","Even one of the twelve heavenly emperors, the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance of the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, his mastery of the Way of the Sword had halted at Sword Sage!","That was because the last realm of the five realms of the Way of the Sword, Sword God, was a paramount realm that only Grand Exalts could touch.","Boom!","At that instant, a rumble erupted in Jian Chen’s head. In a daze, the door that had remained shut over his head smashed open instantly. A profound and wondrous sensation filled his mind. The ways of the entire world, the thousands of laws, all seemed much clearer in Jian Chen’s eyes than before.","At that moment, he had successfully broken through to Sword Sage. He had entered a whole new world!","His accumulation and consolidation at the great completion of Sword Immortal was far too great. Every single stone tablet he comprehended in the Skyscraping World had added to his foundations of the Way of the Sword. Before he fought for the seed of ways, Jian Chen’s Way of the Sword had already reached the very peak of the great completion of Sword Immortal. All he was missing was a single step through the door.","This tiny distance had cut off countless immortals in the Immortals’ World, unable to take another step further. If they did not have enough fortune and talent, even if they spent several hundred thousand years or even millions of years comprehending away arduously, they would still struggle to get past that.","But now, by borrowing the seed of ways left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, Jian Chen had broken through in one fell stroke!","The breakthrough this time came all too naturally. It was unstoppable. Even his unhealed injuries of the soul could not stop his breakthrough.","Moreover, after successfully breaking through to Sword Sage, the seed of ways had not run out of power completely. Jian Chen could not be bothered with understanding the new realm. He continued to absorb the seed of ways’ remaining power, hoping to make it even further down the path that led to the minor achievement of Sword Sage."]},{"number":3949,"title":"Chapter 3949: The Skyscraping World Closes","paragraphs":["“He’s broken through! That truly is the seed of ways left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. It’s actually allowed him to break through so quickly...”","“The seed of ways did play a role in Yang Yutian’s breakthrough, but you can’t ignore his talent either...”","“That’s right. If he had insufficient talent, he won’t be able to make any progress even with assistance from the seed of ways. However, it truly is extremely rare for someone to be able to break through so quickly like Yang Yutian...”","“Originally, I thought that even if he obtained the seed of ways, he would need several centuries or even millennia to break through successfully. After all, after reaching Immortal Emperor, each step takes an extremely long time. I never thought Yang Yutian would actually achieve it in just a short month...”","......","...","Jian Chen obviously could not hide his breakthrough from everyone present. At this moment, some of the Immortal Exalts nearby let out sighs. They looked at Jian Chen with extremely mixed gazes.","In the beginning, many of them had come for the seed of ways, yet right now, none of them cared about the seed of ways anymore. All they could think of was the sovereign god artifact on Yang Yutian.","However, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star protected him on the side, which was why these Immortal Exalts were forced to hold back their urges, afraid to act out of line.","Otherwise, even if it were against Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, some of these early Immortal Exalts would still be bold enough to fight for it.","Xing Caijian’s eyes shone brightly as well. She stared fixedly at the figure basking in light and smiled gently.","She obviously hoped that the successor of the twin swords was as powerful as possible.","She was not helping Jian Chen but the successor of the twin swords.","During the days that Jian Chen spent comprehending the Laws of the Sword, waves of Immortal Exalts came and left. Many of them knew Jian Chen’s precise location. If it were not for the fact that the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had already been exposed, Jian Chen would have never been able to break through so peacefully.","Even Xing Caijian’s identity as the daughter of a heavenly emperor would not protect him.","Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens and the Heavenloss Master of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul watched over Jian Chen just like before. Even though their presence was completely unnecessary, it represented their attitude on this matter.","Vice cult leader Lan Caidie of the Ghost Immortal cult did not show up here. After using the power of the Remnants of the Ghost Immortal, she had paid a very heavy price. Who knew where she was hiding right now, recovering silently.","Meanwhile, certain pieces of news involving Jian Chen had already spread through the entire Skyscraping World under the efforts of a few people.","He had killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect!","His true identity was the Chang Yang that the Wayless Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Feather sect had put out a bounty for, one of the past Thousand Immortal Generals of the Observance Heaven City!","He possessed a powerful formation that had killed a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights, the Profound Spirit Master!","He possessed a sovereign god artifact that could heal him rapidly, making him virtually unkillable, and he had brought several tens of thousand stowaways into the Skyscraping World with him.","Originally, only the Immortal Exalts in the Skyscraping World knew about these pieces of news, but as word got out, virtually everyone learnt about it. Whether they were Immortal Emperors, Immortal Monarchs, or Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, they all knew.","As the news spread, it immediately shocked the entire Skyscraping World. The city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu, was currently in the middle of comprehending one of the nine secret techniques. His expression changed again and again. For a moment, he could not even be bothered with comprehending the secret technique.","“A sovereign god artifact! He actually possesses a sovereign god artifact!” In another region near the foot of the Skyscraping World, the city lord of the Yi Immortal City, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, stood before a stone tablet with his eldest son. When they received this news, they were both shocked. Their hearts churned.","“The Profound Spirit Master is a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. I didn’t expect him of all people to die at Yang Yutian’s hands. Father, we should feel glad that we didn’t get involved,” the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt’s eldest son, Chi Yutian, said with lingering fear. Chills ran down his spine.","The Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt fell silent before letting out a sigh. “You have been very sensible. Regardless of Yang Yutian’s identity, regardless of what treasures he possesses, he is definitely someone that our Yi Immortal City cannot afford to provoke...”","......",",,,","“These people are just despicable.” Xing Caijian was also aware that the matters involving Yang Yutian had already spread through the Skyscraping World. She was powerless about this. She was not able to contain the news. After all, it was several dozen Immortal Exalts spreading the news. It was not like she could make the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star kill all of them.","Even if she actually wanted that, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star would not take action.","“Once our trip in the Skyscraping World ends, fellow Yang Yutian will definitely make a resounding name for himself in the Immortals’ World.” The Heavenloss Master chuckled. He was not worried for Jian Chen at all. So what if he revealed his sovereign god artifact? So what if he killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect? As long as the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance stood forward to cover for him, just who in the Immortals’ World would still have the courage to touch him?","“ Now, it’ll all just come down to how the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance treats Yang Yutian, ” thought the Heavenloss Master. He could not infer too much from a tablet alone. Right now, he both hoped that Jian Chen could be a little closer to the elder princess, but he also hoped that he was not too friendly with the elder princess.","The Heavenloss Master just happened to be in an extremely conflicted state. At the same time, he felt some uneasiness.","In the blink of an eye, three months had already passed since Jian Chen absorbed the seed of ways. On this day, the Skyscraping World suddenly shook violently. The mist that filled the entire world surged violently. Shortly afterwards, blinding golden light lit up in the sky, enveloping every inch of the Skyscraping World. It gave off a tremendous pressure that made all of the experts’ hearts skip a beat.","This was one of the Skyscraping World’s peak formations. At this moment, it had suddenly activated!","“The Skyscraping World is about to close. Everyone in here will be forcefully transported out by the formation’s power.” Xing Caijian looked up at the tremendous formation in the sky. This formation also originated from a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Its purpose was for teleportation!","Virtually no one could hide themselves from this formation. It could ensure that no one would slip past its detection.","Xing Caijian was forced to rouse Jian Chen who was submerged in comprehension. She said, “Once we get out, don’t say anything. Just stand behind me. I will contact my father immediately.”","Jian Chen glanced at the tremendous formation in the sky that rapidly gathered power. After a moment of silence, he said, “Don’t worry about me. Since I have the courage to do all this in the Skyscraping World, I obviously have the confidence to escape as well.”","“You’ll only be taking a risk with that. The only way to ensure absolutely nothing can go wrong is to wait for my father to arrive.” Xing Caijian looked at Jian Chen.","“I’ve killed multiple great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. If the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor were to show himself, it would not be good. It will lead to even more severe consequences,” Jian Chen said seriously. In the Skyscraping World, Xing Caijian had provided him with tremendous help. Since he was confident about slipping away, he obviously did not wish to drag the Heavenly Star Palace into this."]},{"number":3950,"title":"Chapter 3950: Shocking News","paragraphs":["Xing Caijian furrowed her brows slightly. The deaths of the great elders from the Immortal Feather sect would be truly difficult to deal with. After all, it was no longer as simple as a matter of pride and dignity for these courts of heaven anymore when it came to great elders. They were also members of the upper echelon and possessed quite the status.","“Since you’ve killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect, you’ll need my father to stand forward and settle this even more. Otherwise, you will be hunted down throughout the entire world by the Immortal Feather sect. Even if you can flee, it won’t be a long-term solution.” Xing Caijian’s tone was stern.","Jian Chen shook his head with a smile. “The four great elders of the Immortal Feather sect who died by my hand are only the first group. This number will only increase, and it’ll even include a few Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Immortal Feather sect. What is there to settle?”","“Must you oppose the Immortal Feather sect?” Xing Caijian was rather confused.","“I’m not intentionally working against them. There are just some matters that are unavoidable, and there happens to be a need for it as well. You may not know the exact details but your father should know,” Jian Chen said calmly.","When she heard that, a beam of light flashed through Xing Caijian’s eyes. She seemed to have come up with a guess already. She sank into her thoughts.","The conversation between the two of them was carried out secretively. Even the Immortal Exalts gathered nearby were unable to hear the contents of their conversation. Even if they wanted to eavesdrop, they were blocked by an invisible force.","This was the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s power! Since it had been exposed already, there was no need for it to go out of its way to stay hidden.","At this moment, a great power swept down from above. Before this power, even some stronger Immortal Exalts could not develop any will to resist.","In the next moment, an irresistibly powerful force swept through every inch of the Skyscraping World with a great disturbance. Everyone it reached, regardless of cultivation or comprehension, vanished, having been forcefully transported out of the Skyscraping World.","In the blink of an eye, not a single person remained in the enormous Skyscraping World.","Jian Chen only felt his vision blur. When it cleared up again, he had already appeared in an independent space. This space was still a part of the Skyscraping World. It could only be opened using the Skyscraping Sword Scripture.","Elsewhere, the enormous mountain that hid various opportunities and the seed of ways gradually faded away into the space there until it vanished for good.","Only by assembling the one hundred and eight pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture could they summon the mountain again, but that would be a matter several hundred thousand years in the future.","“We’re out, they’re finally out...”","“Hmm? Something is off. Why are there so few people emerging this time...”","“Over three hundred people entered the Skyscraping World but less than two hundred have emerged. Where are the rest...”","“During the past few times the Skyscraping World opened, there were a few losses each time, but that was less than a tenth of everyone who entered. It’s nowhere like this time, where almost a half is gone...”","......","...","Noisy discussions and exclamations of surprise rang out constantly nearby. Jian Chen looked over and discovered many cultivators gathered in small groups of five and three, staring at the people who emerged in surprise.","They had all followed people who possessed pages of the Skyscraping Sword Scripture into this space, but they did not enter in the end.","“What exactly happened inside? Why did so many people perish?” At this moment, an elderly voice boomed out. An old man in white robes silently appeared above a divine hall. He radiated with the might of an Immortal Exalt.","Shortly afterwards, several other presences of Immortal Exalts appeared. From various directions, the Immortal Exalts who idled around all emerged. All of their gazes gathered on the group of people who emerged from the Skyscraping World. Some of them beamed with joy as their nervous hearts finally settled down, as their people who entered the Skyscraping World had emerged alive.","There were also others with extremely ugly and sunken faces. They did not find their people among the group of people who emerged.","“Over three hundred people entered, yet less than two hundred have emerged alive. Probably quite a few have perished out of the Immortal Exalts alone. Looks like the Skyscraping World this time has been busier than any of the previous times.” At this moment, a gentle voice rang out.","From the moment the voice appeared, all of the Immortal Exalts present narrowed their eyes before demonstrating either respect or dread.","The speaker was the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster, an extremely powerful existence. Both his Laws of the Sword and Laws of Illusions had reached the same heights. He was enough to stand paramount within his realm of cultivation!","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster appeared on an immortal vessel that hovered in the air. His presence was entirely erased, making him seem like a regular person.","Seeing how even the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster behaved like that, the Immortal Exalts nearby who unleashed their aura quickly withdrew their presences. They did not let a single wisp of it leak out again.","At this moment, a few cultivators who emerged from the Skyscraping World left the group and quickly made their way in the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s direction. In the end, they stopped behind him and bowed politely.","These people were all the juniors escorted here by the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster.","“Good! You’re all here!” The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster nodded. Seeing how none of the people he brought here were lost, he felt some relief. “Tell me what happened in the Skyscraping World. What was the exact reason that led to the deaths of so many Immortal Exalts? The Skyscraping World is supposed to be a land of fortune that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable left behind for the juniors of the Immortals’ World, yet today, this land of fortune has instead become a zone of danger. It has defied the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s initial wishes.”","“Your highness, thank you for the care you’ve shown the three of us in the Skyscraping World. Now that our journey in the Skyscraping World is over, it’s time for us to return to our sects...” At the same time, great elder Yun Yingshi of the Cloud sect who helped Xing Caijian picked heavenly resources with the two elders under his command, Yun Lianzi and Yun Liansu, bowed deeply towards her. Their faces were filled with gratitude.","Many people in the surroundings saw this. They looked at the three people from the Cloud sect in complete surprise.","Great elder Yun Yingshi seemed to enjoy this attention very much. He could not help but let out a hint of complacency in the depths of his eyes. No matter what, he had been connected to the daughter of the heavenly emperor, Xing Caijian, in this trip to the Skyscraping World. Once the three of them returned, their status in the sect would definitely rise. As a matter of fact, it would be something that they could boast about for a very long time into the future.","The people transported out from the Skyscraping World all dispersed. Some of them remained alone in that space, looking around cautiously, while others returned to their respective seniors’ sides.","“What? The great elders of the Immortal Feather sect were slain in the Skyscraping World?”","“The Profound Spirit Master actually perished? That’s just unbelievable. A land of fortune like the Skyscraping World actually claimed the life of a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt...”","“What did you say? A sovereign god artifact appeared in the Skyscraping World...”","......","...","Very soon, everyone learnt about what had happened in the Skyscraping World, which led to immediate shock.","Far too many people had emerged, whether they were disciples of esteemed peak organisations or Immortal Exalt ancestors themselves. It was impossible to keep the news contained.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster was dazed as well. He stared straight at Jian Chen as if it was the first time he had met him.","It was not just the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster. Everyone gathered in this space, regardless of their cultivation, stared at Jian Chen.","This person actually possessed a sovereign god artifact? A sovereign god artifact! That immediately set everyone’s greed ablaze.","Jian Chen glanced around. He could sense a few discreet presences that fluctuated uncontrollably in a few areas that seemed empty.","The appearance of these presences made Jian Chen think of the people who were tempted to rob him as the Skyscraping Sword Scripture was assembled. If it were not for the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s influence, there probably would have been quite a lot of bloodshed in this space.","However, as soon as Jian Chen thought up to there, a figure suddenly appeared before his eyes. He was an old man who seemed extremely ordinary. At this moment, he radiated with the presence of a Second Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. His eyes burned with greed as he directly reached towards Jian Chen with a restraining force in his hand.","This person did not enter the Skyscraping World. He was not completely familiar with Jian Chen’s feats in battle there. He had only taken action eagerly after learning that Jian Chen possessed a sovereign god artifact, unable to control his urges and greed.","All of the Immortal Exalts who emerged from the Skyscraping World watched on coldly. There were even hints of scorn and mockery in their eyes as if they were silently sneering at this person’s futile efforts.","Faced with the attack, Jian Chen was just about to take action when someone moved even faster than him. The Heavenloss Master immediately appeared in front of him. He extended a finger and sharp sword Qi swept through the space, colliding with the assailant.","Boom!","With a rumble, a powerful storm of energy swept through this space, making all of the cultivators nearby retreat. The entire space twisted violently.","The old man stared at the Heavenloss Master who stood in front of him as his face sank. Afterwards, he looked around subconsciously. When he saw how none of the Immortal Exalts in this space showed any signs of taking action, he could not help but become startled. He realised something, and the burning desire in his eyes gradually subsided. He let out a cold snort before vanishing into space again.","“Yang Yutian, did you really kill the great elders of the Immortal Feather sect?” The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster appeared in front of Jian Chen. His face was stern, and his voice was solemn.","He did not ask about Jian Chen’s sovereign god artifact. Instead, he directly asked about the great elders of the Immortal Feather sect as if their deaths were even more important than the supposed sovereign god artifact.","“That’s right. All three great elders from the Immortal Feather sect who entered the Skyscraping World died by my hand.” Jian Chen did not deny it. He openly admitted it before everyone.","“Caijian, what is your stance with regards to this person?” The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster looked at Xing Caijian sternly."]},{"number":3951,"title":"Chapter 3951: Returning to the Immortals’ World","paragraphs":["“Uncle Illusion-condensing, he is a guest of our Heavenly Star Palace!” Xing Caijian looked directly at the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster.","Faced with Xing Caijian’s determined gaze, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster furrowed his brows. He said sternly, “A guest of the Heavenly Star Palace? Xing Caijian, are you serious about this? He has killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect. Do you have any idea just how severe the consequences will be if you maintain your relationship with him?”","“I’m obviously aware but a guest is a guest. It is not a principle of our Heavenly Star Palace to reject guests just because they’ve offended the Immortal Feather sect. If word of this makes it out, others will even think our Heavenly Star Palace fears the Immortal Feather sect,” said Xing Caijian.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s gaze deepened. There was something very off about Xing Caijian’s attitude towards Jian Chen. He could not help but look at Jian Chen, studying him so seriously and sternly for the first time. His deep eyes were indescribably penetrating like he was trying to see through Jian Chen entirely.","Moreover, the light of divination flickered in the depths of the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s eyes. At that moment, he merged his soul with the world, resonating with the ways in an attempt to peer into some of the secrets hidden in the deepest depths of the world.","Under the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster’s gaze, Jian Chen immediately felt like he had been entirely seen through.","Of course, that was only an illusion. As his strength increased, his ability to hide himself only grew stronger. Coupled with the cover from the mask of the Illusionary Daemon race, it was very difficult to see through him unless he encountered some exceptional Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Very soon, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster turned his gaze away. There was a hint of deep surprise in his eyes. He could not see through the junior before him at all, nor could he deduce anything through divination. Situations like this were extremely rare.","“Princess Xing Caijian, offending the Immortal Feather sect for the sake of a sovereign god artifact is truly not a wise decision. Please reconsider...” In the distance, an old man in grey robes spoke up slowly in an attempt to convince her.","He was known as elder Bai. He was only a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even though his strength was not exceptional, his background was extraordinary. No one present dared to underestimate him.","That was because elder Bai originated from the Courtyard of Ways. He had specially come to escort the students of the Courtyard of Ways, and he had spent his time waiting outside.","“ Sigh, the sovereign god artifact on Yang Yutian has clearly caught the Heavenly Star Palace’s attention. We can all just forget about it... ”","“ Right now, there are so many of us here, which is why Xing Caijian claims Yang Yutian to be a friend. If he were in the Heavenly Star Palace, he’d be a sitting duck... ”","“ From my understanding of the Heavenly Star Palace, that’s not something they would do... ”","“ That’s not something they would do? Hmph, that’s only because it’s not tempting enough. A sovereign god artifact is enough for some courts of heaven to turn against their own consciences. Can’t you see that the Heavenly Star Palace is even prepared to offend the Immortal Feather sect to obtain this sovereign god artifact... ”","......","...","The various Immortal Exalts in the surroundings communicated with one another and discussed in depth. Greed and temptation would flash through their eyes from time to time, but deep wariness would appear when they casually glanced past the ancient sword in Xing Caijian’s arms.","They had already learnt from others about the existence of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","At this moment, the space there twisted violently. Thick cracks spread out, extending out above and below like spider webs.","Through the huge spatial cracks, it was possible to vaguely make out the resplendent starlight in the distance, as well as the magnificent galaxies woven in between, forming a beautiful star chart.","At the same time, over a dozen figures sat near the entrance of the Skyscraping World. Under their invisible pressure, the space there actually seemed to be frozen. Even spiritual Qi was unable to flow.","Every single figure there was extremely powerful. They could summon rain with a wave of their hands and destroy worlds with a stomp. Even when they did not intentionally let out their presence, the wisps they accidentally released was enough to influence the surroundings.","Many of these people were owners of the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World!","Suddenly, the figures there all seemed to sense something. Their eyes snapped open and gazed into the distance.","“The Skyscraping World has finally closed. I never expected its location to have shifted by so much...”","“Why is the entrance so far away this time? I’ve set up the formation here for nothing...” someone said softly.","Meanwhile, the Scholar Capital Master who had waited here for many years had run out of patience a long time ago. Urgency and uneasiness flashed through his eyes. He was extremely worried about the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing being used.","In the next moment, the Scholar Capital Master vanished. He had rushed off as quickly as he could.","Various formation banners or discs hidden in the surrounding space all appeared. They ended up in the hands of their various owners. After stowing these items away, they also rushed towards the entrance.","“Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation, appear!” Suddenly, there was a bellow, and powerful energy immediately appeared from the space there. Nine huge golden cauldrons appeared out from thin air, shining with blinding light.","When the nine golden cauldrons emerged, they seemed like nine huge suns from afar, illuminating the entire cosmos.","In the next moment, the nine golden cauldrons vanished suddenly. When they reappeared, they had already crossed several billion kilometres, directly reaching the entrance of the Skyscraping World before everyone else.","Near the entrance, Jian Chen only felt his surroundings change. When the familiar spiritual Qi appeared, he knew that he had already returned to the Immortals’ World.","Jian Chen immediately raised his guard. The Divine Formation of the Heavens had already been arranged inside the Primeval Divine Hall, ready to launch a startling strike at any time. He had activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight as well, making him suddenly vanish.","The Illusion-Condensing Swordmaster had been watching Jian Chen the entire time. When he sensed Jian Chen vanish, shock immediately flashed through his eyes. His eyes were fixated on the location where Jian Chen vanished from. He felt astonished.","Despite his strength, he was unable to sense where Jian Chen was hiding at all.","“Yang Yutian, you committed various heinous deeds in the Skyscraping World, and you robbed all those medicinal gardens. Don’t even think about escaping!” At this moment, a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt bellowed out furiously. He immediately produced a powerful strand of sword Qi that shot through the air. It exploded before it even reached where Jian Chen had vanished from, turning into a storm that swept through the space there.","The space here belonged to the Immortals’ World, so it was nowhere near as sturdy as the Skyscraping World’s. As a result, when the sword Qi exploded, the turbulence it created immediately swallowed the space there. Terrifying spatial cracks stretched several tens of million kilometres. The disturbance he created was completely unlike anything that had occurred in the Skyscraping World.","The Immortal Exalt clearly understood Jian Chen’s methods extremely well. His attack was purely for the sake of forcing out Jian Chen. He wanted to prevent him from escaping.","“Old Freak Tao, what is wrong with you? If you harm my disciples, I’ll never spare you...”","Various furious and shocked bellows rang out. Many Immortal Exalts protected their disciples, shielding them from the shockwave produced by the sword Qi.","However, his attack had successfully forced Jian Chen out from the space there. All of the space in the surroundings twisted violently and constantly shattered. Jian Chen’s Divine Armour of Heavenflight was affected as well, preventing him from hiding.","It was just a split second, but the split second stopped Jian Chen from leaving. In the next moment, the nine golden cauldrons shot over, radiating with a tremendous presence and assembling a tremendous formation that enveloped the surroundings as well as everyone else."]},{"number":3952,"title":"Chapter 3952: The Robbed Come Knocking","paragraphs":["It was not just Jian Chen. Even the people from the Courtyard of Ways and even the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster, a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, had been trapped by the formation assembled from the cauldrons.","Everyone who emerged from the Skyscraping World, without any exception, had fallen into the formation.","“How bold of these people! How dare they disrespect master like this!” A First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt old man flew into a fury on the Illusion-condensing Master’s immortal vessel. Right when he was about to leave the immortal vessel and question what was going on, a hand pressed against his shoulder gently.","“ Calm down. Let’s see what is happening first, ” the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster said. All of his presence was withdrawn. He seemed like a mortal. He looked around indifferently, directly ignoring the formation assembled from the nine cauldrons.","Jian Chen looked at the nine cauldrons as well. He could tell with a single glance that the nine golden cauldrons were all high quality god artifacts, except they were the weakest kind.","Despite that, a formation assembled from nine high quality god artifacts was enough to trap Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Right when Jian Chen wanted to use the Divine Formation of the Heavens, Xing Caijian seemed to know what he wanted to do. She arrived in front of him in a flash and said with displeasure, “You want to leave as soon as you get out. Do you not trust us? Since I said our Heavenly Star Palace will ensure your safety, no one will be able to harm you.”","“That will only make trouble for you. Less trouble is always better than more trouble,” Jian Chen said helplessly.","“Our Heavenly Star Palace is one of the twelve courts of heaven. We have reigned over the Immortals’ World for countless years. If we were so afraid of trouble, then what right do we have to stand at the apex of the world?” Xing Caijian was serious. Her voice was firm. “Moreover, the trouble in your eyes is a form of responsibility, an undertaking in ours!”","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster had been paying attention to Xing Caijian and Jian Chen the entire time. After hearing Xing Caijian’s words, his doubts grew even heavier.","Earlier, Jian Chen had been forced out by the strand of sword Qi. The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster could have prevented that, but he chose not to. He wanted to see just how far Xing Caijian or perhaps the Heavenly Star Palace would take things for Jian Chen.","Of course, there was another important reason. He was extremely interested in Jian Chen’s identity.","Xing Caijian clearly knew he had killed great elders of the Immortal Feather sect, yet she still wanted to risk war with the Immortal Feather sect just to protect him.","That could only mean his identity was anything but simple.","At this moment, over a dozen figures appeared outside the formation assembled from the nine golden cauldrons. They all radiated with tremendous presences.","As soon as they emerged, a person threw down some formation materials, setting up another powerful formation outside the nine cauldrons. Numerous formations overlapped together, forming an impenetrable wall as if they were afraid that anyone inside would escape.","“This is the Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation. There is only one person who can assemble it, which is the Myriad Gold Ancestor of the Gold Yang sect, the greatest sect on the Numerous Layer Heaven.","“What? It’s actually the paramount existence from the Gold Yang sect? It’s said that the Myriad Gold Ancestor is a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the greatest expert on the Numerous Layer Heaven...”","“Someone as lofty as him has actually come here in person...”","“It’s not just the Gold Yang sect. There’s the Primordial Formation of Archaism. Out of the entire Ancient Immortal sect, there’s only the Old Monolith Immortal who can assemble such a powerful Primordial Formation of Archaism. However, this formation only seals up the space here. He won’t have the courage to actually activate it...”","......","...","Some Immortal Exalts exclaimed inside the formation. They had already recognised who the people were through the formations. They became stern.","Although some of them also came from peak organisations, they came nowhere close to the likes of the Gold Yang sect and the Ancient Immortal sect.","At this moment, the experts gathered outside the formation all took a step and passed through the formations without any obstruction, entering this sealed space.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster had already vanished. He entered the immortal vessel, sitting before a jade table alone as he sipped on some tea at ease.","“I am the Cloud Furnace Master of the Sword Sect of Jade Clouds from the Cloud Extent Heaven. Apologies, everyone. The reason why I’ve temporarily kept everyone here is because the medicinal garden established in the Skyscraping World by our Sword Sect of Jade Clouds has been destroyed. The medicinal garden is extremely important both to me and the Sword Sect of Jade Clouds. We cannot afford to lose it. Once I get to the bottom of this matter, our Sword Sect of Jade Clouds will definitely visit you one by one in apology for our rudeness today!” The Cloud Furnace Master of the Sword Sect of Jade Clouds clasped his fist at everyone. He was very polite.","“I am the Myriad Gold Ancestor of the Gold Yang sect. Apologies, everyone...”","“I am the Split Stream Master of the Immortal Sect of Scarlet Sun. Apologies, everyone...”","......","...","Following the Cloud Furnace Master, the other experts all clasped their fists at everyone as well. After all, the people they had trapped here were connected to various organisations in the Immortals’ World. There were even people from courts of heaven like the Courtyard of Ways. They did not have the courage to be too disrespectful.","If it were not for the fact that they had over a dozen experts assembled together, all suffering losses, they really would not have had the courage to trap these people who emerged from the Sksycraping World.","The people from the Courtyard of Ways stood to one corner like none of this involved them. Clearly, they were already prepared for this situation. They were not surprised at all.","The experts from a few other organisations like the Ghost Immortal cult and the Myriad Ways cult did not dare to show any displeasure either. The experts who sealed off this place were all mid Immortal Exalts. There were even several at the Sixth Heavenly Layer. Every single person represented a major organisation. When they banded together, even an organisation as powerful as a court of heaven had to take them seriously.","“I am the Scholar Capital Master of the Modest Silence Heaven. I only have one goal in coming here. In the past, I nurtured a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing in the Skyscraping World. I hid it with a formation, just so that it could mature successfully. Unexpectedly, someone actually stole the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that I had nurtured during the opening of the Skyscraping World this time.”","“Though, who exactly ended up with the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing?” Towards the end, the Scholar Capital Master’s voice immediately turned cold. The pressure of a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt emanated out slightly.","When they heard the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, many of the Immortal Exalts present responded with strange expressions. Meanwhile, the face of the Heavenloss Master of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul became extremely ugly. He constantly cursed inside.","He was extremely afraid of everything that could lead to the topic of Jian Chen’s relationship with the elder princess.","“So the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing actually belonged to the Scholar Capital Master. No wonder it could reach such a high quality. With the master’s formation concealing it, regular people would truly struggle to find it,” an Immortal Exalt who emerged from the Skyscraping World said in realisation.","The Scholar Capital Master’s heart sat in his throat. He stared at the Immortal Exalt in interest and said urgently, “Then who currently possesses the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing?”"]},{"number":3953,"title":"Chapter 3953: The Mad Master","paragraphs":["As soon as the Scholar Capital Master said that, many people subconsciously glanced at Jian Chen. From time to time, their gazes would also pause on the Heavenloss Master.","Ever since the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing appeared, they were the two who fought most violently for it. The Heavenloss Master had even claimed it prematurely, planning on offering it up to the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.","But afterwards, no one knew what possessed the Heavenloss Master. His attitude towards Jian Chen changed drastically, so much so that many people were unable to adjust accordingly.","The Scholar Capital Master immediately looked at Jian Chen. He furrowed his brows slightly because Jian Chen’s presence was very different from the person who first destroyed the formation.","However, he did not think too much about it. He understood the brutality of the Skyscraping World all too well. It was perfectly normal for the heavenly resources discovered there to change owners several times. The final person who possessed the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing did not have to be the person who destroyed the formation.","“Fellow, is the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing with you?” the Scholar Capital Master asked sternly.","“Scholar Capital Master, I have visited the place where the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing grew. From the various traces left behind, the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing should have been planted there by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. Since it was left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable, it will obviously go to the one destined to possess it, so it shouldn’t be your possession,” Zuo Dao who stood near Jian Chen said. He was very composed and was not overly rude or polite. Even when he faced a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like the Scholar Capital Master, he showed no fear.","“Who are you?” The Scholar Capital Master’s face sank. A hint of cold killing intent flashed through the depths of his eyes.","He was determined to obtain the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. It was far too important to him. As long as it came to the ownership of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, he would not accept any disputes or doubts.","“I am Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens from the Wondrous Success Heaven!” Zuo Dao clasped his fist.","When he heard that, the Scholar Capital Master narrowed his eyes slightly. The killing intent in the depths of his eyes immediately vanished. He furrowed his brows and said, “My Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing isn’t in your possession, so what’re you butting in for?”","“I’m only stating the truth. Everything inside the Skyscraping World was originally left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable to benefit the juniors of the Immortals’ World. Everything inside goes to those destined to possess them. You are one of the three sages of the Modest Silence Heaven, a mighty Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. What you’re doing here is somewhat beneath you,” said Zuo Dao.","Xing Caijian’s eyes shone as well. She glanced at Jian Chen and communicated carefully, “ What is your connection with the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens? Why is an ancestor of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens helping you time and time again? ”","Jian Chen shook his head gently, expressing that he did not know. Actually, he had already developed a guess when he saw how Zuo Dao often accompanied the Heavenloss Master.","Xing Caijian looked at Zuo Dao. Her eyes were filled with doubt. The Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens was no ordinary organisation. Before the rise of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens had been the undisputed rulers of the Wondrous Success Heaven. During their prime, they had a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Even though the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens was already past their prime, their strength still could not be underestimated. They had an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. They possessed the same level of strength as her mother’s sect, the Immortal Sect of Sacred Fire.","Xing Caijian could ignore how the Heavenloss Master of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul was assisting Jian Chen, but if the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens assisted Jian Chen from behind, then the implications would be completely different.","When Zuo Dao revealed his background was the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens, the owners of the medicinal gardens all glanced over. Many of them were cautious.","The Scholar Capital Master did not want to argue with Zuo Dao any further either. He looked at Jian Chen again and said, “Is the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing on you?”","“That’s right, I did obtain the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. However, if you want me to produce the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, then please forgive me, Scholar Capital Master, as I cannot,” Jian Chen said to the Scholar Capital Master.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is extremely important to me. If you return the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to me, I can give you other items of equal value!” The Scholar Capital Master stared straight at Jian Chen. He recalled the final sights he saw with the wisp of his soul that he had left in the Skyscraping World, and he made a comparison.","He had a feeling that the person who destroyed the concealment formation was right in front of him. Even though his appearance was different and his presence was different as well, he found him to be slightly familiar from his demeanor.","However, he looked around, but did not find the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. That made him deliberate slightly, unable to come to an immediate conclusion.","The formation banners he used to hide the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing were of rather high quality. They were precious treasures even to him. He also wanted to recover the lost formation banners.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is already gone.” Jian Chen stared at the Scholar Capital Master in a strange manner.","“W-w-what? G-g-gone?” The Scholar Capital Master’s eyes immediately narrowed drastically. He stared straight at Jian Chen with widened eyes, unable to believe this outcome.","He had spent the past few years waiting uneasily outside the Skyscraping World. What he was most worried about was the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing being used up inside the Skyscraping World. Never did he expect that the thing he worried about the most still ended up happening.","Without the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, it would be very difficult for the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul to recover. He would not be able to grasp the Immortal Soul Annihilation technique through the artifact spirit either.","The only Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing of high enough quality to repair the Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul was the one in the Skyscraping World.","That was because the Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing available in the Immortals’ World were either of too low quality and completely useless to the Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul, or they had been monopolised by the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords.","As a matter of fact, even some lower quality Spiritual Fruits of Sword Nurturing would end up in the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords’ possession.","Without any exaggeration, the Scholar Capital Master basically had no other way to obtain a second Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing of high enough quality if he lost the one in the Skyscraping World.","That was unless he decided to steal from the tiger’s mouth and run the risk of offending the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords.","Suddenly, killing intent radiated from the Scholar Capital Master. His eyes turned bloodshot. His gaze towards Jian Chen was filled with bone-chilling killing intent.","“You little piece of shit, how dare you use up the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing. How dare you use it up. Do you have any idea just how much energy I’ve put into the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing? Do you know how great of a price I’ve paid for it? I’ve even abandoned the war on the Modest Silence Heaven, watching this place for all these years just so I could take back the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, yet you, you, you... You actually used up the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing...”","“Argh! I’m going to kill you!” The Scholar Capital Master lost his mind. His presence exploded. The pressure of a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt shook up the surroundings and twisted the space, forcing back some of the Immortal Exalts in the surroundings.","He struck out in fury. His hand shattered the space, directly hurtling towards Jian Chen with devastating power.","His arduous waiting had all gone to waste. The loss of the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was just too much for him. At that moment, he even forgot to ask about Jian Chen’s origins and background. The only thought that remained in his head was to tear the bastard who destroyed the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to shreds, to make him suffer the most horrific death.","At that moment, the Illusion-condensing Master in the nearby immortal vessel paused slightly. He raised his head. He looked through the immortal vessel, and his gaze landed on Xing Caijian and Jian Chen.","At the same time, the Heavenloss Master’s face changed drastically. He could feel the threat of death from the Scholar Capital Master’s attack.","If the palm strike landed on him, he would be left half-dead even if he somehow managed to survive."]},{"number":3954,"title":"Chapter 3954: Made Public","paragraphs":["The Immortal Exalts who emerged from the Skyscraping World all shivered inside. The Scholar Capital Master’s attack made them all feel the aura of death.","However, despite the devastating might of the Scholar Capital Master’s attack, none of the Immortal Exalts who emerged from the Skyscraping World felt worried about Jian Chen.","Right when the surging energy produced from the Scholar Capital Master’s hand was about to strike Jian Chen, the clear thrum of a sword suddenly erupted. A dazzling streak of sword Qi suddenly shot out from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in Xing Caijian’s arms, instantly slicing through space and flashing past the Scholar Capital Master’s hand.","When the sword Qi appeared, a terrifying pressure filled the space there, immediately leaving the owners of the medicinal gardens shocked.","“T-this presence... This is the presence of a sovereign god artifact...”","“There’s actually a sovereign god artifact here...”","......","...","The owners of the medicinal gardens cried out. All of their gazes changed. They all turned towards Xing Caijian.","When the sword Qi from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star shot past the Scholar Capital Master’s hand, the attack immediately dispersed. At the same time, he felt a stabbing pain.","He subconsciously checked his hand. All he found was a bloody gash. It was not deep, but it struggled to heal.","The Scholar Capital Master immediately calmed down. He retreated reflexively. At the same time, he looked at the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in Xing Caijian’s arms. He had never been so stern before.","As a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he immediately recognised the presence—it belonged to a sovereign god artifact. He also understood that it had no intentions of harming him with the sword Qi. Otherwise, his injuries would be far more than a gash on his hand given the might it had just demonstrated.","“Who are you?” The Scholar Capital Master had already retreated far away. He stared straight at Xing Caijian, but most of his attention went to the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in Xing Caijian’s arms. A hint of burning greed that he struggled to restrain flashed through the depths of his eyes.","A sovereign god artifact, especially one with such terrifying power, was far stronger than the Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul in his possession.","No, it was not just far stronger. They were incomparable. They were on completely different levels.","Despite desiring it very much, the Scholar Capital Master did not have the courage to seize it. The terrifying power that the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had just revealed already gave him chills.","At that moment, Xing Caijian became the centre of attention. All of the cultivators gathered there, regardless of cultivation, turned their gaze towards her.","“Scholar Capital Master, this is princess Caijian of the Heavenly Star Palace!” An Immortal Exalt who emerged from the Skyscraping World introduced her proactively.","“Princess?” A hint of doubt flashed through the Scholar Capital Master’s eyes. The Heavenly Star Palace was one of the twelve courts of heaven. The title of princess was not one that could be claimed by any ordinary member of the organisation.","But shortly afterwards, the Scholar Capital Master thought of something. His heart skipped a beat in surprise. The way he looked at her changed. “You’re the daughter of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and Venerable Cajian, Xing Caijian?”","The owners of the medicinal gardens only learnt about Xing Caijian’s identity at that moment. They were all shocked.","The daughter of a heavenly emperor; this was no regular identity.","“Yang Yutian is a guest of our Heavenly Star Palace. If anyone wants to go after Yang Yutian, you better get through me first,” Xing Caijian said. Her voice was very plain, but it was filled with undefiable determination.","It was very difficult to imagine that a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor would still be able to speak so demandingly before the Scholar Capital Master who was already a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Given the heights he had reached, he would be a lofty existence even in a court of heaven, possessing an extremely illustrious identity. If there were no irreconcilable blood feuds, even courts of heaven were reluctant to make enemies out of such experts.","The Scholar Capital Master ignored Xing Caijian’s rudeness. He only stared at the ancient sword in her possession.","Xing Caijian slowly removed the coarse cloth around the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, revealing an extremely exquisite sheath. It was silvery-white in colour. Countless specks of light shimmered on there like stars, like a magnificent galaxy.","This was the first time that the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had revealed itself in this trip to the Skyscraping World.","However, only the sheath and hilt were visible. There was no pressure of a sovereign god artifact present either.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star intentionally kept itself contained. It would not expose its edge until it attacked.","The Scholar Capital Master gasped. The power of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star made his heart burn with fervour, but he did not have the courage to go after this sovereign god artifact. He could only think about the Divine Sword of the Immortal Soul in his possession.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing is my heart and blood, yet this person destroyed it. He owes me an explanation,” the Scholar Capital Master said coldly.","“The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was planted by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable. It grew step by step through absorbing the spiritual Qi of the Skyscraping World. Since when did it become yours?” Xing Caijian asked.","“Xing Caijian, out of respect for the heavenly emperor, I’m not going to argue with you, but if I don’t get an explanation for the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, I’m not going to drop this matter. Don’t tell me your Heavenly Star Palace wants to provoke a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt over a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing?”","“Your Heavenly Star Palace may be one of the twelve courts of heaven and the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor is influential and highly respected among the important figures of the entire Immortals’ World, but allow me to say something that might not be so pleasant. Within your Heavenly Star Palace, there are only two or three experts who can threaten me.” The Scholar Capital Master was staking it all. The Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing was too important to him.","Xing Caijian furrowed her brows in response. She knew that the Scholar Capital Master was telling the truth. There were not a lot of Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt even across the entire Immortals’ World. Some of the weaker heavens did not even have experts like that. Let alone their Heavenly Star Palace, even the twelve courts of heaven together only had a handful of experts who could handle someone like the Scholar Capital Master.","But despite that, Xing Caijian was not frightened either. “Looks like the Scholar Capital Master wants to make an enemy out of our Heavenly Star Palace over a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing that doesn’t belong to you.” Xing Caijian looked at the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in her arms and said slowly with a frigid voice,” Senior Heavenly Star...”","As soon as he heard Xing Caijian call for the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, the Scholar Capital Master’s heart sank. He called out, “It’s nothing difficult for your Heavenly Star Palace to settle my feud with this kid. You’ll only need to step forward and exchange for a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing of similar quality to the one from the Skyscraping World with the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords. If you agree, I’ll leave immediately.”","“ Scholar Capital Master, why ask for a Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing to settle the feud? Isn’t it better to just seize Yang Yutian? Yang Yutian possesses a sovereign god artifact that can heal him indefinitely. It’s far more powerful than the Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing... ”","At this moment, an obscure voice rang out from thin air. It was clearly some sort of secret technique. Even mid Immortal Exalts could not find the source of the voice.","Basically all of the experts who emerged from the Skyscraping World knew about the sovereign god artifact’s existence, but the owners of the medicinal gardens who had been waiting outside did not. When this voice reached their ears, they immediately shuddered inside.","“ Not only did Yang Yutian take the Scholar Capital Master’s Spiritual Fruit of Sword Nurturing, but all of the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World were destroyed by him too. All of the heavenly resources are in his possession... ” The voice rang out again, echoing through the space as if it was asking for trouble. It completely divulged everything to do with Jian Chen in the Skyscraping World."]},{"number":3955,"title":"Chapter 3955: Taking Action","paragraphs":["The experts who had gathered here because their medicinal gardens had been plundered seemed to forget their original objectives. They all turned their attention towards Jian Chen. Their faces were filled with mixed emotions, involving envy and burning fervour.","At that moment, they were not interested in their beloved medicinal gardens but the sovereign god artifact in Jian Chen’s possession.","“Junior, do you really possess a sovereign god artifact? Why don’t you take it out so we can all take a look?” an old woman said. She wore a grey robe, radiating with the presence of a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","The old woman was known as the Divine Monarch of Cursing Heavens. She grasped the Laws of Curses, allowing her to kill without a trace.","“Little friend, is what that person just said true? Do you really have a sovereign god artifact? One that can heal you indefinitely?” The Split Stream Master of the Immortal Sect of Scarlet Sun stared at Jian Chen in great interest.","The other owners of medicinal gardens did not say anything, but all of them looked towards the Immortal Exalts who had emerged from the Skyscraping World. They all investigated the situation inside the Skyscraping World by communicating with them secretly.","Some of these people had left behind wisps of their senses of souls in their medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World, but the senses of their souls usually spent their time sleeping. They would only rouse when the medicinal garden was under attack, allowing them to grasp the situation.","As a result, the owners of these medicinal gardens were completely ignorant of the major incidents that occurred in the Skyscraping World.","Faced with these questions, none of the Immortal Exalts from the Skyscraping World hid anything. They all stated what they knew.","None of what they said was a secret anyway. They obviously would not offend these owners of medicinal gardens over such a trifling matter.","“ What? Not only does this kid possess a sovereign god artifact, but he also has a formation of terrifying power? ”","“ A Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt actually died by the hand of this Immortal Emperor? It’s that unbelievable? ”","“ Even several dozen Immortal Exalts working together could not kill him. It truly is a sovereign god artifact... ”","Very soon, the owners of the medicinal garden who surrounded the entrance all knew about the storm that Jian Chen had created in the Skyscraping World. They were all deeply shocked.","In particular, the almost undying power granted by the sovereign god artifact left them burning with fervour, tempting them dearly.","At this moment, the owners of the medicinal gardens no longer cared about the resources they had lost in the Skyscraping World. All they could think of was the sovereign god artifact’s endless healing power.","Even the Scholar Capital Master was shocked. He looked at Jian Chen with a hint of caution.","At the same time, they had learnt about how Xing Caijian and Jian Chen did not know one another before they entered the Skyscraping World.","That immediately left the owners of the medicinal gardens thinking.","Suddenly, they seemed to understand what Xing Caijian meant by “guest”.","“So the sovereign god artifact on this kid has caught the Heavenly Star Palace’s attention as well. Yang Yutian, I don’t know what your identity is, but let me tell you a brutal truth. Once you go to the Heavenly Star Palace, your fate will be extremely horrific.” A gruff voice rang out. It came from a middle-aged man in black robes. His appearance was extremely ugly. He radiated with the presence of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","He was the Corroding Venom Ancestor. His original form was a venomous serpent, and he evolved into a dragon after undergoing numerous trials and tribulations. He had already become a divine beast. His battle prowess was extremely great. Even some of the Sixth Heavenly Layer experts here would glance at him with wariness.","“The Heavenly Star Palace is one of the courts of heaven. It has always received our respect, but your appetite today is truly hideous,” the Cloud Furnace Master said coldly.","“If your Heavenly Star Palace wants the sovereign god artifact on him, just state it directly. After all, it’s perfectly understandable to desire a divine item like that. There’s nothing embarrassing about it. Trying to spin it off as something else will only incur shame,” said the Old Monolith Immortal of the Ancient Immortal sect. He stared at Xing Caijian emotionlessly. Even though he was extremely fearful of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, he burned with greed upon the thought of a sovereign god artifact that could heal him indefinitely.","Who would not desire such a sovereign god artifact?","Listening to the slander directed at the Heavenly Star Palace, Xing Caijian’s gaze became extremely frigid. She said coldly, “The seniors who are familiar with our Heavenly Star Palace obviously know the forthrightness and boldness of our Heavenly Star Palace. As for those who don’t understand our Heavenly Star Palace, or perhaps those who want to achieve some kind of objective through slandering our Heavenly Star Palace, it doesn’t matter what I say.”","Xing Caijian stepped forward and stood in front of Jian Chen. At that moment, she faced a group of Immortal Exalts whose strength far surpassed hers. Despite her cultivation at the Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, she radiated with an indomitable presence. “It all comes down to a single statement. If you want to do anything to a guest of our Heavenly Star Palace, you better get through the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in my hand first!”","“Hehehehe, princess Caijian, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star is indeed powerful, leaving us all wary, but its current wielder is not a heavenly emperor after all.” Suddenly, flirtatious laughter rang out. When Xing Caijian heard the voice, the sharpness in her eyes immediately vanished. She completely lowered her guard as well.","In her eyes, the surroundings had already changed. It turned into the scenes she experienced as she grew up in the Heavenly Star Palace. There were no enemies before her, only familiar and reliable figures.","Xing Caijian’s eyes were completely lost. Silently, she had already fallen into an illusion, unable to pull herself out from it.","That was the laws of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Without any external interference, Xing Caijian would struggle to rouse from this illusion even if she spent centuries in it given her strength as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","But in the next moment, a terrifying strand of sword Qi erupted like a flood. Xing Caijian immediately jolted back to her senses. When her vision recovered, the space before her had already plunged into darkness. A streak of light flashed through the darkness, slashing at a certain location behind her.","Spurt!","When the streak of light landed, blood sprayed through the air. The redness of the blood stood out, radiating with powerful energy. At the same time, a pale hand had been forcefully severed from the wrist by the sword Qi.","The confusion in Jian Chen’s eyes vanished as well. His gaze sank. Xing Caijian was not the only one affected just now. Even he had been pulled into the illusion unbeknownst to him. If it were not for the sword Qi that erupted from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, he would have never recovered so quickly.","Jian Chen reached out. The Heaven-lifting sword silently appeared and erupted with dazzling light. He slashed at the region of space where the blood sprayed out from.","The attack bore his Laws of the Sword after reaching Sword Sage. Its power was incomparable to before he broke through.","At the same time, numerous afterimages appeared in the air when he slashed out. Each afterimage seemed surreal, bearing power that even made the Immortal Exalts respond with a double take.","In the end, five of the afterimages instantly merged as well, pushing the might of the attack to an entirely new peak.","The Five Superimposition Sword!","Boom!","With a dull sound, Jian Chen only felt his sword land on something tough. A great force passed through the Heaven-lifting sword, leaving his entire right arm numb.","A beautiful figure appeared where his sword had landed. She was a young lady who only seemed to be in her twenties. She possessed alluring beauty.","However, her right wrist had already become bloodied. Her entire hand had been severed. Even an abnormal, white sword mark had appeared on the white dress she wore.","That was the mark left behind by Jian Chen’s Five Superimposition Sword.","The white dress was also a high quality god artifact. Its defences were impressive.","“The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion, aren’t you a little too hurried? Do you really think your Way of Reality and Illusion can influence the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star?” The Cloud Furnace Master of the Sword Sect of Jade Clouds saw the woman with the severed hand and could not help but laugh.","The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s gaze turned cold. She let out a cold snort, and her body suddenly split apart, into two, then four, then eight. In just a split second, she turned into several hundred figures. Each figure radiated with the presence of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. It was completely impossible to notice any difference between the true and the fake.","“True and fake, fake and true. Among these figures, every single one of them can be viewed as the true body of the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion. At the same time, they can also be viewed as fake bodies. She’s trying to exhaust the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s power,” said the Split Stream Master of the Immortal Sect of Scarlet Sun.","“Hmph, she wants to exhaust the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star as a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt? Does she think the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star is a damaged or weakened sovereign god artifact? It’s a complete sovereign god artifact that bears the power of a heavenly emperor. How can it be that easy to deal with?” The Cloud Furnace Master snorted in disdain."]},{"number":3956,"title":"Chapter 3956: A Scramble From Everyone","paragraphs":["At this moment, the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s several hundred figures filled the surrounding space. The presence of each illusion was entirely the same. It was impossible to distinguish between them.","Suddenly, eight of her illusions approached Jian Chen at the same time. They either raised their hands, formed seals, or used some kind of secret technique. They attacked Jian Chen from eight different directions at the same time.","The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion only had Jian Chen in her eyes. She completely ignored Xing Caijian on the side.","However, when she struck, she used her illusions to influence Jian Chen and Xing Caijian again, sending them into a fake illusion.","This was the laws of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. It turned the laws into illusions, so even Jian Chen struggled to resist it.","He had the Source of Life. His recovery was extremely powerful. He did not fear the attacks of Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts at all. However, when he faced abilities like the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s, Jian Chen was placed in an extremely tough spot.","By now, Jian Chen had been caught by one of the illusions from the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion. The illusion originally only possessed the presence of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. It did not have the corresponding cultivation. However, from the moment she made contact with Jian Chen, a tremendous power seemed to appear from nowhere, trying to restrain Jian Chen with great force.","But at this moment, the power of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star appeared again. With a flash, it slashed towards the first master’s illusion with chilling might.","The illusion’s face changed. Right when the sword Qi was about to touch her, all of the power in the illusion vanished instantly. Afterwards, it was slashed to fragments by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s sword Qi.","But shortly afterwards, the seven other illusions approached Jian Chen at the same time. The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s true cultivation moved between the seven illusions, trying to find an opportunity to capture and abduct Jian Chen.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star took action again. A resplendent strand of sword Qi pressed against the space there, making it crack.","Faced with the sword Qi, the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s seven illusions shattered at the same time.","However, right as they shattered, her true power descended upon the other illusions.","There were still several hundred of her illusions in the surroundings.","In the next moment, another eight illusions took action again, rushing towards Jian Chen from all directions.","Her objective was very simple. She wanted to use her illusions to exhaust the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s powers.","However, the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion had angered the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star with her actions. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star rose up from Xing Caijian’s hand by itself. It shone with a hazy light, which seemed to be composed of countless stars.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star did not leave its sheath. It simply slashed out with the sheath on.","The slash released a paramount power. Afterwards, the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s illusions that lunged towards Jian Chen crumbled midway.","Following those illusions, the several hundred other illusions further away vanished in swathes.","Instantly, all of the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s illusions vanished. All that remained was her true body.","However, a deep gash had appeared on her chest, reaching through to her back. The high quality defensive god artifact had been pierced with ease.","Spurt! Blood sprayed from the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion. Her alluring face had already become sheet-white. She gave off a sense of feebleness.","She had already been heavily injured by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s sword Qi!","Suddenly, the space around Jian Chen froze. He seemed to be encased in ice. He was immobilised.","An expert skilled in the Laws of Space had taken action against him. Their mastery over the Laws of Space was extremely great. Their ability to freeze space was enough to easily restrain all early Immortal Exalts.","In the next moment, Jian Chen suddenly vanished. When he reappeared, he was already near the boundary of the Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation.","A middle-aged man in white robes appeared before him. He was the greatest expert of the Immortal Sect of Grand Unity, the Worldless Immortal Exalt. At this moment, his eyes shone with fervour and excitement. He grabbed Jian Chen by the shoulder, about to flee into the distance.","At this moment, a powerful sensation of danger overtook him. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star hovered in the air, directly producing a strand of sword Qi that shot right towards the Worldless Immortal Exalt. It was like the fall of a galaxy, filling the entire space and rapidly spreading towards him.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt was extremely stern. He extended his finger at the incoming sword Qi. With that, the space began to ripple like water before being indefinitely stretched.","He used the Laws of Space to rewrite space, indefinitely stretching the distance between him and the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","Immediately, the sword Qi produced by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star became extremely slow. In the eyes of the surrounding people, the strand of sword Qi almost came to a standstill.","The sword Qi was very powerful. It could easily tear through space and destroy galaxies. However, the Worldless Immortal Exalt used his mastery over the Laws of Space to forcefully stabilise this region, forcefully dragging the sword Qi from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star into his own world.","However, that only lasted for a moment. The Worldless Immortal Exalt’s body began to spasm gently. His face rapidly paled as well. A streak of blood had already leaked out from the corner of his lips.","He faced unimaginable pressure in his standoff against the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","Suddenly, a dull sound rang out, and the surrounding space twisted wildly. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s sword Qi had still ended up overwhelming the Worldless Immortal Exalt’s Laws of Space, breaking free from the influence and instantly accelerating.","During that time, the Worldless Immortal Exalt had turned around and swung his hand violently at the boundary of the Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation. As the space cracked open, a gate leading to the outside world silently appeared.","He grabbed Jian Chen in one hand and stepped towards the gate. At the same time, he swung his hand and two blinding balls of light flew towards the sword Qi behind him.","The first ball of light was a circular shield. It blazed brightly, radiating with the might of a high quality god artifact.","The second ball of light was a fist-sized object. It crackled with purple lightning, releasing a terrifying presence.","It was an Immortal-destroying Thunder, an extremely rare Immortal-destroying Thunder of exceedingly high quality. It was enough to threaten Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Boom! The sword Qi from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star punched through the high quality god artifact shield, and the shield immediately exploded. It turned into a storm of energy that wore away the sword Qi’s power.","Shortly afterwards, the Immortal-destroying Thunder exploded. Endless purple lightning swallowed the space, drowning out the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s sword Qi.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt was about to leave through a gate.","“Worldless Immortal Exalt, I can let anyone leave here except for you. You grasp the Laws of Space, and you’ve already reached the Sixth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. If you leave, we won’t be able to catch up to you,” the Myriad Gold Ancestor of the Gold Yang sect called out coldly. Shortly afterwards, the Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation began to operate, immediately shutting the gate that the Worldless Immortal Exalt had opened with the Laws of Space.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt’s face changed. In the next moment, a streak of light plunged into his back and emerged from his chest. It was the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s sword Qi.","Spurt! Blood sprayed out from the Worldless Immortal Exalt’s mouth. Suddenly, he felt his hand become empty. The Myriad Gold Ancestor had already appeared silently beside him. Jian Chen had fallen into the Myriad Gold Ancestor’s hands now.","“Senior Heavenly Star!” In the distance, Xing Caijian called out. She was unhappy with the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","As if it sensed Xing Caijian’s mood, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star finally began to draw itself from its sheath after a moment of silence.","Immediately, a peerless edge revealed itself to the world, flooding the entire space with its blinding sharpness."]},{"number":3957,"title":"Chapter 3957: The Immortal Feather Sect","paragraphs":["Finally, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star showed its true appearance. It no longer held back with its glory as a sovereign god artifact, releasing it for the world to see.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt and the Myriad Gold Ancestor stiffened. They stared at the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in shock. They were immobilised.","The two of them had been targeted by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, so it was countless times more intense for them than anyone else nearby. After the sword locked onto their presence, the two of them both developed the illusion that they would doom themselves if they did anything out of line.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt’s heart sank. He grasped the Laws of Space. Originally, he was the most confident person here. As a matter of fact, he even had a hint of fearlessness, as he was confident about escaping. Unless he encountered an opponent who also grasped the Laws of Space, no one could catch up to him. Even when he faced experts whose cultivation far exceeded his, he could escape with ease.","But now, he discovered that he struggled to use the Laws of Space. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s might interfered with the surrounding laws.","With his presence locked onto by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, the Worldless Immortal Exalt felt that even if he fled for billions of kilometres through the Laws of Space, he would not be able to escape the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s pursuit.","“I-is this the true power of a sovereign god artifact?” The Worldless Immortal Exalt was shocked. Sovereign god artifacts in the Immortals’ World were rare, but there were a few. He had experienced the pressure of sovereign god artifacts before in some ancient sects with lengthy histories, but none of these sovereign god artifacts he had encountered before could compare to the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star from the Heavenly Star Palace was not simply a complete sovereign god artifact. It also possessed the power of a heavenly emperor.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star completely stunned everyone in the surroundings. Even some of the owners of the medicinal gardens who were tempted and were about to take action could not help but hold back their urges.","Xing Caijian looked around at the owners of the medicinal gardens and said slowly, “My father sent senior Heavenly Star to accompany me. Originally, it was to ensure my safety in the Skyscraping World. Before I set off, my father had instructed with great diligence that senior Heavenly Star was not to kill blindly. With senior Heavenly Star’s strength, if he really were to strike without holding back, even all the Immortal Exalts here combined would not be enough for senior Heavenly Star to kill.”","“As a result, when senior Heavenly Star struck earlier, he followed my father’s instructions. He only injured without killing, letting you retreat in the face of difficulties.”","Reaching there, Xing Caijian’s eyes immediately became filled with endless coldness. She continued, “However, if you decide to be obstinate, ignoring the warnings of our Heavenly Star Palace and continuing to go after our guest, senior Heavenly Star won’t be holding back anymore.”","“The next time he strikes, senior Heavenly Star will be out to kill!”","When Xing Caijian said her final sentence, all of the owners of the medicinal gardens were shocked. They were extremely stern.","They knew that Xing Caijian was telling the truth. Whenever the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star struck earlier, it remained hidden in its sheath. It had not demonstrated its full strength. But now, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had already been drawn. Its great might that could influence the surrounding laws struck fear into all of them.","However, when they thought about how Jian Chen possessed a sovereign god artifact that could indefinitely heal wounds, many of them found it difficult to give up.","As for the Immortal Exalts who emerged from the Skyscraping World, they had already given up on all wishes completely. Most of them were early Immortal Exalts. Even if there was still a hint of fervour in them, they did not have the courage to take any action.","Only these owners of medicinal gardens had the courage to even think about it due to the strength they took pride in.","As for the plundered medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World, they no longer cared about them.","At this moment, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star slashed out. The sword Qi tore through the starry sky, directly slamming against one of the cauldrons that formed the Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation.","This time, there were no deafening rumbles. The high quality god artifact cauldron was silently reduced to dust.","With the destruction of one of the cauldrons, the Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation that sealed up this space immediately collapsed.","Not only did the sword Qi destroy the Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation, even the few other formations set up outside it were crushed.","A casual strike from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had consecutively destroyed numerous formations of rather high quality, which made the owners of these formations glance over furiously. They bled inside.","Xing Caijian strode through the air, arriving before Jian Chen. “Come with me to the Heavenly Star Palace. Only by coming to our Heavenly Star Palace as a guest will certain people lose the courage to make trouble for you. Otherwise, with their abilities, you might not be able to hide yourself if they search for you through the entire Immortals’ World. After all, there’ll always be a time when you give yourself away.”","“Hmph, you want to protect this kid? I’m afraid your Heavenly Star Palace still isn’t capable of that.” As soon as Xing Caijian finished speaking, an elderly voice rang out from far away. Everyone followed the voice and glanced over subconsciously. They saw a figure striding through the sea of stars on the horizon. He seemed to be strolling over idly, but he would cross an extremely great distance with each step.","He had yet to arrive, but the senses of his soul had already reached over from extremely far away, enveloping everyone here.","The sense of the soul was not that powerful to some of the Immortal Exalts present, but it was filled with an aura of forcefulness that overwhelmed everyone present.","“It’s an ancestor of the Immortal Feather sect, the Wayless Immortal Exalt!” the Old Monolith Immortal of the Ancient Immortal sect said sternly. There was wariness in his eyes.","In the eyes of the owners of the medicinal gardens, the Wayless Immortal Exalt was not particularly powerful, but his background left them with second thoughts.","“Here comes another court of heaven, and he’s specially come for Yang Yutian. It’s getting interesting now. Let’s see if the Heavenly Star Palace can still protect Yang Yutian...”","“Hehe, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star from the Heavenly Star Palace can be pointed at us fearlessly. Let’s see whether it can be pointed at the Immortal Feather sect...”","“I never thought that the Wayless Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Feather sect would arrive so quickly. Looks like someone must have contacted him beforehand...”","......","...","The Wayless Immortal Exalt’s arrival made Xing Caijian frown. With the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star in hand, she could deter everyone else present, including the Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, but she could not deter the Wayless Immortal Exalt.","“ Why have they arrived so soon? We’re in trouble now. ” Xing Caijian grumbled inside. She knew that there was a feud between Jian Chen and the Immortal Feather sect. As a result, she had been gambling that the Immortal Feather sect would not be so well-informed and would not arrive so quickly.","However, she had lost her gamble.","The Wayless Immortal Exalt stopped several kilometres away from Jian Chen. To him, this distance was no different from being inches away.","“You sure know how to hide. Finding you sure wasn’t easy. I heard Tian Changji and the other two both died by your hands in the Skyscraping World. Is that true?” The Wayless Immortal Exalt stared at Jian Chen coldly. Killing intent surged inside him.","He had already heard some reports regarding what had occurred in the Skyscraping World. Even though it was not very complete, he had confirmed something extremely important. The treasure that could rapidly heal wounds was actually a sovereign god artifact!","He had to obtain the sovereign god artifact no matter what. He could not let it fall into the hands of the Heavenly Star Palace.","“That’s right, the three of them did indeed die by my hands. Coupled with the Immortal Emperor who grasped the Laws of Space from last time, four great elders of your Immortal Feather sect have died by my hands.” Jian Chen smiled at the Wayless Immortal Exalt. From how relaxed he seemed, it was as if he had done something of little significance.","“Hmph, having offended our Immortal Feather sect, your fate is already set in stone. No one can change it,” the Wayless Immortal Exalt said coldly. He looked at Xing Caijian who stood beside Jian Chen and said, “Xing Caijian, you know about the grievance between us and this person. Does your Heavenly Star Palace truly plan on protecting this person?”"]},{"number":3958,"title":"Chapter 3958: The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt","paragraphs":["The Wayless Immortal Exalt’s behaviour was rather oppressive. He was completely fearless before Xing Caijian and the organisation behind her, the Heavenly Star Palace.","Back when he still did not know that Jian Chen’s recovery item was a sovereign god artifact, their Immortal Feather sect had already announced a bounty, wanting to find him even if it meant flipping every stone in the Immortals’ World.","Now that they knew it was a sovereign god artifact, they had even fewer reasons to let him go.","“Your Immortal Feather sect has become interested in the sovereign god artifact on Yang Yutian, so you want to kill him and take his treasure?” Xing Caijian asked emotionlessly.","“Hmph, sovereign god artifacts may be precious, but it’s not like our Immortal Feather sect doesn’t have them. Why would we do something like this for the sake of a mere item? Our Immortal Feather sect wants this person captured because he’s already killed four of our great elders,” the Wayless Immortal Exalt said coldly. There were many Immortal Exalts in the surroundings. He definitely could not earn the Immortal Feather sect a reputation for murder and stealing.","“I never thought that as one of the courts of heaven, the Immortal Feather sect would actually be so shameless. You had four great elders die because you asked for it,” Jian Chen suddenly said.","“Junior, what did you just say?” The Wayless Immortal Exalt glared at Jian Chen. His fury surged.","“I said you asked for it. When I competed for the Thousand Immortal General’s position in the Observance Heaven City, your Immortal Feather sect made things difficult for me at every turn. Even after I left the Observance Heaven City, you specially sent an Immortal Emperor who had grasped the Laws of Space to chase me down. If you hadn’t done that, would that Immortal Emperor have died in outer space?”","Jian Chen continued, “Thinking of it now, perhaps it was not just due to the Thousand Immortal General’s position that the Immortal Feather sect made things difficult for me time and time again. The great elder of your Immortal Feather sect, Xia Tianming, lost by my hand, which made you embarrassed. Most importantly, the treasure I possess caught your attention right from the beginning. You want to kill me for it.”","“How dare you. Junior, how can you slander our Immortal Feather sect like this? Regardless, it’s the stone cold truth that you’ve killed great elders of our Immortal Feather sect.”","“It’s quite simple to tell whether it’s slander or not. You only need to slightly investigate in the Observance Heaven City to find out about everything,” said Jian Chen.","“The truth from back then is no longer important. No matter who’s in the wrong, the four great elders of our Immortal Feather sect can’t die for nothing.”","Right when the Wayless Immortal Exalt wanted to speak up, a vigorous voice flooded the surroundings. The voice was very calm and even slightly approachable. It was extremely amicable. However, when everyone heard the voice, they shuddered inside.","From the calm voice, all of them could sense an invisible pressure.","The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster who sipped tea leisurely on an immortal vessel while keeping his presence concealed narrowed his eyes slightly. His hand that held the cup paused momentarily.","A blinding ball of light silently appeared before the Wayless Immortal Exalt. Through the ball of light, it was only possible to make out a slender figure.","“The Cloud Furnace Master of the Sword Sect of Jade Clouds greets senior Thousand Daggeraxe...”","“The master of the Path of Truth and Illusion greets senior Thousand Daggeraxe...”","“Myriad Gold of the Gold Yang sect greets senior Thousand Daggeraxe...”","......","...","None of them could see his face, but many people here were not unfamiliar with his identity. As their faces changed, they all composed themselves without any arrogance and bowed towards him in greeting.","Xing Caijian became even more stern. She stared straight at the figure that basked in resplendent light as if she was facing a powerful opponent.","The Thousand Daggeraxe Ancestor was a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt from the Immortal Feather sect!","The Seventh Heavenly Layer was already the realm of late Immortal Exalt. There was a tremendous difference compared to the Sixth Heavenly Layer.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had already slain a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt in the Skyscraping World. With the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s abilities, she did not fear such an expert.","However, if she actually pointed the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star at the Immortal Feather sect, then it would have severe implications.","“Yang Yutian? Chang Yang? Jian Chen? I don’t care what your name is, nor do I care what your identity or background is. I care even less about who’s right between you and Wayless. I’ve only come here for one reason, the deaths of the four great elders of our sect. How do you plan on explaining yourself to us?” the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt said calmly.","He spoke calmly, but he also gave off an undefiable sense of authority.","He did not care about right and wrong, nor did he care about the process. He only looked at the end result.","In other words, even if the Wayless Immortal Exalt had been wrong the entire time, even if Jian Chen was only fighting back in self-defence, even if Jian Chen had suffered significant harm and losses during this time, the Thousand Soul Immortal Exalt cared about none of that. However, as long as Jian Chen had the courage to harm people of the Immortal Feather sect and embarrass the Immortal Feather sect, he had to give the Immortal Feather sect a satisfying explanation.","This was a form of harassment, reiterating the principle that it was perfectly right and proper for the Immortal Feather sect to oppress other cultivators, and it was a heinous crime for them to oppress back.","Jian Chen furrowed his brows slightly. The attitude that the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt gave off made him feel like he could not be reasoned with.","“You have nothing to say? If that’s the case, I’ll give you a choice. Offer up the sovereign god artifact on you, and we’ll forget all about the fact that you’ve killed four great elders of our Immortal Feather sect,” the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt continued. He said that in front of everyone. He made no attempt to hide it.","When he heard that, the Wayless Immortal Exalt panicked. There were so many Immortal Exalts gathered here. Each one of them represented a peak organisation that dominated a region. If he openly demonstrated his desire for the sovereign god artifact before these people, it would damage the reputation of the Immortal Feather sect.","Even if they wanted the sovereign god artifact, they could not be so direct.","However, the Wayless Immortal Exalt did not have the courage to say anything or even show the slightest hint of displeasure towards the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s method of handling things even when he found it rather inappropriate.","“So the sovereign god artifact on me has also caught your eye, senior!” Jian Chen laughed. He looked around, glancing past the owners of the medicinal gardens. “However, you’re not the only one who’s taken a liking to my sovereign god artifact, senior Thousand Daggeraxe. All of the seniors around here are determined to obtain the sovereign god artifact. In order to obtain it, some of them are even bold enough to offend the Heavenly Star Palace. I just wonder if you’ll be able to hold onto the sovereign god artifact if I handed it over to you, senior Thousand Daggeraxe.”","In the surroundings, the eyes of many of the powerful Immortal Exalts shone with a strange light. A recovery sovereign god artifact was far too tempting to them. Once they possessed it, it was equivalent to obtaining an undying body. For the sake of that, they would be willing to give up everything without any hesitation. They could even abandon their sects.","The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt was very powerful, a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, but he came nowhere close to the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star that bore a heavenly emperor’s power.","“As long as I’m still here, all of you can forget about forcing a guest of our Heavenly Star Palace to do anything. Senior Heavenly Star, please protect Yang Yutian,” Xing Caijian said coldly.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star immediately appeared over Jian Chen’s head.","“Little girl, does your Heavenly Star Palace really want to oppose our Immortal Feather sect?” The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt looked at Xing Cajian. His voice was just as gentle as before. “Our Immortal Feather sect also possesses sovereign god artifacts. I don’t wish for the relationship between the Immortal Feather sect and Heavenly Star Palace to be reduced to such a level.”"]},{"number":3959,"title":"Chapter 3959: The Feather Plume Fan","paragraphs":["“I don’t wish for the relationship between the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect to break down either. Senior, please stop making things difficult for this guest of our Heavenly Star Palace,” said Xing Caijian. She could not afford to back down at all given the current situation.","“Can your so-called guest compare to the four great elders of our Immortal Feather sect?” The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt was slightly angered. Shortly afterwards, he struck out without the slightest hesitation, directly extending his hand towards Jian Chen.","With the strike of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, a terrifying pressure immediately flooded the space, forcing back some of the early Immortal Exalts nearby.","A huge crack appeared in the space there, extending from the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt to Jian Chen. Destructive energy shook up the area. Even mid Immortal Exalts as powerful as the owners of the medicinal gardens were stern.","They truly understood the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s strength when he struck out. As a paramount ancestor of a court of heaven, his strength could not be compared to regular Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Jian Chen felt a colossal threat press closer. The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s palm strike seemed to freeze the space. An invisible force immobilised him.","At that moment, he even developed the illusion that even if he used the Divine Formation of the Heavens, it would not be able to rival this attack.","The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt was far more powerful than the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt he had encountered in the Skyscraping World.","Of course, Jian Chen was unaware that the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was unable to use his full strength as a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt due to the incompatible body.","At this moment, the clear thrum of a sword pierced through the air. The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star shone with blinding light, slashing through the space and shattering all of the laws. It turned into a resplendent curtain of light that surrounded Jian Chen.","A terrifying power rampaged within the curtain of light, sending the laws in the surroundings into chaos.","The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s palm strike was blocked by the curtain of light. It failed to penetrate it.","“Since your Heavenly Star Palace insists on doing this, you better not blame our Immortal Feather sect for what happens next.” The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s face sank. A tremendous presence radiated from his body, making the galaxies rotate backwards.","As the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt formed a seal with his hands, his tremendous energy condensed into an ancient imprint. It contained devastating power.","However, he did not send the imprint in his hand towards Jian Chen. Instead, he raised his hand and pointed up above his head. The imprint shot over his head with destructive power. Shortly afterwards, a multicoloured swirl rapidly condensed over his head. The space there fluctuated violently as if it was being compressed to its limits under the influence of an invisible force.","Very soon, a unique space appeared in the centre of the five-coloured swirl. There were no celestial bodies inside, only an expanse of majestic buildings, shining with hazy light.","“That’s the Immortal Feather sect. The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt has opened space using a secret technique, constructing a spatial bridge to bypass the tremendous distance and directly connect with the other side!”","“The Immortal Feather sect is extremely distant from here. Reaching the Immortal Feather sect will require crossing over a dozen heavens. We would need to take a very long time despite our speed. I never thought that the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt could actually overcome the distance like this...”","“Even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts can’t cross such a great distance instantly, right? This is almost the ability of Grand Exalts...”","Looking at the cluster of structures that appeared in the swirl of energy, many of the Immortal Exalts present were shocked.","At this moment, the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt raised his head. He looked at the depths of the buildings and said, “Elder brother, lend me the Feather Plume Fan!”","The hearts of all the Immortal Exalts tightened. At that moment, they could sense a pair of invisible eyes glance over through the expansive space.","Just an invisible glance brought tremendous pressure upon the Immortal Exalts present.","“ That’s... the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor... ”","“ That has to be the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor. Apart from the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, who else can make us feel such terrifying pressure... ”","Many of the Immortal Exalts there were astounded.","At the same time, the pressure from a sovereign god artifact suddenly emanated from the buildings. Shortly afterwards, a colossal fan appeared silently. It was far too large, blotting out the sky and replacing the surroundings. Even the swathe of buildings from the Immortal Feather sect seemed so significant before the fan.","At this moment, countless cultivators emerged from the buildings of the Immortal Feather sect. They all gazed at the sky in a shaken manner.","In the next moment, the colossal fan suddenly vanished. A streak of light shot out from the buildings of the Immortal Feather sect, crossing through the tunnel between the two locations. Immediately, it arrived before the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt and ended up in his hand.","That was the sovereign god artifact of the Immortal Feather sect, the Feather Plume Fan!","However, the Feather Plume Fan had already become a fraction of its previous size. It had turned into the size of a regular fan.","Everyone’s eyes were glued to the Feather Plume Fan. The Feather Plume Fan was surrounded in blinding light, radiating with the terrifying pressure of a sovereign god artifact. No one could see its true appearance.","Xing Caijian’s face became ugly.","“Little girl, I’ll ask you one last time. Are you going to hand him over or not?” Wielding the Feather Plume Fan, the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s confidence immediately swelled.","The two sovereign god artifacts were directed towards one another. A battle was on the brink of erupting!","“Please settle down, the two of you!” The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster finally stepped forward. He stood between Xing Caijian and the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt and tried to persuade them. “The consequence from the clash of sovereign god artifacts is far too severe. Even the space that hides the Skyscraping World will be affected. Please don’t be impulsive.”","“Illusion-condensing Swordmaster, there’s none of your business here. If you want to settle the conflict between our Immortal Feather sect and the Heavenly Star Palace, there’s only one way, which is to let us take Yang Yutian’s sovereign god artifact. If he agrees, our Immortal Feather sect will not pursue the deaths of the four great elders anymore,” the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt said.","When he heard that, the Wayless Immortal Exalt sighed inside again and again. This attitude was far too straightforward. Couldn’t he be a little more discreet? After all, there were all these ancestors of other organisations in the surroundings.","“Caijian, the situation has already developed like this. Does your Heavenly Star Palace still plan on protecting this person?” The Illusion-condensing Swordmaster glanced at Xing Caijian helplessly. The Immortal Feather sect had created such a great disturbance. They had even mobilised their sect treasure, the Feather Plume Fan. This was no longer a matter of taking revenge for the four great elders.","Their eyes were already set on the regenerative sovereign god artifact!","“I will not give up!” Xing Caijian’s gaze was determined. Her will was unwavering.","“You still won’t give up? If that’s the case, then show me exactly what you’re going to use to protect this person.” The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s eyes turned cold. In the next moment, the sovereign god artifact in his hands erupted with light. The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt swung the Feather Plume Fan at the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star."]},{"number":3960,"title":"Chapter 3960: The Heavenly Emperor Arrives","paragraphs":["With the swing of the Feather Plume Fan, resplendent light immediately wove together in the air, forming a destructive whirlwind that rushed towards the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star.","As the whirlwind advanced, the turbulent power it contained tore space to shreds like paper. Even the laws were affected, producing fluctuations.","“Oh no! Retreat! Retreat quickly!”","The Immortal Exalts present retreated again and again with their disciples and subordinates. Their faces were filled with madness as they completely left the area.","Even Zuo Dao and the Heavenloss Master who were the closest to Jian Chen immediately fled into the distance, afraid of being affected by the clash.","The destructive whirlwind created by the Feather Plume Fan made contact with the curtain produced by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. As the two powers collided, the space split open silently. A ten-metre-wide black hole appeared, emitting a great suction force. It absorbed all of the destructive power produced by the clash between the two sovereign god artifacts.","The first clash between the two sovereign god artifacts ended silently. It did not have too great an impact on the surroundings as originally anticipated.","Of course, that was because they were both intentionally controlling their power. Otherwise, the destructive storms created from a full-powered clash could easily heavily injure early Immortal Exalts given the might of two sovereign god artifacts powered by the energy of heavenly emperors.","The curtain that the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star used to protect Jian Chen shook violently. The sword intent inside dissipated rapidly. It was quickly depleted by the destructive whirlwind produced by the Feather Plume Fan.","Shortly afterwards, the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt swung the Feather Plume Fan again. The power this time was clearly even greater. The blinding light wove together, shining even brighter than a sun. No one could stare directly at it.","Immediately, the curtain produced by the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star shook even more violently. Tiny cracks had already been ripped open.","But very soon, a new power emerged from the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, stabilising the shaking sword intent.","“With just the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, your Heavenly Star Palace won’t be able to protect this person!” The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt stared at the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star icily.","As soon as he said that, the Feather Plume Fan left his control, turning into a ball of blinding light that shot towards the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. Wherever it passed by, space twisted as time descended into chaos. It used absolute force to interfere with the stability of this time and space.","In the next moment, the Feather Plume Fan and the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star vanished at the same time. It had forcefully dragged the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star into a spatial crack. It unleashed its pressure as a sovereign god artifact without holding back, embroiling in a startling battle.","At that moment, everyone could see two balls of blinding light constantly clash in the depths of the spatial crack, erupting with devastating might.","The Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star might have been a complete sovereign god artifact, but the Feather Plume Fan of the Immortal Feather sect was no weaker. Coupled with the fact that they both contained the energy of heavenly emperors, the difference between them was not that large. Their battle would not reach a conclusion any time soon.","However, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star served as Xing Caijian’s greatest weapon in her arsenal. Now that it was occupied by the Feather Plume Fan, she no longer possessed a trump card that could fend off the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt.","“Little girl, let’s see how you protect this person now,” said the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt as if victory was already within his grasp. An invisible power emanated from his body, immediately flooding this space and turning it into an individual domain.","Anything that occurred within this domain would be in the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s grasp.","He clearly took this additional step to prevent Jian Chen from escaping.","“Senior, do you really think our Heavenly Star Palace is powerless once you keep the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star occupied? Today, your Immortal Feather sect definitely won’t be able to take Yang Yutian away.” Xing Caijian’s face was frosty. She yelled out at the empty space, “Dad, if you still don’t come out, your daughter is going to be bullied by the Immortal Feather sect.”","When he heard that, the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s face changed drastically. He immediately stopped hesitating, taking action decisively. He used his immense cultivation to condense a hand that reached towards Jian Chen, wanting to forcefully abduct him before the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor arrived.","“How dare you! I’d like to see who has the courage to bully my daughter!” At this moment, a resounding voice boomed through the world. A sea of stars appeared in an empty patch of space, glimmering with countless specks. Each star was blinding, possessing unimaginable power.","Shortly afterwards, one of the stars emitted a blinding streak of light. It pierced through the void, penetrating the hand of energy before slamming into the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s chest mercilessly with its residual power.","Boom! With a grunt, the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt staggered backwards. His organs surged as his face became flushed.","On the other side, the sea of stars condensed together to form a resplendent figure. The power of stars revolved around him like he was an embodiment of galaxies.","That was the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor!","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s appearance made the surroundings surge. Many of the Immortal Exalts felt their blood boil with emotion and excitement.","Even across the entire Immortals’ World, heavenly emperors were lofty figures, only second to Grand Exalts. To many Immortal Exalts, someone like that only existed in legends. They could spend their entire lives without ever being able to witness someone like that in person.","As a result, being able to personally witness the glory of a heavenly emperor was something worth boasting about for many early Immortal Exalts.","“Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, I never thought you’d actually come in person.” The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt stared straight at the figure condensed from the stars. There was deep wariness in the depths of his eyes.","“How bold of your Immortal Feather sect, to think that you’d even have the courage to bully my daughter. Hmph, if my daughter is even missing a hair, I’ll bring a whole gang of people from the Heavenly Star Palace to your Immortal Feather sect. We’ll flip your ancestral grounds upside down,” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said furiously. He was forceful and blunt, clearly revealing that his doting for his daughter had already reached the point where he could no longer be reasoned with.","“Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, your Heavenly Star Palace is being far too forceful.” An obscure voice rang out. It was gentle and tranquil as if it could influence the emotions of the cultivators present. Everyone who heard the voice, regardless of cultivation, became extremely calm inside. They felt like all of their restlessness and negative emotions had been pacified.","This was the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s voice. It originated from the spatial tunnel created by the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt through a secret technique.","Since the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had appeared, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor could not remain hidden behind the scenes anymore.","“Soaring Immortal, you want to bully my daughter too?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor snorted coldly. The starlight around him became blinding. A beam of almost-tangible light shot out from his eyes, piercing the spatial tunnel with unstoppable might. It directly entered the vicinity of the Immortal Feather sect like the might of the heavens.","A huge eye opened within the darkness behind the structures of the Immortal Feather sect, meeting the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s tangible gaze. As the invisible powers collided, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s gaze gradually dispersed.","At that moment, many cultivators looked at the sky with pale faces between the structures in the Immortal Feather sect. The meeting of the two gazes made them feel extremely oppressed like they were about to suffocate to death.","Some of the upper echelon from the Immortal Feather sect felt uneasy inside. They had no idea what had happened that had actually left the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor so furious.","“Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, are you provoking my Immortal Feather sect?” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s grand voice rang out again, filled with great authority.","“Hahahaha, a mighty Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt has actually come here in person to bully my daughter. My daughter isn’t even an Immortal Exalt yet. Your Immortal Feather sect has gone so far, yet you still have the face to say I’m provoking you? Yeah, I am provoking you. So what?” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said furiously. He had a child at such an advanced age. His daughter did not come easily, so he obviously doted on her dearly. How could he let his own daughter suffer even the slightest?","In the distance, the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster sighed inside. He had underestimated Xing Caijian’s status in the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s heart. He had also underestimated the lengths that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was willing to go to for the sake of her. If Xing Caijian were missing even a hair, he had no doubt that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor would go to war against the Immortal Feather sect.","As for whether the Heavenly Star Palace would actually fall out with the Immortal Feather sect, that no longer seemed so important anymore."]},{"number":3961,"title":"Chapter 3961: The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor","paragraphs":["In the spatial tunnel, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor fell silent momentarily. It seemed like he also did not expect the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor to be willing to go to war over something as trifling as his daughter being harassed.","That also renewed the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s understanding of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s doting for his daughter.","“Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, this kid has killed four great elders of our Immortal Feather sect. When we tried to capture him, Xing Caijian stood forward and stopped us. How do you plan on explaining this, Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor?” the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt said sternly.","“He is truly audacious to the extreme to kill four great elders of our Immortal Feather sect. If your Heavenly Star Palace cannot give us a satisfying proposal to settle this, a battle between us will be unavoidable.” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s authoritative voice rang out from the spatial tunnel, also filled with determination.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor furrowed his brows when he heard that. The Immortal Feather sect had lost four great elders? That was not a small matter.","He turned towards Xing Caijian, and all of the forcefulness in his voice vanished. It was replaced by gentleness and deep doting. “Tell your father, why are you protecting this person so much? You weren’t like this before. What you’ve done today is even making me suspect that you’ve been possessed. Why have you suddenly developed interest in a man, going as far as to risk your life to protect him?”","“Though, your actions are quite similar to what I did back then.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor seemed to remember a memory. He said emotionally, “Back then, when I first met your mother, my behaviour was not too different either. No matter how great the resistance I faced, I did everything I could to protect her.”","As soon as he reached there, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor suddenly felt that something was amiss. He stared at Xing Caijian in interest and said in surprise, “D-don’t tell me you’ve taken a liking to this kid?”","When this thought crossed the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s head, it became more believable the more he thought about it. He subconsciously looked at Jian Chen and said, “Kid, you sure are fortunate to obtain such an extraordinary mask. This should be left behind by a supreme expert of the Illusion Daemon race. With this mask disguising you, there are only a small handful of people even across the entire Immortals’ World who can see through it. Though, you do have quite a striking appearance, so you are worthy of my daughter.”","“Though, the only thing that displeases me is that you’ve created quite a large inconvenience for the Heavenly Star Palace.”","Xing Caijian was in a daze. She stared straight at the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. Her face was filled with extreme speechlessness and disbelief. She never imagined that her father would come up with such an inconceivable idea.","Actually, it was not the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s fault for coming up with an idea like that. He understood his daughter far too well. Over all these years, Xing Caijian had never shown any interest in any man, yet she had suddenly placed such great emphasis on an unfamiliar man, even going as far as risking her life to protect him. Apart from developing feelings for him, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was unable to come up with any other reason.","“Dad, what kind of nonsense are you on about? Yang Yutian is only my acquaintance. It’s nothing like what you said.” Xing Caijian immediately became exasperated once she returned to her senses.","“Hehe, you’ve lost your cool just with this? Looks like I’m right.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor behaved like he had already seen through her.","“Whatever, I can’t be bothered with explaining it to you. Senior Heavenly Star knows the reason. You can go ask senior Heavenly Star.” Xing Caijian snorted gently.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor reached out and ripped open the space with absolute force, directly extending his hand into the spatial crack as if he could bypass any concept of distance. He immediately grabbed the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star that battled the Feather Plume Fan in the depths of the spatial crack before forcefully bringing it back.","In the next moment, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star returned, hovering before the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","At the same time, the Feather Plume Fan returned from the spatial crack as well, radiating with the pressure of a sovereign god artifact as it hovered above the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s head.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor ignored the Feather Plume Fan from the Immortal Feather sect. He looked at the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, having begun communicating with its artifact spirit already.","But very soon, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor trembled gently. It was extremely gentle, but this only demonstrated just how much shock he felt for something like that to happen to an expert of his level.","On the other side, the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt was stern. The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had already found out about the existence of the sovereign god artifact. If the Heavenly Star Palace really were to participate in this scramble for it, the matter would become troublesome. There was even a possibility for the situation to lose control and develop in unexpected ways.","“ No matter what, I can’t let the Heavenly Star Palace leave with the sovereign god artifact. A sovereign god artifact that primarily focuses on recovery is even more important than offensive sovereign god artifacts. If this item falls into the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s possession, none of the twelve courts of heaven will be able to threaten him anymore apart from the Waymight clan... ” the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt thought. He was certain that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor also understood this fact.","On the other hand, if the soveriegn god artifact ended up in the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s possession, the Immortal Feather sect’s strength would definitely swell among the twelve courts of heaven.","On the other side, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor turned his head slowly, looking at Jian Chen sternly for the first time. However, his current body was condensed from the endless stars. His entire figure was surrounded in starlight, obscuring his face, so no one was able to see the emotion on the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s face right now.","Jian Chen’s heart tightened. He felt an invisible gaze land on him as if it was trying to see through him completely.","The last time he experienced this feeling was when he faced the Heavenly Talisman Venerable in person in the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.","Both the Heavenly Talisman Venerable and the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor could see through him with a single glance. Even though heavenly emperors could not see through all of his secrets any more as his strength increased, the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race would still be useless before them.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor stared at Jian Chen silently. He did not say a single word, nor did he take any action. Only a while later did he slowly look away, turning his attention back to the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt. “You can’t take this person with you!”","This time, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s voice was very calm, but his calm tone made the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt’s heart sink suddenly. He could already hear the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s determination from it.","“Senior heavenly emperor, as long as Yang Yutian hands over the sovereign god artifact on him, our feud with him will be settled in its entirety,” the Wayless Immortal Exalt said sternly.","“Your Immortal Feather sect actually chooses to be so shameless. Hmph, you want the sovereign god artifact? I’m afraid your Immortal Feather sect isn’t capable enough!” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor gripped the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star’s hilt. His presence erupted.","“Does your Heavenly Star Palace really want to go to war with our Immortal Feather sect?” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s voice rang out from the spatial tunnel, expressing his determination.","“War it is then! Am I supposed to be afraid of you?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor flared up over the slightest provocation. As his presence swelled, the endless starlight on him immediately rushed upwards, forming a glorious galaxy that charged directly into the spatial tunnel with magnificent colour.","The spatial tunnel shook violently as if it was about to shatter from the tremendous power. However, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s power swept over, forcefully propping up the spatial tunnel that was on the brink of collapse.","On the other side in the Immortal Feather sect, the faces of countless disciples paled. The power of the heavenly emperor descended with a great disturbance. The devastating might was enough to collapse the minds of those with weaker mental fortitude.","Before the vast power, even some Immortal Exalts could not help but develop a feeling of insignificance.","This was the power of a heavenly emperor, the extreme might from a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Its strength could no longer be compared to regular Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts."]},{"number":3962,"title":"Chapter 3962: Arriving in Person","paragraphs":["The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s galaxial force was tremendous. Right when it was about to emerge from the spatial tunnel created by the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt through a secret technique, a cold snort suddenly rang out from the depths of the Immortal Feather sect like a crack of thunder. The terrifying sound wave tore through space, creating a visible ripple that swept through the area in a forceful manner. Wherever it passed by, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s tremendous pressure was repelled.","Immediately, the weaker disciples in the Immortal Feather sect felt the pressure on them lighten. The tremendous might from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had already been blocked outside by the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s cold snort.","At the same time, a blinding ball of light lit up behind the structures of the Immortal Feather sect. A colossal figure completely composed of light sat in the air, even larger than a planet. Who knew how tall it was. The entire area that the Immortal Feather sect occupied resided entirely in the colossal figure’s dantian.","When the figure appeared, the eyes of all of the upper echelon of the Immortal Feather sect burned with admiration. Some of them even dropped to their knees immediately.","They had already noticed that the indomitable figure that had the might to look down on all was the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s manifestation!","In the entire Immortal Feather sect, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was like a god. He was basically the representation of invincibility, a paramount existence that could not be defeated!","In the next moment, a feather condensed before the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s colossal manifestation. It was pure-white and flawless, possessing a holy glow. It contained enough power to make the world tremble.","With a flash, the feather unleashed terrifying power, slicing open the heavens, penetrating the galaxies, and vanishing into the spatial tunnel with devastating power.","Boom!","An explosion rang out in the spatial tunnel. It was deafening. The powerful sound waves twisted space and shattered the world. The feather glowed blindingly, confronting the tremendous force of stars in the spatial tunnel. The collision between these two great forces completely destroyed the spatial tunnel created by the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt.","The spatial tunnel was destroyed, but the distance between these two places remained the same. The collision of the two powers created a new tunnel of energy.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s tremendous force had been blocked inside the spatial tunnel, preventing it from truly descending upon the Immortal Feather sect. Meanwhile, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s feather had also halted in the tunnel of energy, unable to advance a step forward.","During this long-distance clash, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor were evenly-matched.","Of course, these attacks could only be considered as casual strikes from both of them. It could not even be described as serious. Even if they kept fighting for several tens of thousand years like this, the outcome would remain undecided.","“Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, it’s still not too late for you to turn back. If you insist on stopping me from taking Yang Yutian away, I won’t be holding back anymore.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s resonant voice rang out.","“I don’t want to say the same words twice!” the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor said coldly. He was extremely determined. He refused to back down.","“If that’s the case, then let’s keep fighting!” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor yelled out. A great power of the soul emerged from his body, condensing into a resplendent illusionary body that directly entered the energy tunnel.","At the same time, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s power of the soul also strode through the air, entering the energy tunnel. As the figures of light met, the two heavenly emperors engaged in an even more vicious battle.","These attacks did not result in any deafening rumbles of energy. There were only explosions of the power of the soul. It was silent, but it was extremely vicious. The slightest carelessness would result in injuries to the soul.","Surging powers of the soul shook up the surroundings, turning into an invisible storm that ravaged the sea of stars. It made the nearby cultivators feel like their souls were shaking, like they were under attack instead.","A blinding formation had already unfurled within the Immortal Feather sect, forming an impenetrable barrier around the entire sect.","Once a formation of such scale was activated, it would place an extremely great strain on their resources. Now that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor were engaging in a long-ranged battle, the Immortal Feather sect was forced to pay this cost.","Neither the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor nor the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor would give up on Jian Chen.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor knew Jian Chen’s true identity. He wanted to grant him protection.","Meanwhile, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s attention was on the sovereign god artifact that could heal people indefinitely.","Whether it was the deaths of the four great elders or the temptation from the sovereign god artifact, the Immortal Feather sect refused to back down on either.","They were asking for the sovereign god artifact to compensate for the deaths of the four great elders. Reason was on their side. They were not concerned with any public criticism.","As a result, it could be described as a heaven-sent opportunity for the Immortal Feather sect!","The soul battle between the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was extremely vicious. They stood within the energy tunnel, propping the place up with their cultivation. Their figures met again and again, colliding time after time silently. They fought to the point where the surrounding space sank into chaos. The laws descended into disorder.","Suddenly, a brilliant star lit up within the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s soul like a sun. As violent energy swept out, a great boom erupted. A devastating storm completely swallowed the energy tunnel.","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor let out a grunt. His soul that had entered the energy tunnel had been repelled, returning to his body with a long trail of light, vanishing into the depths of the Immortal Feather sect.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s soul also returned to his body. Afterwards, he raised his finger and pointed at the energy tunnel in the distance. The laws wove towards and manifested, turning into a sea of hazy starlight that collapsed the tunnel.","Boom! An explosion rang out from the space there. The energy tunnel linked to the Immortal Feather sect immediately blurred. The view of the Immortal Feather sect completely disappeared.","“Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor!” A furious growl rang out from the depths of the Immortal Feather sect. A resplendent streak of light turned into a bridge and pierced through space, directly penetrating the collapsing swirl of energy. It reached over from the Immortal Feather sect to the nearby space of the Skyscraping World.","Wherever the bridge passed by, the collapsing tunnel of energy actually stabilised once more.","In the next moment, a blinding figure appeared on one end of the bridge. His presence surged, churning up the surroundings. He advanced with an invincible gait, entering the collapsing swirl of energy in a single step. He instantly crossed the tremendous distance between them, truly arriving in the space near the Skyscraping World.","Immediately, a mighty presence flooded the surroundings. The expressions of all of the cultivators nearby changed drastically.","They could already tell that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had arrived in person! He basked in a resplendent haze, standing there like a divine being. They could only make out a rough figure.","“You sure don’t know how to give up.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor sneered. He reached out, and the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star had already appeared in his hand.","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor also extended his hand and made a gesture. The Feather Plume Fan appeared in his hand. “Chaotic Star, you can’t protect this person!”","“Don’t you just have an additional Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt? Do you think my Heavenly Star Palace has no one else?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor sneered."]},{"number":3963,"title":"Chapter 3963: The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor","paragraphs":["“Looks like you’re also determined to obtain this kid’s sovereign god artifact. However, the people of your Heavenly Star Palace aren’t going to get here that quickly. With me to stop you, just Thousand Daggeraxe is enough to deal with him.” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was confident.","“Does your Immortal Feather sect really plan on fighting our Heavenly Star Palace to the death?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s voice became frosty.","The atmosphere in the surroundings immediately became extremely oppressive. An intense clash between two heavenly emperors would be a major matter even to the entire Immortals’ World.","“ Senior, just let me leave by myself. ” At this moment, Jian Chen communicated to the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor from behind him.","He was currently surrounded by the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power of stars. The contents of his message were perfectly hidden, so even the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor could not eavesdrop on their conversation.","“ Don’t worry. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor won’t be able to take you away. With me around, no one will be able to touch you today, ” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor replied. His gruff voice became much gentler.","“ But if I don’t go, a battle between the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect will be unavoidable. That’s not something I want to see, ” Jian Chen said.","“ If we fight, then we fight. What’s there to be afraid of? Since you are the successor chosen by the twin swords, then you are equivalent to the old senior’s disciple. Even if our Heavenly Star Palace mobilises every single person, we’ll ensure your safety. ” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was determined. Afterwards, following a slight pause, he said, “ Moreover, just the Immortal Feather sect is not enough to force our Heavenly Star Palace into such a situation. ”","“ Senior, the conflict between the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect is completely avoidable. I have the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race to disguise me. As long as I leave, it’s virtually impossible for the Immortal Feather sect to find me. On the other hand, if I remain here, not only will a battle between the Immortal Feather sect and the Heavenly Star Palace be unavoidable, but the matter probably will not end here today either, ” Jian Chen said sternly. He had realised that if he stayed here, the situation would only become worse.","“ No. Letting you leave alone is just too dangerous. ” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s voice was filled with concern.","“ Senior heavenly emperor, please forgive me for saying this. I don’t really know the exact relationship between the twelve courts of heaven, but I can roughly guess that even the courts of heaven will have hostile and friendly relationships with one another. The Immortal Feather sect has already made up their minds about seeing the situation today to the very end. They won’t be backing down. Senior heavenly emperor can stop the Immortal Feather sect, but if you press the Immortal Feather sect too far, the Heavenly Star Palace will probably still struggle if they decide to invite other courts of heaven to support them. ” Jian Chen tried to persuade him.","“ Hahahaha, little brother, you underestimate just how much sway your identity holds. I can’t guarantee anything else, but once you disclose your identity, at least half of the courts of heaven will stand on your side. The Immortal Feather sect is nothing, ” said the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","“ Senior, it is inconvenient for me to disclose my identity prematurely. Let alone the fact that we don’t know exactly how many courts of heaven will sincerely want to help me, even if eleven of them are sincere, so what? As long as one court of heaven secretly disagrees, I am still in danger, ” Jian Chen said in a daze.","When he heard that, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s eyes shone. He immediately connected what Jian Chen said at the end with something, which made him fall silent.","“ Letting things get out of hand bring us no benefit at all. As a result, please let me leave by myself, senior. ” Jian Chen struck while the iron was hot. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had arrived in person. The nature of things had changed. He did not want the relationship between the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect to devolve past a point of no return either.","Nearby, Xing Caijian was stern as she also stayed under the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s protection. Without the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, their Heavenly Star Palace could protect Jian Chen forcefully. Even the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt could not stop them.","However, she never anticipated the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor to come here in person.","Someone like that virtually spent all of their time in secluded cultivation. Rarely did they ever bother with external affairs. Let alone tens of thousands of years, they could spend millions of years without ever emerging.","Now that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had come in person, Xing Caijian had lost her confidence as well.","“ The Immortal Feather sect is not the only people who want you. There are many mid Immortal Exalts. Yang Yutian, are you certain that you can slip away under their noses? ” Xing Caijian looked at Jian Chen. She was extremely stern. There was also a hint of guilt like she owed him.","She knew that Jian Chen was originally capable of slipping away with ease. In the end, it was her who made him stay, which instead dragged him into this disadvantageous situation.","When he heard what she said, Jian Chen smiled confidently. “ This isn’t the Skyscraping World. In the Skyscraping World, they can use the unique environment to find me easily, but how are they supposed to find me in this expansive Immortals’ World? ”","“ Through the mask and the armour, your concealment is indeed flawless. ” Xing Caijian looked at the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and said, “ Father, given the current situation, we can only let Yang Yutian leave by himself. This stalemate won’t end well. ”","“ Leaving by yourself is riddled with danger. You will face many unknown perils. Have you really made up your mind? ” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said sternly.","“ Please don’t worry, senior. I may come nowhere close to you, senior, but I do have some ability for self-preservation, ” said Jian Chen.","“I’d like to see how your Heavenly Star Palace stops me today!” said the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor coldly. His body erupted with light as he ripped open space. The colour constantly changed within the shattered space. In the end, an old, grey tower appeared from inside. It was riddled with a sense of antiquity. It was very ancient.","However, when the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor saw the grey tower, his face immediately changed.","“Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor, you owed our Immortal Feather sect a favour in the past. Now, I’m going to use this favour to request for your assistance.” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor looked at the tower.","“Against who?” An ancient voice rang out from the tower.","“The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor!” the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor said.","“Chaotic Star?” The voice from the tower was surprised. “You want to use my favour to sow internal discord? Do you really want to do that?”","On the other side, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was stern. He never expected the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor to ask for assistance so decisively. He had even asked for help from another heavenly emperor.","“Oh no! Go!” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor called out. He formed a seal with his fingers before suddenly pointing it at Jian Chen.","Jian Chen only felt a tremendous force wrap around him. By the time he responded, he discovered that he seemed to have turned into a star. In the next moment, the star erupted with devastating power, annihilating space and taking off into the distance with him. He immediately vanished into the end of the sea of stars.","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor obviously would not let Jian Chen leave like this. Great power radiated from his body, turning into a magnificent bridge. It also shattered space, racing after Jian Chen.","Boom! With a rumble, the bridge that pursued Jian Chen shattered. The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had taken action. The resplendent power of stars permeated space, stopping the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor.","“Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor, help me capture that kid!” the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor called out. He was embroiled with the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, so he could not break free. The Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt was unable to catch up to Jian Chen either with his speed.","Right now, Jian Chen travelled away under the power of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. Only Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts could keep up with this unmatched speed.","“You want to use my favour to deal with a junior? Soaring Immortal, you might not find that embarrassing but I do. Sigh, whatever. Who can help the fact that I owe you a favour?” An illusionary figure emerged from the ancient tower. It vanished into the depths of the sea of stars with a single step, chasing after Jian Chen.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s heart suddenly sank. He wanted to stop the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor, but he was busy with the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor.","“ It’ll be troublesome now! ” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was aware that the power he left with Jian Chen was completely insufficient to escape from a supreme expert like the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor. Once the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor caught up, even the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race would be useless."]},{"number":3964,"title":"Chapter 3964: One After Another","paragraphs":["“Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. I’d like to see how you protect this kid now. Do you really think the power you left behind can contend against the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor?” On the other side, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor said with a hint of complacency. He seemed completely unconcerned.","In this battle between their Immortal Feather sect and the Heavenly Star Palace, it was still their Immortal Feather sect that had the slight upper hand at the end of the day.","Victory would mean a sovereign god artifact that could basically heal him indefinitely!","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was indeed extremely interested in this sovereign god artifact, as it could drastically strengthen his battle prowess. It could even make his battle prowess change in a leap.","At their realm of cultivation, every tiny step of progress came with tremendous difficulty, as they had basically reached the limit already. Unless they crossed the final gap and became Grand Exalts, they basically struggled to grow stronger.","As a result, the appearance of the Source of Life tempted the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor very much. He had to obtain it no matter the cost.","“I didn’t want to do this. Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, you forced me,” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said sternly. With a flip of his hand, an exquisite, palm-size jade sword appeared in his hand.","When the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor noticed the jade sword, his eyes immediately narrowed slightly. He cried out, “That is... the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s presence...”","“That’s right, this is indeed the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s keepsake. I didn’t want to invite the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance over here, but with everything that has occurred so far, I have no other choice,” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said sternly before crushing the small jade sword in his hand without any hesitation.","From the moment the tiny sword shattered, the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance sensed it from the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords that was extremely distant.","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor fell silent. The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s name seemed to influence him greatly, causing him very great pressure.","When he faced the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor could remain relaxed, facing him with composure. However, when he faced the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor felt wariness, deep wariness.","From the twelve courts of heaven, if there was anyone that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was so wary about, then it would be the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance.","Even Daowei Fatian’s influence on the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor came nowhere close until he became a Grand Exalt.","......","...","In the depths of the sea of stars, a shooting star shot through the pitch-black darkness, flying off into the distance with unbelievable speed.","The shooting star was obviously the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power.","At this moment, inside the star condensed from tremendous power, Jian Chen was entirely immobilised. He could not even budge a finger. He could only watch helplessly as the surrounding galaxies receded around him.","Under the protection of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power, he rapidly left the region around the Skyscraping World.","But despite that, Jian Chen found no peace at all. Instead, intense danger bubbled inside him, growing stronger and stronger.","He did not know where the danger came from. Even when he released the senses of his soul, pushing it to the limits, he found nothing.","If the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power was not there, Jian Chen would have activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask of the Illusionary Daemon race before fleeing with the Laws of Space. As long as he was far away enough, he believed that even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts would struggle to find him as long as he did not appear directly in their view.","Unfortunately, there was nothing he could do right now. The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power protected him, but it also restrained him.","“You’re a mere Immortal Emperor, yet you’ve set off a battle between the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor and the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. Kid, what exactly did you do to make the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor so furious that he’d be willing to use up the favour I owed him to capture you?”","Right when Jian Chen was confused by the strange sense of danger, an elderly voice rang out from extremely far behind as if it could travel through space.","The voice came from the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor.","The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor did not know about what had happened in the Skyscraping World. Time was too tight, giving him no opportunity to peer into it. As a result, he was filled with curiosity and confusion as he pursued Jian Chen.","However, the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor’s voice made Jian Chen’s heart tighten. The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power was unable to shake off this person?","“I actually have to personally chase down an Immortal Emperor. Given my identity, that is indeed very embarrassing, but upon the thought that I can pay back the favour I owe the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor from back then, it’ll be all for the best. Hahahaha...”","“Kid, you can’t escape. Even if you have the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power taking you away, that’s just power left behind by him. That power alone can’t shake me off.”","“But you have nothing to worry about. I won’t harm you. I’ll only capture and hand you to the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor to pay back the favour I owe him...” the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor said with ease from behind.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power was already weakening. Jian Chen was slowing down and could not last for too long.","At this moment, using the glow of the starlight, Jian Chen captured a distant figure striding through the space behind him. The distance between them rapidly shortened.","Jian Chen was stern. He knew this person’s strength was definitely beyond imagination to be able to catch up to the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power. Even though he did not know who he was, he was definitely even more powerful than a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt like the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt.","An expert like that was well beyond what he could deal with.","But right now, there was nothing that Jian Chen could do. Unless the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power ran out, there was nothing he was capable of.","The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor was already getting closer and closer to Jian Chen. He was about to enter the range of Jian Chen’s senses of the soul. However, due to the overwhelming difference in cultivation, he still could not capture the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor’s existence.","But suddenly, Jian Chen felt the looming danger vanish. When he looked behind him using the starlight, the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor’s figure was already gone.","At this moment, the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor hovered in the sea of stars, staring ahead with furrowed eyebrows. There was a hint of wariness in his elderly gaze.","A middle-aged woman in black hovered before the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor. Her presence was not powerful, only a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","However, a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor had made the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor come to a halt, facing her carefully.","“Senior Universe Breaching, you are the paramount ancestor of the Tower of Myriad Ways of the twelve courts of heaven. With such a lofty status, why are you personally chasing down an Immortal Emperor junior?” The woman in black looked at the Universe Breaching Immortal Emperor calmly. Even though she referred to him as her senior, there was no sense of respect in her words at all. It seemed more like she was conversing with an equal.","“I am also curious, Daowei Huanru. Why are you here? Don’t tell me it’s also for that little guy?” The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor was cautious, as both the strength and background of the person before him was not something that he could ignore.","The woman in black who blocked the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor was the second ancestor of the Waymight clan, Daowei Huanru!","“That’s right. I did indeed come for that little guy,” said the Illusionary Ancestor.","When he heard that, the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor immediately became pained. “That little guy sure is full of surprises. Not only did he cause a battle between the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, but even you’ve come in person. Looks like the favour I owe to Soaring Immortal isn’t that easy to return.”","“It’s true that the favour you owe to the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor isn’t that easy to return. At the very least, you won’t be returning it this time,” said the Illusionary Ancestor.","“Even your Waymight clan has come, so I obviously won’t be able to return the favour. Our Tower of Myriad Worlds is not bold enough to displease your Waymight clan.” The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor smiled wryly. In the past, the Waymight clan had also been one of the twelve courts of heaven. They could hold each other back, but they did not fear one another.","But now, across the entire Immortals’ World, who was bold enough to provoke the Waymight clan!","The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor was very decisive. He said nothing more, turning around and returning. He did not even want to know the reason behind this.","That was because he had already sensed a surging sword intent hidden in the surroundings. It was so powerful that it gave him chills."]},{"number":3965,"title":"Chapter 3965: The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance","paragraphs":["After the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor left, the Illusionary Ancestor turned around and stared in the direction that Jian Chen had departed in. By now, she was unable to see Jian Chen at all. With this small delay, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power had already taken him far away, vanishing into the depths of the sea of stars.","“First, it was a battle between the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, and then it was the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor’s pursuit through outer space. In the end, I never expected that even you would actually come, Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance. The storms stirred up by this little guy really aren’t of an ordinary magnitude.” The Illusionary Ancestor looked in the direction that Jian Chen had vanished in as she seemingly muttered to herself.","As soon as she finished speaking, the surrounding space suddenly lit up. The Laws of the Sword condensed in outer space before turning into a blinding figure in the end.","It was the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance from the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, one of the twelve courts of heaven!","However, it clearly was not the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s main body. It was only a clone condensed from the Laws of the Sword. It shone with blinding light like a god.","“Looks like you’re familiar with this person?” the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance said. The illusionary eyes hidden within the blinding light seemed to stare at the Illusionary Ancestor casually.","“I happened to meet him once. I happen to find this little guy very agreeable,” said the Illusionary Ancestor. Afterwards, she looked at the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance. There were some hints of respect in her voice. “Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance, have you also come for this little guy?”","“I came for the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor. The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor urgently messaged me to hold off the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor. I came in such a hurry, so I didn’t even have time to understand the situation,” said the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance. Shortly afterwards, his eyes began to flicker with light as he peered into this matter. He tried to get to the bottom of this.","With their cultivation, they no longer needed to ask others to learn about many matters. They only needed to peer into it slightly. They could gaze into the past and future, learning many secrets of the world.","But very soon, a smear of surprise appeared in the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s eyes, as he had discovered that he was unable to peer into any details regarding Jian Chen.","“So you were invited by the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. And I had thought that the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance had specially come for this little guy,” said the Illusionary Ancestor with a smile as she let out a sigh of relief inside.","“Since Universe Breaching is already gone, it’s time for me to leave as well. Farewell!” The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance said nothing more. He turned around and left, vanishing into the depths of the sea of stars instantly.","The Illusionary Ancestor remained where she was. She gazed off in the direction that the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance had left in with some mixed emotions. Only after a moment of silence did she let out a gentle sigh. “With the passing of time, people change. Among these courts of heaven, just how many of them still remain true to themselves? Little guy, there isn’t much that I can help you with...”","A terrifying storm of energy raged like a tsunami in the space outside the Skyscraping World, tearing apart the surroundings to the point where it struggled to heal.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor remained locked in battle.","At this moment, a figure of light arrived from afar. It directly pierced the storm of energy created by the battle between the two heavenly emperors and entered the heart of the storm.","It was the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor of the Tower of Myriad Worlds!","At this moment, the laws circulated around the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor, blocking all of the energy that approached him. He looked at the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor and sighed gently. “I wasn’t able to bring that person back. Soaring Immortal, I’ll have to return the favour I owe you next time.”","When he heard that, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s heart sank. His face darkened.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor could not help but laugh aloud. His uneasiness finally settled down.","With the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor’s return, the battle between the two heavenly emperors came to a halt. They were only keeping each other busy. There was no longer any need to keep fighting now.","“Was it the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance of the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords that stopped you?” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor looked at the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor. He was stern.","“The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance was indeed present. After all these years, he’s become even more powerful than before.” The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor sighed emotionally. The Illusionary Ancestor’s figure appeared in his head, but he did not disclose anything about her in the end.","As long as he made no mention of her, even heavenly emperors were unable to peer into existences like the Illusionary Ancestor.","After saying that, the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor vanished, having left already. He had no interest in the matters that occurred here.","At this moment, lofty Laws of the Sword suddenly descended. In the next moment, a figure condensed from the laws appeared out of nowhere. It was the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance.","Sensing the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s presence, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s eyes narrowed slightly. He could clearly sense that the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s presence was visibly stronger than before.","“ The Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor is right. The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance is indeed growing stronger! ” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was secretly shocked.","“Thank you, Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance!” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor smiled complacently. He began to exchange pleasantries with the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance.","“And I was wondering what kind of conflict you had with the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor. Turns out it’s just for a junior. Chaotic Star, you’ve paid quite the price to protect that junior.” The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance looked at the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","“Hahahaha, it’s worth it no matter how great the price!” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was unconcerned. He was in a great mood, forming a clear contrast to the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s sunken face.","“The junior’s name is Yang Yutian. He killed four great elders of our Immortal Feather sect. Fellow Sword Radiance, our Immortal Feather sect already has a blood feud with this kid. I do hope that you won’t get involved in this. This matter might develop beyond the point of no return,” the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor said sternly.","The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance furrowed his brows slightly. He had killed four great elders of the Immortal Feather sect? This was quite a major matter. Any peak organisation would be infuriated over the loss of four great elders.","“Fellow Sword Radiance, I am hoping that you can hand him to our Immortal Feather sect,” the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor continued.","“He’s not with me,” the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance said calmly.","“He’s not with you?” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor refused to believe it. In his eyes, if the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was willing to go to such great lengths to protect Jian Chen, it was definitely because he eyed the healing sovereign god artifact as well. Why would he let him get away?","However, when he thought of the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s identity and personality, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was unable to doubt him.","That was because the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance would never stoop as low as lying.","“Hahahaha, that little brother’s cultivation might not be very high, but his hiding ability is absolutely outstanding. Soaring Immortal, it’ll be almost impossible for you to find him now.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor chuckled.","“Chaotic Star, who is he?” the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance asked. His eyes shone. He could sense that something was slightly off with the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","As a heavenly emperor, why would he care about an Immortal Emperor junior so much?","“Fellow Sword Radiance, please pay a visit to the Heavenly Star Palace,” said the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance nodded. He did not refuse.","“Lan Caidie, I’ve already learnt from Caijian about everything that happened in the Skyscraping World. You’ve done very well. You haven’t disappointed me.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor gazed into the distance and praised Lan Caidie.","“To be able to assist the heavenly emperor is not only an honour for me but also the paramount duty of our entire Ghost Immortal cult.” Lan Caidie was overjoyed. Her eyes were filled with admiration.","Afterwards, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor returned to the Heavenly Star Palace with Xing Caijian and the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor also returned to the Immortal Feather sect, leaving behind the Thousand Daggeraxe Immortal Exalt and the Wayless Immortal Exalt to scour the Immortals’ World for Jian Chen. At the same time, they increased their bounty on Jian Chen. The bountiful reward they offered even tempted many Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Immortals’ World."]},{"number":3966,"title":"Chapter 3966: Learning the Identity","paragraphs":["At the same time, all of the cultivators who emerged from the Skyscraping World, including the owners of the medicinal gardens, had been silenced. They were strictly forbidden from disclosing any details about the Skyscraping World.","Even the Illusion-condensing Swordmaster, Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens, and the Courtyard of Ways had been asked to keep this a close secret.","The demand for secrecy obviously displeased many people present, but when they thought about who had asked for it, they all shut up.","The order came from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor of the Heavenly Star Palace as well as the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor of the Immortal Feather sect!","The two heavenly emperors had fought one another because of Jian Chen, but they reached a surprising agreement when it came to keeping this matter a secret.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor did so for the sake of Jian Chen’s safety. He obviously did not wish for him to attract too much attention. Even when Jian Chen’s hiding ability was exceptional, he had to prepare for the worst.","Meanwhile, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor did not wish for news about Jian Chen’s sovereign god artifact to be leaked. Otherwise, who would still be interested in the bounty that their Immortal Feather sect had set?","“ A sovereign god artifact has appeared on an Immortal Emperor junior. This is a heaven-sent opportunity. Do the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor really think they can keep this news contained? ”","“ Nothing can be kept a secret forever. It’s impossible for what happened here to be contained for all of eternity. It might be possible for a short period of time. After all, the influence of heavenly emperors cannot be underestimated. No one would want to be the first to incur the wrath of the heavenly emperors... ”","“ Originally, I came for the medicinal garden in the Skyscraping World, but I never expected to see a show like this. A healing sovereign god artifact is a tremendous opportunity enough to change any person’s fate... ”","......","...","Some of the owners of the medicinal gardens sighed inside. Their eyes burned with fervour. Containing the news happened to be what they wanted as well.","Some of them also hoped that fewer people knew about this.","“We belong to the Courtyard of Ways. We stand equal to the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect. What gives them the right to order us around...” an Immortal Monarch from the Courtyard of Ways said unhappily.","However, as soon as he said that, he was silenced by a member of the upper echelon of the Courtyard of Ways. The Courtyard of Ways had no reason to fear the Immortal Feather sect and the Heavenly Star Palace, but they were doing this out of respect for them. They would not spread the news to the outside world, but it did not prevent them from reporting this matter to the higher-ups.","“ Since Yang Yutian has the elder princess’s tablet, why do you think he didn’t produce it? In the current Immortals’ World, the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance has even more influence than the heavenly emperors. ” On the other side, Zuo Dao of the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens communicated to the Heavenloss Master. Due to Jian Chen, the two of them travelled together for a very long time. They advanced and retreated together like they had forged an alliance.","The Heavenloss Master shook his head and said, “ I’m not certain why he refuses to show the elder princess’s tablet. He should know just how much influence the elder princess now has. As long as he has the elder princess supporting him, he can resolve a lot of problems. ”","Reaching there, the Heavenloss Master paused. He could not help but recall what Jian Chen told him in the Skyscraping World, but now, he developed doubts about that. He said in thought, “ Perhaps Yang Yutian and the elder princess aren’t as close as we imagined, which is why he doesn’t have the courage to use her reputation. ”","Zuo Dao glanced at the Heavenloss Master deeply and said, “ We’ve already confirmed that Yang Yutian, Chang Yang, and Jian Chen are all the same person now. Heavenloss Master, as long as you probe into exactly why that earth-shaking battle had erupted between the elder princess and the four ancestors of the Sacred Beast clan, I’m certain you won’t come to this conclusion. ”","When he heard that, the Heavenloss Master furrowed his brows slightly. He discovered that Zuo Dao seemed to grasp even more complete information about Yang Yutian than him.","“ I need to return to the Divine Valley of the Nine Heavens. I have to report what happened here as quickly as possible. Heavenloss Master, let me give you a reminder before I leave. Yang Yutian’s background might be even more complicated than you think. In short, it was a wise decision for you to not oppose him, ” Zuo Dao communicated. He recalled the news he had learnt from Immortal Exalt Tan Yu in the Skyscraping World.","The Illusionary Ancestor of the Waymight clan seemed to treat Jian Chen very differently.","Elsewhere, the city lord of the Yi Immortal City of the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt, arrived before the city lord of the Immortal Rising City, Immortal Exalt Tan Yu. He was very humble, sincerely apologising for what he did in the past.","Everything that occurred outside the Skyscraping World had left him quite frightened. Who would have thought that a mere Immortal Emperor would actually draw over four heavenly emperors. Regardless of what Jian Chen’s relationship was with these heavenly emperors, whether they were friend or foe, the Scarlet Fire Immortal Exalt had already decided that he would not be getting involved in this matter. He hurriedly tried to mend his relationship with the Immortal Rising City.","His measly Yi Immortal City could not handle an upheaval like this.","Outside the Skyscraping World, as the people gathered here dispersed, the noisy surroundings finally recovered their usual tranquility.","Apart from the Scholar Capital Master who immediately returned to the Modest Silence Heaven in a hurry due to the war, the other owners of the medicinal gardens basically did not return to their respective territories. Instead, they followed the direction that Jian Chen had left in, searching along the way silently.","They did not care about the Immortal Feather sect’s bounty, nor did they care about the protection from the Heavenly Star Palace, as this had to do with a sovereign god artifact. Even if they had to risk opposing courts of heaven, they had to try their luck.","There were some opportunities that were completely worthwhile for them to risk their lives for. They could even abandon the sects, clans, and family behind them.","The sovereign god artifact on Jian Chen that could heal wounds endlessly was completely worth this price.","In a beautiful garden in the depths of the Heavenly Star Palace, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance walked along a small path leisurely. An invisible power enveloped the entire garden, completely isolating this area from the outside world.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was here in person, while the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance was still a clone.","“What did you say? He’s the successor of the Azulet swords?” Very soon, the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance learnt about Jian Chen’s true identity from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. He immediately shuddered inside.","Despite being a heavenly emperor, he struggled to remain calm after learning this secret. His heart skipped a beat.","Looking at how surprised the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance was, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor laughed and said, “This had been personally confirmed by the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star. If you don’t believe me, you can ask it yourself.” With a thought, the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star appeared. All of its presence was contained. It seemed extremely dim.","The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance clearly cared very much about the successor of the Azulet swords. He personally communicated with the artifact spirit of the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star before finally confirming this matter.","“After over three million years, I never thought that the Azulet swords that went missing would finally appear again...” the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance paused and let out an emotional sigh. He was filled with a multitude of emotions.","“Regardless of who he is, since he’s been chosen by the twin swords, he’s obviously the old senior’s successor. As a result, we need to give him the greatest assistance and protection we can give. Sword Radiance, what is your stance on this?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor looked at the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance.","“The stance of our Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords has never changed. Even before the old senior’s successor appeared, our Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords had already gone to our greatest efforts to protect the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. In particular, Sword Heart faced Nanming Yuyan of the Vermillion Bird clan in battle for the sake of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens on the Reverent Observance Heaven. He even became heavily injured as a result. Now that the old senior’s successor has appeared, our Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords will do everything we can to protect him,” the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance said sternly.","“With your Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords confirming your position, I feel much more confident. If you include the others, we’ll virtually be able to assemble at least half of the twelve courts of heaven to stand firmly by the successor of the twin swords’ side.” }The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor eased up.","“Half?” The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance shook his head. “You may be thinking too optimistically. After all these years, it really is difficult to say exactly what their stance towards the successor of the twin swords is. The debt that the Immortals’ World owes to the old senior, as well as the influence he left behind, has been constantly fading away to some of these people.”","“As a matter of fact, there are quite a few of these people who don’t even take their debt to the old senior seriously. They might speak up or do something on the surface, but that’s only to shut up any rumours and gossip outside. If they really were to make a great sacrifice, all they’ll do is agree on the surface and do nothing in actuality.”","When he heard that, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s face suddenly sank. His gaze immediately sharpened.","“And, the greatest source of trouble right now isn’t from the courts of heaven. Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, do you know who I encountered when I pursued the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor?”","“Who?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was curious.","“The second ancestor of the Waymight clan, Daowei Huanru!”","When the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance said that, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s face immediately changed. He lost his composure and cried out, “What did you say? You encountered Daowei Huanru? Impossible. Why would the Waymight clan pay attention to what happens in the Skyscraping World?”","“How would I know? And from the looks of things, Daowei Huanru seems to have learnt of him even before us.” The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance sighed gently.","“How did this happen? The Waymight clan... the Waymight clan... He’s in trouble now. Given Daowei Huanru’s identity, why would she pay attention to an Immortal Emperor junior for no reason, even going as far as to stop the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor? She definitely knows Yang Yutian’s identity.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s face changed. He subconsciously clenched his fists.","The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance fell silent momentarily. He closely recalled everything that had occurred when he met Daowei Huanru and said, “Daowei Huanru’s attitude was rather strange. She... didn’t seem to bear any ill intentions.”"]},{"number":3967,"title":"Chapter 3967: Xing Caijian’s Gift","paragraphs":["“With her identity, how can she possibly develop ill will towards an Immortal Emperor junior? After all, they’re only interested in the twin swords.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor disagreed.","“Oh right, Yang Yutian didn’t end up in the hands of the Illusionary Ancestor?”","“He had already successfully escaped through your power. The Illusionary Ancestor did not stop him,” said the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance.","“She didn’t stop him? Looks like they still haven’t found a suitable reason. After all, they are a sovereign clan of the Immortals’ World now. They still care about their dignity at the end of the day. However, it is fortunate that they still know to hold back a little. Otherwise, if they really tried to rob him with no sense of shame, no one would be able to stop them.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor sighed gently. “It’s a pity that the timing is so terrible. The old senior’s successor has appeared at a horrible time. Senior Samsaric is currently in danger with his fate unknown. Without senior Samsaric holding off the Waymight clan, how are we supposed to contend with the Waymight clan as just courts of heaven?”","Thinking up to there, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s heart weighed heavily. He struggled to maintain his previous optimism with the Waymight clan’s appearance.","The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance fell silent as well. If the successor of the twin swords had not been discovered by the Waymight clan, it was completely possible for them to grant him protection as courts of heaven. Even if they could not manage that, they could hide him and reveal him to the world once the time was ripe.","But since he had raised the Waymight clan’s attention already, this would be rather difficult to handle.","The peak experts of the Immortals’ World had already seen through the ambitions of the Waymight clan a long time ago. As a matter of fact, it had ceased to be a secret among the upper rungs of society.","“In the past, the Waymight clan used various methods to accept some disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens into their clan. Now, these disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens still bear the title of disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, but they’ve actually become members of the Waymight clan already.”","“The Waymight clan began scheming after the twin swords many years ago. The group of disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens they originally accepted are just waiting for the right time to replace the main lineage. Afterwards, they can rightfully inherit the twin swords. As long as the main lineage supported by the Waymight clan gains the twin swords, it will be equivalent to the twin swords ending up in the Waymight clan’s hands.”","“In the past, the twin swords never appeared, so the disciples supported by the Waymight clan never did anything. Now that the successor of the twin swords has emerged, the Waymight clan should take action very soon,” the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance said in thought.","When he heard that, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s eyes turned cold. He said in resentment, “Back then, Daowei Fatian had yet to become a Grand Exalt. I never thought he had already begun scheming after the twin swords. If I had known about his ambitions earlier, I should have let him die at the hands of the experts of the Saints’ World.”","“The Waymight clan is not the only one with such ambitions. After all, the twin swords are so terrifyingly powerful. Who in the Immortals’ World isn’t tempted by them? Even if they can’t fuse them, just wielding them serves as a tremendous source of deterrence.”","“However, discussing this now is already pointless. Let’s see how we can preserve the original lineage of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens instead,” he Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance said.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor furrowed his brows in thought and said, “Apart from Daowei Fatian, there’s only the Grand Exalt of the Ancient and Profound in the Immortals’ World. If we really run out of options, we’ll go and find him. The Grand Exalt of the Ancient and Profound might not want to risk offending Daowei Fatian to stand with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, but we have no better options.”","The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance shook his head gently and said, “Although Ancient and Profound has been a Grand Exalt for much longer than Daowei Fatian, Daowei Fatian possesses the Book of the Populace. His strength is already beyond what the Grand Exalt of the Ancient and Profound can stop. This method would not be appropriate.”","“Don’t tell me you have better ideas?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor looked at the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance.","“Didn’t I tell you already? The Waymight clan still cares about their appearances at the end of the day. As long as they don’t take it by force, there’ll be room for maneuvering. This is only temporary, but we’ll drag it out for as long as we can...”","......","...","Jian Chen traversed almost half of the Immortals’ World at a terrifying speed under the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power before finally stopping in an unfamiliar region of space.","Without the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power to restrain him, Jian Chen finally recovered his freedom. He activated the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, silently blending into the space there.","However, after doing all that, Jian Chen suddenly narrowed his eyes. He stared straight at his hand.","Before he had even realised it, a Space Ring had appeared in his hand.","He carefully sorted through his memories before finally realising that the Space Ring had been shoved into his hand secretly before the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had restrained him with his absolute strength and sent him flying away from that place.","However, his attention had been focused elsewhere and his body was restrained, which was why he did not notice immediately.","Jian Chen did not have the time to check the Space Ring. He did not know if any experts had tailed the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s power in pursuit of him. As a result, he immediately left this space under the combined disguise of the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","Afterwards, Jian Chen used the Laws of Space to travel through the sea of stars. He changed directly numerous times, running around aimlessly like a headless fly.","In the end, after three days of travel, Jian Chen stopped on a meteor with an uneven surface.","“I’ll spend the next period of time cultivating in peace here.” Jian Chen found a natural cave. He entered the cave and sat down. His Laws of the Sword had only just broken through. His overall strength had increased significantly, so he needed to spend some time to properly consolidate it.","As a matter of fact, Jian Chen did not even have the time to check the items in the Space Ring. He immediately began comprehending the Laws of the Sword.","The power from the seed of ways left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had yet to disperse. A small amount of comprehension of the Ways of the Sword still remained. These fragments of ways were constantly weakening and dispersing with each passing moment, so he needed to seize every second and absorb as much of this comprehension as possible.","Even though the remaining power from the seed of ways was nowhere near enough for Jian Chen to breakthrough again, it was still an opportunity for a great increase in a short period of time, so he obviously could not waste it.","Seven days later, the power in the seed of ways completely dispersed. The seven days of cultivation completely surpassed a century of Jian Chen’s usual, arduous cultivation when it came to results.","Jian Chen opened his eyes slowly and began studying the Space Ring in his hand. It was of an exquisite, feminine design. A faint body fragrance still lingered on it.","As he looked at the Space Ring, a ray of light shone through Jian Chen’s eyes. He already knew who the Space Ring belonged to.","In the next moment, he sent the senses of his soul inside the Space Ring. The items inside immediately left Jian Chen shocked. He was overwhelmed by a multitude of different feelings.","The Space Ring was filled with piles of heavenly resources. Across the different qualities, there were several hundred thousand of them in total.","Jian Chen could tell with a single glance that these heavenly resources all came from the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World. Due to the sheer variety, they served all sorts of different purposes.","Xing Caijian had packaged up all the heavenly resources she had collected in the Skyscraping World and given them to Jian Chen."]},{"number":3968,"title":"Chapter 3968: The Strength of the Sacred Beast Clan","paragraphs":["“This is a tremendous gift.” Jian Chen sighed emotionally. Almost seventy percent of the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World had ended up in Xing Caijian’s hands. After all, she possessed the Divine Sword of the Heavenly Star, which allowed her to get through the formations extremely quickly.","Seventy percent of the heavenly resources might have been nothing to a court of heaven, but it was tremendous wealth in Jian Chen’s eyes.","The value of these heavenly resources even surpassed everything he had obtained from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.","The heavenly resources he obtained from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants possessed an advantage in quantity, but they came nowhere close to the ones in the Skyscraping World when it came down to quality and grade.","The heavenly resources from the medicinal gardens of the Skyscraping World had been growing for several hundred thousand years at the very least. Most of them had already evolved into God Tier. There was an extremely small number below God Tier, unlike the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants where heavenly resources below God Tier formed the majority.","“Is my daughter’s gift to your satisfaction?” At this moment, a gruff voice rang out. A burly, middle-aged man had appeared beside Jian Chen before he had even noticed, staring at him with a smile.","His presence was erased, and he wore regular clothes. He seemed very approachable like an old farmer.","“Thank you for your assistance, senior!” Jian Chen immediately clasped his fist and bowed towards the middle-aged man. This was the first time he had seen the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s true appearance. However, from the familiar voice and the words that he said, he immediately recognised who this was.","Jian Chen was not surprised by how the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor could find him. After all, he had been escorted by the power of the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor the entire way here. With his methods as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, perhaps he had left an indetectable imprint on him.","Moreover, Xing Caijian’s Space Ring was still in his possession.","“Many people are searching for you everywhere right now. Apart from the Immortal Feather sect, there’s also the Immortal Exalts who lost their heavenly resources in the Skyscraping World. What do you plan on doing next? Have you considered coming to your Heavenly Star Palace?” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor stared at Jian Chen with interest. Only now did he finally have the time to properly study Jian Chen.","“Thank you for your offer, senior, but I don’t plan on going to the Heavenly Star Palace for the time being, just in case I cause any trouble,” Jian Chen clasped his fist towards the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and said. Seeing how the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was displeased with that reply, he was forced to explain. “It’s not that I don’t believe in the Heavenly Star Palace’s strength. As one of the courts of heaven, the Heavenly Star Palace is so powerful that you can make the entire Immortals’ World shake with just a stomp. It’s just that my identity is linked with far too many matters. I’m sure you’re also aware of this, senior.”","“Looks like you know quite a bit. Then are you aware that you’ve already raised the attention of the Waymight clan? And on top of that, you’ve raised the attention of someone significant from the Waymight clan?” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said sternly.","“May I ask who you are referring to, senior?” Jian Chen’s eyes shone with interest. He could not help but recall a figure.","“The second ancestor of the Waymight clan, Daowei Huanru!” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor told Jian Chen about how Daowei Huanru had stopped the Universe Breaching Heavenly Emperor, which immediately shocked him. His eyes were filled with mixed feelings.","“If you were in the Heavenly Star Palace, at least we can help you hold off Daowei Huanru, but if you continue to move around alone, you will not be able to fight back at all once Daowei Huanru moves against you.”","“As for Daowei Fatian, he’s heavily injured. It’s rumoured that he’s entered secluded cultivation for recovery, and he probably won’t be emerging any time soon. As long as he does not take action personally, the Heavenly Star Palace can ensure your safety. The other courts of heaven will not have the courage to declare war on our Heavenly Star Palace over you either, as the identity of the successor of the twin swords still bears some weight at the end of the day.”","“Of course, the exact weight will vary. If you have the support of our Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords, this weight will be tremendous. No one will be able to ignore it. However, if you don’t have the support of these courts of heaven, I’m afraid very few people will take you seriously unless you possess enough absolute strength to crush all.”","Reaching there, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor paused. Afterwards, he gradually became stern. “As for Daowei Fatian, it’s true that our Heavenly Star Palace can’t stop him, but we’re still one of the twelve courts of heaven. Even against someone like that, we have the right to a voice. By then, we’ll rope in a few other courts of heaven as an alliance. That way, even Daowei Fatian can’t ignore us...”","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor directly referred to the Grand Exalt by his name. Even though Daowei Fatian had already become a Grand Exalt, truly transcending the world, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor was unable to muster up any respect towards him.","“Senior, the Grand Exalt may be injured, but if you directly refer to his name like this, aren’t you afraid of him sensing something?” Jian Chen was quite nervous as he listened along. He had met several Grand Exalts before, and he knew just how exceptional the methods of Grand Exalts were. Their names happened to be taboo.","However, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor completely disregarded this with disdain. “You have nothing to worry about. At my cultivation, there are no taboos that I cannot speak of in the world. If I want him to sense it, he’ll sense it, but if I don’t, he won’t. Grand Exalts have already transcended, standing up high, but don’t underestimate the heavenly emperors either...”","Jian Chen was enlightened with that. For some powerful Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, their distance from Grand Exalt was truly just a step. Out of the one hundred layers of laws that a Grand Exalt possessed, these Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts were already on the ninety-ninth layer.","However, it was also this one step that led to such a tremendous difference in strength between the two.","Afterwards, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor helped Jian Chen analyse the benefits and detriments involved. He tried his best to convince Jian Chen to hide in the Heavenly Star Palace.","However, no matter how the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor embellished his words, no matter what promises he issued, Jian Chen turned them all down without any hesitation in the end.","To Jian Chen, going to the Heavenly Star Palace was equivalent to tying himself up. Once a Grand Exalt came in person, he would be directly exposed before them with nowhere to escape to.","That was not what he wanted.","Although he would also struggle to hide from Grand Exalts outside, at least he could resolve a few matters that he needed to resolve before a Grand Exalt had noticed him.","Most importantly, he possessed a treasure that could hide away from Grand Exalts. The Fortune God Jade could evade all senses. It could only be detected by the naked eye.","As a result, even though a Grand Exalt could observe the entire Immortals’ World on a whim, they could not discover Fortune God Jade.","“Sigh, since you’re so stubborn, I’m not going to force you. The Heavenly Star Palace can serve as your home. If you ever grow tired of wandering around outside or encounter any enemies so powerful that you stand no chance, you can come to the Heavenly Star Palace at any time. As long as they’re not Grand Exalts, our Heavenly Star Palace can help you hold off any expert,” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said seriously.","“Then what if I offend the Sacred Beast clan?” Jian Chen suddenly asked out of curiosity.","When he heard Jian Chen mention the Sacred Beast clan, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s face immediately hardened. Afterwards, he stared at Jian Chen solemnly and said, “Unless you run out of choices, do not provoke the Sacred Beast clan. No, even if you end up in conflict with them, bear with whatever you can.”","“The Sacred Beast clan’s strength is beyond your imagination. They’re not as simple as a race. Instead, they are the remaining forces of a major world. Apart from Grand Exalts, no one can stand up against the Sacred Beast clan. Not even Fang Jing of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance can.”","“Fang Jing might have faced off against four members of the Sacred Beast clan and emerged victoriously in the end, shaking up the entire Immortals’ World, but that’s only a tiny fraction of the Sacred Beast clan’s forces.”","As he spoke about the Sacred Beast clan, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor became unprecedentedly stern. Clearly, his wariness towards them reached deep into his bones.","“Senior, just how powerful is the Sacred Beast clan?” Jian Chen asked curiously.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor sank into his thoughts. Finally, he replied as if he had come up with a relatively easy way of explaining it. “I’ll describe it to you like this. If you set aside the Grand Exalts and amass all the strength across the thirty-three heavens and twelve courts of heaven in the Immortals’ World, the Sacred Beast clan can probably match a third of it. Even though this is not exactly an accurate estimate, that paints a rough picture.”","“The Sacred Beast clan is that powerful?” Even Jian Chen could not help but leap in fright. This was a third of the entire Immortals’ World’s forces. Did that not mean the Sacred Beast clan was equivalent to eleven heavens and four courts of heaven?","Let alone everything else, just the Immortal Exalts from eleven heavens already reached into the hundreds.","This matter was truly shocking. During the Sword Sect of Violet Heaven’s most glorious time, they only had ten Immortal Exalts.","“The Sacred Beast clan is not just the Azure Dragon clan, the White Tiger clan, the Vermillion Bird clan, and the Black Tortoise clan. There are many other daemon organisations under the rule of these four clans such as the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants from the Reverent Observance Heaven that also belongs to the Sacred Beast clan. As a powerful organistaion that has a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants doesn’t even rank within the top ten organisations under the rule of the Sacred Beast clan.”","“The Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants isn’t even in the top ten?” Jian Chen was shocked again. Apart from the Observance Heaven City, the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants was already the undisputed greatest organisation on the Reverent Observance Heaven. Their Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Space-splitting Venerable, was an invincible figure on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","However, a tremendous organisation led by such an expert did not even rank within the top ten of all the organisations under the rule of the Sacred Beast clan?","That was simply startling.","In the past, the strength of the Sacred Beast clan had always been a mystery to Jian Chen, but now, he finally gained a clearer understanding. His wariness towards them peaked.","At this moment, he could not help but think of the Spiritsages in the Saints’ World.","Compared to the Spiritsages, the Sacred Beast clan had been far too fortunate. They had basically joined the Immortals’ World without paying much of a price, preserving the strength of the Daemons’ World to the greatest degree."]},{"number":3969,"title":"Chapter 3969: History of the Daemons’ World","paragraphs":["Looking at how shocked Jian Chen was, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor immediately began laughing. “What? You’re frightened? If you knew their history, you’d find that the Sacred Beast clan is far, far weaker than what they once were.”","“The Daemons’ World is very different from our Immortals’ World. The Immortals’ World is divided into the thirty-three heavens, while the Daemons’ World was split into the four cardinal directions. The four regions corresponding to the cardinal directions were ruled by the Azure Dragon clan, the White Tiger clan, the Vermillion Bird clan, and the Black Tortoise clan.”","“These four clans are equivalent to the four imperial clans of the entire Daemons’ World. They stand above, ruling over all of the organisations within their regions. Even with the passage of countless years, their status as the four imperial clans has never been shaken.”","“When the Daemons’ World was still in one piece, the Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Vermillion Bird, and Black Tortoise clans had never experienced an interruption in the lineage of their Grand Exalts. Even when their older Grand Exalts perished due to various reasons, new Grand Exalts would be born very quickly, filling in their empty spots. Just like that, each generation succeeded the last for who knew how many years, completely consolidating their status as the four imperial clans.”","“As a matter of fact, during their most glorious ages, some of the imperial clans might even have two Grand Exalts coexisting at the same time...”","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor described the history of the Daemons’ World to Jian Chen in detail. Jian Chen became more and more startled the more he listened. He discovered that even when he already had a very high opinion of the Sacred Beast clan’s strength, he still ended up severely underestimating the four so-called imperial clans.","Even their lineage of Grand Exalts had never been interrupted. Did that not mean that they had produced countless Grand Exalts throughout the history of the four imperial clans?","At the same time, who knew how many Grand Exalt’s legacies were left behind?","With such a terrifying heritage, just which peak organisation in the Immortals’ World could rival them?","“Senior, apart from the four imperial clans, have any of the other clans produced Grand Exalts?” Jian Chen asked curiously. In his knowledge, once a new Grand Exalt was born, the situation across all the organisations in the entire world would be renewed. This was true in both the Saints’ World and the Immortals’ World.","At the very least, with his understanding of the Saints’ World, there were no peak organisations that could establish such a lengthy rule like the four imperial clans of the Daemons’ World.","“Of course, there have been. Throughout the history of the Daemons’ World, many Grand Exalts have appeared outside of the four imperial clans, but they were unable to change the situation of the Daemons’ World in the end. The four imperial clans always stood together. An additional Grand Exalt or two that did not belong to the four imperial clans would not be able to change the overall situation. Their greatest purpose would just be to lead their clans to temporary independence. As long as their Grand Exalt remained, they would not fall under the rule of the four imperial clans. However, they would not have the courage to fight the four imperial clans for territory either. They would only be able to preserve their original territory.”","“Many years afterwards, once their Grand Exalts perished, they would lose their independence as well. All of the clans would return to the rule of the four imperial clans. There were no other peak clans apart from the four imperial clans that managed to continuously produce Grand Exalts in the Daemons’ World, so there obviously isn’t an organisation that can shake the ruling status of the four imperial clans.”","Reaching there, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor sighed gently. “You should understand now with all that I’ve said that the Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Vermillion Bird, and Black Tortoise clans aren’t the only ones that have preserved their Grand Exalt’s bloodline and legacies. Among the organisations ruled by the four imperial clans, there are still some peak clans that possess relatively complete Grand Exalt’s legacies. Among the particularly powerful, their strength even rivals the four imperial clans, almost to the point where they match them evenly.”","“Since their peak organisations are so powerful, why do they still accept the rule of the four imperial clans? After all, the four imperial clans no longer have Grand Exalts. If they were to declare independence, they’d be completely able to claim their own territory and stand supreme,” Jian Chen said.","“There are many reasons. First of all, because they’re daemons, a lot of their territory is different from the Immortals’ World. Moreover, they had been ruled over for far too long in the original Daemons’ World. Their subservience to the four imperial clans has already become a part of their bloodline. It’s not that easy to eliminate.”","“Secondly, they’re relatively tight-knit. If they were to leave the four imperial clans, there are quite a lot of organisations in the Immortals’ World that can come after them. So what if they possess strength that rivals the courts of heaven? Even courts of heaven in the Immortals’ World come and go with time, being updated with each generation. However, if they fall back onto the four imperial clans, who beneath Grand Exalt has the courage to walk over them?”","“Thirdly, a supreme bloodline exists among the four imperial clans. When their supreme bloodline appears, it is a symbol of invincibility. It’s said that before the Daemons’ World had shattered, most of the Grand Exalts born in the four imperial clans possessed this supreme bloodline. As a result, even when the other clans of the Daemons’ World produced Grand Exalts, they were not the opponent of this supreme bloodline.”","“There was no one in the Daemons’ World that did not fear and revere the supreme bloodline of the four imperial clans. If the Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Vermillion Bird, and Black Tortoise clans were the imperial clans of the Daemons’ World, then the supreme bloodline was the royalty among the imperial clans. No, it should be said that they’re the rulers of the imperial clans...”","“It is also the existence of these supreme bloodlines that completely snuffed out any thought of resistance from these peak clans...”","“Supreme bloodlines?” Jian Chen suddenly narrowed his eyes. He thought of something.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor explained it further to Jian Chen. “The supreme bloodlines is only a description given to them by us. Among the four imperial clans, they call the supreme bloodlines the Nineclawed Golden Dragon, the Sacredfeathered Tiger Emperors, the Eternallife Vermillion Bird, and the Violetgolden Black Tortoise.”","“It’s said that before the Daemons’ World had shattered, the supreme bloodlines were passed down consistently between generations and were rarely ever interrupted. Even if there was an interruption, it would only be for a short period of time. But now, who knows how many years it’s been since the Immortals’ World has heard of the legends of the supreme bloodlines...”","......","...","As if he was afraid that Jian Chen would ignorantly provoke the Sacred Beast clan, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor basically hid nothing about the Sacred Beast clan, telling it all to Jian Chen in detail.","Jian Chen had finally truly gained an understanding for the Sacred Beast clan’s strength for the first time through the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. Their terrifying heritage deeply shocked Jian Chen.","“ No wonder even a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Heavenly Talisman Venerable, warned me to not touch the pair of Dragon Blood Fish inside the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. With the terrifying strength of the Sacred Beast clan, just which organisation in the Immortals’ World doesn’t fear them apart from Grand Exalts? ” Jian Chen thought to himself."]},{"number":3970,"title":"Chapter 3970: The Heavenly Emperors’ Care","paragraphs":["“There’s nothing embarrassing about respecting the Sacred Beast clan, but there’s no need to go as far as to fear them. As long as you don’t cross the Sacred Beast clan’s bottom line, they won’t mobilise their forces en masse. Because the Sacred Beast clan does not have a Grand Exalt right now, they don’t have the courage to act too recklessly in the Immortals’ World.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor divulged another piece of important information, which reduced some of Jian Chen’s wariness towards the Sacred Beast clan.","He could not help but recall the rumour he had heard many years ago about the battle between the Sword Heart Ancestor of the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords and Nanming Yuyan of the Sacred Beast clan.","Perhaps it was exactly because he understood where the Sacred Beast clan’s bottom line was that the Sword Heart Ancestor was still bold enough to face Nanming Yuyan in battle despite knowing their strength.","“Oh right, I heard you had two Immortal Exalts that follow you. Can I see them?” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said calmly.","Jian Chen obviously would not reject the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s small request. He immediately let out the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had already found out who he would be meeting before he came out, so his face was filled with respect. He bowed politely towards the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. “Greetings to senior heavenly emperor from this measly demon!”","On the other side, the Immortal Devouring Orchid also made a gesture of lowering its head, showing great respect.","“A Fourth Heavenly Layer Demon Exalt. An expert like that isn’t that easy to control. How much do you trust this demon?” the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor looked at the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and said calmly. He did not give off any of the might that would match a heavenly emperor.","However, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt felt his heart tighten as if tremendous danger had enveloped him. He could vaguely sense an invisible power fill his surroundings, filled with lethal killing intent. It was extremely terrifying, where he could be doomed if he made the slightest inappropriate movement.","“My loyalty to the sect master is completely sincere. I bear no other motives. The sect master also possesses my lifebound true soul. As long as my lifebound true soul is in his possession, my fate is completely at his whim. Even if I want to betray the sect master, I can’t,” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt said with a trembling voice before secretly glancing at Jian Chen beside him. He continued, “Moreover, why would I betray the sect master? In all the years I’ve lived, I’ve never experienced such a fascinating journey as the one I’ve spent by the sect master’s side. I’ve also achieved many feats that I wouldn’t even think of in the past. The sect master’s identity is extremely special. Only by following the sect master will I achieve infinite glory in the future...”","“There are so many benefits for me in following the sect master. Senior heavenly emperor, what reason do I have to betray the sect master?”","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt did not demonstrate any of his usual pride or dignity before the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. He began to grovel instead.","In all the years Jian Chen had spent with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, this was the first time he had seen him behave like this.","After a thought, Jian Chen took out the lifebound true soul that the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had initially handed over to him from the Primeval Divine Hall. “Senior, “This is the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s lifebound true soul. As long as this remains in my possession, I can indeed decide his fate at whim.”","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor looked at the lifebound true soul. Only after studying it for a while did he say, “Nothing seems wrong with the lifebound true soul at first glance, but this demon is relatively special. He’s not a creature that cultivated to his current state. Instead, he’s the result of countless negative emotions condensing together. Special lifeforms like him usually possess some unique abilities, so they can’t be trusted so easily.”","With a pause, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor formed a seal. Tremendous power immediately gathered over from the surrounding region. The power was startling to Jian Chen, while the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt experienced its full might. His body even began to tremble. He was terrified.","In the end, the tremendous power condensed into an ancient glyph in the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s hand. He directly sent the glyph into the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s body.","Immediately, starlight glimmered on the surface of the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s body before completely sinking into his body, blood, and even soul like a brand.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s face changed slightly, but he recovered very quickly. He had already guessed the function of the glyph that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had embedded into his body. However, these things no longer concerned him as he had already handed over his lifebound true soul.","“I’ll teach you a technique. If this demon ever runs amok, you can directly control his fate through this technique.” As the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor said that, he had already pressed his finger against Jian Chen’s forehead gently. Immediately, an ancient secret technique appeared in Jian Chen’s head.","However, Jian Chen was only able to control the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s fate through this technique. It was equivalent to a key. He was unable to use this same technique on another person.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor clearly did not trust the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt to be following Jian Chen around. Even with the lifebound true soul, he had to set up another safeguard.","“ Sigh, why bother? I already made up my mind to follow the sect master to the death. I’ve already come to the realisation that the sect master is a pivotal figure in my life... ” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt grumbled inside.","Shortly afterwards, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor looked at the Immortal Devouring Orchid, and he gradually furrowed his brows.","As a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, there were many things and matters in the world that he could see through with a single glance. He could even see their past and future, gazing into the secrets of the deepest depths.","As a result, when the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor observed the Immortal Devouring Orchid seriously, he immediately discovered many strange features.","“This Immortal Devouring Orchid has actually departed from the range of its species as an Immortal Devouring Orchid. It is a lifeform from a level so high that even I struggle to see through it immediately. I struggle to imagine how it managed to evolve to its current state.” The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor let out a sigh of amazement. He had already noticed how extraordinary the Immortal Devouring Orchid was.","At this moment, the Immortal Devouring Orchid was very reserved. It was not known whether it was capable of breathing, but at this moment, it seemed like it was holding its breath before the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","“Senior, I raised this Immortal Devouring Orchid from a seed. It is one of my closest and most reliable friends. I completely trust it. I’m certain it won’t betray me.” Jian Chen explained as if he was afraid that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor would also plant some kind of restraining power in the Immortal Devouring Orchid.","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor stared at the Immortal Devouring Orchid with interest. The depths of his eyes shimmered with a peering light. Only after a while did he say slowly, “A connection akin to a bloodline exists between it and you. You are extremely close. I can tell that it won’t betray you.”","The Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor waved his hand and sent the Immortal Devouring Orchid and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt back inside the Primeval Divine Hall. Afterwards, he took out another Space Ring and passed it over to Jian Chen. “Accept this Space Ring. These are some resources that the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance left for you. He also told me to tell you that if you encounter any difficulties with regards to cultivation, you can go directly to the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords. He will personally answer your questions and guide you on your cultivation of the Way of the Sword.”","“You cultivate the Chaotic Body. Although you’ll struggle to reach Immortal Exalt with your cultivation, your comprehension is unaffected. I’m certain you will make drastic progress on the Way of the Sword with the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance’s personal guidance...”","When he heard that, Jian Che smiled wryly inside. Who said his comprehension was not affected? After learning about the predicament of the Martial Soul lineage, he understood that his comprehension could not reach Immortal Exalt either.","The Chaotic Body limited his cultivation, while the Martial Soul lineage limited his cultivation. Now that he had virtually reached the end of these two paths, Jian Chen himself was slightly lost as well with regards to the path ahead of him.","Afterwards, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor warned Jian Chen about a few other matters that he needed to pay attention to before leaving silently. He left behind Jian Chen all by himself.","Jian Chen exhaled deeply. For the time being, he did not have to worry about the matter of Immortal Exalt. His Way of the Sword had only just broken through. There were many other things he needed to do first.","He checked the Space Ring that the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance had left to him, and his eyes immediately lit up. The Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance had actually given him a total of a million five-coloured immortal crystals, coupled with over a thousand mid grade God Tier heavenly resources and several dozen high grade God Tier heavenly resources.","On top of that, there were several hundred God Tier pills. They were high grade at the very least.","Both the heavenly resources and the pills were without an exception for increasing cultivation.","He had just broken through with the Way of the Sword, so his Chaotic Body could reach the eighteenth layer. These resources for cultivation were exactly what he needed right now."]},{"number":3971,"title":"Chapter 3971: Second Strike of the Formation","paragraphs":["Jian Chen did not remain there after the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor left. After concealing himself with the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, he silently left there with the Laws of Space.","Afterwards, he continued wandering aimlessly through the sea of stars for a few more hours before entering a dead planet.","The planet was extremely large, not much smaller even when compared to the eighty-one planets of the Saints’ World. It was possible to tell that it was once brimming with life, but it was completely desolate now. There were no signs of life at all.","Jian Chen’s senses of the soul enveloped the entire planet. He discovered a colossal cavern in its centre. After hesitating for a moment, he directly transported himself into the interior of the planet with the Laws of Space before throwing down a set of formation banners. He set up a blocking formation there.","The formation’s quality was not very high. It could only block off the senses of souls from early Immortal Exalts. It was one of his spoils from the Skyscraping World.","He had already raised the attention of the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor. On top of that, aside from the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, he had no idea if he had caught the attention of experts on par with the heavenly emperors or even beyond the heavenly emperors. As a result, he needed to maintain his highest level of vigilance. He refused to stay in one place for too long.","Even under the dual disguise of the mask and the armour, Jian Chen still did not have the courage to be careless.","After setting up the blocking formation in the centre of the desolate star, he sat down in the dark and quiet space and began consolidating his Way of the Sword.","Sword Sage was a completely new realm to Jian Chen. At the same time, it brought completely new powers. Since he had these powers for the first time, he needed to spend some time familiaring himself with them. Otherwise, it would be very difficult for him to use the strength brought forth by his new cultivation realm to its fullest potential.","“ The Profound Sword Qi has strengthened again! ” Jian Chen was jubilant. With the Laws of the Swords’ breakthrough, various aspects of his strength grew in terms of quality. The power of the Shadowless Lifetaking Strike and the Hundred Superimposition Sword had grown significantly.","Although he was still an Immortal Emperor right now, his battle prowess had increased significantly. He would be able to kill some early Immortal Exalts even easier than before.","Jian Chen did not stay on this planet for too long. Several months later, he stowed the blocking formation away and erased all of his traces and presences before leaving under the cover of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race. He searched for a new place for cultivation.","Just like that, Jian Chen changed locations every few months. After five entire years, he finally finished consolidating the realm of Sword Sage. He completely grasped all of the changes as well as the various aspects that had strengthened as a result of this new realm.","Jian Chen had yet to reach the very end of the path for initial achievement of Sword Sage. As he comprehended the Laws of the Sword further in the future, there was still some room for growth.","At this moment, Jian Chen’s mind suddenly shuddered. The power of the Spatial Insect Emperor’s beast soul surged forward from hiding. The profound mysteries of space constantly merged into his soul.","The power of the beast soul was greatly beneficial to Jian Chen. As he absorbed more of the Spatial Insect Emperor’s beast soul, Jian Chen could clearly sense that his comprehension and grasp of the Laws of the Sword was growing at an unbelievable rate.","This was the benefit that came with breaking through with the Laws of the Sword.","A breakthrough in the Ways of the Sword meant growth in the power of the soul.","As long as his soul strengthened, the power of the Spatial Insect Emperor lurking inside Jian Chen would surge forth and strengthen Jian Chen’s Laws of Space.","Jian Chen did not continue to change locations with such frequency. He remained on the current meteor for almost two decades before finally rousing.","During these two short decades, he had grown in a way where others would struggle to achieve even if they had tens of thousand or even hundreds of thousand years. His Laws of Space directly reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor.","The power of the Spatial Insect Emperor’s beast soul did not run out. There was still a tiny amount hiding in Jian Chen’s body. According to Jian Chen’s estimates, the remaining bit of power could elevate his Laws of Space to the First or Second Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt.","Apart from the Laws of Space reaching the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor, even the Profound Sword Qi in his soul had increased to six. Jian Chen’s trump cards had strengthened once again.","“ I wonder if I’ll have the fortune to enjoy the Spatial Insect Emperor’s remaining power in the future. ” Jian Chen sighed gently inside. To him, Immortal Exalt was a place beyond his reach.","“ Master, Thousand Soul is looking for you. ” At this moment, the Primeval artifact spirit’s voice rang out in Jian Chen’s head.","Jian Chen immediately entered the Primeval Divine Hall. He met with the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt in an independent space.","At this moment, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt hovered above several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples. There were several dozen Immortal Monarchs and a few Immortal Emperors nearby.","Jian Chen saw undisguised joy and excitement on the faces of these people. Even the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was no different.","“What’s happened that’s left you all so happy?” Jian Chen glanced past everyone and asked curiously. However, when he noticed the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples below, Jian Chen’s eyes immediately shone.","After not using the Divine Formation of the Heavens for many years, he discovered that the number of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples here had already reached fifty thousand.","Fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals had already reached the standard required for the Divine Formation of the Heavens!","“Hehehehe, sect master, you must have noticed it too. Our sect has already assembled fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples. When I was testing earlier, I discovered that after assembling the fifty thousand disciples, the Divine Formation of the Heavens has changed slightly as well,” the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt said excitedly. He showed even more respect towards Jian Chen than before.","“Stop? What our sect? Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, you’re not a disciple of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, much less a member of the upper echelon. You have to keep this clear.” Jian Chen corrected the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt in time.","“Hehe, it’s all the same, it’s all the same.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt rubbed his head awkwardly.","“It’s different. You are from the demonic path at the end of the day. There is a difference between demons and immortals. You can’t join the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.” Jian Chen did not dwell on this topic any further. There was a hint of eagerness in his eyes. “Tell me, how has the Divine Formation of the Heavens changed?”","“Hehe, sect master, please take a look for yourself.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt smiled mysteriously before signalling to everyone. Very soon, the fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, the several dozen Immortal Monarchs, the few Immortal Emperors, and the Immortal Devouring Orchid assembled the Divine Formation of the Heavens with great familiarity.","Immediately, the surrounding space was swallowed by blinding light. A terrifying pressure filled the space, startling Jian Chen.","Just from the emanating pressure, Jian Chen could tell that the Divine Formation of the Heavens had grown much stronger than before.","Suddenly, a blinding beam of light erupted, slamming into the floor of the Primeval Divine Hall with a deafening rumble. It stirred up a storm of energy.","Jian Chen squinted his eyes in the distance. He stared straight at the Divine Formation of the Heavens. After launching a strike this time, the formation did not disperse from running out of energy. Instead, it maintained a terrifying pressure.","“ Don’t tell me the Divine Formation of the Heavens is already capable of launching two strikes? ” This thought crossed Jian Chen’s mind.","In the next moment, his thoughts were confirmed. Another devastating beam of light fell down without any reduction in power, slamming into the ground heavily and producing another great rumble."]},{"number":3972,"title":"Chapter 3972: The Seven Souls Awaken","paragraphs":["The violent storm of energy wreaked havoc inside the Primeval Divine Hall. This was the aftermath from the Divine Formation of the Heavens. Just the power of the aftermath posed a significant threat to some early Immortal Exalts.","Jian Chen did not face the aftermath directly. He stood far away, using the Primeval Divine Hall’s power and the divine hall’s toughness to mitigate this storm of energy.","The Primeval Divine Hall was a sovereign god artifact after all. Even though the Divine Formation of the Heavens had strengthened substantially, it still could not cause any damage to the Primeval Divine Hall.","After launching two consecutive strikes, the Divine Formation of the Heavens finally dimmed, but despite that, the fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals who assembled the formation did not completely exhaust their energy. Around twenty percent of it still remained.","This result made Jian Chen smile uncontrollably.","In the past, all of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals would run out of energy after launching a single strike.","But now, even after two attacks, these Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals still had power left over.","This was a huge improvement.","“Sect master, the Divine Formation of the Heavens is now truly capable of both offence and defence. As long as the formation is operating, its defences are so powerful that even I would struggle to breach it at my peak.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s voice was filled with undisguised joy as well. As one of the crucial members for assembling the formation, he obviously wished that the formation could be as powerful as possible.","Jian Chen looked at the Divine Formation of the Heavens assembled by all the disciples. He understood that the reason why the Divine Formation of the Heavens had strengthened so much was due to assembling all fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. It was equivalent to fulfilling a basic requirement of the Divine Formation of the Heavens, unlocking some of its powers.","Even if one of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals were missing, the Divine Formation of the Heavens could not launch a second strike.","In the future, as the number of Immortal Monarchs, Immortal Emperors, and Immortal Exalts increased, the Divine Formation of the Heavens would gradually demonstrate its terrifying might as a Grand Exalt’s formation.","At this moment, Jian Chen suddenly felt a tremble in his soul. When he experienced this sensation, his eyes immediately narrowed. As if a distant memory had overtaken him, the depths of his eyes were filled with recollection and mixed feelings.","In the next moment, his consciousness immediately entered his soul. In the centre of his expansive sea of consciousness, the twin swords, the Primeval artifact spirit, and the Source of Life united their strength to suppress the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul. His soul only managed to guard a small region. He seemed like he was no longer capable of fighting back.","Seven extremely tiny specks of light hovered in an extremely remote location in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness.","Jian Chen stared at the seven specks of light and gradually became surprised.","Back when he was on the Desolate Plane of the forty-nine great planes of the Saints’ World, he had encountered the remains of eight experts deep underground. Moreover, he had obtained eight golden cores of laws from the lingering wills of these eight experts.","The seven specks of light were the souls left behind by seven of the experts.","By now, with Jian Chen’s current insights, how could he not tell what the seven souls were trying to do?","They used the golden core of laws as a cover to silently infiltrate his sea of consciousness. They were actually waiting to be reborn once their souls had recovered.","This method of rebirth would be extremely harmful to the host. Perhaps it would be possession where they directly occupied his body.","In the past, the souls of the seven experts were extremely feeble. They were forced to fall into a deep slumber. Now, they finally seemed to recover enough power, showing signs of awakening.","Jian Chen was completely different from before. As a result, even when the seven foreign souls only showed signs of awakening, Jian Chen sensed it immediately.","“You’re the one awakening first, but you’re only showing some signs of awakening right now. It’ll probably take a little longer before you completely awaken. Whatever, let me lend you a hand so you awaken sooner.” Jian Chen looked at one of the specks of light. Afterwards, he ingested a heavenly resource for healing the soul without any hesitation. However, he did not absorb any of the heavenly resource’s tremendous power. Instead, he channelled it entirely into the soul that was about to awaken.","The mid grade God Tier heavenly resource was highly beneficial to the soul. After absorbing the tremendous power, the soul strengthened at a visible rate.","Despite that, their souls were still extremely feeble in Jian Chen’s eyes, so feeble that he could destroy them at whim.","“I’ve finally awakened... but... who am I? And where is this?”","At this moment, a murmur rang out from the soul that had just awakened. It was filled with confusion.","Among the seven specks of light hovering in Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness, one of them had vanished silently. They had turned into an illusionary, miniature figure.","It was a miniature figure because it was only the size of a hand.","As the miniature figure consolidated, her figure gradually cleared up as well. It was possible to make out her delicate facial features.","She was a woman with alluring beauty. She possessed a glistening pair of golden wings on her back. As she unfurled her wings, a golden halo expanded from her. She seemed like a holy existence.","Jian Chen immediately recalled the female creature that stood three hundred metres tall that he had seen in the underground cavern on the Desolate Plane. Back then, she seemed indomitable, wrapped in undefeatable battle intent. She was a living war goddess.","Jian Chen said nothing. He simply observed her quietly.","The winged woman furrowed her brows and racked her brains. Having just awoken from her slumber, she did not seem to recall the past yet. Her eyes were filled with confusion and doubt, studying the surroundings at times while also looking down at her own body.","Only after a good while did she finally seem to remember her identity. Her empty eyes shone brightly as she smiled faintly.","“I... see... I didn’t think our plan would actually succeed. We actually managed to break free from the shackles and avoid a fate of death through this method, earning ourselves a second life. I just wonder how much time I was asleep for,” the woman murmured. She felt like there was something very important that she had not remembered yet. Right when she was about to think about it, she subconsciously noticed the six other specks of light beside her.","Her attention was immediately drawn away by the six souls. When she discovered how feeble the six others were, having yet to awaken, she was overjoyed.","In the next moment, her soul turned into a ball of mist and immediately enveloped one of the souls. Right when she tried to devour it, rings of ancient patterns appeared on the soul. They were very profound, filled with the truths of the ways.","“An oath of ways?” The woman was surprised. Only then did she remember and say regretfully, “I see now. Back then, we all swore an oath of ways to not turn on one another before we had recovered our bodies and returned to Grand Primes. Those who break the oath will have their souls destroyed.”","“The reason why I agreed to an oath like this back then was to prevent them from moving against me. I didn’t think it would end up holding me back instead. A pity, a pity...”","“Oh right, there was the kid who originally inherited my golden core of laws. I wonder what his cultivation is. He should have reached Infinite Prime, right?”","Only at this moment did the woman seem to awaken completely. She recalled everything that had happened in the past. When she looked at the sea of consciousness again, her face immediately changed drastically. She cried out subconsciously, “This is his soul? Impossible, how can the kid’s soul be so powerful!?”"]},{"number":3973,"title":"Chapter 3973: The Origin Composition Daemon Exalt","paragraphs":["“Senior, are you talking about me?”","As soon as the woman finished talking, a voice suddenly rang out from behind her. Jian Chen’s figure appeared there silently, staring at the woman with a slight smile.","The winged woman stared straight at Jian Chen. Her face was extremely stern. She said solemnly, “Are you the kid who inherited my golden core of laws?”","“That’s right, it was me!” Jian Chen smiled faintly. He clasped his fist and said, “The matter between us in the past was just a deal, where you gave me your golden core of laws and I was responsible for detonating your power and completely destroying Gusta’s body, but regardless, I still have to thank senior for your bestowment back then.”","The woman’s face gradually sank. She could already tell what Jian Chen was implying. He was reminding her that the matters from back then were only a deal. Neither of them owed anything to the other.","“I never thought we’d actually slumber for so long. You were so puny back then, yet you’ve already become so powerful now,” the woman said sternly. She glanced at Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness, having sensed the strength of it already.","If she were in peak condition, then the current Jian Chen obviously posed no threat to her at all. He could not even be regarded as an ant.","But now, not only had she lost her body and cultivation, but even her soul was extremely feeble.","With the current strength of her soul, she obviously experienced a tremendous difference in might compared to Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness. It felt like she was facing an undefeatable opponent.","At the same time, she sensed a terrifying pressure that even gave her chills from the central location of Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness.","This series of factors made the woman who had just awoken feel despair.","“No, you haven’t actually been slumbering for too long. My strength has just increased a little quickly.” Jian Chen continued to smile faintly. He said patiently, “Though, didn’t you seniors perish completely back then? Even your lingering wills dispersed, so why have you ended up in my soul without any warning? You never told me that something like this would happen back then.”","His words immediately made the woman’s face change. It seemed like she could not come up with an explanation. She was also aware that Jian Chen was not as easy to fool as before with his current cultivation.","“ Quick, wake up. There’s a change in the situation. ” Left at a slight loss, she immediately communicated with the six other souls. At the same time, she sent wisps of the power of her soul to the six others. Her illusionary body rapidly shrank as her soul quickly weakened.","Jian Chen watched silently. He sensed what she was doing, but he did not stop her.","“Hmm? Where is this...”","“Have I finally awakened? I wonder how long we’ve been sleeping for, but regardless, we’ve finally earned a second chance at life. Hahahaha...”","“That’s strange. Who am I? Why can’t I recall it completely...”","......","...","Very soon, the six other souls all awakened. After suffering from temporary amnesia, they recalled what had happened in the past one after another. They understood everything that had happened before this.","“A change in the situation? What change?”","“You actually sacrificed the power of your own soul to awaken us. This is unheard of. And I had thought that the first to awaken would swallow this kid’s soul...”","“How is the kid who inherited our golden cores of laws back then doing? How strong is he? Has he reached our standard? Though, since we’ve awakened at the same time, clearly no one can claim him all for themselves. Let’s split him evenly...”","The experts who awakened afterwards clearly did not understand their current predicament. They had spoken up subconsciously.","“Shut up!” The winged woman’s face was ugly as it could get. She quickly silenced them with a growl, afraid that these ignorant people would make the situation even worse.","Only at this moment did the six newly-awakened souls sense that something amiss. They quickly stopped talking and checked their surroundings. Very soon, their faces all changed.","“What a powerful soul. This is a Ninth Heavenly Layer Chaotic Prime’s at the very least, and there are several other terrifying presences too...” someone immediately cried out.","“Is this really the junior who inherited our golden core of laws? How has he become so powerful? Logically speaking, we shouldn’t have slept for that long...”","“I am Jian Chen. Congratulations on your awakening, seniors.” Jian Chen clasped his fist and bowed towards these people as a junior. He had a faint smile.","No matter how terrifying these seven experts had been in their former lives, they were all sitting ducks right now.","The souls all fell silent. They had all understood the situation they were in. The junior who had been as feeble as an ant back then had actually become so powerful now. He could destroy them at whim. A result like this was unexpected.","“Origin Composition Daemon Exalt, it’s all up to you now,” one of the souls said sternly.","Shortly afterwards, one of the six souls changed and turned into a miniature figure the size of a hand. He wore black clothes with peppered hair. He had a hook nose, and his face was covered with wrinkles.","“I am the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt. The golden core of the Laws of Curses that you inherited back then was from me.” The hook-nosed old man stared at Jian Chen. Even though he was astounded by Jian Chen’s accomplishments, he did not behave as frantically or as helplessly as the others.","“However, my Laws of Curses are different from other people’s. My ways aren’t that easy to inherit,” the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt smiled mysteriously.","In the next moment, Jian Chen furrowed his brows slightly. A ripple appeared in his sea of consciousness.","He discovered that the Laws of Curses he comprehended were constantly collapsing. It felt like someone had severed the way, forcefully stripping him of his comprehension.","Shortly afterwards, fragments of ways drifted through Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness like snowflakes before being absorbed by the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt’s soul. These fragments of ways were highly nourishing to him. His soul swelled up at a visible rate.","Jian Chen was surprised. At this moment, he could truly sense his comprehension of the Laws of Curses constantly bleed away. He struggled to believe that the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt could still strip him of his comprehension in such a forceful and brutal way despite being so feeble. It was beyond imagination.","“ This is probably an innate ability, ” Jian Chen guessed inside.","“I had merged the Shared Fate technique into my ways back then. Since you’ve absorbed my golden core of laws, you obviously bear the presence of the Shared Fate technique as well.”","“The Shared Fate technique is an innate ability of my race. Once used, our fates become shared. Your survival is mine, and my death is yours. Two souls will mutually share one body...”","“Junior, I left behind the Shared Fate technique back then originally as a safety measure. Actually, I was very reluctant to use this technique. Once I use this technique, I’ll need to use quite a lot of strength to come out on top and claim the main spot, thus earning the right to control the body.”","“After claiming the main spot, I’ll have to expend a very great amount of energy to release the Shared Fate technique so that your fate no longer ties me down. Only then can I move against you.”","“In the past, the Shared Fate technique was usually used by my race when we encountered opponents we could not defeat. It was used on opponents stronger than us for a chance at survival. You’re a mere Chaotic Prime, yet I’m personally using the Shared Fate technique on you. You should feel honoured,” the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt said forcefully.","He used the fragments from the Laws of Curses to recover his soul to a certain extent. At the same time, he used the Shared Fate technique, and his soul began to merge with Jian Chen’s.","This was an innate ability. It was specially designed to be used on people stronger than the user. It was extremely forceful and very difficult to stop.","After hearing about the wonders of the Shared Fate technique, the other experts all let out sighs of relief. They had all sworn oaths of ways to not turn against each other before they had returned to Grand Prime. If the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt used the Shared Fate technique on Jian Chen, sharing the same fate as him, Jian Chen would not be able to touch them either."]},{"number":3974,"title":"Chapter 3974: The Seven Souls Submit","paragraphs":["“Thankfully, we had you around, Origin Composition Daemon Exalt, or we’d be in danger this time...”","“If it weren’t for the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt, it’s true that we would struggle to deal with our current situation given our conditions. Who would have thought that a mere ant from back then would actually grow to such heights while we were asleep...”","The souls all smiled happily, but before they could celebrate properly, a strange presence suddenly appeared. Shortly afterwards, a different power of the soul seemed to emerge from the sea of consciousness.","When this power of the soul appeared, Jian Chen’s collapsing Ways of Curses stabilised miraculously. That was not all either. Even the fragments of ways that scattered in his sea of consciousness reassembled together, immediately breaking free from the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt’s influence and merging back into Jian Chen’s soul.","“W-what’s going on? My Shared Fate technique has actually failed? Impossible, this is impossible...” In the next moment, the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt cried out in shock. He was filled with disbelief.","His cry also put the six other experts who had just relaxed on edge. Their minds tensed up.","“Origin Composition Daemon Exalt, is your innate ability reliable or not?” one of the souls asked rather nervously. This had to do with their fates. They could not allow any careless mistakes.","The Origin Composition Daemon Exalt was dazed. He said blankly, “I’m very feeble right now, nowhere close to my peak condition, but the Shared Fate technique is not affected. After all, the technique only cares about the level of my soul. I’m using it on someone weaker than me as well. Given the level of my soul, once I use this technique, even Ninth Heavenly Layer Grand Primes won’t be able to resist it. Logically speaking, there should be no possibility of failure against a Chaotic Prime like him.”","Reaching there, the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt suddenly shuddered. His eyes rapidly narrowed as if he had been greatly frightened. He cried out hysterically, “W-what is this? Argh, dammit. This is actually Chaotic Force. From the presence, it doesn’t even seem to be false Chaotic Force. How can a power like this appear here?”","“No wonder, no wonder my Shared Fate technique would fail. His soul actually possesses a power like Chaotic Force. This has already surpassed the limits of the Shared Fate technique.”","“This kid actually has a wisp of Chaotic Force merged into his soul? Impossible, this is impossible. What kind of deviant is this? Chaotic Force is such a brutal and terrifying power, so how can it be merged into someone’s soul? This completely goes against regular logic...”","The Origin Composition Daemon Exalt was not the only one frightened. At this moment, the six other experts also discovered the existence of the Chaotic Force. They were all shocked, also filled with disbelief.","Seeing how startled the seven souls were, Jian Chen could not help but find it hilarious. “Looks like your innate ability called the Shared Fate technique isn’t enough to tie your fate with mine.” As he said that, Jian Chen’s chaotic soul appeared before the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt. Shortly afterwards, the fragments of ways absorbed by the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt were stripped from his body, returning to Jian Chen’s soul.","Immediately, Jian Chen’s Laws of Curses recovered. All of the comprehension that had been stripped from him against his will returned.","This was his comprehension in the first place. Moreover, they were inside his sea of consciousness. It obviously was not too difficult for him to reclaim his own power.","In another environment, it would not be this easy to recover his ways if they had been stripped from him.","With the fragments of ways taken from him, the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt became more and more feeble. In the end, he lost all of the power he had absorbed from Jian Chen; all of it was reclaimed entirely.","“The Shared Fate technique is useless on me. What else are you capable of? Use it all.” Jian Chen looked at the seven souls calmly.","The souls had yet to recover from their shock. They remained silent for a very long time before one of them finally said with mixed feelings, “Little brother, we admit that we underestimated you back then, and we hid some details from you. However, the seven of us still gave you our golden cores of laws when you were so weak. We’ve provided you with a certain amount of assistance on your path of cultivation. None of us want you as an enemy, so could you let us leave?”","“You’re shameless enough to mention the golden cores of laws?” Jian Chen’s voice immediately turned cold.","“T-then what do you want us to do?” The souls were rather guilty.","“I noticed your existence right from the beginning. You should know the reason why I kept you around until now.” Jian Chen scanned the seven souls slowly. A strange light flashed through his eyes. “You can make a decision now. Submit or die!”","“You want the seven of us to all submit to a Chaotic Prime like you? Kid, do you have any idea what kind of expert the seven of us were in our former lives? I’m afraid that even if we were willing to submit to you, you won’t be able to bear the consequences,” one of the souls said angrily.","“Since you won’t submit, I’ll erase you all.” Jian Chen’s voice was filled with killing intent. As his mood shifted, a violent storm of killing intent immediately brewed in the sea of consciousness, making the expressions of the seven souls change.","They could clearly sense the change in Jian Chen’s mood in the sea of consciousness. They could also sense the actual killing intent Jian Chen directed towards them.","This definitely was not as simple as trying to scare them.","“Hold on, we can pass on all of our cultivation experience from our past lives. We can even teach you all the secret techniques and God Tier Battle Skills we had grasped. We only want to leave in peace...”","“Little brother, we’re already so feeble. There’s nothing we can do. Even if you keep us around, we’re useless, so why force us into something like this? Why don’t you just exchange for some things that are useful to you instead...”","“Little brother, don’t underestimate our legacies. During our peak conditions, even the weakest of us were Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Primes. The strongest even rivaled Ninth Heavenly Layer Grand Primes. Our legacies are what is truly priceless...”","The souls ran out of confidence. They began to put forward extremely tempting conditions.","Unfortunately, no matter what they said, Jian Chen did not budge. He said coldly, “I’m going to ask you one last time. Are you going to submit or die?”","The seven souls could clearly sense Jian Chen’s determination in his sea of consciousness. They were immediately overcome with sorrow.","In the end, they were unwilling to accept dying here like this. They all chose to submit.","Jian Chen was not surprised by this result. If the seven experts were willing to die, they would not have played a trick like this when they initially left behind their golden core of laws. Instead, they would have been as at ease as swordmaster Yun Chi. They would have left without any longing for the living, truly vanishing from the world."]},{"number":3975,"title":"Chapter 3975: Identities","paragraphs":["Afterwards, the seven souls all swore oaths of ways to never betray Jian Chen as he demanded.","Jian Chen had no better way to control the seven of them for the time being. After all, they were no regular folk. They were all late Grand Primes, possessing exceptional abilities. They could not be controlled through ordinary methods.","Even with them swearing oaths of ways, Jian Chen did not trust them completely. They were weakened right now, so perhaps they were bound by the oaths of ways. However, once they recovered their peak strength, Jian Chen was not certain whether they would have any methods to get around the restraints of the oath of ways.","However, this was all he could do right now.","“Sigh, fate sure toys with people. I didn’t think I’d be enslaved from the moment I woke up...”","“Who can help the fact that we ran into a freak? His soul actually has a strand of true Chaotic Force fused in, which directly renders my innate ability useless. Otherwise, this would have never happened...”","After swearing the oaths of ways, the seven experts were all like deflated balloons. They were dispirited and depressed.","As late Grand Primes, they naturally possessed a sense of pride. They looked down on mere Chaotic Primes.","However, no matter how prideful they were, they were forced to lower their lofty heads before the threat of death.","“Introduce yourselves. How do I refer to you? And what was your cultivation during your prime?” Jian Chen said to them in a great mood.","Afterwards, through a simple self-introduction by the seven experts, Jian Chen finally gained a clear understanding of their strength.","The winged woman who awakened first was called Su Le. In her peak, she was an Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Prime.","The Origin Composition Daemon Exalt who used the Shared Fate technique on him was a Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Prime in his peak condition.","The remaining five people were Bai Jinchi, a Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Prime.","The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt, an Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Prime.","The Might Venerable, an Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Prime.","The Red Phosphor Grand Prime, an Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Prime.","The Unparalleled Emperor, an Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Prime.","Among the seven souls, apart from the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt and Bai Jinchi, the other five were all at the Eighth Heavenly Layer!","Jian Chen also learnt from them that they all possessed extraordinary bloodlines. Every single one of them came from an impressive background, possessing the strength to face those stronger than them. The Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Primes could face the Eighth Heavenly Layer, while the Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Primes could face the Ninth Heavenly Layer.","It was exactly because their bloodlines were special that they had caught the attention of supreme experts of the Ancient Great Apes, falling into traps and being reduced to sacrifices for Gusta’s physical body.","“And I had thought that master would have to use quite a bit of effort to make them submit. I never thought they would submit so easily. Compared to the other expert, the seven of you are just spineless.” The voice of the twin swords rang out. With a flash of dazzling violet and azure, the two of them appeared before the seven experts.","When they heard the twin swords’ sneer, the seven experts’ faces were all ugly. Right when they were about to curse in anger, they sensed something, and they looked at the sword spirits in a shaken manner. Shock surged through their hearts.","“T-this is the artifact spirit of a sovereign god artifact?”","“How is this possible? What kind of luck does this kid have? To think that he even possesses treasure like this...”","“Even during our peak condition, we would never even dream of such fortunes. He’s only a Chaotic Prime, so how has he obtained something like this?”","The appearance of the sword spirits immediately shocked the seven experts. All of them turned green with greed.","“Hehehehe, you lot have finally awakened. You sure have made master wait.” An elderly voice rang out. The artifact spirit of the Primeval Divine Hall appeared, turning into the figure of a small old man that appeared before the seven souls.","“A-another sovereign god artifact...”","The expressions of the seven experts suddenly changed. Their faces were filled with disbelief.","If the appearance of the sword spirits had left them envious, then the Primeval artifact spirit’s appearance had left them all stunned.","But shortly afterwards, something even more shocking occurred. The Source of Life silently appeared, having gathered over out of curiosity.","They continued to suppress the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy with their powers, but they no longer needed to use their full strength.","The appearance of the three sovereign god artifacts left the seven experts dumbstruck. They were unable to return to their senses.","“They’re too weak. If you want them to recover, it’ll take quite a bit of resources. Jian Chen, your burden has increased yet again.” The Source of Life hovered there with its hands on its hips as it criticized Jian Chen.","“Master, how do you plan on handling these people?” the Primeval artifact spirit asked with shining eyes.","“Primeval, if I were to let them possess the generals, what would happen if they try to betray me? Don’t tell me they’ll be able to leave with the bodies of the generals?” After some thought, Jian Chen still ended up stating his doubt. He had actually decided how he would deal with the seven souls many years ago. However, this qualm had always existed. He was afraid that this decision would cost him everything.","There were many powerful generals in the Primeval Divine Hall. All they lacked were powerful souls. As long as he could find souls as substitutes, these generals could turn into a powerful source of assistance instantly.","The seven souls were without a doubt the best choice.","Just like that, it would save him the process of reconstructing their bodies and recovering their cultivations. He could use them to their greatest potential in the shortest time possible.","“You don’t have to worry about this at all, master. As long as their souls possess the bodies of the generals, they will never betray you. Unless they become Saints themselves, they cannot escape your control,” the Primeval artifact spirit said in guarantee.","Jian Chen stopped worrying after that. He had already understood that the Saint of Grand Clarity had left a safety measure with the generals. Unless they became Saints, they could not escape from this restraint.","He immediately eased up as if he had found some peace of mind.","It was not that he did not believe in the oath of ways. The seven souls were far too powerful in their former lives. He did not know how powerful the restraint from the oath of ways would be on them, nor did he know if they had any methods to avoid the punishment from the oath of ways. If they decided to turn against him once they had grown in power, the consequences would be immeasurable.","The seven souls could not hear the conversation between Jian Chen and the Primeval artifact spirit. After all, this was inside his sea of consciousness. He did not need to use words to communicate.","Apart from Su Le who had awakened first, the seven other souls fell back into slumber very quickly. They had not recovered yet. They had been forcefully awakened by Su Le, so they could not stay awake for too long. Now, they had reverted back to their previous state.","If Jian Chen were willing, it was completely possible for him to prematurely awaken the six other souls at the cost of some resources, but he was in no hurry to do so. The generals had yet to be unsealed from the Primeval Divine Hall. He did not need these souls just yet.","“H-how exactly did you tame three sovereign god artifacts?” Shock lingered in Su Le’s eyes. She stared at Jian Chen in disbelief.","“That’s none of your business. You left behind the Laws of Strength among the seven golden cores of laws, right?” Jian Chen asked.","Su Le nodded.","Jian Chen smiled faintly. “I have already reached Infinite Prime with the Laws of Strength. If I have an Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Prime personally guiding me, I’ll definitely make rapid progress. Su Le, from today onwards, you will guide me with my cultivation of the Laws of Strength. Do you have any objections?”","Having sworn an oath of ways already, Su Le obviously did not have the courage to raise any objections. “I’m extremely weak right now. I can only pass on some of my experiences and knowledge verbally. If you find a way for me to recover, I can directly manifest the mysteries of the ways for you and personally pass the ways onto you. I can even teach you some of the powerful secret techniques I know without holding back.”","“Powerful secret techniques? You mean the ones you initially left in your golden cores of laws?” Jian Chen said mysteriously.","“You can’t blame us. You were so weak back then after all. The golden cores of laws we left were at most enough for you to reach Infinite Prime. As a result, the secret techniques were all made to suit your strength. Under those circumstances, even if we gave you overly profound secret techniques, you’d struggle to grasp them with your strength,” said Su Le."]},{"number":3976,"title":"Chapter 3976: Breakthrough Failed","paragraphs":["At the time, the secret techniques left behind by the seven experts were indeed extremely powerful to Jian Chen. They could be regarded as powerful trump cards for Infinite Primes.","But now, Jian Chen had already reached the peak of Chaotic Prime, so these secret techniques were useless.","After a simple conversation with Su Le, Jian Chen left his sea of consciousness. He still had more important matters to tend to. He did not want to waste too much time here.","Jian Chen did not immediately agree to Su Le’s request to help her heal her soul.","With the resources he currently possessed, he could allow Su Le to heal substantially quickly, but it was still not time yet.","Even if he healed Su Le back to early Grand Prime in a short period of time, she would not be of much help to Jian Chen as just a soul.","Without a physical body, she could not even participate in the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","Jian Chen did not plan on reconstructing her body either.","After leaving his sea of consciousness, Jian Chen did not exit the Primeval Divine Hall. Instead, he went to the top floor. With a wave of his hand, numerous Space Rings appeared before him, and he picked up one of them. With a rattle, a great pile of jade boxes of various sizes slid out, piling up very quickly. Each jade box held heavenly resources of varying grades.","These were all spoils from the Skyscraping World. Not only did they contain the heavenly resources from the several dozen medicinal gardens he had plundered, but there was also the wealth of the fallen Immortal Exalts.","These heavenly resources had all been sorted through. Right now, the ones that Jian Chen took out were all God Tier heavenly resources for improving cultivation.","However, low grade God Tier formed the majority. There were even fewer mid and high grade God Tier heavenly resources.","“Low grade God Tier heavenly resources are already useless for me. I can only use resources at mid grade or higher.” Jian Chen glanced past the mountainous pile of heavenly resources. After a moment of thought, he quietly stowed away all of the low grade resources.","Immediately, more than half of the heavenly resources around him vanished.","“ Back then in the Saints’ World, thanks to the Wind Venerable’s generosity, the half a piece of Chaotic Fruit of Ways pushed my chaotic neidan to the limits of the seventeenth layer. Although I’ve exhausted some Chaotic Force through my battles over the years, it’s still quite close to being full. I wonder if the resources in my possession are enough for me to break through to the last layer of the Chaotic Body in one stroke, ” Jian Chen thought to himself. God Tier heavenly resources obviously came nowhere close to the Chaotic Fruit of Ways. The only advantage they possessed was quantity.","Fortunately, he possessed a tremendous amount of resources from the Skyscraping World. Coupled with the large amount of cultivation resources from the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance, Jian Chen had the courage to attempt to break through to the eighteenth layer.","“ Regardless of whether I succeed or not, I have to give it a try and probe out the eighteenth layer of the Chaotic Body. ” Jian Chen went to work immediately. He began consuming the mid grade God Tier heavenly resources.","Immediately, the mid grade God Tier heavenly resources around Jian Chen were reduced one by one. He refined all of the heavenly resources at a terrifying rate. In the end, all of it turned into strands of Chaotic Force and merged into his dantian, entering his chaotic neidan.","Jian Chen’s chaotic neidan was being replenished bit by bit. He made gradual but steady progress towards filling it.","Cultivation was timeless. Completely submerged in cultivation, Jian Chen seemed to forget the concept of time, oblivious to the passing moments. He only knew that the heavenly resources he had taken out around him were reducing at a rapid rate. After who knew how long, the first batch of heavenly resources finally ran out.","Afterwards, he took out a second batch, also piling it around him. The resplendent, hazy light swallowed him.","Before he knew it, the second batch of heavenly resources had run out as well. Jian Chen repeated this with a third batch.","Jian Chen depleted his heavenly resources at a terrifying rate. The chaotic neidan in his dantian had become visibly larger, but the further he progressed, the slower it grew.","Upon growing in size, any addition to the radius would require even more Chaotic Force than before.","When Jian Chen checked his Space Ring again, he discovered that he had already run out of mid grade God Tier heavenly resources for increasing cultivation. He immediately took out another Space Ring and poured out a large number of bottles. They all contained mid grade God Tier pills that he had previously tidied through.","He picked up a jade bottle and poured over a dozen mid grade God Tier pills into his mouth at once.","Gradually, the jade bottles around Jian Chen diminished as well. In the end, he used up all of the mid grade God Tier pills on him for increasing cultivation.","At this moment, whether it was mid grade God Tier heavenly resources or pills, Jian Chen did not possess any more for increasing cultivation.","After exhausting so many heavenly resources, Jian Chen’s chaotic neidan finally showed signs of being full.","“ God Tier heavenly resources just don’t come close to the Chaotic Fruit of Ways. ” Silently observing the chaotic neidan in his dantian, Jian Chen sighed inside. After exhausting so many God Tier heavenly resources, the result did not even come close to a tenth of the half a piece of Chaotic Fruit of Ways.","Unfortunately, he no longer had any Chaotic Fruit of Ways on him. Even if the effects of these heavenly resources were almost insignificant, he could only continue like this reluctantly.","After hesitating for a short moment, Jian Chen silently took out two last Space Rings. One stored high grade God Tier heavenly resources, while the other contained high grade God Tier pills.","He continued consuming high grade God Tier pills and heavenly resources.","They were the only resources left on him that could increase his cultivation, as well as the batch with the highest quality.","The effects of the high grade God Tier pills outmatched mid grade God Tier pills. As they entered his belly, Jian Chen felt like a ball of fire had erupted inside his body. The surging energy flowed through his limbs before being rapidly converted into Chaotic Force.","Immediately, Jian Chen’s Chaotic Force began to grow at a rate that was several times faster than before.","The high grade God Tier heavenly resources rapidly decreased around Jian Chen, but he gradually began to frown. He discovered that the size of the chaotic neidan had clearly reached its limit already, but no matter how much Chaotic Force it absorbed, he did not go through the processes of shattering the neidan and reforging his body.","It felt like the chaotic neidan had suddenly become a bottomless hole. It could not be filled no matter what.","“ From the first to the seventeenth layer of cultivating the Chaotic Body, the chaotic neidan would shatter at a time like this, so why isn’t it shattering when I’m trying to break through to the eighteenth layer? Don’t tell me the process of reaching the eighteenth layer is different from the seventeen other times before? ” Jian Chen thought. He checked through his remaining resources. After making a tough decision, he continued refining them.","This time, he consumed his resources even more intensely than before. He swallowed the high grade God Tier pills several at a time. He was extremely imprudent.","The chaotic neidan that had grown to its limits in his dantian welcomed everything. No matter how much Chaotic Force was produced, it absorbed it all.","However, when Jian Chen used up half of his high grade God Tier heavenly resources, he finally noticed a slight change in the chaotic neidan. The chaotic neidan’s strength seemed to be increasing slowly at an undetectable rate.","The change in the chaotic neidan startled Jian Chen. He immediately stopped and checked his Chaotic Force. Shortly afterwards, his eyes lit up. He discovered that his Chaotic Force was indeed slightly stronger than back then in the Skyscraping World.","“ I understand now. The chaotic neidan has reached the limit of Chaotic Force it can hold, but my Chaotic Force hasn’t reached the standard of breaking through to the eighteenth layer, which is why it hasn’t shattered yet. ”","“ Sure enough, the breakthrough to the eighteenth layer is different from before. ”","Jian Chen stopped cultivating. He only had a third of the high grade God Tier heavenly resources and pills left. He had a very strong feeling that if he wanted to break through to the eighteenth layer, the resources he currently possessed were nowhere near enough.","Even if he used up all of the high grade God Tier resources, absorbed the five-coloured immortal crystals, and the mountainous piles of energy crystals inside the Energy-devouring Furnace, he still would not reach the eighteenth layer.","“ I’ve failed to break through to the eighteenth layer, but I’m getting closer and closer. Looks like I need to continue collecting resources, ” Jian Chen thought. At the same time, there was a hint of eagerness. His Chaotic Body had not broken through, but his Chaotic Force was slowly strengthening."]},{"number":3977,"title":"Chapter 3977: Within the Sect","paragraphs":["After leaving the top floor of the Primeval Divine Hall, Jian Chen paid a visit to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. When he arrived in this paradise-like world, he could not help but relax.","The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was even more beautiful than before. Spiritual birds took to the skies as spiritual beasts roamed the mountains. From time to time, the cries of all the birds and beasts would echo through the land, adding a sense of vigour to the entire world.","Spiritual Qi was extremely abundant inside the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. It came nowhere close to the Skyscraping World, but it was completely sufficient for the needs of the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","It had been a very long time since Jian Chen roamed the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. This time, he walked around the place calmly with the mentality of a passerby. He did not use the senses of his soul, only using his eyes to see the world. He visited the various mountains and rivers.","He passed by many places of cultivation belonging to the disciples of the sect and clearly saw the disciples of various strengths sitting in their dwellings, focused on cultivation.","He also saw many disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens gathered together in groups of three and five, either sparring with one another or holding intense conversations, sharing their experiences.","Along the way, Jian Chen saw how the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was brimming with vigour. It was like the rising sun, gradually growing stronger with each passing moment and shining brighter.","Even though the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was now isolated from the outside world, residing in a completely sealed space, Jian Chen did not see any negative emotions from these disciples.","It was as if none of these disciples cared about this so-called sealed environment. Every single one of them cultivated furiously and absorbed the spiritual Qi of the world greedily, absolutely enchanted by it.","Many of these disciples had all experienced the tougher times of the sect, when spiritual Qi was thin and resources were lacking. During a time like that, even cultivation had become a luxury.","Now, they had an endless amount of cultivation resources, and they would even receive an abundant amount of heavenly resources and pills every once in a while. This was a time that many disciples could only once dream of.","All of the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens were extremely satisfied with the current state of the sect.","Jian Chen passed many mountains wrapped in spiritual Qi and reached the main peak at the centre very soon.","The main peak was no longer a place that regular disciples could visit. As a result, the main peak was extremely quiet. Only the Divine Hall of Violet Heavens that represented the glory of the entire sect stood there quietly.","This was formerly the residence of the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Even though Jian Chen rarely ever visited this place, its divine status in the sect was unshakeable.","Two Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals sat beside the entrance with their legs crossed. They were solemn.","Jian Chen recognised the two of them. They were once core disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, possessing substantial status, but now, they had been arranged to guard the entrance of the Divine Hall of Violet Heavens.","“You have such a great environment for cultivation, yet you’re here guarding an empty hall. Aren’t you just wasting time? You don’t have to guard this place. You can go and cultivate,” Jian Chen showed himself and said to the two of them.","“S-sect master!” Seeing how Jian Chen had suddenly appeared, the two Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals were alarmed. They immediately stood up and bowed out of respect.","In their impression, ever since the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was rebirthed in flames, the sect master had become elusive. Rarely did they ever see him.","Now, after all these years, they finally saw Jian Chen again. They were obviously filled with unspeakable joy. They were extremely emotional.","By now, Jian Chen had become something akin to a god in the eyes of the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. It was nothing like back then on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","“Sect master, the Divine Hall of Violet Heavens is a sacred place to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. How can such an important place remain unguarded? We’re not just guarding the Divine Hall of Violet Heavens but also the dignity of our Sword Sect of Violet Heavens!”","“Being able to guard the Divine Hall of Violet Heavens is our utmost honour. Please let us keep this opportunity. We definitely won’t let you down. We’ll do everything that we can...” the two Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals said respectfully.","Jian Chen could not bear to disappoint them when he was met with the two Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals’ eager gazes, so he said nothing else. He allowed the two of them to remain here.","Jian Chen did not enter the Divine Hall of Violet Heavens. Right when he was about to leave the main peak, a wondrous fragrance of pills filled his nose. Jian Chen shifted his gaze and looked in the direction of the smell. In the next moment, he vanished.","When he appeared again, he was already elsewhere. Several figures gathered around a huge cauldron as the heavy smell of pills wafted out endlessly.","The figures involved Dan Chenzi from the Hall of Alchemy, Lin Sen from the Divine Wood clan, and a few Immortal Emperors that Jian Chen had previously saved from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.","The nine Immortal Emperors gathered around the cauldron and engaged in chitchat. They seemed to get along extremely well.","“The Spirit Transformation pills are almost complete. Dan Chenzi, have you learnt it yet?”","“Dan Chenzi, we have seven people as witnesses for this bet. According to the rules, not only do you have to give us three mid grade God Tier pills each, but you also have to give Lin Sen a mid grade God Tier pill formula...”","“Hahaha, out of the entire sect, your Hall of Alchemy is the wealthiest. Dan Chenzi, perhaps it’ll cost you a bit this time...”","“Let me think about it. Dan Chenzi, if you lose, you better give us three mid grade God Tier pills for recovering cultivation. After all, the divine formation takes quite a toll. We need to make ample preparation ourselves so that we don’t end up dragging everyone down when it matters most...”","The seven Immortal Emperors that Jian Chen had saved from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants smiled. The person refining the pills this time was not Dan Chenzi but Lin Sen of the Divine Wood clan.","Before the colossal cauldron, the leader of the Hall of Alchemy, Dan Chenzi, was stern. He stared straight at the cauldron engulfed in flames. Gradually, his eyes became filled with reluctance and sighs.","By now, the pills in the cauldron seemed to be complete. Lin Sen formed a seal with his hand before suddenly pressing it against the cauldron. With a rumble, flames gushed out and the lid of the cauldron rushed into the air. Nine round pills flew out, which Lin Sen caught in one fell stroke.","Gazing at the nine pills, there was a hint of exhaustion on Lin Sen’s face. He carefully stored the pills away in a jade bottle before looking at Dan Chenzi and smiling. “Have you learnt how to refine Spirit Transformation pills?”","A light of deduction flashed through Dan Chenzi’s eyes. In the end, he let out a gentle sigh. “You’re right. Outsiders are indeed unable to refine Spirit Transformation pills. There are indeed some other necessary conditions for refining this pill. Our Hall of Alchemy does not meet these conditions.”","“Hahaha, Dan Chenzi, you’re dreaming if you think you can replace my importance to senior daemon flower. Even in our Divine Wood clan, I’m the only one who can refine Spirit Transformation pills of this quality.” Lin Sen laughed.","“A loss is a loss. Dan Chenzi, give us our pills...”","“Hahaha, serving as your guarantor is pretty good. I’ve earned three mid grade God Tier pills so easily...”","The Immortal Emperors urged. They were in a great mood."]},{"number":3978,"title":"Chapter 3978: Arriving on the Jade’s End Heaven","paragraphs":["“A loss is a loss. Since I have lost, you will obviously be getting what I promised.” With a wave of Dan Chenzi’s hand, seven white jade bottles flew out and directly entered the hands of the seven Immortal Emperors.","Catching the jade bottles, they subconsciously opened the lid and checked inside. Sure enough, there were three mid grade God Tier pills for recovering cultivation inside. They immediately smiled from ear to ear.","“Now this truly is the Hall of Alchemy that is the wealthiest in the sect. Sure enough, you are extravagant. You can give over twenty mid grade God Tier pills away without even batting an eye. Dan Chenzi, you’ve left me so envious that I almost want to rob you.” One of the Immortal Emperors laughed.","Then Dan Chenzi gave Lin Sen an alchemy formula for a mid grade God Tier pill as promised. He shot a glare at that Immortal Emperor and said seriously, “If you want to rob me, you can do it whenever. I promise I won’t fight back.”","“Hahaha, forget about it. I want to live for a little longer. Who doesn’t know that your Hall of Alchemy is an irreplaceable treasure to the sect master. If anyone tries to go after you, the sect master will skin them alive.” The Immortal Emperor laughed.","“Exactly. The Hall of Alchemy is far more important than us Immortal Emperors. Without the Hall of Alchemy, the regular operation of that peerless formation will become an issue...”","“In the sect, we can offend anyone by the Hall of Alchemy. Hahahaha...”","The other Immortal Emperors all joked.","“I didn’t think it’d be so busy here.” At this moment, a gentle laugh suddenly rang out. Jian Chen appeared before everyone.","The Immortal Emperors who had been joking around earlier all became stern. They bowed politely. “Greetings, sect master!”","Jian Chen nodded towards them amicably before looking at the jade bottle in Lin Sen’s hand. “Since the Spirit Transformation pills are useful to the Immortal Devouring Orchid, be sure to refine some more in the future. From today onwards, all resources will be prioritised to the Spirit Transformation pills.”","“I was trying to grasp the refinement method for the Spirit Transformation pills so that I could increase the production rate. Unfortunately, only fellow Lin Sen can refine the Spirit Transformation pill. I have disappointed you, sect master,” Dan Chenzi said regretfully.","“Leave the Spirit Transformation pills entirely to Lin Sen. Your Hall of Alchemy is already busy enough. Oh right, if you discover any disciples who have a talent for alchemy in the sect, you can directly absorb them into your Hall of Alchemy,” Jian Chen said to Dan Chenzi.","At this moment, a huge shadow appeared, enveloping everyone from above. The pressure of an Immortal Exalt emanated out slightly, stifling the Immortal Emperors present.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid had appeared. Its colossal body thousands of metres long blotted out the sky, giving off a powerful pressure that no one could ignore.","Including Dan Chenzi and Lin Sen, all of the Immortal Emperors bowed towards the Immortal Devouring Orchid. They all showed great respect.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid’s might only lingered for a split second. Soon, it noticed Jian Chen, and its colossal figure immediately shrunk down, happily jumping onto his wrist and turning into a bracelet with great familiarity. It was extremely close to Jian Chen.","Lin Sen used this opportunity to hand over the Spirit Transformation pills he had just refined. With a force of suction, the Immortal Devouring Orchid swallowed the jade bottle.","The only value to his existence was to refine Spirit Transformation pills for the Immortal Devouring Orchid. If the Immortal Devouring Orchid had not been in great need of the Spirit Transformation pills, Jian Chen would have killed him back on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","Jian Chen looked at the Immortal Devouring Orchid on his wrist with a gentle gaze. He felt very glad, as the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s strength grew even faster than he had anticipated. Since the last time he saw it, the Immortal Devouring Orchid had already made relatively large progress in the Second Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. It currently progressed towards the Third Heavenly Layer at an unstoppable pace.","That even made Jian Chen wonder if the Immortal Devouring Orchid would break through to the Third Heavenly Layer by the time he roused from his next secluded cultivation.","Shortly afterwards, Jian Chen entered the world within the Immortal Devouring Orchid. Within this colossal space that resembled a true world, Jian Chen saw the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s “supply”. Corpses of experts hovered in the space there, serving as the primary reason for why the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s strength progressed so quickly.","However, most of these corpses were Xuanhuang beasts.","“ The Immortal Devouring Orchid’s strength is indeed increasing extremely quickly right now, but once it reaches the Fourth or Fifth Heavenly Layer, future progress will be very difficult. ” Jian Chen glanced at the corpses that had already reduced significantly in number, and his joy immediately died down significantly. Every small step that the Immortal Devouring Orchid made would deplete several fold more resources than before. It would be more and more difficult to collect these resources in the future.","After leaving the world within the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s body, Jian Chen visited Jing Mumu. He originally wanted to guide Jing Mumu on her cultivation, but he discovered that she had already entered the world within the speck paved by the Nine Limits Saint. She was cultivating in seclusion there.","Jian Chen did not disturb Jing Mumu. He directly left the Primeval Divine Hall. He used the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight to disguise himself before taking out a star chart and verifying his position.","“Among the thirty-three heavens of the Immortals’ World, I am currently closest to the Jade’s End Heaven,” Jian Chen murmured softly. Staring at the Jade’s End Heaven on the star chart, his eyes shone with a strange light.","“The Jade’s End Heaven. The Master of Profound Secrets seems to be there.” When he thought of the Master of Profound Secrets, Jian Chen could not help but think of when he accidentally discovered Immortal Emperor Taihang’s death by accident on the Grand Sovereign Heaven.","Immortal Emperor Taihang was one of the last three great elders in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Tasked with a heavy responsibility, he led a group of disciples and successors of the sect into hiding, leaving their homeland in hopes of preservation if the sect faced destruction.","Unfortunately, Immortal Emperor Taihang was murdered on the Grand Sovereign Heaven. Although Jian Chen had already killed the people responsible for Immortal Emperor Taihang’s death, the Master of Profound Secrets was behind these people.","“ Master of Profound Secrets, it’s time for me to pay you a visit. ” Jian Chen’s gaze immediately turned cold. With a flip of his hand, the star chart vanished. It was now replaced by a tablet.","The tablet belonged to the Master of Profound Secrets.","Jian Chen fiddled around with the Master of Profound Secrets’ tablet and smiled mysteriously. In the next moment, he vanished suddenly.","......","...","On the Jade’s End Heaven, inside Azure Mountain City, Jian Chen sat within a restaurant while disguised as a bearded, burly man. He sipped on some spiritual wine alone as he ate some delicacies made from heavenly resources.","He would glance at the sprawling mountains a thousand kilometres away from the city from time to time.","The mountain range was called the Azure Light mountain. It was where the Master of Profound Secrets cultivated.","The Azure Mountain City where Jian Chen currently resided was renowned throughout the Jade’s End Heaven because it was located at the foot of the Azure Light mountain. It was basically an organisation that belonged to the Master of Profound Secrets.","The Master of Profound Secrets had no sect or clan. Not only was he a renowned peak expert on the Jade’s End Heaven, but he was also one of the few alchemy grandmasters in the Immortals’ World. Although the Azure Mountain City was under the Master of Profound Secrets’ protection, it did not belong to him. In the beginning, it only served as a location where the Master of Profound Secrets sold his pills. It had developed to its current state over time."]},{"number":3979,"title":"Chapter 3979: Azure Light Mountain","paragraphs":["The Master of Profound Secrets liked to refine pills. The pills he refined encompassed various grades and types. Apart from God Tier pills, he would even regularly refine a whole heap of Immortal Tier pills.","The Master of Profound Secrets did not use the majority of the pills on himself, so they ended up circulating in the Azure Mountain City, becoming hot items desired by various organisations.","Various organisations of different sizes from across the Jade’s End Heaven would gather in the Azure Mountain City all year round. Their objective was very simple—to watch the various pills that came down from the Azure Light Mountain. Larger organisations that were a little more capable would pay attention to low and mid grade God Tier pills, while smaller organisations would direct their attention to various Immortal Tier pills.","The Master of Profound Secrets possessed an extremely great mastery over alchemy. Regardless of the pill, both its quality and effectiveness would be thirty percent higher if he refined it, yet they would be cheap as well. As a result, any pill from the Azure Light Mountain would be snatched up immediately regardless of the grade. Then it would be turned into various heavenly resources and delivered back to the Master of Profound Secrets.","This was all news that Jian Chen had learnt after arriving on the Jade’s End Heaven. He had already remained on the Jade’s End Heaven for almost half a month. He did not proceed to the Azure Light Mountain recklessly. Instead, he visited the various large cities of the Jade’s End Heaven and spent some resources gathering information through different avenues. Some of it was about the Master of Profound Secrets, while the other information was about the Skyscraping World.","It had already been several decades since the Skyscraping World shut its doors, but Jian Chen did not find any later reports regarding the Skyscraping World on the Jade’s End Heaven. Everything that occurred in the Skyscraping World had been contained by the two heavenly emperors, so news did not spread even until now.","As a matter of fact, even some of the peak organisations on the Jade’s End Heaven did not hear anything about the Skyscraping World.","“ Since the news from the Skyscraping World has been so strictly contained, the Master of Profound Secrets shouldn’t know my identity, ” Jian Chen looked at the bustling streets as he thought.","In the Skyscraping World, his disguise had already stopped being a secret. Basically everyone knew that the Thousand Immortal General Chang Yang from the Observance Heaven City, the sect master Jian Chen of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, and Yang Yutian from the Skyscraping World were the same person. If the Master of Profound Secrets found out he had connections with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, he would be more cautious. It might even lead to some unexpected accidents.","As a result, before he went to the Azure Light Mountain, Jian Chen needed to make all the preparations he could.","After all, many experts were secretly directing their attention towards the sovereign god artifacts on him.","At this moment, dark clouds suddenly loomed over the Azure Light Mountain in the distance. Violet lightning crackled between the clouds, erupting with thunder.","When the dark clouds appeared, all of the cultivators in the Azure Mountain City thousands of kilometres away felt tremendous pressure as if a mountain was weighing against their chests. It was suffocating.","“Another one of these lightning tribulations, just like a century ago...”","“The Master of Profound Secrets must be refining an impressive God Tier pill. He triggers a tribulation every century...”","“It is no wonder that there recently hasn’t been any pills from the Azure Light Mountain. So the Master of Profound Secrets is refining a peerless pill. I wonder how much longer he needs to complete it...”","“Some higher quality God Tier pills can take thousands or even ten thousand years to refine. The God Tier pill that the Master of Profound Secrets is refining right now is clearly not of low quality. Looks like there won’t be any other Immortal Tier pills from the Azure Light Mountain for a very long time into the future...”","Discussions arose throughout the Azure Mountain City as they gazed at the colossal tribulation clouds that enveloped most of the Azure Light Mountain. Many cultivators were filled with pity.","Suddenly, a terrifying pressure erupted from the Azure Light Mountain. As someone’s mighty cultivation surged, a colossal hand extended out from the depths of the Azure Light Mountain, striking the sky with devastating power.","When the hand appeared, countless cultivators in the Azure Mountain City narrowed their eyes. Their faces immediately turned sheet-white.","To them, the power of the hand was far too terrifying. Even if a wisp of its presence leaked out, it was enough to annihilate most of them.","Boom!","With a rumble, the hand of energy directly struck the tribulation lightning. The terrifying tribulation that was enough to make countless cultivators in the Azure Mountain City pale had been forcefully scattered by that attack.","Immediately, the space above the Azure Light Mountain twisted violently. Spatial cracks covered the entire sky before collapsing in fragments.","The sky over the Azure Light Mountain sank into temporary darkness. Only several seconds did the space stabilise and clear up once more.","The pressure dispersed. Many cultivators in the Azure Mountain City breathed a sigh of relief as if a heavy burden had been lifted from their shoulders.","In the restaurant by the side of the street, Jian Chen gazed in the direction that the hand had vanished in. He had already recognised who it was. It was one of the four experts who had assisted the Master of Profound Secrets in dealing with the Starflame Demon Lion. He was the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Courtyard of Four Sages on the Scholarly Attainment Heaven, a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","At this moment, a man in black robes appeared before Jian Chen. He quietly communicated to Jian Chen, “ Sect master, I’ve already searched through the entire Jade’s End Heaven. Apart from the native experts of the Jade’s End Heaven, I haven’t discovered any hidden presences for the time being. ”","The man in black robes was the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt!","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt then added, “ Of course, due to my limited strength, this is all I can find. You can’t eliminate any foreign experts who’ve hidden themselves on the Jade’s End Heaven through exceptional methods. ”","Jian Chen sat with his head lowered in thought for a moment before silently rising and making his way outside. He said to the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, “ Enter the Primeval Divine Hall and prepare the Divine Formation of the Heavens! ”","“ Yes, sect master! ” Excitement flashed through the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s eyes. Shortly afterwards, he vanished silently. He had already entered the Primeval Divine Hall secretly.","Jian Chen left the Azure Mountain City. He changed his disguise into the face that the Master of Profound Secrets was familiar with before directly flying towards the mountain entrance on the Azure Light Mountain.","On the Jade’s End Heaven, the Master of Profound Secrets was someone who cared about his reputation very much. Any expert who visited the Azure Light Mountain, regardless of strength or background, had to enter by the main entrance. If they directly flew over the Azure Light Mountain without permission, it would be viewed as severe provocation.","Of course, this rule set up by the Master of Profound Secrets was only followed by organisations native to the Jade’s End Heaven and some foreign experts whose backgrounds were not too powerful. If a late Immortal Exalt directly flew over the Azure Light Mountain, the Master of Profound Secrets would simply ignore it.","Jian Chen came with hostile intentions, but he clearly did not want to displease the Master of Profound Secrets over a small detail like this, so he followed the rules and entered by the main entrance.","“Who is it? State your identity!” As soon as he approached the Azure Light Mountain, a medicinal page appeared. He possessed the cultivation of a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, and he stared at Jian Chen haughtily.","The medicinal page seemed very young, but who knew how many years he had been cultivating for already.","“I am Yang Yutian. I’ve come to visit the Master of Profound Secrets!” Jian Chen clasped his fist. When he stated his name, he paid close attention to the medicinal page’s expression.","However, the medicinal page’s expression did not change at all as if he had never heard of Yang Yutian before. He waved his hand rather impatiently and said, “Can’t you see that the master is refining pills? When he’s refining pills, the master does not receive any guests. You should go. Don’t get in the way of the master refining his peerless pill.”","Jian Chen casually tossed out a tablet and said, “This is the tablet that the master gave to me.”","The page showed great disdain. “The master specially instructed beforehand that the pill he is refining this time is very important. He refuses to meet with anyone, even if they have a tablet.” That was what he said, but Jian Chen had already tossed his tablet over, so the page caught it subconsciously. Right when he was about to return the tablet to Jian Chen, he unintentionally glanced at the tablet.","It was just a casual glance, but when he truly saw the tablet, his eyes immediately narrowed violently. His heart began thumping uncontrollably.","The Master of Profound Secrets gave away many kinds of tablets. He gave away many tablets as well. As a result, there were plenty of people who possessed the Master of Profound Secrets’ tablets.","However, these tablets were also split into categories. For example, with owners of regular tablets, the page would not even bat an eye when he faced them. He could order them around.","However, the tablet that Jian Chen had produced was different; it was no regular tablet but one of the highest grade.","The page who was familiar with the Master of Profound Secrets knew extremely well that only special people that the Master of Profound Secrets believed could not be offended or possessed statuses so esteemed that even the Master of Profound Secrets had to treat carefully, had the right to receive these kinds of tablets.","Since Jian Chen possessed a tablet like that, the page obviously viewed him as a major figure that even the Master of Profound Secrets refused to offend.","As long as a major figure like that demonstrated even the slightest displeasure towards him in front of the Master of Profound Secrets, his life might meet its end. He would be mercilessly executed by the Master of Profound Secrets.","The page’s attitude immediately underwent a drastic turnaround. He became extremely polite. Cupping the tablet in both hands, he passed it back to Jian Chen and said fearfully, “It’s all my fault. I have been blind for failing to recognise such an important guest. Please give me the chance to right this wrong.”","“Can I enter the Azure Light Mountain?” Jian Chen stared at the page indifferently.","“Of course, of course you can. This way please, senior. I’ll lead you to the main hall right now!” The page politely invited Jian Chen onto the Azure Light Mountain. Very soon, he brought Jian Chen to a majestic hall.","Over a dozen pages were already waiting there. They seemed to have found out about Jian Chen’s esteemed status already. Every single one of them was extremely polite, serving various kinds of spiritual fruits in an orderly and careful manner.","“Senior, the master has specially warned us that the pill he’s refining this time is very important. He cannot afford to make any mistakes, and he is not to be disturbed by anyone. However, due to your special identity, senior, you obviously don’t fall under that rule. As a result, please wait here for a moment. I'll contact the master immediately.”","“Then go!” Jian Chen waved his hand without any concern. However, he sighed inside. He knew that he only received this treatment due to the Illusionary Ancestor.","When he thought of the Illusionary Ancestor, Jian Chen felt very puzzled, as he did not know why the Illusionary Ancestor was so kind to him.","“Hahahaha, and I had been wondering why the refinement process had become so smooth recently. So it’s my friend Yang Yutian who’s come to the Azure Light Mountain, immediately turning it into a blessed land. Even this cauldron of ancient pills that I’m refining has become much easier...”","Jian Chen did not wait for long. The Master of Profound Secrets’ familiar voice rang out from outside. He had clearly only just come from the alchemy room. A fiery presence still lingered on him. Even his robes had faded slightly in colour from the heat.","With the Master of Profound Secrets’ arrival, the temperature in the cool hall immediately rose as if it had turned into a huge furnace."]},{"number":3980,"title":"Chapter 3980: Meeting the Master of Profound Secrets","paragraphs":["When he watched the Master of Profound Secrets stride into the hall, a hint of surprise appeared in Jian Chen’s eyes. He obviously knew that the Master of Profound Secrets was currently refining ancient pills for the Illusionary Ancestor, so he could not commit mistakes. As a result, he originally thought the Master of Profound Secrets would only send a soul clone to receive him. He never expected him to come in person!","“You are too kind, master. With your exceptional master over alchemy, what kind of pill can’t you refine with ease? Instead, I’ve come without any warning, so I hope I haven’t disturbed you.” Jian Chen stood up and clasped his hands at the Master of Profound Secrets with a smile.","“I’ve been looking forward to your visit, fellow Yang Yutian. You’ve finally come today, so how can I call it a disturbance?” The Master of Profound Secrets laughed. Shortly afterwards, he looked around and said, “Fellow Jade Lotus, fellow Rushing Lightning, fellow Blood Butcher, fellow Ancient Virtue, an important guest has come to my Azure Light Mountain. Please gather here. I’ll hold a banquet to welcome fellow Yang Yutian.”","The Master of Profound Secrets’ voice resounded through the surroundings, completely resonating across the Azure Light Mountain.","Shortly afterwards, four figures appeared silently behind the Master of Profound Secrets. They were the four experts who had assisted him in killing the Starflame Demon Lion. They were the Jade Lotus Master of Mount Penglai on the Jade’s End Heaven, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt of the Heaven’s Thunder Tower on the Numerous Layer Heaven, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt of the Blood Immortal sect on the Ease Nurturing Heaven, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Courtyard of Four Sages on the Scholarly Attainment Heaven.","The four experts were all Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. They were all stronger than the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt at his peak.","However, when they faced Jian Chen who was merely an Immortal Emperor, they all set aside their arrogance. Even though they were not as enthusiastic as the Master of Profound Secrets, they still greeted Jian Chen amicably with smiles.","As someone favoured by the Illusionary Ancestor, they could not afford to offend him without good reason regardless of his identity or background.","The Master of Profound Secrets immediately began instructing the medicinal pages to prepare a banquet for Jian Chen to welcome him. However, Jian Chen declined the offer by using the refinement of the ancient pills as a reason.","As soon as he thought of the cauldron of ancient pills that were still in the process of being refined, the Master of Profound Secrets became slightly worried. He was concerned that something would go wrong, so he agreed with Jian Chen and gave up on the banquet.","“I’ve come to the Azure Light Mountain this time for two reasons. I want to learn about the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation, and I also want to see the supreme pill that can only be refined from the essence of the Starflame Demon Lion’s five organs. I was wondering if I could be fortunate enough for that to happen,” Jian Chen said.","When he heard about the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation, the Master of Profound Secrets’ eyes immediately lit up. When the Illusionary Ancestor slew the Starflame Demon Lion, she had given its inner core to Jian Chen. The inner core was a superb material for refining Divine Pills of Way Accumulation.","The Master of Profound Secrets smiled even more enthusiastically. “The ancient pills I’m refining are extraordinary, not just because you rarely come across pills of such high grade, but also because my client is extremely honourable, so honourable that I’m forced to devote all of my efforts to refining these pills. I can’t allow for any mistakes to happen. If someone else put forward a request like this, even if they were a late Immortal Exalt, I’d downright refuse them, but you are an exception, fellow Yang Yutian.”","“Fellow Yang Yutian, please come with me to where I refine my pills!”","The Master of Profound Secrets made an inviting gesture. Afterwards, he led the way. Meanwhile, the four experts headed off in their respective directions. Under the Master of Profound Secrets’ request, they continued to guard the Azure Light Mountain.","Very soon, Jian Chen entered a mountain peak enveloped by several formations and finally saw where the Master of Profound Secrets refined his pills.","It was an open terrace. A colossal cauldron thirty metres tall stood there silent. The violent flames engulfed the entire cauldron, releasing a terrifying heat that seemed to be able to burn the space there.","One of the Master of Profound Secrets’ soul clones sat there, carefully observing any changes in the cauldron. Now that he had arrived here in person, the two immediately merged together.","Jian Chen stopped three hundred metres away from the cauldron. The burning flames were far too terrifying. They were enough to burn Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts to death. With his current strength, he could not get any closer.","Even the Fourth Heavenly Layer Master of Profound Secrets did not have the courage to remain near the flames for extended periods of time.","“Before I finish refining this cauldron of ancient pills, there’s nothing else that I can do either. I won’t be able to refine the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation. If fellow Yang Yutian wants to refine the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation, I’m afraid you’ll have to wait a little,” the Master of Profound Secrets gazed at the cauldron up ahead and said with some pity.","“I heard this cauldron of ancient pills is refined for the crown prince Daowei Chengqing?” Jian Chen looked at the cauldron and asked casually.","“That’s correct. This is indeed something prepared by the Illusionary Ancestor for crown prince Daowei Chengqing. As long as crown prince Daowei Chengqing ingests these pills when he breaks through to Immortal Exalt, he will forge the strongest foundations after he reaches Immortal Exalt. He will be unprecedentedly powerful and unmatched within the same realm.” As soon as he mentioned Daowei Chengqing, the Master of Profound Secrets’ eyes were filled with undisguised amazement. “Even though Daowei Chengqing has already become unmatched in his realm of cultivation with his exceptional talent, it will without a doubt push him to a new height on the path of invincibility if he has the assistance of this pill.”","“As a result, the Illusionary Ancestor cares very much about this cauldron of ancient pills.”","“I never thought that the Illusionary Ancestor would care about Daowei Chengqing so much. In order to assemble the materials for refining this pill, she went as far as to personally slay that powerful Starflame Demon Lion.” Jian Chen sighed. He was slightly cautious but also grateful towards her.","However, he only had hostility towards Daowei Chengqing.","He would never forget how Daowei Chengqing had tried using a strand of Stainless Qi as bait to harm him back then in the sacred land of the Observance Heaven City. If he had not been careful, he probably would have suffered tremendously.","“There’s no need to be envious of crown prince Daowei Chengqing, fellow Yang Yutian. Actually, the Illusionary Ancestor treats you quite well, even on par with crown prince Daowei Chengqing. After all, when she slew the Starflame Demon Lion, the Illusionary Ancestor actually went as far as to shoulder the severe consequence of a more intense tribulation of decline just to save that person for fellow Yang Yutian.”","“Apart from crown prince Daowei Chengqing, I’m afraid that only you can make the Illusionary Ancestor make such a great sacrifice.”","The Master of Profound Secrets looked at Jian Chen with a smile. He was extremely friendly, giving off a sense of closeness. He asked curiously, “Oh right, I was wondering about what clan or sect you came from, fellow Yang Yutian. Once this cauldron of pills is complete, I’ll definitely pay a visit in person. By then, I hope you won’t turn me away, fellow Yang Yutian.”","Jian Chen knew the Master of Profound Secrets was trying to investigate his identity and background. He said with a smile, “With the master’s status, you’d be an esteemed guest no matter where you go, so how can you be turned away? Unfortunately, I belong to no sect or clan. I am an independent cultivator in the Immortals’ World, which may disappoint the master.”","“Haha, it’s not a problem, it’s not a problem. If it’s inconvenient for fellow Yang Yutian to tell me, you can just treat it like I never asked.” The Master of Profound Secrets clearly did not believe him. After all, the Illusionary Ancestor had exposed Jian Chen for his lie back then. He also knew that the name Yang Yutian was fake.","However, regardless of whether it was fake or not, this was not important. He only needed to know that the Illusionary Ancestor favoured this person very much.","That was the greatest value that the Master of Profound Secrets saw in him, as well as the only value he saw in him.","“It’s not inconvenient. It’s just that the organisation I came from had been destroyed long ago. I only managed to inherit my master’s legacy on the brink of his death,” Jian Chen said."]},{"number":3981,"title":"Chapter 3981: Probing","paragraphs":["When he heard that, the Master of Profound Secrets was very surprised. He sighed. “I never thought that fellow Yang Yutian would have an encounter like that behind him. Don’t tell me the reason why you’re hiding your identity is because of enemies?”","“Partially.” Jian Chen demonstrated a moment of hesitation before finally making up his mind about something important. His eyes became resolute as he clasped his fist towards the Master of Profound Secrets. “Since we’re already talking about this, there’s no point in hiding it any longer. The truth is that my master is the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon.”","“What? The Heaven-defeating Sword Demon? Don’t tell me it’s the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon who perished five million years ago?” When he heard the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon’s name, the Master of Profound Secrets was startled, subconsciously crying out loud.","In the Immortals’ World, there were countless people who bore the name of Heaven-defeating Sword Demon, but there was only one who truly made a name for himself.","“That’s right, the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon who perished five million years ago. However, I only met a wisp of lingering will left behind by my master after he had died. After passing my master’s tests, my master brought me to a hidden dwelling that he had set up when he was still alive. In the hidden dwelling, my master had already arranged everything. I also received my master’s legacy there,” Jian Chen said with mixed feelings.","The Master of Profound Secrets was shocked. He murmured to himself, “The Heaven-defeating Sword Demon. The Heaven-defeating Sword Demon. I never thought that fellow Yang Yutian’s master would actually be the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon. Back in the day, the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon was a brutal, fearless demon that basically no one dared to provoke. He was extremely eccentric, bloodthirsty, and vengeful. In the past, after some disciples from a few major sects accidentally angered him, he annihilated the sects behind them. Many innocent people were involved.”","“Although the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon was only a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he grasped some extremely profound secret techniques, allowing him to face the Sixth Heavenly Layer. Moreover, he possessed an exceptional concealment technique, so even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts were not able to find his tracks.”","“That served as the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon’s basis for roaming the Immortals’ World fearlessly. During that period, among the many peak organisations that stood at the apex of the Immortals’ World, all of them would feel pained when the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon was mentioned. Even the courts of heaven were very fearful of the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon, refusing to provoke him without good reason.”","“That was because an example that shook the Immortals’ World had happened before. A disciple of a court of heaven offended the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon. In the end, he was slain by the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon without any hesitation. As a result, the court of heaven began feuding with the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon. This continued until one of their Immortal Exalt ancestors was heavily injured by the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon, finally alarming the heavenly emperor. In the end, the heavenly emperor from that court of heaven personally hunted down the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon, yet he still managed to slip away.”","“The Heaven-defeating Sword Demon was extremely skilled in both fleeing and hiding. As he hid in the Immortals’ World, the heavenly emperor never managed to find the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon over all those years no matter how exceptional his techniques were...”","“The Heaven-defeating Sword Demon began to watch the court of heaven as well. He did not approach the court of heaven, just remaining in hiding and watching them. Whenever a disciple from that court of heaven left the organisation, they would become a target for the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon regardless of their cultivation.”","“Against experts he stood no chance, the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon would avoid them from afar. Once he encountered ones he could deal with, he would strike swiftly, killing them in a single strike...”","“In order to deal with the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon, the court of heaven tried many different ideas. They also made many arrangements and traps. The heavenly emperor participated numerous times as well, but the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon would either see through it or slip away. In the end, the court of heaven was forced into shutting its gates for ten thousand years. From then on, the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon’s reputation skyrocketed...”","Reaching there, the Master of Profound Secret’s face was filled with emotion. He sighed and said, “The Heaven-defeating Sword Demon was indeed a legendary figure. He was both fearsome and respectable. He was fearsome for his bloodthirsty nature and disregard for lives, annihilating entire organisations for no good reason. He could strike fear into the hearts of people with just his name. He was respectable for his abilities and techniques. He was just a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, yet he could make heavenly emperors powerless against him. Throughout the Immortals’ World, just how many people could achieve that alone?”","“Let alone Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, even some late Immortal Exalts will struggle to achieve what the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon did when faced with the pursuit of a heavenly emperor...”","Reaching there, the Master of Profound Secrets glanced at Jian Chen deeply. Jian Chen’s concealment ability was also exceptional. That bore great similarity to the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon.","“But so what if he could avoid heavenly emperors for the time being? Didn’t my master still die in the end?” There was a hint of sorrow in Jian Chen’s voice.","“The Heaven-defeating Sword Demon was far too arrogant. In that day and age, he should have never offended a super organisation with a Grand Exalt. As long as he didn’t provoke those Grand Exalt organisations, the courts of heaven would indeed be powerless against the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon,” the Master of Profound Secrets said in pity. Shortly afterwards, he looked at Jian Chen in interest and said, “Fellow Yang Yutian, do you know who your master died to?”","“Of course, I do. My master was killed by an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Under the pursuit of that Immortal Exalt from the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, all of my master’s hiding techniques became useless.” When he mentioned the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, chilling killing intent appeared in Jian Chen’s voice.","The Master of Profound Secrets smiled gently. “Back then, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had a Grand Exalt. As long as the Grand Exalt exerted some influence, your master would obviously have nowhere to hide. It could be said that the Heaven-defeating Sword Demon’s death is directly connected to that Grand Exalt.”","“However, times change. The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was like the midday sun back then, influencing the entire Immortals’ World, yet it still ended up declining. It can’t even compare to some small sects. Do you want to avenge your master, fellow Yang Yutian?”","“I have never forgotten about avenging my master. Even though my master’s murderer already perished many years ago, his sect still stands after all. Although the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens on the Reverent Observance Heaven is being watched by many people, which makes it difficult to take action openly, there are still some disciples wandering the world outside. As a result, I’ve been secretly investigating these disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens lurking in hiding over the years.”","“When I inherited my master’s legacy, I swore an oath to annihilate every single disciple of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens,” Jian Chen said coldly.","“Then have you made any progress, fellow Yang Yutian?” the Master of Profound Secrets asked.","Jian Chen immediately became cautious. He stared straight at the Master of Profound Secrets and said, “The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens may have declined, but the power lurking behind them is still formidable. If you know these secrets, you’re not going to try and use them against me, are you?”","The Master of Profound Secrets began laughing. “You are overthinking this, fellow Yang Yutian. Even if you forget the possibility that I might be feuding with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, just from how much the Illusionary Ancestor favours you, I would never harm you even if I were a hundred times bolder.”","A streak of light flashed through Jian Chen’s eyes. He asked in surprise, “You also have a grievance with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens?”","The Master of Profound Secrets recalled a sorrowful matter of the past. He immediately became dispirited. “The truth is I accepted a disciple in the past. He possessed great talent and demonstrated tremendous potential with both the Way of Alchemy and the Way of Smithing. I had always viewed him as my successor, holding great expectations for him...”","“But in the end, my disciple was killed by a disciple of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens...”","“As a result, I have always borne a very deep grudge towards the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens...”","The Master of Profound Secrets’ elderly eyes shone with bone-deep hatred.","“In other words, you and I are people of the same path. Looks like I’m not alone on the path of revenge. Master of Profound Secrets, are you willing to travel with me on this path of revenge?” Jian Chen asked. In the past, the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens upheld justice with a strong sense of duty. They punished many crooked folk in the Immortals’ World. He knew that since the Master of Profound Secrets’ disciple had raised the attention of disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, he must have committed some heinous crimes.","The sorrow did not vanish from the Master of Profound Secrets’ eyes. He continued, “I have always been working on avenging my disciple. The ancestral grounds of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens on the Reverent Observance Heaven is a place where major organisations secretly face off against one another. It has connections to many. I don’t have the courage to rashly become involved with the matters there, but I have found quite a few disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens who are wandering the world.”","“Really? That’s fantastic. I was wondering if you could tell me about these people.” Jian Chen beamed with joy.","“Too late. They’ve already been buried with my disciple.” The Master of Profound Secrets sneered as his eyes shone coldly.","Killing intent immediately surged in the bottom of Jian Chen’s heart, but he concealed it perfectly. He sighed gently. “What a pity. I originally thought that I could join hands with you and embark on a path of revenge together. I never thought that you would have already rushed ahead.”","The Master of Profound Secrets looked at Jian Chen deeply and said, “Fellow Yang Yutian, out of respect for the Illusionary Ancestor, I’ll give you a warning. If you want to go after the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, you have to get to the bottom of their background. Right now, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens can be viewed as two factions. One faction is the main branch on the Reverent Observance Heaven, while the other faction is the branch supported by the Waymight clan.”","“You must not touch even a hair of the branch supported by the Waymight clan. Your master’s death is a lesson that you should learn from. You must not follow the same path as your master.”","“Thank you for telling me this. I will never forget it.” Jian Chen continued to ask, “I know that you are well-informed and possess knowledge about many secrets that I do not know of. I was wondering if you could recommend to me a few other people who are on the same path?”","After a moment of thought, the Master of Profound Secrets said, “I do indeed know some fellows who have a grievance with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. I won’t mention the ones I’m not close with, but there are a few who absolutely hate the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. They all possess organisations of a certain scale as well, so you can visit them. Perhaps they will possess the information that you are after.”"]},{"number":3982,"title":"Chapter 3982: Killed Without Mercy","paragraphs":["The Master of Profound Secrets believed Jian Chen sincerely. He immediately took out a jade slip and passed it to Jian Chen after engraving some information on it. “I am quite close with the people on here. Without my recommendation, you will never be able to get any useful information out of them if you were to recklessly visit them. They will also vehemently deny any grievances towards the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.”","“As a result, I’ve already made a secret mark on the jade slip. They will understand everything when they see the mark. They will place their complete trust in you. You can ask them about everything, fellow Yang Yutian.”","Jian Chen grabbed the jade slip and took a look. There were only five names on there. Under each name was a clear indication of the organisation they came from and the background they possessed. Moreover, all of these people were early Immortal Exalts.","None of these five people were on the Jade’s End Heaven. They were on five different heavens. One of them was the Grand Sovereign Heaven, which threw Jian Chen into a daze.","Not only was the Grand Sovereign Heaven Jian Chen’s first stop in the Immortals’ World, but it was also where he had found one of the three great elders of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Immortal Emperor Taihang.","After stowing the jade slip away, Jian Chen clasped his fist towards the Master of Profound Secrets and thanked him. However, the Master of Profound Secrets who was already directing his full attention towards the situation in the cauldron had failed to notice that Jian Chen’s attitude was rather cold right now.","At this moment, something happened in the cauldron. Pulses of violent energy surged out endlessly, slamming against the cauldron and producing rumbles. The entire cauldron shook gently.","The medicinal power inside was changing. The balance achieved previously was about to be broken. If it were not dealt with, it would end in the cauldron exploding.","The Master of Profound Secrets handled this calmly. He arrived before the cauldron with a flash and directly pressed one hand against it. His turbulent energy surged into the cauldron as an endless flow. At the same time, he flicked his other hand at the nearby pile of heavenly resources. Heavenly resources wrapped in hazy light were cast into the cauldron in an orderly fashion.","Under the Master of Profound Secrets’ guidance, the violent power in the cauldron finally settled down. Everything turned back to normal.","However, the Master of Profound Secrets did not relax. Instead, he became even more stern. He constantly produced seals with his hand while his eyes remained glued to the cauldron, giving it his full attention.","Jian Chen stared straight at the cauldron as well. His mastery over the Way of Alchemy came nowhere close to the Master of Profound Secrets’, but he did have some achievement. He could clearly tell that the ancient pills in the cauldron seemed to have reached some kind of important step. The various powers inside were strengthening with each passing moment. The Master of Profound Secrets needed to maintain the balance and stability between these powers at all times.","“Master, how much longer do you need until you finish refining these pills?” Jian Chen suddenly asked.","The Master of Profound Secrets struck out with his hand again and again, hitting various locations of the cauldron according to some kind of special rhythm. Only after that did he say in thought, “That’s difficult to say. After all, the quality of these pills is extremely high, and they are extremely difficult to refine. Many of the incidents that occurred during the refinement process were not under my control. I could only deal with them as they occurred.”","“However, if I were to provide an estimate, it’ll take another thousand years at the earliest. If it takes longer than that, it might even take several tens of thousand years.”","“Another thousand years at the earliest? That’s a pity.” Jian Chen stared at the cauldron with a hint of regret. Afterwards, he turned around and walked into the distance, moving away from the cauldron.","Watching Jian Chen walk away, the Master of Profound Secrets thought Jian Chen did not want to refine the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation anymore. He could not help but panic. “Don’t panic, my friend. A thousand years is but a blink of an eye to the likes of us. I can promise you that once these pills are complete, I will immediately refine the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation for you.”","When he heard that, Jian Chen could not help but stop. He slowly turned around and looked at the Master of Profound Secrets. “Actually, I never wanted you to refine the Divine Pills of Way Accumulation.”","The Master of Profound Secrets was taken aback. He looked at Jian Chen with a hint of confusion, but before he could say anything, Jian Chen spoke up again, “Actually, I came to the Azure Light Mountain for a single goal—the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens!”","“Master of Profound Secrets, we originally had no grievances, but there are some things that I have no choice but to do. Apologies for the offence!”","After Jian Chen said that, the space over his head twisted. A peerless formation composed of several tens of thousand cultivators silently appeared, radiating with a chilling presence.","It was the Divine Formation of the Heavens!","The Master of Profound Secrets was a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt after all. As his place of alchemy, there were many formations in the surroundings as well. In order to eliminate any chance for the Master of Profound Secrets to make use of the formations, Jian Chen used the Divine Formation of the Heavens without any hesitation, aiming to kill him in a single strike.","This time also happened to be the first time that the Divine Formation of the Heavens was revealed to the world after assembling all fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples. Although it had yet to erupt with that devastating strike, the pressure it emanated far surpassed its previous state.","“Fellow Yang Yutian, w-w-what do you mean by this?” The Master of Profound Secrets stared at the peerless formation that appeared out of thin air in a daze. He was clueless.","Actually, from the moment the Divine Formation of the Heavens appeared, the Master of Profound Secrets had already realised that something was off. However, he struggled to believe that Jian Chen would actually come after him at such a critical time.","After all, it was currently a crucial moment in refining the ancient pills. The Illusionary Ancestor also happened to be in need of these pills. Since Yang Yutian was favoured by the Illusionary Ancestor and had benefitted from her grace, there was no reason for him to ruin her plans no matter what.","Before the Master of Profound Secrets could think any more about it, a devastating blast of light suddenly appeared, descending with gorgeous colour. It completely locked onto the space where the Master of Profound Secrets resided.","Boom!","With a deafening rumble, the Master of Profound Secrets’ body was completely reduced to nothing under the devastating blast from the Divine Formation of the Heavens. In his moments before death, his eyes were filled with disbelief.","It was as if even upon death, he did not understand why Jian Chen wanted to kill him.","The power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens was extremely startling. Not only did it completely claim the Master of Profound Secrets’ life with that strike, but it even pierced the high quality god artifact cauldron on the side. It destroyed the ancient pills that the Master of Profund Secrets had been refining.","It tore apart all the formations that the Master of Profound Secrets had set up in the surroundings as well. The terrifying shockwave turned into a devastating storm that swept through the surroundings. The entire mountain range seemed to be facing the end of the world. The rocks collapsed, the ground sank in, and even the sky turned to black.","“Oh no, the Master of Profound Secrets...”","“What exactly is going on? What a powerful energy storm. Retreat!”","......","...","In the surroundings of the Azure Light Mountain, four figures rushed into the air with tremendous presences. They were all startled and enraged.","They were the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Jade Lotus Master.","But at this moment, they seemed quite lacklustre as they faced the shockwave from the Divine Formation of the Heavens as Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. They all retreated rapidly in their surprise and fury.","The energy storm was far too powerful. It was truly devastating. Even with their strength, they struggled to stop it. All they could do was launch powerful attacks while retreating, throwing everything they had at the incoming wave of energy to mitigate its might.","The blast from the Divine Formation of the Heavens directly plunged underground, landing deep into the foundations of the Azure Light Mountain. It made the entire Jade End’s Heaven shake.","At this moment, the entire Jade’s End Heaven experienced an earthquake. Countless cracks ran across the entire place like spider webs.","From outer space, it was even possible to see the entire Jade’s End Heaven shift in position.","All of the peak experts on the Jade’s End Heaven opened their eyes. They stared in the direction of the Azure Light Mountain in shock.","In the next moment, numerous figures appeared around the Azure Light Mountain like they had teleported over. There were over thirty of them. Their presences all varied in strength, but even the weakest was a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","“Everyone, let’s block this storm together!” the Jade Lotus Master roared out hysterically. Her voice boomed across the Jade’s End Heaven.","She was an expert native to the Jade’s End Heaven. She possessed very great prestige. With her calling, all of the Immortal Exalts gathered there took action, working together to hold back the shockwave from the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","The Jade’s End Heaven was not the Skyscraping World. The Skyscraping World had many peak formations set up by Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. The Divine Formation of the Heavens obviously could not cause too much damage there.","However, the Jade’s End Heaven was different. Let alone attacks on par with late Immortal Exalts, even the battles between mid Immortal Exalts could bring devastation to a heaven."]},{"number":3983,"title":"Chapter 3983: The Illusionary Ancestor Arrives","paragraphs":["Immediately, the Azure Light Mountain rumbled endlessly. All of the Immortal Exalts struck out. Streaks of resplendent light shot across the sky, collapsing the space with terrifying presences.","The space around the Azure Light Mountain constantly shattered and healed. Even the ways woven into the region began to ripple.","With over thirty Immortal Exalts from the Jade’s End Heaven gathered here, their intense clash with the shockwave from the Divine Formation of the Heavens was basically like the end of the world.","Figures constantly gathered further away. They were Immortal Emperors from various regions of the Jade’s End Heaven. At this moment, they all stared at the terrifying sight near the Azure Light Mountain in shock. Many of them paled.","As Immortal Emperors, they were already experts who could rule over a region on the Jade’s End Heaven, but they were unable to interfere with the catastrophe up ahead.","“That’s the Master of Profound Secrets’ territory. What is happening? Why did this occur...”","“I heard that the Master of Profound Secrets is in the process of refining an impressive cauldron of ancient pills. Surely this isn’t caused by failure in the refinement process...”","“Even if he failed in refining the pills, it shouldn’t have caused such a terrifying disaster. How can this devastating situation be caused by mere pills?”","......","...","The Immortal Emperors that had gathered nearby discussed intensely among themselves. All of their hearts wavered, struggling to remain calm.","Finally, under the combined efforts of all these Immortal Exalts, the shockwave created by the Divine Formation of the Heavens was completely mitigated, preventing the devastating storm from expanding and causing even more destruction.","The Azure Mountain City that stood over a thousand kilometres away from the Azure Light Mountain remained, but all of its walls had already collapsed. The ground was riddled with cracks. It was severely damaged.","A figure hovered in front of the Azure Mountain City, glowing resplendently.","It was the Jade Lotus Master!","The Azure Mountain City was quite fortunate to have the Jade Lotus Master blocking in front of it, allowing the city to be spared from annihilation. Everyone in the city remained safe and sound.","However, before the Jade Lotus Master, the entire Azure Light Mountain had vanished. A huge hole appeared in the ground. It was bottomless, reaching into the depths of the Jade’s End Heaven.","At this moment, a few figures flashed beside the Jade Lotus Master. The Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt from the Numerous Layer Heaven, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt from the Ease Nurturing Heaven, and the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt from the Scholarly Attainment Heaven appeared. They were all extremely stern.","“This is definitely not from refining the pills. The Master of Profound Secrets was attacked by someone powerful!” the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt said sternly. He stared at the bottomless hole in front of him. He only felt chills well up from the bottom of his heart.","“It’s too terrifying. Just the residual shockwave is so frightening. Even the four of us struggle to fend it off. This is the attack of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt at the very least, o-or even beyond that...” The Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt’s voice trembled slightly.","The senses of the Jade Lotus Master’s soul spread out like a blanket, finely combing through the ruins before her. However, as she searched, the Jade Lotus Master gradually began to pale. She sobbed as she said, “The Master of Profound Secrets is gone. I can’t find any hint of him...”","When they heard that, the three other experts fell silent. They had originally come here to watch over the Master of Profound Secrets as he refined the ancient pills, but what had happened in the end? The Azure Light Mountain faced a catastrophe, and the Master of Profound Secrets had gone missing. Meanwhile, the four of them who were supposed to be guarding him were unscathed.","Even more ironically, they did not even know what had happened.","The several dozen native Immortal Exalts nearby gathered around the Jade Lotus Master. They were all stern, asking the Jade Lotus Master what had happened here.","Right when the Jade Lotus Master wanted to explain, the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt suddenly waved his hand. Soon afterwards, a ruined cauldron flew out from the pit, hovering above everyone’s head as it radiated with residual heat.","When they saw the cauldron, the expressions of the four experts changed drastically, as they knew that the Master of Profound Secrets had been using it to refine the ancient pills. Right now, the high quality god artifact cauldron had already been pierced. It was covered in cracks.","“Oh no, the pills have been destroyed. Quick, contact the Waymight clan!” The Jade Lotus Master immediately paled. In order to refine this cauldron of ancient pills, the Illusionary Ancestor had gone to very great lengths. Now that the pills were destroyed, they struggled to imagine just how furious the Illusionary Ancestor would be.","The Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt all realised the severity of the matter. Their faces all became extremely ugly.","As people who participated in killing the Starflame Demon Lion, they obviously understood just how important this cauldron of pills was to the Illusionary Ancestor. Now that it was destroyed, how were they supposed to explain themselves to her?","Even though they were not responsible for refining the pills, they had an unshirkable responsibility as the people watching over the entire process.","For a moment, the four experts were rather hesitant. Contact the Illusionary Ancestor? None of them had the courage to do so.","In the end, it was the Jade Lotus Master who stood forward. She set out a series of plentiful conditions and made many promises before finally convincing a native expert of the Jade’s End Heaven.","They were a Third Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt and also the ancestor of an organisation. However, because their sect had made many enemies on the Jade’s End Heaven, the situation in the recent years had been very pessimistic. With no other choice, they could only accept the Jade Lotus Master’s request, immediately heading off to the Waymight clan.","At the same time, a figure hid away in the tremendous sea of stars beyond the Jade’s End Heaven, hovering there silently and watching everything that unfolded on the Azure Light Mountain from afar.","As the experts of the Jade’s End Heaven gathered, their powerful senses of the soul swept past him time and time again, but no one discovered this figure hidden in the sea of stars.","It was Jian Chen!","After the killing strike with the Divine Formation of the Heavens, he had managed to slip away silently without the four experts sensing him. The many formations that the Master of Profound Secrets had set up in the surroundings had played an important role in this.","These formations had served as a momentary obstruction, allowing him to send the Divine Formation of the Heavens back into the Primeval Divine Hall. Then he hid his presence with the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and avoided the senses of the four experts.","When the four experts focused on mitigating the shockwave from the Divine Formation of the Heavens, Jian Chen used the opportunity to leave the Azure Light Mountain. Only when he arrived in a stable region of space in the sea of stars could he fully unleash the concealment capabilities of the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","Gazing at the Azure Light Mountain that had already been razed to the ground as well as the bottomless hole in the centre of the mountain range, Jian Chen could not help but gasp. The power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens had completely surpassed his expectations.","“ Immortal Emperor Taihang and the deceased disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens have been completely avenged. It’s just a pity that all the resources on the Azure Light Mountain have gone to waste, ” Jian Chen thought. Gazing at the high quality god artifact cauldron that he had pierced, he felt slightly delighted for some reason.","Back in the sacred land of the Observance Heaven City, Daowei Chengqing had tried to harm him with a strand of Stainless Qi. Now, he had destroyed the pills specially prepared for Daowei Chengqing. It was tit for tat.","The only person that he felt like he owed was the Illusionary Ancestor.","“ I can’t stay on the Jade’s End Heaven for long. It’s time to leave. ” Jian Chen sighed gently before turning around and vanishing into the depths of the sea of stars, leaving the Jade’s End Heaven.","The culprit behind the catastrophe on the Jade Light Mountain left with ease, but the psychological pressure and shadow he cast on the Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Jade’s End Heaven lingered without dispersing. In particular, when these Immortal Exalts learnt that the pills that the second ancestor of the Waymight clan wanted had been destroyed, all of them felt like they were about to black out. They were overcome with a sense of dread.","Compared to the pills, the Master of Profound Secrets’ death no longer seemed significant. All everyone thought of was how to pacify the Illusionary Ancestor’s wrath and how to get her to spare the Jade’s End Heaven.","The entire mountain range had been locked down. Everything there was preserved in their initial state, waiting for the arrival of the Illusionary Ancestor.","“Who? Who killed the Master of Profound Secrets?”","“An alchemy grandmaster like the Master of Profound Secrets is a treasure to the entire Immortals’ World. Who would ever want to harm someone like that...”","......","...","The next day, some foreign Immortal Exalts arrived on the Jade’s End Heaven. They had all received the Master of Profound Secrets’ grace before or were indebted to him. After hearing about his death, they all spoke up against the injustice that had occurred.","However, they fell quiet very quickly. All of them stared blankly at the apocalyptic sight of the Azure Light Mountain. They could not help but feel chills.","That was because a presence of destruction continued to linger over the ruined mountains.","Just the lingering presence alone struck fear into the hearts of these Immortal Exalts.","Finally, after several days, the sky over the entire Jade’s End Heaven suddenly darkened. All of the cultivators on the Jade’s End Heaven, regardless of cultivation, felt like they could not breathe. A strong sensation of suffocation pressed heavily against their chests.","They could not see. They could not breathe. At that moment, all of the cultivators on the Jade’s End Heaven felt like the end of the world was here.","The stronger they were, the stronger the feeling was. Some Immortal Emperors and even Immortal Exalts could clearly sense that a surging power had locked onto the entire Jade’s End Heaven. This power was so great that it far surpassed the destructive energy that erupted on the Azure Light Mountain. All of the Immortal Exalts on the Jade’s End Heaven felt their hearts tremble.","“I-i-it’s the Illusionary Ancestor!” The Jade Lotus Master’s face paled. Deep fear filled her eyes. She could already sense the familiar presence from the Illusionary Ancestor, but the terrifying presence that she demonstrated right now was countless times stronger than when she slew the Starflame Demon Lion."]},{"number":3984,"title":"Chapter 3984: The Illusionary Ancestor’s Fury","paragraphs":["It was not just the Jade Lotus Master. As the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt faced the Illusionary Ancestor’s tremendous presence, they could not help but shake inside.","If the Illusionary Ancestor only left them wary when she hunted down the Starflame Demon Lion, then the Illusionary Ancestor right now filled them all with fear, fear from the bottom of their hearts.","“I-isn’t the Illusionary Ancestor facing the tribulation of decline? D-don’t tell me that the tribulation of decline is already over...”","“P-perhaps this is the Illusionary Ancestor’s true strength. When she killed the Starflame Demon Lion, that was only the Illusionary Ancestor’s secondary body...”","The Jade Lotus Master, the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt whispered amongst themselves. Their faces were pale as they felt uneasy inside. They had no idea how to explain themselves to the Illusionary Ancestor.","They had all sensed her fury. Her terrifying killing intent that could even make the sky pale made them feel like they had been plunged into a cavern of ice.","Even the four of them, Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, experienced such sensations, so the weaker Immortal Exalts on the Jade’s End Heaven had an even more intense experience. Many of the early Immortal Exalts felt like they had been immobilised, restrained in place by an unimaginably powerful force.","The Illusionary Ancestor was truly furious!","“What exactly happened here?”","At this moment, a cold voice rang out. The Illusionary Ancestor had already appeared over the Azure Light Mountain before anyone had noticed. She was dressed in the same black clothes, radiating with terrifying killing intent that could shake the world.","The cauldron that had a hole blasted through it hovered before her. The residue from the failed pill lingered on there.","When the Illusionary Ancestor saw the residue, her cold eyes became even more frigid.","“I-Illusionary Ancestor, we’re not certain about what happened here either, nor did we sense the arrival of any expert. The Azure Light Mountain just ended up like this afterwards,” the Jade Lotus Master said reluctantly with a trembling voice.","“Illusionary Ancestor, the four of us had been guarding the surroundings of the Azure Light Mountain closely. Originally, everything was normal. Nothing had happened, but suddenly, an extremely powerful storm of energy erupted on the Azure Light Mountain...”","“Senior Illusionary Ancestor, we truly did not sense the arrival of any expert. The incident on the Azure Light Mountain even made us wonder if something had gone wrong as the Master of Profound Secrets was refining the ancient pills...”","The Jade Lotus Master, the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt, the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt, and the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt all spoke up to explain. They all added to the story, telling her what had happened here truthfully.","The Illusionary Ancestor’s icy gaze landed on the four of them. She said coldly, “The four of you are Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts after all. You can be considered as prominent figures who rule over an entire region. The four of you were guarding the Azure Light Mountain together, yet the Azure Light Mountain was still destroyed. If you failed to stop the enemy, then so be it, but you didn’t even catch a glimpse of their shadow. Are you all just trash?”","“Even if it were a peak Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, you should at least know who they were with your cultivation.”","Faced with the Illusionary Ancestor’s fury, the four experts all felt wry inside. They truly had not seen the enemy.","Looking at the four, the Illusionary Ancestor knew that she could not rely on them. Her eyes began to shine as she used her abilities to peer into the past and future, observing what had happened here.","Unfortunately, she failed. All of the traces of ways in this space had been destroyed. Any method of turning back time was useless.","“You’ve destroyed my ancient pills. Are you opposing our Waymight clan?” the Illusionary Ancestor balled her fists and said icily. She did not seem to care too much about the Master of Profound Secrets’ death. She only cared about the cauldron of pills that he was supposed to refine.","“Oh right, Illusionary Ancestor. Before this occurred, fellow Yang Yutian had come to the Azure Light Mountain, but he’s gone now. H-he might have suffered an accident as well,” the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt abruptly said.","When they heard this from the Jade Lotus Master, the Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt and the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt suddenly remembered him. They had almost forgotten about this person.","After all, an Immortal Emperor was not enough for them to care so much. If they had not considered how the Illusionary Ancestor treated him, they would not even bother sparing a glance at such a person.","“What? Yang Yutian was here?” When she heard the name, the Illusionary Ancestor was immediately taken aback. She was overcome with surprise.","Shortly afterwards, she glanced at the bottomless pit in the centre of the mountain range again. Her eyes immediately flickered. She seemed to have come up with a guess.","In the next moment, the Illusionary Ancestor suddenly closed her eyes. A terrifying sense of the soul flooded out and immediately enveloped the Azure Light Mountain.","The powerful senses of her soul ventured to the very bottom of the pit as if she was trying to analyse the residual violent energy.","When the Illusionary Ancestor shut her eyes and sensed the surroundings, the four experts could not help but look at one another. There was a hint of disbelief in their eyes.","The four of them could clearly sense that when the Illusionary Ancestor learnt that Yang Yutian had been on the Azure Light Mountain earlier, her killing intent had diminished significantly.","They knew exactly how important the pills were to the Illusionary Ancestor. Otherwise, she would not have gone to such great lengths to kill the Starflame Demon Lion.","Now that the pills were destroyed, the Illusionary Ancestor’s fury and killing intent seemed to be enough to devour the entire region. It gave countless people chills.","Yet in the end, the chilling killing intent she gave off subsided with the appearance of someone as insignificant as that?","At that moment, the four experts all thought of Jian Chen, but in the end, they all sighed. After all, in their eyes, Jian Chen had suffered the same fate. He could not have survived the terrifying shockwave.","Over half a minute later, the Illusionary Ancestor finally opened her eyes slowly. Most of the coldness and killing intent in her eyes had subsided. She no longer seemed to possess any of the annihilating fury from before. Instead, her face was replaced with some mixed and conflicted emotions.","It felt like the Illusionary Ancestor was faced with some kind of difficult choice, leaving her wavering and uncertain.","She had already sensed the presence of the Divine Formation of the Heavens. Even though there were some differences from what she had sensed on the Hall Brilliance Heaven, the damage was indeed caused by it.","The Illusionary Ancestor could not help but think of the hint of killing intent Jian Chen had exhibited towards the Master of Profound Secrets. She had sensed it when she was slaying the Starflame Demon Lion.","The Illusionary Ancestor hovered there in silence as her expression changed again and again. Her eyes were very conflicted. It was possible to tell that she was at a crossroad. She knew that she could have prevented or stopped all of this entirely, yet in the end, it led to such a huge loss.","She could go without caring about the Master of Profound Secrets, but she had to care about the cauldron of pills."]},{"number":3985,"title":"Chapter 3985: The One Behind it All","paragraphs":["“I had specially prepared this cauldron of pills for Qing’er to let him establish the strongest foundation when he broke through to Immortal Exalt. Why did you destroy these pills...”","“You may have a grudge with the Master of Profound Secrets, but why did you have to harm Qing’er in the process? Even if you have a feud with the Master of Profound Secrets, couldn’t you choose another time? Couldn’t you wait until he had finished refining this cauldron of pills before you settled your grievance...” the Illusionary Ancestor murmured to herself softly.","Her expression changed rapidly, from fury to confusion and then helplessness. As a matter of fact, some regret would even flash over her face from time to time.","She had been too careless and too confident. Not only had she been too certain of the influence that the Master of Profound Secrets possessed, but she had also been too certain in the Waymight clan’s paramount authority that no one dared to defy. It was exactly because of this mindset that the Illusionary Ancestor thought that it would be perfectly safe to leave the Master of Profound Secrets to refine these pills. She thought that no one in the Immortals’ World would come after them.","An accident just ended up happening.","If she had known that something like this would happen sooner, she would have arranged some countermeasures here.","The four experts heard the Illusionary Ancestor’s mutterings, so they knew that she was aware of the murderer’s identity. Their curiosity was immediately piqued, so one of them asked carefully, “S-senior Illusionary Ancestor, may we ask who killed the Master of Profound Secrets and destroyed this cauldron of pills?”","“Our strength may be lacking, but we’re willing to serve senior Illusionary Ancestor like horses and assist senior Illusionary Ancestor in hunting down the culprit...”","“The four of us are willing to make up for our mistake. Even if our combined strength is almost insignificant, nowhere close to yours, we’re still willing to serve the Illusionary Ancestor with utmost loyalty...”","The Rushing Lightning Immortal Exalt, the Jade Lotus Master, and the Blood Butcher Immortal Exalt all spoke up.","“You... really are foolish. Even till now, you actually still don’t know who destroyed the pills. You’ve even seen this person with your own eyes. He’s no one else but Yang Yutian who entered the Azure Light Mountain under your watch.” The Illusionary Ancestor sighed.","“What? I-it’s Y-Y-Yang Yutian...” The four of them were stunned. Their faces were filled with disbelief.","Yang Yutian was the one who destroyed the Azure Light Mountain? The Immortal Emperor junior that they did not even take too seriously?","That was completely impossible!","“Looks like you still don’t know about what happened in the Skyscraping World, or you wouldn’t underestimate Yang Yutian like this.” The Illusionary Ancestor sighed. The news from the Skyscraping World had been contained far too well. None of the organisations that these four people originated from had disciples or descendants who had entered the Skyscraping World, so they were still clueless about the events that transpired there.","“I didn’t think that the person behind it all was actually Yang Yutian. Not only did he kill the Master of Profound Secrets, but he even destroyed crown prince Daowei Chengqing’s cauldron of pills. So much for showing him so much care. I didn’t think he’d actually be so despicable,” the Jade Lotus Master grumbled on the Illusionary Ancestor’s behalf.","“I won’t interfere with Yang Yutian’s matters in the future anymore. From now onwards, I have nothing to do with him,” the Illusionary Ancestor said emotionlessly. In the next moment, she vanished, having left the Jade’s End Heaven.","However, she did not travel very far away. Instead, she hovered near the Jade’s End Heaven, giving one final glance at the Azure Light Mountain with mixed feelings. She stared straight at the bottomless pit produced by the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","The destruction of the pills had originally left her radiating with killing intent. No matter who it was, even if it was the Sacred Beast clan, she would have never spared them. However, whenever Jian Chen’s figure crossed her mind, her killing intent that had erupted like a volcano would soften uncontrollably. She was simply unable to muster the will to go after Jian Chen.","Suddenly, the Illusionary Ancestor turned her gaze and looked at the outskirts of the Azure Light Mountain. On a mountain peak filled with people, a woman in simple clothes caught her attention.","On the surface, the woman’s presence was merely an Immortal Monarch’s, but the Illusionary Ancestor could tell with a single glance that she was a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","The woman was the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion!","Apart from the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion, there were two other hidden figures in two different directions that piqued the Illusionary Ancestor’s attention.","They were the Myriad Gold Ancestor of the Gold Yang sect and the Worldless Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Sect of Grand Unity.","The two of them were both Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts!","The Master of Profound Secrets’ cultivation might not have been close to the peak, but there were only a handful of people in the Immortals’ World who could match his mastery over the Way of Alchemy. Not only had he perished, but even the Azure Light Mountain had been destroyed, so this obviously led to quite an uproar in the Immortals’ World.","As a result, the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion, the Myriad Gold Ancestor of the Gold Yang sect, and the Worldless Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Sect of Grand Unity had all gathered over when they heard the news.","The Illusionary Ancestor obviously knew these three experts had come for Jian Chen. However, the pills had been destroyed, so she could not be bothered with Jian Chen’s matters anymore.","In the next moment, the Illusionary Ancestor strode off into outer space. She vanished into the depths of the sea of stars, completely leaving this place.","The Illusionary Ancestor had departed, but the Myriad Gold Ancestor of the Gold Yang sect and the Worldless Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Sect of Grand Unity hidden nearby did not leave. They lingered near the outskirts of the Azure Light Mountain and constantly studied the surroundings as if they were confirming something.","“ This really does seem similar to the damage caused by that formation. ” The Myriad Gold Ancestor of the Gold Yang sect deliberated. He seemed to have an idea, but he was not very certain.","Shortly afterwards, he made up his mind and stopped hiding. The presence of a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt expanded discreetly before arriving before the Jade Lotus Master in a single step.","When the Jade Lotus Master sensed the discreet presence that surpassed hers, her heart immediately tightened slightly. She was stern.","That was because on the Jade’s End Heaven, a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt was virtually invincible. No one could stop them.","However, when the Jade Lotus Master saw that it was the Myriad Gold Ancestor, she could not help but be taken aback. She clasped her fist amicably and smiled. “So it’s fellow Myriad Gold. I never thought that fellow Myriad Gold would travel so far to come here in person. Don’t tell me you’re also here to stand up against the injustice that befell the Master of Profound Secrets?”","“Fellow Jade Lotus, I was hoping that you could tell me everything that happened here.” The Myriad Gold Ancestor and the Jade Lotus Master were familiar with one another. After a simple exchange of pleasantries, he cut right to the chase.","As the Myriad Gold Ancestor spoke, an invisible force expanded out, enveloping him and the Jade Lotus Master, isolating everything.","Immediately, the Myriad Gold Ancestor and the Jade Lotus Master’s figures became blurry to everyone around them.","“Fellow Myriad Gold, you can’t be so selfish, as I also want to know everything that happened here.” The energy barrier that the Myriad Gold Ancestor set up was torn open, and the Worldless Immortal Exalt of the Immortal Sect of Grand Unity appeared silently."]},{"number":3986,"title":"Chapter 3986: Returning to the Reverent Observance Heaven","paragraphs":["Following the Worldless Immortal Exalt, the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion stopped hiding and also emerged.","“I didn’t think that the two of you would also be here. That really has surprised me.” The Myriad Gold Ancestor glanced at the Worldless Immortal Exalt and the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion as his eyes shone.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt glanced at the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion who stood to one side silently. A faint hint of sternness flashed through the depths of his eyes. Afterwards, he looked at the Jade Lotus Master and said, “You can tell us now.”","Faced with two Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts and a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Jade Lotus Master did not have the courage to hide anything. She immediately told them what had happened here. However, when she approached the topic of the Illusionary Ancestor, she spoke with great prudence, refusing to elaborate.","After explaining everything, the Jade Lotus Master became rather confused. She did not see any hints of fury or hatred in the eyes of the Myriad Gold Ancestor, the Worldless Immortal Exalt, or the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion. As a matter of fact, there were even hints of excitement and glee in their eyes.","“Fellows, have you really come for the Master of Profound Secrets’ death?” the Jade Lotus Master said hesitantly. She felt like something was amiss.","“Of course!” The Worldless Immortal Exalt smiled mysteriously and said, “Thank you for the information. The three of us still have other matters to deal with, so we’ll be taking our leave.”","As he said that, the Worldless Immortal Exalt discreetly communicated with the Myriad Gold Ancestor and the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion before leaving. He immediately vanished.","The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion and the Myriad Gold Ancestor hesitated for a moment before leaving as well.","The Jade Lotus Master watched as the three experts disappeared. Her expression was uncertain and mixed.","“The three of them didn’t come for the Master of Profound Secrets’ death, as they’re completely unfazed by his death,” the Ancient Virtue Immortal Exalt drifted over slowly and said in thought.","The Jade Lotus Master nodded. She glanced at the bottomless hole in the centre of the Azure Light Mountain and said sternly, “I sensed it too. They don’t care about the Master of Profound Secrets’ fate, but they seem to be very interested in the traces here.”","The Jade Lotus Master paused and seemed to make a connection. She said with uncertainty, “Don’t tell me they’ve come for Yang Yutian?”","“Yang Yutian? Actually Yang Yutian again? Our knowledge of this person is far too lacking. We should properly investigate him...”","The Worldless Immortal Exalt, the Myriad Gold Ancestor, and the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion hovered above a desert that was extremely distant from the Azure Light Mountain on the Jade’s End Heaven.","“Wordless Immortal Exalt, if you have something to say, just say it. I don’t have enough time to waste here,” the Myriad Gold Ancestor said emotionlessly.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt smiled and said, “Have you thought about working together?”","“I haven’t! Working together might lead to even more qualms,” the Myriad Gold Ancestor said without hesitation.","The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion did not say anything. She only hovered there silently.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt continued to smile. He explained further. “In the Immortals’ World right now, we’re not the only three looking for Yang Yutian. Perhaps there are heavenly emperors secretly taking action as well. Since we know about Yang Yutian’s traces on the Jade’s End Heaven, we’re without a doubt one step ahead of everyone else. If we use this opportunity and work together, our chances of finding Yang Yutian will definitely be drastically increased.”","“However, the reason why I suggest we work together is not just to find Yang Yutian. Yang Yutian’s cultivation might not be anything impressive, but dealing with him is anything but simple. If we’re careless, it might even cost us our lives. After all, you’ve both witnessed what that formation is capable of.”","The Myriad Gold Ancestor looked down; the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion was stern. They recalled the destructive power on the Azure Light Mountain once again. It was so great that it left them startled.","Even though they were extremely wary of the power of this formation, it did not frighten them. Instead, they desired it even more.","As long as they could dodge the devastating strike from the formation, Immortal Emperors would be no different from ants in their eyes.","The Worldless Immortal Exalt continued, “The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion’s illusionary body can perfectly deceive others, which is ideal for triumphing over his formation. He’ll end up using the formation on the illusionary body. Meanwhile, fellow Myriad Gold’s Nine Dragons Prison Cauldron Formation can seal up space. As long as he’s in the formation, Yang Yutian will remain trapped no matter how good he is at hiding.”","“As for me, I grasp the Laws of Space; you should both be aware of the advantages. I don’t need to elaborate. As a result, if we work together, we can assist one another. Perhaps there might be some qualms and we’ll need to guard against one another, but the benefits still outweigh the disadvantages.”","“How will we split the goods?” the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion said.","“That’ll obviously come down to our individual abilities once we capture Yang Yutian. Or, we can also come up with a way to split everything so that everyone benefits and doesn’t leave empty-handed,” the Worldless Immortal Exalt said with a smile.","The Myriad Gold Ancestor and the first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion sank into their thoughts as if they were weighing the advantages against the disadvantages.","“Alright. I agree to work together.” The Myriad Gold Ancestor finally made his decision after several seconds of thought.","The first master of the Path of Truth and Illusion did not refuse either. She also joined after some thought.","......","...","In outer space, Jian Chen travelled quickly using the Laws of Space under the cover of the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","Now, his Laws of Space had already reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor. Coupled with the natural talent of the Spatial Insect Emperor, Jian Chen’s usage and grasp over the Laws of Space had already surpassed other experts of the same level. He no longer needed to rely on teleportation formations to travel through outer space.","It was not peaceful in the sea of stars. Various dangers also lurked here. Some of the perils were even enough to threaten Immortal Exalts, let alone Immortal Emperors.","As a result, along the way, Jian Chen encountered many battles between cultivators. There were also pursuits between immortal vessels, as well as star beasts prowling around on the hunt.","In order to hide his tracks, Jian Chen did not interfere with anything along the way. The mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight allowed him to avoid these battles perfectly.","Finally, after several days, Jian Chen had crossed an extremely great distance and returned to the Reverent Observance Heaven.","Coming back here, he only had a single goal—to take back the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens with him!","“ I wonder if the Daoist Sect of Xuanchi, the Sword Sect of Grand Sun, the Tianhai clan, and the Three Swords sect managed to leave behind their legacies or not... ” Jian Chen sighed inside as he gazed at the fragment of land that hovered before him. These organisations had all been destroyed by the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. It could be said that he was indirectly responsible for their destruction.","However, Jian Chen was powerless over this. He could not give up on the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ revenge and stop going after the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants just because they would murder the innocent.","Before long, Jian Chen arrived before a lofty, majestic city. It was the Observance Heaven City."]},{"number":3987,"title":"Chapter 3987: A Heavenly Emperor Lying in Wait","paragraphs":["An ancient bronze mirror hung above the gates of the Observance Heaven City. It was a part of the city. From time to time, it would beam down a streak of light to test the cultivation of those who entered and determine the necessary daily fee.","Jian Chen had entered the Observance Heaven City before, so he obviously possessed an entry tablet. He had filled it up with many coloured immortal crystals as well, so he did not have to worry about the issue of entry at all.","After entering the Observance Heaven City smoothly, Jian Chen found a high-class inn and settled down there. After activating the obscuring barrier that came with the room, he called out to the empty air, “Senior artifact spirit, I know that you’re present everywhere. Please show yourself!”","“You still have the courage to come back? You sure are bold. Do you really think no one has seen through you?” The artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City’s cold voice rang out of thin air as soon as Jian Chen finished speaking.","In the Observance Heaven City, the artifact spirit could be described as an omnipresent and omniscient existence of invincibility. It had already known that Jian Chen had entered the Observance Heaven City the moment he set foot inside.","Seeing how the artifact spirit acknowledged him, Jian Chen eased up inside. Entering the Observance Heaven City was easy but contacting the artifact spirit was not.","Not everyone had the right to speak with the artifact spirit.","“Senior artifact spirit, I’d like to meet with the master of the Pavilions of Heavenly Secrets. I was hoping you could assist me with this.” Jian Chen clasped his fist. He spoke with great respect.","“You sure are clever for not going straight to the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets. I will pass on your request, but whether you’re able to meet with him will come down to your luck,” the artifact spirit replied.","Jian Chen furrowed his brows when he heard that, but he recovered soon after. He did not directly go to the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets and instead chose to ask the artifact spirit to pass on the message to guard against some things.","The artifact spirit’s words allowed Jian Chen to understand that the precautions he took were not unnecessary.","“ Sure enough, the Reverent Observance Heaven isn’t as peaceful as it seems on the surface. It was a wise decision to not barge right into the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, ” Jian Chen thought.","Afterwards, Jian Chen waited patiently in the inn. He sat on a cushion calmly with his eyes shut.","However, he did not have to wait for too long. After only five minutes, the space in the room suddenly twisted. It silently turned into a gate that appeared before Jian Chen.","The scenery in the gate was the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets that Jian Chen was familiar with!","Sitting on the cushion, Jian Chen opened his eyes and smiled faintly. He stood up and stepped through the gate.","In the miniature world, the master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets gazed at Jian Chen amicably with a smile.","“Greetings, pavilion master. Please forgive my sudden intrusion.” Jian Chen bowed.","The pavilion master’s plain gaze seemed to possess a penetrative power. He completely saw through Jian Chen. He smiled faintly. “Compared to the last time we met, you have become much stronger. You must have benefitted even beyond my imaginations from your trip to the Skyscraping World.”","“I did benefit slightly from the Skyscraping World,” Jian Chen said modestly. Afterwards, with a flip of his hand, he took out five god artifacts from his Space Ring. They were three medium quality god artifacts and two high quality god artifacts.","He had killed many Immortal Exalts in the Skyscraping World, so the last thing he lacked right now were various kinds of god artifacts. He even possessed many cultivation methods and secret techniques. Unfortunately, he did not find any that suited him.","The five god artifact hovered in the air with hazy light. Jian Chen clasped his fist towards the pavilion master. “Pavilion master, I’d like to inquire about some information regarding the Reverent Observance Heaven. Is this enough as remuneration?”","The pavilion master pushed the two high quality god artifacts back over to Jian Chen. He only accepted the three medium quality god artifacts. “The information that you want to know this time is anything but simple, so I’ll accept these three medium quality god artifacts from you as a symbolic token.”","The pavilion master paused and gradually became stern.","Sensing the change in the pavilion master’s expression, Jian Chen’s heart tightened. What kind of person was the pavilion master? He was a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. Even someone like him had become stern, so the situation was even more severe than he had imagined.","“Jian Chen, there is something that you did very well with, which was to not rashly make your way over to the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. Otherwise, you’d be in quite a lot of trouble.” As soon as the pavilion master spoke, the information that he revealed left Jian Chen shocked.","“May I ask what danger lurks in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens?” Jian Chen asked grimly. He subconsciously thought of the first ancestor of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, the Space-splitting Venerable, but he immediately rejected that thought. The Space-splitting Venerable was very powerful, a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, but someone like that was still not enough for the pavilion master to become so serious.","“The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor of the Immortal Feather sect is currently hiding in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. No one who visits the Sword Region of Violet Heavens can escape his watch,” the pavilion master said sternly.","“What? The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor is actually watching over the Sword Region of Violet Heavens personally?” Jian Chen was surprised. This was a mighty heavenly emperor. He was aloof, yet he had come in person to wait for him. This matter was indeed unbelievable.","“The recovery sovereign god artifact on you is extremely tempting to the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor. In order to obtain it, he’s capable of doing anything.” The pavilion master sighed gently and said, “Although you have two treasures that can conceal you perfectly, you won’t be able to fool the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor if you are in close proximity. As a result, as soon as you enter the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor will recognise you.”","“In other words, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor is certain that I would return to the Sword Region of Violet Heavens.” Jian Chen furrowed his brows. It was not good news that a heavenly emperor was personally watching over the Sword Region of Violet Heavens.","“After the Skyscraping World, many experts have been investigating you. Basically nothing you did in the Skyscraping World remains a secret. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor obviously knows that you’ll return to the Sword Region of Violet Heavens sooner or later to retrieve the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain. It’s not just the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. A few extra Immortal Exalts have even appeared in the Observance Heaven City,” the pavilion master said.","“Then have the existence of the twin swords been exposed, pavilion master?” Jian Chen was stern.","The pavilion master shook his head. “The existence of the twin swords still haven’t been exposed for now, as you possess other sovereign god artifacts on you. As a result, everything special that occurred to you, including the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City’s different attitude towards you, has been attributed to the other sovereign god artifacts by everyone else.”","“After all, if you possess a sovereign god artifact, it would make sense for the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City to take special care of you.”","Jian Chen let out a sigh of relief when he heard that.","However, he began to sigh inside again soon after. With the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor watching over the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, he obviously could not retrieve the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain.","The Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was extremely important. It was critical for finding the remaining Energy-gathering Divine Mountains.","The more Energy-gathering Divine Mountains he had, the faster the Primeval Divine Hall could recover. He would be able to accelerate the process of awakening the generals.","At the same time, he understood why the Soaring Immortal Emperor only had his eyes on the Sword Region of Violet Heavens and not the entire Reverent Observance Heaven. With the abilities of a heavenly emperor, he could obviously cover the entire Reverent Observance Heaven with the senses of his soul. Nothing that happened would be able to escape his senses.","However, due to his disguise from the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, even heavenly emperors were unable to see through him with the senses of their souls. They could only see through him with their naked eye from a close distance away.","That was why the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor did not watch over the entire Reverent Observance Heaven, instead choosing to lie in wait in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens."]},{"number":3988,"title":"Chapter 3988: New Troubles","paragraphs":["“Pavilion master, do you know how long the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor has remained in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens?” Jian Chen asked after some thought.","“Three years after the matter near the Skyscraping World ended, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor appeared in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. Apart from leaving once a few days ago, he basically did not set foot away from there.” The pavilion master glanced at Jian Chen deeply and said, “And the reason why he left a few days ago was also connected to you. The disturbance you caused on the Jade’s End Heaven has caught the attention of quite a few people.”","When he heard that, Jian Chen immediately felt very glad. Fortunately, he had left the Jade’s End Heaven immediately, or he might have been discovered.","He was confident that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor must have scoured every corner of the Jade’s End Heaven after travelling all the way there.","“He only went to the Jade’s End Heaven a few days ago. Now, he’s already back on the Reverent Observance Heaven. It’s not like the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor is lacking a sovereign god artifact. Why is he so persistent about obtaining my possessions? I’ve even begun to suspect that he knows the twin swords are on me.” Jian Chen felt rather pained as well. Of all the places the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had to watch, it just had to be the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, which prevented him from retrieving the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain.","“If it were any other sovereign god artifact, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor would want to get his hands on it, but he would still care about his reputation. However, the recovery sovereign god artifact on you is different. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor wants it more than anyone else. In the near future, he will face a tribulation of life or death. If he has the recovery sovereign god artifact, then his chances of surviving the tribulation will greatly increase.”","“That’s only the first reason. The second reason is also because he’s noticed how you’re relatively close with the Heavenly Star Palace. He’s afraid that the Heavenly Star Palace will gain a sovereign god artifact as a result, which also forces him to come after you.”","“As a result, your grudge with the Immortal Feather sect is not as simple as killing a few great elders anymore. The situation has already become even more complicated.”","“However, with the fact that you killed a few great elders of the Immortal Feather sect, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor won’t sully his name too much even if he comes after you personally, even if he robs you of your sovereign god artifact. Even if the other courts of heaven participate and compete for it, their actions will not be as justified as the Immortal Feather sect’s,” said the pavilion master.","Jian Chen fell silent. He had already begun thinking about how to draw the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor away.","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had to leave the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. No, just leaving the Sword Region of Violet Heavens was not enough. He had to travel far away from the Reverent Observance Heaven. Only then did he have a chance at retrieving the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens.","At this moment, the pavilion master sighed gently and said, “You were far too brash with the matter on the Jade’s End Heaven. You shouldn’t have destroyed the cauldron of pills that Daowei Huanru wanted to get refined. Even if Daowei Chengqing once set up a trap for you in the sacred land of the Observance Heaven City, you shouldn’t have angered Daowei Huanru.”","“That’s because Daowei Huanru really does care about you. Even though I don't know the reason for it, I can feel that Daowei Huanru has no ill intentions towards you. I firmly believe that even if she found out the twin swords were on you, she would not do anything detrimental to you.”","“If you can obtain Daowei Huanru’s support, then it would be a piece of cake for you to retrieve the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ Energy-gathering Divine Mountain.”","“Pavilion master, the Illusionary Ancestor is the second ancestor of the Waymight clan after all. The Waymight clan is after the twin swords,” Jian Chen said sternly.","“It is different between people,” the pavilion master said slowly. After a slight pause, he said extremely cautiously, “And I suspect that Daowei Huanru already knows the secret that the twin swords are on you.”","“That’s because Daowei Huanru has been more attentive in her investigation than any other expert. On top of that, she possesses an additional avenue of information compared to other experts, which is the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.”","When he heard that, Jian Chen furrowed his brows. The Illusionary Ancestor already knew about the existence of the twin swords?","If the Illusionary Ancestor had obtained some information from the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, then it would not be so surprising if she knew about the existence of the twin swords.","Although it was not very likely for the elder princess to disclose his secret of the twin swords according to his understanding of her, the Illusionary Ancestor was a reputed expert who had made a name for herself a long time ago after all. Her knowledge and insight was definitely beyond Fang Jing’s. Who knew if she could deduce some clues.","However, despite knowing about the twin swords, the Illusionary Ancestor still chose to keep his secret. She did not try to take the twin swords either, nor did she tell his secret to Daowei Fatian.","Why did the Illusionary Ancestor treat him in such a special way?","That doubt had lingered in Jian Chen’s mind for a very long time. He struggled to find an answer.","After a moment of thought, Jian Chen said slowly, “I am indeed indebted to the Illusionary Ancestor. However, if I could choose again with what happened on the Azure Light Mountain of the Jade’s End Heaven, I would still make the same choice. The Master of Profound Secrets must die. If I didn’t have the ability to kill him, then so be it. Since I did, then even letting him live for a day longer in this world brings me guilt towards the deceased disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.”","“As for the Illusionary Ancestor’s loss, I can only hope that I will have the opportunity in the future to repay her...”","The pavilion master laughed. “If you want to repay Daowei Huanru, I’m afraid you’ll struggle to find the opportunity now, as her strength has soared once more. She’s already reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer. She’s completely on par with heavenly emperors.”","“What? The Illusionary Ancestor’s strength has already reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer? The tribulation of decline has already ended for her?” Jian Chen was both surprised and overjoyed.","When he heard Jian Chen mention the tribulation of decline, the pavilion master furrowed his brows slightly. “According to my understanding of her, her tribulation of decline should not have ended so quickly. Moreover, the tribulation of decline this time was more severe than any of the previous times. Surprisingly, not only did it end prematurely, but her secondary body successfully reached the Eighth Heavenly Layer as well.”","“Even if her secondary body has reached the Eighth Heavenly Layer, merging the two bodies is not easy, yet when she reappeared again, her primary and secondary bodies had already merged together, breaking through to the Ninth Heavenly Layer.”","The pavilion master’s voice was filled with amazement as if he also found this unbelievable. At the same time, there was a hint of pity in his voice, pity for Jian Chen that he had failed to gain her favour.","Jian Chen and the pavilion master conversed for four whole hours. From the pavilion master, Jian Chen learnt many pieces of useful information.","After these four hours, Jian Chen and the pavilion master bade farewell to one another. Afterwards, he was sent back to the inn through the same method as he had arrived.","The Observance Heaven City was absolutely safe. Even Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts did not have the courage to stir up trouble here. However, catching the attention of one in the Observance Heaven City would still lead to tremendous problems when leaving.","As a result, in consideration of Jian Chen, the pavilion master did not make him leave through the main entrance. He personally sent him away.","Returning to the inn, Jian Chen walked over to his bed and sat down. He sank into his thoughts. Various names like Fang Jing, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance, and so on flashed through his mind. He pondered about how he would deal with the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor who watched the Sword Region of Violet Heavens closely."]},{"number":3989,"title":"Chapter 3989: Comprehending the Secret Technique","paragraphs":["“ It’s not like I don’t have a way to keep the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor busy. I just need any of Fang Jing, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, or the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance. With any of them around, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor will be too busy to deal with me. In particular, if Fang Jing were to come, her influence would even surpass the other two heavenly emperors, ” Jian Chen thought to himself. He was not without methods to handle the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, but he really did not want to bother these people unless he had truly run out of options.","If he owed them too many favours, he would probably struggle to repay them in the future.","“ If I can’t do that, then I can attack the Immortal Feather sect with the Divine Formation of Heavens. It doesn’t matter if I don’t manage to kill anyone from the Immortal Feather sect. I just need to cause you some problems. ” Jian Chen suddenly thought of that idea, but he soon dismissed it with a shake of his head.","Attacking the Immortal Feather sect? That was far too risky. It was the main base of a court of heaven after all. There must have been a Grand Exalt’s formation. At the same time, apart from the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, there were other late Immortal Exalts in the Immortal Feather sect. They would not be as easy to deal with as he imagined.","“ What about exposing some of my tracks on other heavens and drawing the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor over? But that won’t really work either. Heavenly emperors move too quickly. They even possess secret techniques that can allow them to cross a vast distance instantly. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor will probably have enough time to do multiple trips before I even make it back... ”","No matter how Jian Chen thought, he was unable to come up with an appropriate idea. After all, he was not facing a regular Immortal Exalt this time but a heavenly emperor who stood at the peak of the world. The abilities of these people were immense. They were capable of unimaginable things, so they were not as easy to deceive.","At the very least, they could not be deceived by a minor figure who was not even an Immortal Exalt like him.","“ The pavilion master said that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor would face a tribulation in the near future. When it comes to biding time, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor definitely can’t outlast me. If that’s the case, then I’d like to see just how long you can remain in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. ” Jian Chen gritted his teeth and chose to wait out the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor.","Afterwards, Jian Chen notified the innkeeper that he would be in secluded cultivation before locking himself in his room. He wanted to limit any chance of being spotted, so he did not head out as much as possible.","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was powerless against him even if Jian Chen was seen through in the Observance Heaven City.","However, once an expert of that level locked onto him, he basically could not leave at all. He had to remain in the Observance Heaven City forever.","“ With my limited resources right now, I can only maintain my current level of the Chaotic Body. As for the Laws of the Sword, I’ll struggle to make any progress for the time being too. On top of that, the limitations from the Martial Soul lineage will probably prevent my Laws of the Sword from reaching Immortal Exalt. ”","“ Out of all the laws I’ve comprehended, unless I reach late Immortal Emperor with them, they’ll struggle to be of any assistance to me in battle. However, reaching late Immortal Emperor with them isn’t something I can achieve in a short period of time. I’ll need an extended period of comprehension and accumulation. ”","“ As a result, all I can do right now is to continue comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword. Each additional layer I comprehend will directly increase my strength. ” Jian Chen calculated.","He might have grasped over a dozen laws right now, but they were too much to chew. Right now, the only ones that were of actual use to him were the Laws of the Sword and the Laws of Space.","Afterwards, with a flip of his hand, Jian Chen produced a jade disc.","The disc was ordinary in appearance. It did not give off any ripples of energy. It seemed like a regular item. No one would connect the jade disc with the thought of treasure from a single glance.","However, when Jian Chen held the jade disc in his hand, he was solemn like he was holding great treasure. As a matter of fact, a hint of burning fervour even appeared in the depths of his eyes.","He had accidentally obtained this jade disc when he was comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword inside the Skyscraping World.","Now, he had already confirmed that the jade disc originated from the Hole of Reincarnation. The Hundred Superimposition Sword that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable comprehended also originated from the jade disc in his hand.","In simpler terms, the jade disc in his hand was for passing on the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","“ It has already become a public belief in the Immortals’ World that items from the Hole of Reincarnation are enough to change the fates of people. They are a shortcut to the apex. Now, I technically also possess one of these items, ” Jian Chen thought. The Hole of Reincarnation had existed through the eons. It represented mystery and the unknown. However, Daowei Chengqing’s emergence from the Hole of Reincarnation finally allowed the people in the Immortals’ World to recognise its wonders.","That was because Daowei Chengqing emerged with two items from the Hole of Reincarnation, the Book of the Populace and the Dominion’s Brush. They led to the rise of two supreme experts, Daowei Fatian and Fang Jing.","The former had become a Grand Exalt because of the Book of the Populace, truly achieving an evolution.","The latter had also become a terrifying existence that surpassed heavenly emperors due to the strength of the Dominion’s Brush.","In the past, heavenly emperors were supreme experts only second to Grand Exalts, but now, this rule had almost been rewritten. Fang Jing had appeared between the heavenly emperors and the Grand Exalts.","On top of that, the three servants by Daowei Chengqing’s side had never stood out before. They never even came close to the concept of talent.","Yet even with their aptitude, they became late Immortal Exalts in an extremely short period of time. Even many unprecedented deviants of monstrous talent could only look up to this grand feat.","This had all occurred because of the Hole of Reincarnation.","Sitting on his bed, Jian Chen sucked in a deep breath and dismissed all other thoughts. He gathered his mind and began comprehending the jade disc in his hand.","When his consciousness made contact with the jade disc, an ancient and profound presence immediately radiated out. There were two kinds of this presence. One of them was the presence of the Hole of Reincarnation, while the other was a power that contained the secrets of the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","Comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword through the jade disc was vastly different from comprehending the tablet that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had left behind in the Skyscraping World.","The Hundred Superimposition Sword left behind by the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had been created through a mixture of his ways and technique. It only contained the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s personal comprehension.","Meanwhile, comprehending the Hundred Superimposition Sword through the jade disc involved a single simple strand of presence, a presence that contained the wonders of the ways.","However, Jian Chen had already sensed that only the Hundred Superimposition Sword comprehended from the jade disc in his hand would be the purest kind. If he were fortunate enough, he could grasp all one hundred layers.","On the other hand, if he walked the Skyscraping Sword Venerable’s path, his lifelong achievements would struggle to surpass the level that the Skyscraping Sword Venerable had reached.","Before he knew it, Jian Chen had already entered a state of semi-consciousness. He had completely submerged himself in the wondrous world of the Hundred Superimposition Sword. The mysterious presence inside the jade disc was like a medium, drawing Jian Chen into this wondrous state.","In this state, Jian Chen felt like he had entered a strange new world. There was no landscape in this world. There was no time or space, nor any celestial bodies. There was only an extremely profound kind of indescribable law.","This law was different from the ones he usually came into contact with and comprehended. It seemed to possess a great power that originated from the birth of the universe.","From this power, Jian Chen sensed the silhouette of the Hundred Superimposition Sword and its secrets."]},{"number":3990,"title":"Chapter 3990: Passive Increase","paragraphs":["“ These abnormal emotions occurring within me are probably due to the strand of presence from the Hole of Reincarnation. ”","“ But why is the presence from the Hole of Reincarnation having such a big impact on me? Why does it make me uncontrollably sad? ”","Jian Chen was completely unable to suppress his strange sorrow. The heart-wrenching pain reached deep into his soul, turning into cloudy tears that poured out without any signs of stopping.","Even with the sturdy willpower and impregnable mental fortitude he had developed, he was unable to stave off these emotions of sorrow. They shattered it with ease.","“ And how many other people have experienced these strange emotions apart from me? ” Jian Chen wondered.","His current state was extremely strange. He was clearly shedding tears, yet thought filled his eyes. He felt extremely saddened inside, but the sadness also left him puzzled.","Submerged in sadness, Jian Chen even momentarily forgot about the matter regarding the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","No, he had not forgotten. It was better said that the abnormal emotions had far too great of an impact on him. It was so great that he no longer cared or paid any attention to the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","After the ancient jade disc had shattered, the secrets of the Hundred Superimposition Sword contained inside did not disperse. Instead, it turned into a profound comprehension of ways, gradually merging with Jian Chen’s soul.","This kind of merging was different. It was as if Jian Chen was directly absorbing it, and he was not even doing that actively. It occurred completely passively.","Even when Jian Chen was overwhelmed with sadness, no longer paying any thought to the Hundred Superimposition Sword, the comprehension and secrets of the technique were still being absorbed.","And, whenever he absorbed a portion, Jian Chen’s grasp and understanding of the Hundred Superimposition Sword would increase slightly.","This was completely passive and beyond his control. It was more difficult for Jian Chen to stop this process than continue.","In the past, Jian Chen had to devote a vast amount of time and energy to comprehension if he wanted to grasp the Hundred Superimposition Sword. If he did not have sufficient talent and fortune, even gaining a basic grasp would have been almost impossible.","But at this moment, he did not have to exert any effort at all. The Hundred Superimposition Sword had already entered a state of self-comprehension. It was unbelievable.","If Jian Chen’s emotions had not been overwhelmed by the sadness, this change would have definitely left him ravishing in joy.","But now, under the influence of the sadness, he was in a state of utmost indifference. Nothing in the world could interest him anymore. He completely neglected the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","Jian Chen wiped away his tears and gasped for air as he sat there, trying his best to calm himself down. However, he discovered that he was unable to pacify his emotions.","At that moment, he only felt his chest weigh extremely heavily. He was in an emotional turmoil. He had no desire to cultivate at all.","He stood up and left the room he had spent several years in secluded cultivation with rather heavy steps. He appeared on the streets of the Observance Heaven City alone. He gazed at the bustling, busy streets in a daze.","Jian Chen wandered through the bustling streets aimlessly. Under the influence of the strange emotions, he lost interest in everything going on around him. He was completely dejected and seemed like he was a walking corpse.","Of course, he did not drop his guard in the very depths of his heart. He maintained the false appearance and presence from the mask of the Illusionary Daemon race, hiding his true identity.","This continued for several days. Jian Chen wandered through the Observance Heaven City like he had lost his soul. He was dispirited.","However, with the passage of several days, the influence of the sorrow on him gradually weakened.","During this period of time, he questioned himself time and time again. He constantly tried to find the source of this sorrow, but apart from confirming it was connected to the wisp of presence from the Hole of Reincarnation, he was clueless.","At this moment, Jian Chen felt his mind suddenly clear up. In a daze, he seemed to gain some kind of new understanding.","In just a few days, his Hundred Superimposition Sword had already reached the seventh layer!","The first five layers of the Hundred Superimposition Sword had taken him eighteen years!","Going from the fifth layer to the sixth layer had taken him five years!","Now, going from the sixth layer to the seventh layer only took him a few days!","And, after comprehending the seventh layer of the Hundred Superimposition Sword, he did not slow down. As the profound presence from the ancient jade disc was absorbed, Jian Chen’s comprehension of the Hundred Superimposition Sword gradually advanced towards the eighth layer.","“I never thought that Chang Yang who contended against the first great elder of the Immortal Feather sect, Xia Tianming, actually possessed a sovereign god artifact...”","“Much less did I think that Chang Yang actually disguised himself at Yang Yutian and stirred up such a great storm in the Skyscraping World...”","“Exactly. It’s said that when the Skyscraping World opened this time, a rather shocking number of Immortal Exalts had perished. Virtually all of their deaths were connected to Yang Yutian...”","“You know the Profound Spirit Master, right? He’s one of the ancestors of the Heavenly Palace of Scaling Heights from the Cloud Extent Heaven, a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. It’s said that he was killed by Yang Yutian right in the eye of the public...”","“A sovereign god artifact. That’s a sovereign god artifact. I never thought that a treasure like that would actually fall into the hands of an Immortal Emperor. How envious...”","......","...","A conversation caught Jian Chen’s attention. When he turned around subconsciously, he discovered a familiar estate.","Jian Chen immediately began to reminisce.","He had once been the temporary owner of this estate. When he served as the Thousand Immortal General, everything in the estate belonged to him.","Several cultivators walked out from the main entrance of the estate. They ranged from Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals to Immortal Monarchs. They walked off into the distance in discussion before vanishing into a luxurious inn in the end.","“ All acquaintances. ” Jian Chen watched these people walk off into the distance as he sighed inside. He had already recognised these people. They had all been his subordinates. Although he could not name many of them, he did recognise their appearances and presences.","Apart from a change in the Thousand Immortal General, the estate he used to stay in retained the same people.","“Looks like the events that occurred in the Skyscraping World have already been leaked. As time goes on, there will only be more people that know.” Jian Chen sank into his thoughts. His emotions had already recovered substantially now. The strange sadness had gradually receded as well, unable to influence the state of his mind.","He immediately stopped his aimless stroll through the streets, quickly returning to his inn.","“I’ve actually comprehended the Hundred Superimposition Sword up to the seventh layer?” Only at this moment was he in the right state of mind to pay attention to the changes to the Hundred Superimposition Sword and himself. He was immediately startled.","The Hundred Superimposition Sword had gone from the sixth layer to the seventh layer in such a short time. Jian Chen struggled to believe that as he understood the exact difficulty involved.","He immediately gathered his focus and began closely examining the changes that occurred after the jade disc had merged with his soul. However, the more he observed, the more startled he became. He discovered that his grasp over the Hundred Superimposition Sword was growing at an unbelievable pace. He basically gained a new understanding with each passing moment.","“ It doesn’t need any effort from me at all. It’s comprehending automatically? Why is that the case? ” Even with Jian Chen’s knowledge and insight, he was stumped by his discoveries.","He had seen countless battle skills and secret techniques before, but he had never heard about something so strange.","“ At this rate, will it comprehend itself to the hundredth layer? ” Jian Chen found this unbelievable. After some thought, he entered the Primeval Divine Hall. He arrived in an empty area so that he could test out the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","Boom! As the seven blurs merged into one, the Heaven-lifting sword in his hand erupted with blinding light, slashing heavily against the Primeval Divine Hall and producing a terrifying storm of energy.","“ It can’t be wrong. This is seven times the power. I’ve actually grasped the Hundred Superimposition Sword up to the seventh layer? ” Jian Chen was dazed when he sensed the powerful storm of energy.","It was not as simple as the seventh layer. There was another important factor—he used it just too easily and just too casually.","This was clearly some kind of profound and powerful secret technique, yet it felt even easier than God Tier Battle Skills when he used it.","“ With my current level of comprehension, I can use some God Tier Battle Skills instantly, without any need for charging up, but the Hundred Superimposition Sword can no longer be described as instantly. It comes to me completely naturally. It feels as if it was part of me in the first place, like my own hand or foot! ”","No matter how Jian Chen thought about this, he was unable to understand the reason. In the end, he could only attribute it to the Hole of Reincarnation.","“The Hole of Reincarnation has influenced my emotions twice now. Don’t tell me some kind of unknown connection exists between me and the Hole of Reincarnation?” Jian Chen murmured before taking a step and instantly vanishing. When he reappeared, he had already arrived at where the Divine Formation of the Heavens was assembled.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, the Immortal Devouring Orchid, and the nine Immortal Emperors were all present. Nearby were the fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples."]},{"number":3991,"title":"Chapter 3991: Searching for the Reason","paragraphs":["Jian Chen did not disturb the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples. Instead, he gathered the nine Immortal Emperors and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, sternly asking them for everything they knew about the Hole of Reincarnation.","Seeing how stern Jian Chen was, the Immortal Emperors and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt did not ask any questions despite being quite curious. They all told him everything they knew about the Hole of Reincarnation.","However, their knowledge was nothing new to Jian Chen. Basically none of it were secrets in the Immortals’ World.","“Have you ever heard rumours about the Hole of Reincarnation affecting the emotions of people?” Jian Chen asked.","“Affecting the emotions of people?” When they heard that, they looked at one another before shaking their heads.","“Sect master, there are many rumours regarding the Hole of Reincarnation in the Immortals’ World, but we have never heard about it affecting the emotions of people...”","“Let alone affecting emotions, there are no rumours that even touch on emotions. Of course, if you insist on it, there’s everyone’s greed towards the Hole of Reincarnation. After all, with Daowei Chengqing as an example, many people hunger for the treasures in the Hole of Reincarnation...”","......","...","Jian Chen did not learn anything useful from the nine Immortal Emperors and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. After leaving the Primeval Divine Hall, Jian Chen sat in his room. He continued to ponder about the sorrow that arose strangely.","It had happened twice already. The strange sorrow seemed to weigh on Jian Chen’s mind permanently now. Unless he got to the bottom of it, he would struggle to find peace.","After some thought, Jian Chen called for the artifact spirit of the Observance Heaven City again. Through the artifact spirit, he met the master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets again without any obstruction.","As a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the pavilion master possessed tremendous status. Even if the ancestors of peak organisations wanted to meet with him, it would be quite difficult, yet Jian Chen could basically visit him whenever he wanted. Such treatment only demonstrated how much the pavilion master cared for Jian Chen.","This time, Jian Chen cut right to the chase. He directly told the pavilion master about the emotions he experienced.","Jian Chen trusted the pavilion master very much, so he did not hide too many things. Of course, he did not disclose the strange phenomenon with the Hundred Superimposition Sword.","“You said the presence from the Hole of Reincarnation affects your emotions and leaves you in a state of uncontrollable sorrow?” When the pavilion master learnt about what had happened to Jian Chen, he was stunned. He was extremely shocked.","Even the way he looked at Jian Chen changed. There were hints of doubt as if he was trying to tell if Jian Chen was fooling around with him.","Jian Chen was stern. He said seriously, “Senior, not only are you extremely knowledgeable, but you can also peer into the secrets of the world. Have you ever heard of examples where the Hole of Reincarnation can affect people?”","“I haven’t. I only know that every single item that emerges from the Hole of Reincarnation is enough to drive people crazy. This is a result of their own greed. It cannot be attributed to the Hole of Reincarnation.” The pavilion master furrowed his brows tightly. He stared straight at Jian Chen and said in thought, “Apart from that, has the Hole of Reincarnation affected you in any other strange way?”","Jian Chen closely recalled his entire experience when he passed by the Hole of Reincarnation the first time. After a moment of hesitation, he said slowly, “I was overcome with an urge, an urge to enter the Hole of Reincarnation.”","When he heard that, the pavilion master’s face changed slightly. Enter the Hole of Reincarnation? That was nothing to joke about.","Throughout history, there were plenty of people who had entered the Hole of Reincarnation. They varied in strength. But without any exception, none of them returned. They were basically confirmed as dead.","As a matter of fact, the ancient records noted that a Grand Exalt had entered the Hole of Reincarnation, but they had not emerged even to this day, vanishing from the Immortals’ World forever.","Although the Hole of Reincarnation had been praised as a land of fortune throughout history, a place that could change the fates of people, it was also an abyss. It was an abyss of no return that could swallow all living creatures.","Daowei Chengqing’s appearance a hundred thousand years ago finally broke this curse, which also pushed the Hole of Reincarnation to a new peak.","The pavilion master sank into momentary silence. A good while later, he told Jian Chen extremely sternly, “There is something that you must remember. No matter what kind of effect the Hole of Reincarnation has on you, no matter how curious you are about the Hole of Reincarnation, you must never set foot inside.”","Jian Chen nodded. He was quite curious about the Hole of Reincarnation, but he was also extremely wary of it, holding it in deep veneration.","“I can’t tell you too much about the Hole of Reincarnation, as that place is far too mysterious. Even our Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets doesn’t possess too much information about it. Let alone us, even if you go and ask Grand Exalts, you won’t get much of a reply either.”","“Because even Grand Exalts do not dare to set foot in that place...”","Before long, Jian Chen bade farewell to the pavilion master before being sent off. He returned to the inn.","After Jian Chen’s departure, the vice master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets, Liao Chen, suddenly appeared. He bowed towards the pavilion master politely before saying slowly, “Pavilion master, this is unprecedented, for someone’s emotions to actually be influenced by the Hole of Reincarnation. Is this potentially indicating that Jian Chen has a destiny with the Hole of Reincarnation?”","When he heard that, the pavilion master’s eyes suddenly narrowed. He understood Liao Chen. He understood that when Liao Chen said the word “destiny” in such a solemn manner, it definitely was not as simple as all the cultivators gathering outside the Hole of Reincarnation and gaining inspiration and comprehension from its changes.","“Keep going!” the pavilion master said. Actually, he already knew what Liao Chen was thinking.","Liao Chen sucked in a deep breath. After a moment of deliberation, he said, “The Hole of Reincarnation has existed for all these years. We have never heard of it affecting a person’s emotions. Jian Chen should be the first that we know of. As a result, I have a bold theory. Could Jian Chen be the second person after Daowei Chengqing who can enter the Hole of Reincarnation?”","The pavilion master shook his head and said, “Your theory is too crazy. Although there has never been an example of the Hole of Reincarnation influencing a person’s emotions, there have been many cultivators who have benefitted from the changes with the Hole of Reincarnation over the years. Do they also have a destiny with the Hole of Reincarnation?”","“You are right, pavilion master. I’ve been too brash with my conclusion. I shouldn’t make this conclusion so easily,” Liao Chen said shamefully.","“You are just too hopeful that a second destined person can emerge from the Hole of Reincarnation. The Hole of Reincarnation has existed for countless years. Even throughout history, Daowei Chengqing is the only one to emerge from there. For a second person to appear in such a short amount of time, just how slim are the chances?” The pavilion master sighed gently. “And, we don’t even know if there will be a second person who can emerge from the Hole of Reincarnation alive at all. Even if there is, I wonder if I’ll be able to witness it in my lifetime.”"]},{"number":3992,"title":"Chapter 3992: Future Danger","paragraphs":["Vice pavilion master Liao Chen nodded deep in thought. Shortly afterwards, he recalled something. He became worried. “When I communicate with the ways during cultivation in recent years, I regularly sense a tremendous danger in a distant place. This sense of danger can truly be described as world-ending, enough to upheave the entire legacy and heritage of our Immortals’ World.”","“Although our Immortals’ World already possesses the Dominion’s Brush and the Book of the Populace, I still have a feeling that these two items are unable to contend against the apocalypse that might occur in the future.”","“If we can’t stop the apocalypse, then even with our Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets rooted in the Observance Heaven City, we won’t be able to avoid destruction.”","“And the only way to contend against this apocalypse that I can think of is the Hole of Reincarnation...”","When he mentioned the Hole of Reincarnation, a strange light appeared in Liao Chen’s eyes. There was a great desire to know more, as well as an entrustment of hope.","The pavilion master sighed gently and said, “The danger you sense comes from the Saints’ World. The Grand Exalt of Ancient Paths from the Saints’ World is forging an ultimate god artifact of extremely startling power. It’s said that once this god artifact is forged, it can completely alter the fate of a major world. It can make that world invincible.”","“However, our Immortals’ World is currently weaker than them in comparison. Even with the Grand Exalt birthed by the Waymight clan, we still can’t make up for our difference with the Saints’ World. As for the ultimate god artifact, there’s nothing that we can do for the time being.”","“If a second person were to emerge from the Hole of Reincarnation, then perhaps we can change this disadvantageous circumstance,” Liao Chen said softly.","The pavilion master said powerlessly, “Daowei Chengqing said the Hole of Reincarnation can only be entered once. If he were to enter a second time, he would not be able to emerge again like everyone else. Otherwise, we could get him to enter a second time and see if he could bring out anything mysterious.”","“I just wonder if Daowei Chengqing is telling the truth or not. It’s just a pity that we can’t peer into anything regarding him. Otherwise, we’d be able to tell whether he’s telling the truth or not,” said Liao Chen.","“So what if he was lying? The Waymight clan has already risen up and become a clan with a sovereign. In the current Immortals’ World, who can still force them to do something against their will?” The pavilion master paused. His gaze deepened as he said, “However, there is something that is true. Ever since Daowei Chengqing was reborn, he did not enter the Hole of Reincarnation a second time. He did not even approach the place. Perhaps he is telling the truth, that it can only be entered once.”","“As for Jian Chen...” When he mentioned Jian Chen, the pavilion master could not help but pause. Mixed emotions filled his eyes. In the end, he let out a gentle sigh and said, “Regardless of what kind of special attraction the Hole of Reincarnation has become to him, he cannot be allowed to set foot inside.”","“He is the inheritor of the twin swords. He also bears the hope of the revival of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. His duties and responsibilities should be focused on the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. He should not be concerning himself with this future disaster.”","“After all, he’s just an Immortal Emperor right now. He is even being hunted down by numerous Immortal Exalts in the Immortals’ World. There are some burdens that are not for him to bear...”","“The Immortals’ World has already let down the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Now that the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens has finally produced a promising seedling with hopes of rising back up again, how can we forfeit this seedling to the Hole of Reincarnation...”","In the inn, Jian Chen stood by the window and gazed at the streets outside in deep thought. He continued to think about the influence on his emotions from the presence from the Hole of Reincarnation. It seemed like he would struggle to find peace unless he got to the bottom of this.","But in the end, no matter how he racked his brains, no matter how he divined, he found nothing at all.","This had to do with the Hole of Reincarnation after all, a mysterious place that even Grand Exalts did not understand. Unless he entered it, he would struggle to gain more information.","In the blink of an eye, another half a month had passed. During this time, Jian Chen discovered that the events of the Skyscraping World had spread further and further. Even though he had not gained a fine grasp over the situation outside, the people aware of these events were not limited to important disciples from major organisations in the Observance Heaven City at least. Some mid-range organisations knew as well. As a matter of fact, even some of the clansmen of lesser importance in these organisations had heard about it.","A forceful attempt at containment would definitely lead to an eruption in retaliation. Now, the events of the Skyscraping World were in the process of erupting. Even with both the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect working together to contain the news, it would not prevail in the long run.","Whether it was a sovereign god artifact that could heal injuries indefinitely, the clash between the two heavenly emperors of the Immortal Feather sect and the Heavenly Star Palace outside the Skyscraping World, or even the Heavenly Emperor of Sword Radiance from the Immortal Sect of Myriad Swords personally appearing, they were all pieces of news that could shake up the entire Immortals’ World once they made it out, let alone the fact that they had all occurred together.","The influence of that was obviously beyond imagination.","“Four heavenly emperors personally showed up, and it even led to a conflict between the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor. Who would have thought that the instigator was once a Thousand Immortal General of our Observance Heaven City...”","“Yeah, who would have thought that an Immortal Emperor could actually stir up such a great mess...”","“I heard that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor went to great lengths to protect Chang Yang, far more than he would ever do for a regular descendant. Coupled with Chang Yang’s mysterious identity and background, there are even people in the Immortals’ World who suspect Chang Yang to be the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s illegitimate son...”","“In my opinion, the reason why the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor would protect Chang Yang is probably for the sovereign god artifact on him as well...”","......","...","Now, Jian Chen could hear rumours like that in the Observance Heaven City alone. Everyone participated in this discussion. There were rumours as exaggerated as they came.","“ Fortunately, I had dealt with the Master of Profound Secrets beforehand. If the Master of Profound Secrets heard about this, killing him won’t be so easy once he raises his guard, ” Jian Chen thought. At this moment, he felt a hint of understanding appear in his head. Before he knew it, his Hundred Superimposition Sword had grown once again, successfully reaching the eighth layer.","Eight superimpositions were eight fold in power. He could clearly sense that his battle prowess was increasing.","“ The Skyscraping Sword Venerable went through many years of arduous comprehension to only grasp nine layers in the end, yet I’ve grasped eight in such a short amount of time. Moreover, after grasping the eighth layer, the Hundred Superimposition Sword is progressing towards the ninth layer. I’ll grasp the ninth layer before long. If senior Skyscraping Sword Venerable learned about this, I wonder how he would feel. ” Jian Chen sighed inside. He had already set aside the matter of the Hole of Reincarnation temporarily, as he was forced to accept a cruel and powerless reality. Any questions regarding the Hole of Reincarnation were currently beyond his reach to answer.","“Big news! It’s only just come out. A supreme ancestor of the Immortal Feather sect personally paid a visit to the Cloud Extent Heaven and obliterated the body of an Immortal Exalt from an organisation there. Over a dozen Immortal Emperor great elders have been heavily injured...”","“It’s not just the Cloud Extent Heaven. Something big has happened on the Venerated Aptitude Heaven as well. The Heavenly Star Palace of the twelve courts of heaven sent an Immortal Exalt ancestor to the Venerated Aptitude Heaven, arranging a peak formation of extraordinary power and trapping a peak organisation on the Venerated Aptitude Heaven. It’s said that they’ll keep the sect trapped inside for a hundred thousand years...”","“I heard they disclosed the events of the Skyscraping World against the strict personal orders of the two heavenly emperors...”","“Courts of heaven cannot be disobeyed. These two suppressed organisations disobeyed the will of the Heavenly Star Palace and the Immortal Feather sect, which was why they faced retribution...”"]},{"number":3993,"title":"Chapter 3993: The Wicked Immortal Elder","paragraphs":["Discussions filled the Observance Heaven City. Many immortals conversed about this matter enthusiastically.","The courts of heaven had personally taken action against peak organisations of the Immortals’ World. It was a shocking matter. In particular, it received even more attention because it was connected to the storm in the Skyscraping World and a sovereign god artifact.","But as of right now, apart from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, Xing Caijian, and a small number of people, no one else in the Immortals’ World knew that Jian Chen possessed far more than one sovereign god artifact. They all subconsciously assumed the recovery sovereign god also allowed him to bring several tens of thousand cultivators into the Skyscraping World.","As the news of the Skyscraping World spread, the owners of the medicinal gardens who learnt about this first and were sweeping the Immortals’ World for Jian Chen became nervous. The competition was getting even more intense.","“Whoever can obtain this recovery sovereign god artifact will obtain an undying body. This item is just too tempting. There will only be more and more experts who compete for it...”","“So what if even heavenly emperors are partaking in this? Before an opportunity that can almost change one’s fate, there are far too many people willing to give up everything, face the strongest opponent fearlessly, and sacrifice their lives for a chance at this...”","“As long as it’s tempting enough, some people are willing to push their boundaries with others that have the protection of Grand Exalts, let alone heavenly emperors...”","At this moment, various Immortal Exalts all sighed throughout the Immortals’ World. Some of them immediately shut off their senses and directed their attention back to cultivation, ignoring the conflict in the outside world. Some were unable to resist the temptation after a moment of hesitation and struggle, leaving their dwellings decisively.","They had already decided on competing for this sovereign god artifact. Even when their opponents were influential heavenly emperors, they were still willing to take the chance.","The path of cultivation was treacherous and difficult. An expert’s status was paved from the corpses of countless geniuses. For the sake of a grand opportunity that was virtually life-changing, many people had already cast aside all of their qualms. Even if they made the world their enemy, they would not care.","On this day, everyone in the Observance Heaven City, ranging from the city lord Jiang Pingtian to lower cultivators that had not even reached Immortal Monarch, sensed a chilling pressure. It made their breathing become abnormally difficult.","Jiang Pingtian immediately stood up from his throne in the city lord’s estate. He became extremely stern.","“A supreme expert has come to the Observance Heaven City. He’s using his presence to announce his arrival. He has neither interfered with the usual operation of the city, nor has he broken any of the rules. Looks like the Observance Heaven City will only become livelier in the near future,” Jiang Pingtian said in thought.","With a flash, the vice city lord dressed in fiery-red robes, the Master of Fire Virtue, appeared. He was also stern. “Fellow Jiang, do you know who they are?”","Jiang Pingtian replied calmly, “They’ve spread a wisp of their pressure across the entire city. Although it’s quite vague, it is also quite tremendous. It comes from all directions, making it impossible to lock onto the person, much less find out who they are.”","When he heard that, the Master of Fire Virtue was secretly surprised. Jiang Pingtian was the city lord of the Observance Heaven City. He possessed many special authorities here, yet even he was unable to lock onto this person. He realised that this person’s strength was probably beyond his imagination.","Jiang Pingtian continued, “However, I can roughly guess his intentions. He’s probably come for the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets.”","At this moment, an old man in grey robes stood quietly outside the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets. He seemed extremely ordinary like an old farmer. He was modest and simple in appearance. He did not stand out at all.","People bustled down the busy street, but they all treated him like he was invisible when they passed by. Even when they glanced past him, they saw nothing.","Virtually as soon as the old man arrived there, a spatial gate opened before him. The scenery inside was the miniature world where the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets resided.","The old man did not hesitate. He stepped through the spatial gate and appeared before the pavilion master.","“Tian Jizi, I want to know Yang Yutian’s precise whereabouts. State your price!” The old man in grey robes faced the pavilion master. There was no hint of additional respect in his voice, only a sense of indifference towards an equal.","“Wicked Immortal Elder, do you also want to contend for the sovereign god artifact?” the pavilion master sat before him and said calmly.","“Three million years ago in that war against the experts of the Saints’ World, my disciple was heavily injured. It’s been extremely difficult for him to recover from his injuries. I’ve tried everything that I know, and it’s still been useless. The appearance of the recovery sovereign god artifact has allowed me to see an opportunity for my disciple’s recovery,” the Wicked Immortal Elder said.","“Wicked Immortal Elder, you better think things through. The sovereign god artifact isn’t that easy to obtain. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor from the Immortal Feather sect is also determined to obtain it.” The pavilion master sighed gently.","The Wicked Immortal Elder’s eyes were cold. “So what? Even if a heavenly emperor wants to stop me, I’ll give them a taste of what I’m capable of.”","The pavilion master glanced at the Wicked Immortal Elder deeply and said, “Please return. I can’t help you with this, as I am unable to divine anything with regards to him. You must be aware of this too.”","“You are the master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets. You grasp the unfathomable Technique of Heavenly Secrets. You just might be able to find an inkling or two when it comes to things that I can’t divine,” the Wicked Immortal Elder said.","“I also can’t divine anything. Please return,” the pavilion master asked for him to leave.","“I will use a supreme secret technique created by a Grand Exalt. It should strengthen your Technique of Heavenly Secrets by thirty percent at the very least.” The Wicked Immortal Elder refused to give up.","“Even with the support of your secret technique, I still won’t be able to find anything, as this is not something that the Technique of Heavenly Secrets can peer into. It is not something that can be captured through secret techniques,” said the pavilion master.","“If you don’t try, how would you know the result?”","“There’s no need to try. Why waste the effort?” The pavilion master had already become a little displeased.","The Wicked Immortal Elder lost his temper. With a step, the miniature world where the entire Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets resided began to shake violently like it was experiencing an earthquake.","“Tian Jizi, is it really that difficult for you to use the Technique of Heavenly Secrets for me? Or are you saying that I don’t have the right for you to do it given my strength and status?” the Wicked Immortal Elder yelled angrily.","“Wicked Immortal Elder, this is the Observance Heaven City. You know the consequences of breaking the rules. You don’t need me to explain them to you,” the pavilion master said indifferently.","The Wicked Immortal Elder sucked in a deep breath and slowly calmed his anger. After a cold snort, he turned around and left the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets.","Before long, the Wicked Immortal Elder arrived in a foreign space. Five shining stars appeared before him. Each star radiated with a dense presence of life.","As the Wicked Immortal Elder spread his fingers, the five stars exploded. Endless life force was condensed violently before entirely being absorbed by the very centre.","When the presence of life dissipated, a few remains were revealed in the centre of the stars.","This was a complete body, except it had been split into five parts, each sealed within the five stars.","“Wake up, my disciple. I’ve already found the opportunity to help you recover,” the Wicked Immortal Elder said rather sorrowfully.","PS: The author is sick and has been in a terrible condition lately, which is why the recent release rate can only be described as horrendous. Please forgive him. The author will immediately return to regular releases as soon as he has recovered."]},{"number":3994,"title":"Chapter 3994: A Game of Chess","paragraphs":["After saying that, the Wicked Immortal Elder simply stood there quietly as he waited. He did not say a second word.","This wait lasted several hours. Finally, a ripple suddenly appeared in space. The entire region undulated like water. Shortly afterwards, a powerful consciousness seemed to awaken from its slumber, growing stronger and stronger.","When the consciousness awakened, the five body pieces floating in outer space seemed to be drawn together by a mysterious force. They began to approach one another before finally assembling into one body.","This was a damaged body. It was covered in many vicious and terrifying wounds. All of its organs had been pierced, covered with finger-sized holes. A strange power lingered in each wound.","It was exactly this lingering strange power that prevented the body from recovering from its injuries.","“H-has m-master really f-found a-a way for m-me to recover...” A voice rang out in outer space. Even though it was communication from the soul, it was still fragmented. It sounded extremely feeble.","The Wicked Immortal Elder stood with his arms by his side. “Right now, it’s only a chance, the greatest chance that I’ve found so far. As for whether you can actually recover, we’ll only know once we give it a try.”","The Wicked Immortal Elder paused. He said sternly, “However, if we want to grasp this chance, we need to expend some effort. He is very good at hiding. Even heavenly emperors struggle to find him.”","“E-even heavenly emperors... struggle to find him. Then master, d-do we still have a chance...” The feeble soul communicated.","When he heard that, the Wicked Immortal Elder laughed aloud and said, “When it comes to fighting, I might not be able to beat heavenly emperors, but when it comes to looking for people, there are no heavenly emperors that surpasses me in this day and age.”","“Yes, master. I’ll rebuild my body now!” In the next moment, the assembled body shone with dazzling light. A great power of vitality radiated out, shaking up the space there.","Under the envelopment of the light, the five areas of rupture rapidly closed up. They gradually melded into one complete form.","The Wicked Immortal Elder watched the figure recover, pausing on the wounds that lingered with strange energy multiple times. A deep sense of guilt flashed through the bottom of his eyes.","In that intense war three million years, these injuries and this fate should have been his, but his disciple used his innate secret technique at a critical moment to turn the situation around. He forcefully moved these injuries over to himself, enduring everything.","As a result, the Wicked Immortal Elder felt a deep sense of responsibility and guilt towards his disciple.","At this moment, the Wicked Immortal Elder furrowed his brows. He turned his head towards the distance.","Where his gaze landed, an old man silently appeared from nowhere. He was dressed in an old and faded set of daoist robes. His presence was concealed, making him seem like a regular daoist priest.","However, the appearance of the daoist priest immediately made the Wicked Immortal Elder wary like he was facing a powerful opponent.","“Heavenly Talisman Venerable, what are you doing here?” The Wicked Immortal Elder stared straight at the old daoist priest with hostility.","The person right before him was his old rival. They had clashed openly and secretly for who knew how many years already. Neither of them could triumph over the other.","“Wicked Immortal, we still haven’t finished our game of chess from last time,” the Heavenly Talisman Venerable said indifferently. With a wave of his hand, an ancient talisman flew out, turning into a colossal chessboard in outer space.","“I still have other matters to deal with right now. I have no time for your game of chess. I’ll face you some other day!” the Wicked Immortal Elder said coldly.","“I’ve come all the way here. That’s not for you to decide.” The Heavenly Talisman Venerable smiled gently. The chessboard from the talisman expanded, immediately enveloping the Heavenly Talisman Venerable and the Wicked Immortal Elder.","The chessboard was like another world with its unique rules. They were extremely sturdy. In particular, after being reinforced by the Heavenly Talisman Venerable’s power, even a peak expert like the Wicked Immortal Elder would struggle to break free from here quickly.","The Wicked Immortal Elder’s face darkened. He growled and said, “Heavenly Talisman Venerable, are you intentionally keeping me busy, stopping me from leaving here?”","“Come. Let’s talk after this game.” The Heavenly Talisman Venerable’s smile gradually vanished. He formed a seal with one hand. The chessboard immediately erupted with a great power, crushing towards the Wicked Immortal Elder in an overwhelming manner.","“Heavenly Talisman Venerable, looks like you’re determined to stop me from leaving.” The Wicked Immortal Elder’s eyes were filled with killing intent. With that, the tremendous presence of a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt erupted from his body before turning into an invisible blade that shot towards the Heavenly Talisman Venerable mercilessly.","Boom!","The two terrifying powers collided midway, producing a deafening rumble. The entire world of the chessboard shook violently.","From this clash, the Wicked Immortal Elder and the Heavenly Talisman Venerable were evenly matched. Neither of them had the advantage over the other.","The Heavenly Talisman Venerable was stern. With a flick of his finger, a chess piece immediately fell down from thin air. It was the size of a planet.","When the chess piece landed on the chessboard, the quiet chessboard immediately became filled with an icy presence of desolation.","The Wicked Immortal Elder was unfazed. He used his energy to condense a planet-sized chess piece as well, erupting with devastating power that swept through the chessboard.","The chessboard was both a board and a battlefield. It was filled with endless killing intent. The slightest lapse in caution was enough to doom them.","“We won’t be able to finish this game of chess any time soon. My disciple, you’ll have to go by yourself...” The Wicked Immortal Elder’s frustrated voice rang out.","......","...","On the Reverent Observance Heaven, a cloaked figure roamed through the Sword Region of Violet Heavens.","He seemed to be on a leisurely stroll, but he moved with unbelievable speed. With each step, he would cross an extremely great distance. He was like a ghost, silently appearing near each cultivator that entered the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, inspecting them with the naked eye from a close distance.","No one in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens sensed his existence. Even Immortal Emperors who would pass by the Sword Region of Violet Heavens from time to time failed to sense his approach.","Let alone Immortal Emperors, even the Space-splitting Venerable who constantly watched the Sword Region of Violet Heavens with the senses of his soul from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants failed to sense the cloaked figure’s existence.","The cloaked figure completely covered his appearance. He was the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor from the Immortal Feather sect of the twelve courts of heaven."]},{"number":3995,"title":"Chapter 3995: The Dungeon Demon God","paragraphs":["The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was clearly extremely determined to obtain Jian Chen’s Source of Life. As a mighty heavenly emperor, he possessed an esteemed status, yet he had stooped to the level of coming to the Reverent Observance Heaven in person, expending tremendous effort to search through every single person.","Such a matter was extremely rare.","Actually, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was extremely frustrated as well. He did not want to do this either, but he truly had no other choice. Jian Chen’s ability to hide his presence and tracks was far too powerful. All of his methods of divination were useless against him. He could not even detect him with the senses of his soul as a heavenly emperor. The only way to see through his disguise that he could think of was by observing him from a close distance with the naked eye.","As a result, he was forced to shrink his search range to the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. If the range was too large, he would be powerless as well.","At this moment, a red imprint suddenly flashed on the forehead of the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor as he hid himself under the cloak.","“Oh no!” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s face changed and immediately darkened.","In the next moment, an extremely powerful demon Qi appeared beyond the Reverent Observance Heaven. It turned into rolling black clouds that enveloped the entire heaven.","In an instant, the entire Reverent Observance Heaven sank into darkness. The terrifying demon Qi shrouded the sky and cut off all light. It was as if the end of the world was here.","In the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, the red imprint on the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s forehead continued to flash. His face sank as he stared straight at a certain location within the dark clouds.","Various Immortal Exalts rose up into the air across the Reverent Observance Heaven. They all stared at the dark sky sternly. Within the depths of the thick demon Qi, they felt a stifling pressure.","“Another supreme expert of paramount cultivation has arrived. Sigh, the Reverent Observance Heaven is only getting busier and busier with the coming days.” In the Observance Heaven City, Jiang Pingtian hovered above the city lord’s estate and let out a heavy sigh.","“The Dungeon Demon God is the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s mortal enemy. They are each other’s fated tribulations. It won’t be that easy for the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor to wait on the Reverent Observance Heaven for Jian Chen to show up now,” the master of the Pavilion of Heavenly Secrets gazed through space and murmured to himself inside the miniature world in the Observance Heaven City.","The vice pavilion master Liao Chen appeared. He was extremely stern. “Pavilion master, can the Dungeon Demon God really keep the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor busy? This is the Immortals’ World after all. There are still some old freaks who never show themselves in the Immortals’ World that hold great hostility towards the Demons’ World.”","“Don’t worry, the Dungeon Demon God has specially come for the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor. A Grand Exalt bore witness to their matter. No one can interfere,” said the pavilion master.","Outside the Reverent Observance Heaven, a colossal figure suddenly appeared within the boundless demon Qi. He stood several million metres tall like a planet.","“Hahahaha, old man Soaring Immortal, why are you on the Reverent Observance Heaven instead of watching over your nest, the Immortal Feather sect? You even disguised yourself so well, lurking around like a ghost as if you’re afraid that others might find out who you are.”","“You’re an impressive heavenly emperor, yet you’ve resorted to hiding and disguising yourself like this. Probably none of the countless experts on the Reverent Observance Heaven even know that a heavenly emperor is actually hiding in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens...”","A gruff voice rang out from beyond the Reverent Observance Heaven, reverberating throughout the entire heaven.","On top of that, there was a strange kind of power inside the voice. It influenced the spiritual Qi of the entire heaven, causing it to collide together violently and produce rumbles.","This was an expert on the same level as the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor. Before an expert like this, any single word or action they made was sufficient to influence the order of the entire heaven.","As the voice rang out, the Reverent Observance Heaven immediately fell into an uproar, as the information revealed was far too shocking. Just how honourable was a heavenly emperor? Yet at this moment, one had actually come to the Reverent Observance Heaven without raising any attention. That immediately shocked the countless experts of the Reverent Observance Heaven.","In the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor who wrapped himself tightly in a cloak had an extremely sunken face. Surging killing intent flowed through his eyes.","The red imprint glowed even brighter on his forehead. Vaguely, it seemed like a ball of pure demon Qi was flowing through the depths of the imprint.","In the next moment, he vanished, immediately leaving the Reverent Observance Heaven and arriving before the shrouding demon Qi.","“Dungeon Demon God, the day of our battle has yet to arrive. You shouldn’t have come to the Immortals’ World. Piss off back to your Demons’ World,” the cloaked Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor said as he growled deeply.","“Hahahaha, you and I were originally one, so why make such a separation? Since you can stay in the Immortals’ World, so can I.” The Dungeon Demon God’s fearless laughter rang out from the demon Qi that blotted out the sky.","“Your existence is my greatest source of humiliation. When the day of our battle comes, I will definitely eradicate you with my own hands. All of your achievements will be mine. It will forge my path to the apex,” the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor said icily.","“You’re too confident. I know everything that you’re capable of. When the day of our battle comes, who dies to whose hand has yet to be determined,” the Dungeon Demon God laughed. “Though, I feel like I have a slightly better chance at victory. Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, when we can one another, you will definitely be the one who dies, as you’re already lacking that courage to advance fearlessly even in the face of death.”","“You’ve already begun to dread this. You’re afraid that you’ll lose everything that you possess right now. It’s exactly because of that fear that you would try all sorts of methods to increase your strength, which is why you’d shrink up on the Reverent Observance Heaven. You want to try and steal the fortunes of a junior despite being an impressive heavenly emperor, just so you can prevail in the future battle...”","The Dungeon Demon God hid nothing at all. He openly stated the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s goals. His booming voice was like thunder, reaching every part of the Reverent Observance Heaven.","For a moment, the faces of many experts on the Reverent Observance Heaven changed. In particular, the hearts of many of the Immortal Exalts that had also come for the sovereign god artifact sank.","The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had already become so furious that he trembled. Hiding in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens and waiting for a junior that was only an Immortal Emperor to come his way was truly nothing to be proud of. If word of this made it out, it would damage his reputation. Now that this embarrassing matter that he had desperately tried to hide had been exposed by the Dungeon Demon God, he immediately felt humiliated.","“Dungeon Demon God, you’re looking to die!” The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor could not stand it any more. He suddenly let out a furious roar, and the tremendous pressure of a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt erupted from him. He directly struck at the Dungeon Demon God.","Immediately, a terrifying power ripped apart the world. Even a crack appeared in the demon Qi that enveloped the entire Reverent Observance Heaven. The nearby space collapsed.","“Hahahaha, you’ve lost your temper just like this? Old man Soaring Immortal, when it comes to our fated battle in the future, your defeat is none but set in stone.” The Dungeon Demon God let out a laugh. Shortly afterwards, the blotting demon Qi suddenly contracted, finally turning into a regular-sized figure. He radiated with a terrifying and chilling pressure, engaging the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor in a violent clash."]},{"number":3996,"title":"Chapter 3996: Retrieving the Divine Mountain (1)","paragraphs":["“Anyone in the Immortal’s World is permitted to obtain the sovereign god artifact on that junior, anyone except you, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor...”","With that, the Dungeon Demon God and the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor both disappeared from beyond the Reverent Observance Heaven. Only a huge spatial crack remained in the sky, releasing waves of terrifying presence.","They had already entered the spatial crack, engaging in a startling battle. Each strike would result in a turbulent storm, and each clash possessed devastating might.","After all, as supreme experts on the level of heavenly emperors, even if their current battle was not a matter of life or death, the energy they produced was extremely shocking. It gave chills to the Immortal Exalts on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","“Another battle on the level of heavenly emperors! It hasn’t even been that long since the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance faced the four supreme ancestors of the Sacred Beast clan. I never thought these peerless battles that rarely occur even across the span of millions of years would actually occur twice in such a short amount of time...”","“When the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance demonstrated her might on the Reverent Observance Heaven, the cause was that the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants had almost been completely annihilated. The person behind it all was the Thousand Immortal General of the Observance Heaven City, Chang Yang. This time, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor and the Dungeon Demon God are also fighting outside the Reverent Observance Heaven because of Chang Yang...”","“I never thought that despite only being a puny Immortal Emperor, Chang Yang would stir up such a storm on the Reverent Observance Heaven...”","On the Reverent Observance Heaven, many Immortal Exalts stared at the spatial crack that hung in outer space. They all let out sighs with mixed feelings.","Meanwhile, the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor who was locked in battle against the Dungeon Demon God fumed inside. He knew that he would be caught up with the Dungeon Demon God. He could not break free, so he would not have any spare strength to contend for the sovereign god artifact.","At the same time, Jian Chen stood by the window of his room in the Observance Heaven City and stared up. His eyes were glued on the huge spatial crack. His lips gradually curled into a smile.","Previously, he was unable to approach the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens because the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor was lurking in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens, but he knew his opportunity had come now.","Outside the Reverent Observance Heaven, the huge spatial crack gradually shrunk. The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor and the Dungeon Demon God were rapidly moving away, travelling further and further away from the Reverent Observance Heaven.","In just a minute, the crack had closed up completely.","They had completely left the Reverent Observance Heaven. Even the earth-shaking battle that erupted between them could not affect the space near the heaven anymore.","Immortal Exalts emerged from the Reverent Observance Heaven one by one. They tore open the space with their hands before diving inside.","This was a battle on the level of heavenly emperors. It was extremely fascinating, which led to many Immortal Exalts following along. They watched on while maintaining a huge distance, anticipating any potential sources of inspiration.","The battle between heavenly emperors had drawn away almost half of the Immortal Exalts on the Reverent Observance Heaven. The Immortal Exalts remaining on the Reverent Observance Heaven had decreased significantly.","Even the vice city lord of the Observance Heaven City, the Master of Fire Virtue, had followed along to watch.","In the depths of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, the Space-splitting Venerable hovered mid-air with his legs crossed within a tower. He stared outside but did not budge.","The other ancestors of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants stood outside the tower side by side. They were all tempted.","“You have me watching over this place. If you want to go, then go. A battle on the level of heavenly emperors is extremely rare. Hopefully, you can benefit through spectating,” the Space-splitting Venerable said indifferently.","When they heard that, the ancestors of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants stopped hesitating. They left the Reverent Observance Heaven decisively, also entering a spatial crack.","After they left, the Space-splitting Venerable turned his gaze towards the direction of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. His eyes were extremely cold. He said to himself, “I never thought that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had actually been hiding in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens the entire time. Hmph, Jian Chen is someone that the crown prince wants. He’s the crown prince’s prey. Even heavenly emperors will have to stand aside...”","Jian Chen stood in front of the window in his room. With the startling vision of a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, he gazed through space effortlessly and saw the Immortal Exalts leave one by one.","“ All of the experts on the Reverent Observance Heaven have their attention drawn away by the battle right now. This is a heaven-sent opportunity! ” Jian Chen’s eyes glowed brightly. Without hesitation, he erased his presence. Under the concealment of the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight, he left the Observance Heaven City elusively and directly appeared inside the Sword Region of Violet Heavens.","On the main peak of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens that had already become overgrown with weeds, Jian Chen hovered in the air while invisible, gazing at the sky above him.","After breaking through with the Laws of the Sword, his Laws of Space had strengthened drastically as well. Now, he could already vaguely sense the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain that was hidden in the space there.","The Energy-gathering Divine Mountain had been sealed here by the Star Clustered Ancestor through his Laws of Space. It could not stop stronger Immortal Exalts, but it could prevent weaker folk from coming after it.","If it were not for the Divine Formation of the Heavens, Jian Chen would also be powerless over the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain with his current strength. He could not sever it from here.","Even if he had the help of the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid, it would not be enough.","He needed the strength of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt at the very least to even shake the seal here.","But despite that, it would still take tremendous effort for a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt to remove the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain.","Above the main peak, Jian Chen gazed in the direction of the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain. His eyes shone with hesitancy.","He knew that once he took action, the disturbance he created would definitely alert all of the experts on the Reverent Observance Heaven. Even though many Immortal Exalts had already gone to watch the battle between heavenly emperors, a number of people still remained.","However, the hesitation in Jian Chen’s eyes only lasted for a short moment before being replaced by determination. In the next moment, the surrounding space twisted. Several tens of thousand disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, along with a group of experts, had been forcefully transported out by the power of the Primeval Divine Hall.","As soon as they emerged, they had already assembled the Divine Formation of the Heavens. The blinding light illuminated the surroundings.","In a tower in the depths of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, the Space-splitting Venerable who levitated in the air suddenly opened his eyes. They shone with a shocking light as he stared in the direction of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","Over the years, he had been constantly keeping an eye out on all of the disturbances that occurred in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Earlier, Jian Chen had the disguise from the Divine Armour of Heavenflight and the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race, so the Space-splitting Venerable was unable to sense his existence. Now that the Divine Formation of the Heavens had appeared, he had obviously been exposed.","“Several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, several dozen Immortal Monarchs, nine Immortal Emperors... Jian Chen, I’ve waited for you for all these years. You’ve finally appeared.” The Space-splitting Venerable’s eyes immediately turned vicious. His face twisted in hatred, radiating with killing intent.","He thought of the miserable state of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. A million of his clansmen across the entire sect had been annihilated. One of the seven ancestors, ancestor Ling, had perished. The Cloud-treading Ancestor had his body destroyed, and he had yet to recover even now.","Even he himself had been greatly humiliated at the hand of the elder princess. He would never be able to regain his sense of pride.","He did not have the courage to find the elder princess to vent, so he pushed all of this resentment and grievance onto Jian Chen.","“The master of the Immortal Sect of Alchemy Qi, Dan Chenzi, Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. Sure enough, the two of you are with him as well. The other Immortal Emperors seem to be prisoners of our Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants as well. Good! Good! Very good! Originally, I only had suspicions, but now, I’ve finally confirmed who destroyed my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. It really is you...” The Space-splitting Venerable ground his teeth. His eyes became bloodshot as if they were about to bleed. He was filled with bone-deep hatred.","At that moment, he had finally found irrefutable evidence!","The Space-splitting Venerable vanished silently. With a step, he crossed an extremely great distance, directly arriving in the Sword Region of Violet Heavens from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.","He disguised his presence and hid in a certain location inside the Sword Region of Violet Heavens. He stared through the space, fixed on the direction of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","“ It’s the Divine Formation of the Heavens from the Observance Heaven City. I never thought you’d actually obtain that. Though, the formation is not complete. You can only unleash its power once, ” the Space-splitting Venerable sneered inside. The experts of the Immortals’ World had already become familiar with the fact that Jian Chen possessed the Divine Formation of the Heavens. He obviously possessed first-hand information on this as well."]},{"number":3997,"title":"Chapter 3997: Retrieving the Divine Mountain (2)","paragraphs":["On the other side, Jian Chen also entered the Divine Formation of the Heavens. The Divine Formation of the Heavens now possessed both offensive and defensive capabilities, with quite an extraordinary defence. Just the formation alone could block the attacks of mid Immortal Exalts.","At the very centre of the formation, Jian Chen directly took the main position. As soon as he entered the main position, it was as if he became the formation’s brain. He could clearly sense all the changes in the formation, easily controlling every bit of power available.","At that moment, the power from the fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, the several dozen Immortal Monarchs, the nine Immortal Emperors, and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid had all been united by the formation, now within Jian Chen’s grasp.","Sensing the devastating power inside the formation, Jian Chen began to worry that the formation would end up damaging the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain somehow from being too powerful. As a result, he immediately called out, “Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, leave the formation!”","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt understood his intentions and left his position in the formation without any hesitation.","Having lost the support of a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, the Divine Formation of the Heavens’ power plummeted.","Despite that, it still maintained the great strength equivalent to a peak Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","Jian Chen stopped hesitating and struck out decisively. A surging energy storm tore through the surroundings. The power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens turned into a colossal beacon of light that directly shot into space, colliding viciously against the location of the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain.","Boom!","Immediately, the world rumbled. Above the main peak of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, the space collapsed in chunks. A terrifying storm of energy pressed against the earth, causing the entire sect to sink downwards.","A strange crack rang out from the hiding spot of the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain as if the invisible power lurking there had been cut off. Having lost the disguise and restraint of this power, the colossal mountain hidden in the space there finally revealed itself.","The Energy-gathering Divine Mountain sealed there by the Star Clustered Ancestor had directly been freed by Jian Chen’s Divine Formation of the Heavens.","The strike also alarmed all of the Immortal Exalts on the Reverent Observance Heaven. Immediately, powerful senses of the soul gathered over from afar, arriving instantly.","“What a startling formation... It can’t be wrong, this is the formation from the rumours...”","“It’s Yang Yutian from the Skyscraping World. I never thought he would immediately appear as soon as the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor left. He’s a mere Immortal Emperor, yet he’s so bold. Isn’t he afraid that the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor would suddenly return...”","“Sure enough, Yang Yutian was hiding on the Reverent Observance Heaven. He’s actually going as far as to expose himself just to retrieve the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain. He sure is hung up over this sect...”","Many Immortal Exalts sighed throughout the Reverent Observance Heaven. There were also many Immortal Exalts whose eyes burned with fervour, striding through the air and hurrying towards the Sword Region of Violet Heavens as quickly as possible.","There were also a few figures in the Observance Heaven City who suddenly raised their heads before rushing towards the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens with lightning speed.","In the city lord’s estate, Jiang Pingtian stood on the highest level and gazed off in the direction of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. His eyebrows were firmly furrowed. There was a hint of worry.","Over the main peak of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, the huge Energy-gathering Divine Mountain fell with the pressure of a high quality god artifact. Down below, Jian Chen began forming seals with his hands sternly. He used a secret technique to control the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt returned to his position in the formation. His return pushed the Divine Formation of the Heavens to its strongest form that it could currently reach.","“The Divine Formation of the Heavens has already run out of power. Yang Yutian, you deserve a thousand deaths for massacring a million disciples of my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants!” A chilling voice that seemed to originate from the depths of hell rang out, filled with frosty killing intent.","The Space-splitting Venerable of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants appeared silently, radiating with great pressure.","However, his pressure seemed a little overextended. Although it was at the Seventh Heavenly Layer, it was only equivalent to the Sixth Heavenly Layer in strength.","The injuries he suffered from the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance were far too heavy. Even after ingesting precious high grade God Tier pills for recovery, he had yet to return to his peak condition even now.","Under the blinding light from the Divine Formation of the Heavens, Jian Chen turned his head slightly as he controlled the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain. His gaze met the Space-splitting Venerable who had suddenly appeared. This was the first time he had met the Space-splitting Venerable, but he had already guessed his identity given his words.","After all, across the entire Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, there was only a single person whose cultivation had reached such a level.","“What exactly is your identity? Who are you working for? Why did you massacre a million disciples of my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants?” The Space-splitting Venerable ground his teeth with bone-deep hatred.","“Don’t you know my identity already? And with all these years of grievances between the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens and the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, doesn’t it make perfect sense for me to massacre your Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants?” Jian Chen said calmly, but his hands did not stop, collecting the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain as quickly as possible.","“Impossible. Don’t try to deceive me. You’re not a disciple of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens at all. You’re just using the identity of a disciple to disguise yourself and hide your true identity.”","The Space-splitting Venerable roared angrily. He glanced past the Immortal Emperors and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt in the Divine Formation of the Heavens. His anger became even more uncontrollably violent.","These people were all once prisoners of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, but they had all become Jian Chen’s greatest source of assistance, providing tremendous power to the Divine Formation of the Heavens. It triggered the Space-splitting Venerable very much.","“Once I imprison you, I’ll skin you alive and make you suffer the pain of having a demon insect gnawing away at your soul,” the Space-splitting Venerable roared furiously. He could clearly sense that many experts were gathering over already, so he stopped hesitating, directly reaching towards Jian Chen from afar.","Immediately, the powerful pressure of a late Immortal Exalt flooded the surroundings. A huge hand was conjured in the space there, sealing off the surroundings and enveloping Jian Chen along with the Divine Formation of the Heavens.","He had already confirmed who had destroyed the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. Out of pure rage, the Space-splitting Venerable even forgot to inform Daowei Chengqing about Jian Chen’s appearance.","At the same time, the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain suddenly shrank, turning into a streak of light before ending up in Jian Chen’s hand. Afterwards, the Divine Formation of the Heavens erupted with blinding light again, radiating with a tremendous pressure that even made the Space-splitting Venerable’s expression change.","With the addition of the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, the power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens was completely on show. It was entirely capable of threatening late Immortal Exalts.","However, the Space-splitting Venerable was unconcerned. Instead, he sneered. “Stop with the act. Your formation is only capable of a single strike. You’ve already used up that attack. You’re not capable of launching a second attack at all in a short period of time.”","However, as soon as the Space-splitting Venerable said that, his face immediately changed.","A resplendent beam of light shot out from the Divine Formation of the Heavens, shattering the space along the way and piercing the huge hand condensed from energy like it was unstoppable, surging towards the Space-splitting Venerable.","“Dammit, the rumours were wrong!” The Space-splitting Venerable’s eyes narrowed with surprise and shock. However, he was still a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt after all. His reaction speed could not be slow. He directly punched out with his fist.","When the Space-splitting Venerable punched out, the space produced a thunderous boom. The terrifying energy shattered the space. A colossal elephant hoof vaguely manifested as if it wanted to trample the entire world beneath its feet from above.","Boom!","With a great rumble, the Space-splitting Venerable was flung far away. He flew a hundred kilometres away before steadying himself with difficulty. His face was flushed red.","He stared at the Divine Formation of the Heavens a hundred kilometres away in shock. His eyes were filled with disbelief.","He was still injured right now, so he could only unleash the strength of a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. However, he still had the foundations at the Seventh Heavenly Layer after all. With his cultivation still present, how could he have been blasted away so easily?","Suddenly, the Space-splitting Venerable opened his mouth and spurted with blood. His body was like a fragile piece of pottery, becoming covered in dense cracks."]},{"number":3998,"title":"Chapter 3998: Breaking out of the Encirclement","paragraphs":["After assembling the fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, the strength of the Divine Formation of the Heavens had already increased substantially. It could not be stopped without the strength of the Seventh Heavenly Layer now.","If the Space-splitting Venerable only possessed strength at the Sixth Heavenly Layer and lacked his foundations at the Seventh Heavenly Layer, the injuries he would have suffered would have been far more than this.","However, after launching two attacks, the Divine Formation of the Heavens began to dim as well. Its power had virtually run out.","Of course, the primary reason for this was the fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. Their energy was limited in the first place. Now that they were being used to power the incomplete Divine Formation of the Heavens, they could only launch two strikes.","Without them, they would probably struggle to even assemble the incomplete Divine Formation of the Heavens with just several dozen Immortal Monarchs and a few Immortal Emperors!","“Yang Yutian, I’ve finally found you. Looks like your formation can’t launch a third attack.” An excited voice rang out from the screen of light created by the Divine Formation of the Heavens. An old man appeared silently, extending his hand towards Jian Chen with lightning speed.","Jian Chen had seen this person before. He was one of the owners of the medicinal gardens in the Skyscraping World. He had assembled at the entrance of the Skyscraping World with the other owners.","Originally, this person had only come for the heavenly resources they had lost in the Skyscraping World. They wanted to retrieve them.","But after learning that Jian Chen possessed a sovereign god artifact, many of them changed their goals.","It was not just the sovereign god artifact. Even the Divine Formation of the Heavens in Jian Chen’s possession had also become their target.","Bang!","With a heavy sound, the old man’s hand was blocked by the screen of light formed by the Divine Formation of the Heavens. The screen of light shook violently and rapidly became covered in cracks like it would shatter at any time.","Although the Divine Formation of the Heavens was capable of both offence and defence, its defences came nowhere close to its offensive power. Coupled with the fact that it had already launched two attacks, the power of the formation had virtually run out. That was why blocking the attack from the Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt had almost pushed it to its limits.","Jian Chen furrowed his brows. Meanwhile, the hearts of the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Emperors who assembled the formation sank inside. They could all sense that the Divine Formation of the Heavens was already nearing collapse. It could not launch any more attacks.","The old man also sensed that the Divine Formation of the Heavens was close to shattering. He immediately let out a sneer and struck out again, swinging out with his great power as a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.","“Sect master, let me block him!” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt called out. He left his position in the formation. Powerful demon Qi spread out, turning into a powerful shield in front of them.","After the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt left the formation, the colossal Divine Formation of the Heavens also vanished, having been pulled back inside by the tremendous power of the Primeval Divine Hall.","Immediately, all of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, Immortal Monarchs, and Immortal Emperors vanished. Only the Immortal Devouring Orchid remained outside.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid took action at almost the same time as the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. Many of its tendrils began to grow, each becoming extremely thick. They wove together and formed a thick barrier in front of them.","Boom!","At this exact moment, the attack from the old man arrived. With a heavy sound, his palm strike shattered the shield that the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had condensed with his demon Qi in an unstoppable manner.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt sprayed with blood. He collided heavily against the Immortal Devouring Orchid behind him. The great force even knocked the huge Immortal Devouring Orchid backwards.","After repelling the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt, the old man’s palm strike still possessed some remaining strength. It struck into the wall that the Immortal Devouring Orchid had woven from its tendrils. The wall of green plant matter directly shattered. All of the vines, large or small, were shredded to pieces, spraying in all directions.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid shuddered violently. Cracks immediately appeared on its huge main trunk. Green liquid seeped out.","They were up against a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt after all. Even when the Immortal Devouring Orchid and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt worked together, they struggled to stop his attack.","However, because the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt had received the attack first, the damage that the Immortal Devouring Orchid received was well below the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s. Coupled with its virtually indestructible ability, the crack on its main stalk quickly stopped spreading. Even its severed tendrils began to regrow at a visible rate.","Meanwhile, the old man’s palm strike had been completely nullified.","Jian Chen appeared. He used the Laws of Space to shoot past the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and the Immortal Devouring Orchid, fleeing into the distance with them as quickly as he could. He did not hesitate or pause for even a split second.","That was because apart from the Divine Formation of the Heavens, he did not possess any other abilities to threaten Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts right now.","Even though he had made significant progress with the Hundred Superimposition Sword recently, he had only comprehended it to the eighth layer.","Eight layers was equivalent to multiplying his battle prowess by eight. However, with his foundations as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, even if it was eight times in strength, he could not threaten a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt at all.","The difference in cultivation was far too great!","“Yang Yutian, don’t even think about escaping this time!” The old man roared furiously from behind. He had already gained a good grasp over some of Jian Chen’s techniques and methods from the people who emerged from the Skyscraping World. He did not dare to waste any time, chasing after him as quickly as he could.","With just a single step, he appeared in front of Jian Chen, blocking his path perfectly.","This was not the Skyscraping World. Without the restraints of the special environment inside the Skyscraping World, he could cross the entire Reverent Observance Heaven with a few steps given his cultivation at the Sixth Heavenly Layer.","On top of that, with this short delay, more and more Immortal Exalts arrived. Even the weakest was at the Fourth Heavenly Layer.","As for early Immortal Exalts, perhaps they were aware of their capabilities, so they did not participate this time.","“This person massacred a million clansmen of my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. He’s brought my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants to near extinction. This is unforgivable. Anyone who wants to contend against me for him will be making an enemy out of my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants and me...” The Space-splitting Venerable who gradually recovered his strength chased over as well. His eyes were completely red, having fallen into rage and fury as he roared at the sky.","As the Space-splitting Venerable’s tremendous presence as a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt filled the surroundings, some of the Immortal Exalts who arrived nearby showed wariness in their eyes.","However, it was only wariness. Just the Space-splitting Venerable alone was not enough to make these people retreat.","This was a battle for opportunity and fortune after all, as well as a chance to change their fates. Before such temptations, even if there were heavenly emperors in the way, they would still try their luck.","On the other side, Jian Chen’s path had only just been blocked when he activated the Divine Armour of Heavenflight. He vanished entirely from the surroundings along with his presence.","The arriving Immortal Exalts were not surprised at all. In the next moment, a few of them struck out at the same time, shaking up the space with their powerful cultivations.","With their cultivations that had reached mid Immortal Exalt at the very least, coupled with so many people working together, the force that shook up the space was so great that it interfered with almost half of the Reverent Observance Heaven. It made the space in this region shake violently. Countless sects and cities were affected."]},{"number":3999,"title":"Chapter 3999: Chapter 4000: Lu Wujin’s Choice","paragraphs":["Several hundred million kilometres away, Jian Chen fell out of the air. The shaking space restricted his hiding ability.","He did not hesitate at all. With the heavily-injured Thousand Soul Demon Exalt in one hand and the Immortal Devouring Orchid that had shrunk to a fraction of its original size wrapped around his wrist, he crossed almost half of the heaven with a step.","After reaching the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor with the Laws of Space, his speed had increased drastically.","“Hehehehe, Yang Yutian, your mastery over the Laws of Space is still a little too low.” Suddenly, a sneer rang out. The space around Jian Chen instantly froze. Everything was set in place. Jian Chen was also restrained as a result.","Jian Chen narrowed his eyes. This was the Laws of Space from a Fourth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt!","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt stood up. His face was pale as blood dribbled from the corner of his mouth. He opened his mouth and spat out a cloud of black demon Qi, which turned into a great force that slammed against the frozen space.","Bang! A heavy sound rang out from the surrounding space. The restraints created by the lurking expert through the Laws of Space had been destroyed. Jian Chen used this opportunity to grab the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt and flee once more, arriving in outer space.","The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt coughed violently. His face became even more sheet-white, giving off a sense of haggardness.","Behind, the Space-splitting Venerable and the mid Immortal Exalts continued to pursue him relentlessly. They constantly interfered with space, drastically affecting Jian Chen’s Divine Armour of Heavenflight.","But fortunately, his Laws of Space had already reached the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor. Coupled with the ability he inherited from the Spatial Insect Emperor, he possessed a natural intimacy with space. Although he was only at the Ninth Heavenly Layer, both his control and usage of space had surpassed his comprehension. As such, Jian Chen was able to slip away time and time again despite the pursuit of multiple mid Immortal Exalts.","However, this was only for the time being!","Suddenly, the landscape before Jian Chen changed. It was replaced by a sea of snowy-white. He gathered his focus to look at it and discovered that a white piece of paper had appeared before him. It was an extremely huge piece of white paper. When it unfurled, it could easily wrap an entire planet.","At this moment, the paper seemed to have replaced the space there. As it lingered, the surrounding space twisted violently. The Laws of Space were severely affected. This region of space seemed to fall under the paper’s control.","This was no regular sheet of paper but a high quality god artifact that possessed the mysteries of space!","Jian Chen’s face sank. Before the white paper, he felt that the Laws of Space he inherited from the Spatial Insect Emperor were suppressed for the first time in his life as if they had left his control.","At this moment, the huge sheet of paper began to fold. It began to wrap around Jian Chen with extremely powerful Laws of Space.","Jian Chen immediately used the Laws of Space in an attempt to escape, but he discovered that his unfaltering Laws of Space had actually become useless. When he took a step, he remained where he was.","It was as if this space was entirely under the paper’s control.","“Even if he is to be captured, he should end up in the hands of my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. Even if he is to die, he can only die by the hands of my Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. You lingering imps, you can all piss off!” The Space-splitting Venerable roared furiously. He radiated with killing intent and directly threw a merciless punch at the paper.","Boom!","With a rumble, the high quality god artifact paper was blown away by the Space-splitting Venerable’s punch. It dimmed, and the mysteries of space it radiated with collapsed in chunks as well.","Without the paper interfering with the space, Jian Chen’s movements were no longer restricted. He immediately shot off into the distance using the Laws of Space.","However, as soon as he vanished, a colossal, metal cage appeared where he was previously, sealing up the space.","The pursuit and battle that unfolded in outer space had drawn over all the experts on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","At this moment, the various Immortal Exalts throughout the Reverent Observance Heaven hovered above their respective sects and gazed at outer space with mixed feelings. Some of them were full of sighs. They could not imagine that an Immortal Emperor could outmaneuver so many mid Immortal Exalts for so long.","There were also other people who were furious. Their eyes shone with coldness and malice. They thought about how this person was responsible for all the peak organisations that had been destroyed on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","On the highest floor of the city lord’s estate in the Observance Heaven City, the present city lord, Jiang Pingtian, stood with his hands by his side. His gaze towards outer space was filled with worry and a deep sense of helplessness.","He wanted to assist, but he was also wary of something, so he could only hold back this urge.","“These people have truly gone too far.” At this moment, a cold voice rang out from behind Jiang Pingtian.","A middle-aged man in white clothes silently appeared there. He also gazed at outer space. The depths of his eyes were filled with bone-chilling coldness.","He was the other vice city lord apart from the Master of Fire Virtue, Lu Wujin!","Jiang Pingtian looked at Lu Wujin beside him. There was a hint of surprise in his eyes. “From how indignant you seem, are you planning on assisting him?”","Lu Wujin reached out with his hand and a snowy-white blade appeared there. Despite its glow being entirely contained without giving off any presence at all, it still radiated with a heavy sense of pressure.","The blade came from out of the twelve courts of heaven, the Courtyard of Ways. It was one of the Courtyard of Ways’ sovereign god artifacts, the Way-bearing blade!","“If there are no accidents, Jian Chen will struggle to escape. No matter how wondrous his Laws of Space are, he’ll still struggle to escape from an encirclement of so many Immortal Exalts.” Lu Wujin gripped the Way-bearing blade as his eyes shone with powerful battle intent!","“Why are you helping him?” Jiang Pingtian was curious.","When he heard that, Lu Wujin became slightly dazed. He said sternly, “Because he is the master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Regardless of what his true background is, since he bears the title of the master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, I can’t let other people go after him.”","“The person they hunt down can be Jian Chen, Chang Yang, or Yang Yutian. I can ignore all of that. However, it definitely can’t be the master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens!”","A hint of surprise flashed through Jiang Pingtian’s eyes. “The implications of this are quite large. Even with the strength of you and me, it can only be described as futile. It might even cost us our lives if we get involved. Have you thought it through?”","“The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens has been targeted by various people in the past, declining with each passing day. I witnessed all of it and remained silent. But now, I truly can’t just stand by and watch as the master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens is hunted down,” Lu Wujin said emotionlessly. After that, he stopped hesitating, directly entering outer space with the Way-bearing blade.","It was also at this moment that the Way-bearing blade released its pressure, erupting with blinding light. It immediately ceased to hide its might as a sovereign god artifact, releasing it freely.","“Lu Wujin, what are you trying to do? Are you really trying to make a mortal enemy out of our Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants?”","Lu Wujin’s appearance made the Space-splitting Venerable’s face change drastically. He called out furiously.","The former was a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, but he did originate from the Courtyard of Ways after all. He even bore a sovereign god artifact. As a result, Lu Wujin was so powerful that even the Space-splitting Venerable was extremely wary of him.","“Don’t tell me the blade in his hand is the Courtyard of Ways’ Way-bearing blade?”","The Immortal Exalts who intercepted Jian Chen nearby also looked at Lu Wujin subconsciously. Their gazes all gathered on the Way-bearing blade, becoming filled with envy and jealousy.","Lu Wujin’s face was frosty. Right when he was about to say something, he furrowed his brows and looked at the space nearby.","The Space-splitting Venerable and the other Immortal Exalts all seemed to sense this as well. They all looked over sternly.","A huge crack suddenly appeared where their gazes gathered. Violent streams of energy and temporal storms rushed out from inside, together with a tremendous pressure that shocked all of the Immortal Exalts present.","This was the supreme pressure of Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts!","When the pressure appeared, all of the Immortal Exalts’ hearts tightened, including the Space-splitting Venerable’s. They were on full alert.","“Hahaha, old man Soaring Immortal, you better just stay here obediently...” The Dungeon Demon God’s fearless laughter rang out from the spatial crack. Shortly afterwards, destructive energy erupted from inside."]},{"number":4000,"title":"Chapter 4000: Chapter 4001: The Crown Prince Arrives","paragraphs":["When they heard the voice, the Immortal Exalts all let out slight sighs of relief. They were only mid Immortal Exalts. The existence of heavenly emperors gave them very great mental pressure.","Although they were all prepared to steal from the mouth of a tiger in order to obtain Jian Chen’s sovereign god artifact, all of them would still be fearful if they actually had to face a heavenly emperor.","“The Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor is locked in combat against the Dungeon Demon God. He can’t break free. That’s extremely fortunate for us...” A Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt sighed, but very soon, his face changed. He cried out, “Oh no, Yang Yutian has escaped!”","At this moment, all traces of Jian Chen had already vanished from the surroundings, clearly having hidden away already. If they did not force him out of hiding immediately, then they would basically lose all hope of finding him.","“Hmph, he’s just a mere Immortal Emperor. If he manages to slip away with all of us here, we’d be utterly humiliated,” said an Immortal Exalt in black robes. His tremendous energy erupted. Just the terrifying presence he gave off made the region of ten million kilometres twist violently.","“Eight Directions Destruction!” the old man in black bellowed out furiously. He used a secret technique. Terrifying energy turned into a visible shockwave, instantly spreading to several billion kilometres away, shaking up the region.","However, despite interfering with a very large range of space, he still did not see Jian Chen.","The Space-splitting Venerable also flew into a fury. He had heard far too much about Jian Chen’s rumours. Maybe he did not know about all of Jian Chen’s chronicles in the Skyscraping World, but he did know about most of it. As a result, he was acutely aware that if he let this person slip away, finding him again would be even harder than finding a needle in a haystack.","Afterwards, the Space-splitting Venerable also began launching attacks furiously. His pressure as a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt erupted fearlessly, destroying the space again and again in an attempt to force out the hiding Jian Chen.","The other Immortal Exalts did not idle around either. They scattered across the various regions of space. All of them were frantic, unable to hide the panic in their eyes. They all attacked the space furiously, leading to powerful shockwaves that destroyed entire clouds of meteors.","However, after searching through the surroundings with their combined efforts, they still failed to find Jian Chen.","When they saw this, their faces all became sunken. In particular, the Space-splitting Venerable’s eyes were filled with a reluctance to accept this.","They were forced to accept a brutal truth. Jian Chen had already escaped from their control.","Lu Wujin hovered in the sea of stars with the Way-bearing blade in hand. He scanned the surrounding space with a strange colour in his eyes and murmured, “This hiding ability truly is terrifying. It is no wonder that even the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor had to take action personally in order to find him.”","“But this is good too. I don’t have to offend these people now...”","After muttering that to himself, Lu Wujin turned around and returned to the Observance Heaven City.","“Has Yang Yutian really escaped?”","“An Immortal Emperor actually managed to escape successfully even with so many Immortal Exalts intercepting him. How unbelievable...”","“Jian Chen’s hiding ability is far too powerful. If we hadn’t destroyed the space and forced him out multiple times, he probably would have fled a long time ago. Once he vanishes, even the senses of a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt’s soul can’t find anything. He can hide away flawlessly...”","“Let alone a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, probably even a heavenly emperor can’t detect him with the senses of their souls. Otherwise, he would have never been able to remain in hiding under the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor’s watch for such a long time...”","On the Reverent Observance Heaven, the Immortal Exalts all witnessed what had happened in outer space. Many of their faces were filled with amazement, as they had yet to witness such an outstanding Immortal Emperor before.","“Jian Chen, get out here. You killed a million of my clansmen from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. This is an irreconcilable grudge. I will carve you to pieces...”","“Chang Yang, if you don’t come out, I’ll kill everyone connected to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens and destroy all the organisations that have connections to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. You will pay a price for provoking the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants...”","A violent storm of energy swept through outer space, wreaking havoc among the stars. The Space-splitting Venerable flew into a fury and let out a deafening roar.","After seeing the Immortal Emperors and the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt who had once been imprisoned in the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants, the Space-splitting Venerable had been greatly triggered, almost to the point where he lost all sense of rationality.","Suddenly, the Space-splitting Venerable thought of something and quivered all over. The scarlet colour in his eyes receded like the tide. Afterwards, he formed a seal with one hand, producing an ancient and profound imprint.","Once the imprint was completed, the Space-splitting Venerable could delicately sense that a special power of laws pulsed, spreading into the distant unknown.","At the same time, in a region extremely distant from the Reverent Observance Heaven, Daowei Chengqing dressed in white robes sat within a beautifully-decorated hall within a series of dignified, ancient structures. His eyes were shut as if he was cultivating.","The profound laws pulsed around him. These laws were different from the ones that other people comprehended. They were much deeper and much more vague. They seemed to have surpassed the strength of laws that Daowei Chengqing currently possessed, reaching a higher realm.","Suddenly, Daowei Chengqing sensed something. He opened his eyes and gazed off in the direction of the Reverent Observance Heaven. He murmured, “It’s the Space-splitting Venerable who’s calling for me. Don’t tell me the inheritor of the twin swords has appeared?”","When he thought of the twin swords, Daowei Chengqing could not help but become serious. A presence from the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor radiated from him. He swung his arms around and drew in the air skillfully with his cultivation, producing an ancient formation in the very end.","“Master, what’s happened?” An elderly voice rang out. Three servants appeared. They were Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, but when they looked at Daowei Chengqing who was only a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, they were filled with respect from the bottom of their hearts.","“I want to pay a visit to the Reverent Observance Heaven. Come with me,” Daowei Chengqing said calmly. In the next moment, the space in front of him split open, turning into a multi-coloured spatial gate. Dense laws were woven inside as if it was connected to the entire world, allowing him to reach any corner of the Immortals’ World.","Gazing at the gate, the three servants were surprised, as this was the first time they had ever seen Daowei Chengqing use an ability like this.","“The journey to the Reverent Observance Heaven is extremely distant. Even with our strength, we need to spend quite some time. Why don’t you let us lead the way instead, master? Don’t tell me this technique is even faster than the three of us?” At this moment, the three servants asked.","Despite their curiosity, they directly stepped into the spatial gate behind Daowei Chengqing. In the next moment, the surrounding landscape changed, and they had arrived in an unfamiliar region of space.","Several hundred metres in front of them, the Space-splitting Venerable stood in a daze. His face was filled with shock.","“Y-your majesty, you were nearby?” the Space-splitting Venerable asked subconsciously.","Daowei Chengqing furrowed his brows slightly. He quickly looked around and said, “I was cultivating in the clan. I immediately hurried over here after receiving your message. Where is he?”","When he heard that, the Space-splitting Venerable could not help but gasp. He was shaken up inside. The Waymight clan was more than halfway across the Immortals’ World from the Reverent Observance Heaven, yet Daowei Chengqing had only used five seconds to reach here after he had passed on the news.","He had traversed more than half of the Immortals’ World in such a short amount of time. This ability was almost akin to what Grand Exalts were capable of.","Although peak experts had special methods that virtually achieved the same result, they often had extremely stringent requirements to fulfill. They could not achieve this as easily as Daowei Chengqing had.","More importantly, Daowei Chengqing’s cultivation was only at the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor right now!"]}]);
